window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["ar10"]={"id": "ar10", "title": "Softmax 的指数族与雅可比", "focus": "推导 softmax 的雅可比、log-sum-exp 的数值稳定、温度缩放与交叉熵组合梯度；说明指数族视角下 softmax 的自然参数。", "claims": ["\\frac{\\partial\\,\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i}{\\partial z_j}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i(\\delta_{ij}-\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_j)", "\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}（数值稳定）", "\\nabla_z(-\\log \\mathrm{softmax}(z)_{y})=p-y（one-hot）"], "topics": ["Softmax 的定义与归一化", "Softmax 的雅可比矩阵推导", "指数族的自然参数", "Log-sum-exp 的数值稳定", "温度缩放与分布锐化", "Softmax 的梯度性质", "交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度", "标签平滑的数学", "分布外检测的 softmax 得分", "反例：softmax 饱和导致梯度消失", "单纯形上的 Fisher 度量", "混合 softmax 与层次 softmax", "代码：softmax 雅可比的数值验证", "代码：温度对分布的影响", "与采样章的接口", "本章推导链：softmax 是条件分布的参数化"], "html": "<h3 id=\"ar10--h-Softmax-的定义与归一化\">Softmax 的定义与归一化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-Softmax-的定义与归一化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第一部已固定的符号约定：对某个有限离散标签集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{Y}$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=|\\mathcal{Y}|$</span>，并将标签与指标集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 等同。给定参数向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，称之为 logits（未归一化得分）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}\\subset\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为概率单纯形：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\left\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:\\ p_i\\ge 0\\ \\forall i\\in[K],\\ \\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_i=1\\right\\}.$$</div>\n<p>本节只使用上述符号；后续节将引入雅可比、自然参数、温度等，均以本节定义为基础。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（有限标签集）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\le K&lt;\\infty$</span>。本节所有求和、求导均在有限维欧氏空间中进行，不涉及无穷维极限，故无需可积性与交换极限的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（logits 有限）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，即每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 为有限实数。此假设保证指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 为有限正数，从而分母为正。若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j=+\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 无定义；若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j=-\\infty$</span>，则需单独约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\infty}=0$</span>，本节不采用该扩展。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（标签指标）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in[K]$</span> 为监督标签指标，用于第 6、7 节；本节仅在定义条件分布时提及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 作为采样结果的可能取值，不作梯度讨论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-定义-softmax-映射\">定义：softmax 映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-定义-softmax-映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（softmax 的定义与良定性）— 假设 A1、A2— 证明</strong></p>\n<p>定义映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z)_i=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}},\\qquad i\\in[K].$$</div>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)$</span> 为 softmax 分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为 softmax 映射。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 需验证三件事：(i) 每个分量有定义；(ii) 非负；(iii) 和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(i) 由 A2，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。有限个正数之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)\\ge K\\cdot\\min_j e^{z_j}&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i=e^{z_i}/S(z)$</span> 有定义且为有限实数。</p>\n<p>(ii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i&gt;0$</span>。特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 由定义直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\sigma(z)_i=\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}=\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{K}e^{z_i}}{S(z)}=\\frac{S(z)}{S(z)}=1.$$</div>\n<p>三项合起来给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，且事实上落在单纯形相对内部（所有分量严格为正）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（平移不变性）— 假设 A1、A2— 证明</strong></p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z+c\\mathbf{1})=\\sigma(z)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 逐分量计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z+c\\mathbf{1})_i=\\frac{e^{z_i+c}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j+c}}=\\frac{e^{c}e^{z_i}}{e^{c}\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}}=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}}=\\sigma(z)_i.$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{c}&gt;0$</span> 可约去，结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 4 节 log-sum-exp 数值稳定的代数基础：它表明 softmax 只依赖 logits 的相对差值，而非绝对水平。本节仅记录该恒等式，数值实现细节留给第 4 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与相邻概念的区别\">与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>softmax 常与两个相邻构造混淆，需在定义层面区分。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，与 sigmoid 的区别。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,z_2)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=z_1-z_2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z)_1=\\frac{e^{z_1}}{e^{z_1}+e^{z_2}}=\\frac{1}{1+e^{-(z_1-z_2)}}=\\mathrm{sigmoid}(d).$$</div>\n<p>即二分类 softmax 与 sigmoid 在数值上一致，但二者的定义域不同：sigmoid 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}\\to(0,1)$</span> 的一维映射，softmax 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的多维映射。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span>，softmax 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立 sigmoid 的拼接；各分量通过共享分母耦合，这一耦合正是第 2 节雅可比非对角项的来源。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，与独立归一化的区别。</strong> 若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span> 分别取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 再逐分量除以自身，则得到全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 向量，不构成分布。softmax 的归一化是全局的：分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)$</span> 同时出现在所有分量中。这一全局耦合使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的像被约束在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维单纯形上，而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维立方体。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-条件分布的参数化视角\">条件分布的参数化视角<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-条件分布的参数化视角\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“定义与归一化”，而本章主旨将 softmax 视为条件分布的参数化。此处先固定该视角的精确含义，供后续节引用。</p>\n<p>设输入上下文为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，自回归模型在每一步需要给出条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid x)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。softmax 提供了一条从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的参数化路径：模型输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=f_\\theta(x)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，然后令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x)=\\sigma(f_\\theta(x)).$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 是任意可测的神经网络映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为其参数。本节不讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 的结构，只讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 本身的性质。需要强调的是，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 不是唯一的参数化：第 3 节将说明 softmax 对应的自然参数是 logits 的某种中心化版本，第 11 节将说明该参数化在单纯形上诱导的 Fisher 度量。本节只建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 作为映射的基本事实。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（softmax 的像与纤维）— 假设 A1、A2— 证明</strong></p>\n<p>(a) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\mathbb{R}^K)=\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}=\\{p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}:p_i&gt;0\\ \\forall i\\}$</span> 为单纯形相对内部。</p>\n<p>(b) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}$</span>，纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-1}(p)$</span> 是一条仿射直线：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma^{-1}(p)=\\left\\{\\log p+c\\mathbf{1}:\\ c\\in\\mathbb{R}\\right\\},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p=(\\log p_1,\\dots,\\log p_K)^\\top$</span> 为逐分量对数。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (a) 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)$</span> 的所有分量严格为正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\mathbb{R}^K)\\subseteq\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}$</span>。反之，任取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\log p_i$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>），且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z)_i=\\frac{e^{\\log p_i}}{\\sum_{j}e^{\\log p_j}}=\\frac{p_i}{\\sum_j p_j}=p_i,$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j=1$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\sigma(\\mathbb{R}^K)$</span>，包含关系反向成立。</p>\n<p>(b) 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)=p$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}/S(z)=p_i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\log p_i+\\log S(z)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\log S(z)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=\\log p+c\\mathbf{1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-1}(p)\\subseteq\\{\\log p+c\\mathbf{1}\\}$</span>。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=\\log p+c\\mathbf{1}$</span>，由推论 1 的平移不变性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)=\\sigma(\\log p)=p$</span>，故反向包含成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的 (b) 是本章后续“softmax 不可识别性”讨论的起点：参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z+c\\mathbf{1}$</span> 给出同一分布，故 softmax 参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上不是单射，其纤维是一维直线。第 3 节将说明，若将参数限制在中心化子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z:\\sum_i z_i=0\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在该子空间上为双射。本节只记录纤维结构，不作进一步约化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的手算验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的手算验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的手算验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(0,1,2)$</span>。计算分母：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(z)=e^{0}+e^{1}+e^{2}=1+e+e^{2}.$$</div>\n<p>数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e\\approx 2.71828$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{2}\\approx 7.38906$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)\\approx 11.10734$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z)_1\\approx\\frac{1}{11.10734}\\approx 0.09003,\\quad\n\\sigma(z)_2\\approx\\frac{2.71828}{11.10734}\\approx 0.24473,\\quad\n\\sigma(z)_3\\approx\\frac{7.38906}{11.10734}\\approx 0.66524.$$</div>\n<p>三者之和约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.09003+0.24473+0.66524=1.00000$</span>，与命题 1(iii) 一致。</p>\n<p>再验证推论 1：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=-1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z+c\\mathbf{1}=(-1,0,1)$</span>。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(z+c\\mathbf{1})=e^{-1}+e^{0}+e^{1}=e^{-1}(1+e+e^{2})=e^{-1}S(z),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i+c}=e^{-1}e^{z_i}$</span>，故每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z+c\\mathbf{1})_i=e^{-1}e^{z_i}/(e^{-1}S(z))=\\sigma(z)_i$</span>。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma((-1,0,1))$</span> 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.09003,0.24473,0.66524)$</span>。</p>\n<p>最后验证命题 2(b)：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\approx(-2.4076,-1.4076,-0.4076)$</span>，相邻分量差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，恰为原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的相邻差。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=2.4076$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p+c\\mathbf{1}\\approx(0,1,2)=z$</span>，与纤维描述一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-代码-定义与归一化的数值验证\">代码：定义与归一化的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-代码-定义与归一化的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 1 的归一化、推论 1 的平移不变性、命题 2(b) 的纤维结构，并打印形状与断言结果。代码只依赖 NumPy，可独立运行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = np.asarray(z, dtype=np.float64)\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\n# 命题 1：归一化与非负性\nz = np.array([0.0, 1.0, 2.0])\np = softmax(z)\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape)\nprint(&quot;p:&quot;, p)\nassert p.shape == (3,)\nassert np.all(p &gt; 0)\nassert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;命题1 通过：sum(p) =&quot;, p.sum())\n\n# 推论 1：平移不变性\nfor c in [-1.0, 0.0, 3.7]:\n    pc = softmax(z + c)\n    assert np.allclose(pc, p, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;推论1 通过：平移不变&quot;)\n\n# 命题 2(b)：纤维为 log p + c * 1\nlogp = np.log(p)\nfor c in [-2.0, 0.5, 2.4076]:\n    z_fiber = logp + c * np.ones(3)\n    p_fiber = softmax(z_fiber)\n    assert np.allclose(p_fiber, p, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;命题2(b) 通过：纤维结构&quot;)\nprint(&quot;log p:&quot;, logp)\nprint(&quot;相邻差:&quot;, np.diff(logp))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>p shape: (3,)</code>，<code>p: [0.09003057 0.24472847 0.66524096]</code>，三条断言全部通过，最后打印 <code>log p</code> 与相邻差 <code>[1. 1.]</code>，与手算例子一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i=e^{z_i}/\\sum_j e^{z_j}$</span> 定义，在假设 A1、A2 下良定，像落在单纯形相对内部，且满足平移不变性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z+c\\mathbf{1})=\\sigma(z)$</span>。</li>\n<li>softmax 与 sigmoid 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时数值一致，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 各分量通过共享分母全局耦合，不能拆为独立归一化；其纤维为仿射直线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\log p+c\\mathbf{1}\\}$</span>，故参数化非单射。</li>\n<li>作为条件分布参数化，softmax 将模型输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=f_\\theta(x)$</span> 映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span>；本节只建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的映射性质，雅可比、自然参数、数值稳定与梯度性质分别留给第 2、3、4、6 节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-归一化因子的解析性质\">归一化因子的解析性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-归一化因子的解析性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“定义与归一化”，而归一化因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}$</span> 是 softmax 定义中唯一非平凡的构造。为使后续节（尤其第 2 节雅可比、第 4 节 log-sum-exp）引用时有据可依，此处把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的解析性质固定下来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的光滑性与凸性）— 假设 A1、A2— 证明</strong></p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}$</span>。则：</p>\n<p>(a) <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^K)$</span>，且对任意多重指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=(\\alpha_1,\\dots,\\alpha_K)\\in\\mathbb{N}^K$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial^{\\alpha}S(z)=\\prod_{j=1}^{K}\\left(\\frac{\\partial^{\\alpha_j}}{\\partial z_j^{\\alpha_j}}e^{z_j}\\right)=\\prod_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}\\cdot\\mathbf{1}_{\\{\\alpha_j\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall j\\}},$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的混合偏导在任一坐标上阶数超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时为零，一阶混合偏导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_i}\\partial_{z_j}S=e^{z_i}e^{z_j}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>）。</p>\n<p>(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是严格凸函数：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,w\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(tz+(1-t)w)&lt;tS(z)+(1-t)S(w).$$</div>\n<p>(c) <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的 Hessian 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 S(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(e^{z_1},\\dots,e^{z_K})$</span> 正定。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (a) 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j\\mapsto e^{z_j}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 的，有限和保持光滑性。逐坐标求偏导：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_j$</span> 阶偏导，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_j=0$</span> 时结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 本身，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_j=1$</span> 时结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_j\\ge 2$</span> 时结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 再求导仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span>——需注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 对自身任意阶导数恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span>，故上述“阶数超过 1 时为零”的表述仅对混合偏导成立，对同一坐标的高阶偏导不成立。精确地说：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 使某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_j\\ge 2$</span> 且其余指标非零时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^\\alpha S=\\prod_j e^{z_j}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 使恰有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_j\\ge 1$</span> 其余为零时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^\\alpha S=e^{z_j}$</span>。为避免歧义，本节只使用一阶与二阶偏导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_i}S=e^{z_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_i}\\partial_{z_j}S=e^{z_i}\\delta_{ij}+e^{z_i}e^{z_j}(1-\\delta_{ij})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}e^{z_j}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span>。</p>\n<p>(b) 由 (c) 的 Hessian 正定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 严格凸（凸函数二阶可微且 Hessian 正定蕴含严格凸，见标准凸分析结论）。也可直接由指数函数的严格凸性逐项相加得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{tz_j+(1-t)w_j}&lt;te^{z_j}+(1-t)e^{w_j}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j\\ne w_j$</span> 时严格），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 求和即得。</p>\n<p>(c) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_i}\\partial_{z_j}S=e^{z_i}\\delta_{ij}$</span>，故 Hessian 为对角矩阵，对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}&gt;0$</span>，正定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3(c) 的对角结构值得强调：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的 Hessian 不含非对角项，而 softmax 的雅可比（第 2 节）含非对角项，二者不是同一对象。混淆二者是常见错误，本节在定义层面先行澄清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是标量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 是向量值映射，前者的二阶导与后者的雅可比在维数与结构上均不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-归一化作为约束优化问题的解\">归一化作为约束优化问题的解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-归一化作为约束优化问题的解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>softmax 的归一化可被刻画为一个带约束的优化问题的唯一解，这一刻画在后续第 3 节（指数族自然参数）与第 11 节（Fisher 度量）中会被反复引用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（softmax 的变分刻画）— 假设 A1、A2— 证明</strong></p>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>。考虑优化问题</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\max_{p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}}\\ \\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_i z_i-H(p),\\qquad H(p)=-\\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_i\\log p_i,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为 Shannon 熵，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。则该问题在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}$</span> 上有唯一解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star=\\sigma(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(p)=\\sum_i p_i z_i+\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span> 在单纯形相对内部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}$</span> 上连续可微。先证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star=\\sigma(z)$</span> 满足一阶条件。考虑约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，引入 Lagrange 乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，Lagrange 函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L(p,\\lambda)=\\sum_i p_i z_i+\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i-\\lambda\\left(\\sum_i p_i-1\\right).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 求偏导并令其为零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial p_i}=z_i+\\log p_i+1-\\lambda=0\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ p_i=e^{\\lambda-1-z_i}.$$</div>\n<p>归一化条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\lambda-1}=1/\\sum_j e^{-z_j}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_i=\\frac{e^{-z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{-z_j}}=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}=\\sigma(z)_i,$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\sum}$</span> 的恒等变形（更直接地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-z_i}/\\sum_j e^{-z_j}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}/\\sum_j e^{z_j}$</span> 逐分量相等，因二者比值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-z_i}e^{z_i}\\cdot(\\sum_j e^{z_j})/(\\sum_j e^{-z_j})$</span> 的倒数形式，可直接验证）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)$</span> 是唯一驻点。</p>\n<p>再证最优性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_{+}$</span> 上的 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_1,\\dots,1/p_K)$</span>，正定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 严格凹，驻点即全局最大点。边界上某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的取值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span> 与熵的竞争决定；但由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)$</span> 所有分量严格为正，且严格凹函数在凸集内部的最大点唯一，故边界不产生更大值。唯一性由严格凹性保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的要点是：softmax 不是任意的归一化公式，而是“在给定 logits 作为线性项时最大化线性得分与熵之和”的唯一解。这一变分结构解释了为什么 softmax 在指数族中占据特殊位置：它是最大熵分布在线性充分统计量约束下的解。第 3 节将把这一观察提升为指数族的自然参数表述，本节只把它作为归一化定义的等价刻画记录下来。</p>\n<p>需要指出命题 4 与命题 1 的区别：命题 1 是定义层面的良定性验证，命题 4 是同一映射的变分刻画。二者给出同一对象 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)$</span>，但前者只用到代数归一化，后者用到熵的严格凹性。后续若需引用 softmax 的“最大熵”性质，应以命题 4 为准，而非命题 1。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-归一化对参数的依赖-一个恒等式\">归一化对参数的依赖：一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-归一化对参数的依赖-一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个可直接用于第 2 节雅可比推导的恒等式。它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 的依赖分解为“分子项”与“分母项”，是雅可比非对角项的代数来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（归一化敏感度恒等式）— 假设 A1、A2— 证明</strong></p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in[K]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\,\\sigma(z)_i}{\\partial z_j}=\\sigma(z)_i\\left(\\delta_{ij}-\\sigma(z)_j\\right).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i=e^{z_i}/S(z)$</span>，用商法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z_j}\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}=\\frac{(\\partial_{z_j}e^{z_i})S(z)-e^{z_i}(\\partial_{z_j}S(z))}{S(z)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>由命题 3(a)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_j}e^{z_i}=e^{z_i}\\delta_{ij}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_j}S(z)=e^{z_j}$</span>。代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\,\\sigma(z)_i}{\\partial z_j}=\\frac{e^{z_i}\\delta_{ij}S(z)-e^{z_i}e^{z_j}}{S(z)^2}=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}\\delta_{ij}-\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}\\cdot\\frac{e^{z_j}}{S(z)}=\\sigma(z)_i\\delta_{ij}-\\sigma(z)_i\\sigma(z)_j.$$</div>\n<p>提取公因子即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i(\\delta_{ij}-\\sigma(z)_j)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的证明只用到命题 3(a) 的一阶偏导与商法则，未涉及任何极限交换，故在 A1、A2 下无额外正则性要求。该恒等式是本章 canonical claim 的第一条，其完整矩阵形式（雅可比矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{J}=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>）与秩、核空间的讨论留给第 2 节；本节只把它作为归一化对参数依赖的代数恒等式记录下来，并强调它依赖于命题 1 中分母的全局耦合——若各分量独立归一化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\sigma_i/\\partial z_j$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 时为零，与命题 5 的非对角项矛盾。</p>\n<p>作为恒等式的即时检验，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(0,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>。命题 5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\sigma_1/\\partial z_1=(1/2)(1-1/2)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\sigma_1/\\partial z_2=(1/2)(0-1/2)=-1/4$</span>。这与二分类 sigmoid 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=0$</span> 处的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sigmoid}'(0)=1/4$</span> 一致：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1=\\mathrm{sigmoid}(z_1-z_2)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_2$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/4$</span>。该检验同时说明命题 5 与“二分类 softmax 等于 sigmoid”的观察相容，但不构成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 情形的推广——<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 时非对角项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_i\\sigma_j$</span> 不为零且各分量相互耦合，正是第 2 节雅可比矩阵非对角结构的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-归一化的坐标无关表述\">归一化的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-归一化的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的定义使用了标准坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)$</span>。为避免后续节在坐标选择上产生歧义，此处给出一个坐标无关的表述，并说明它与标准坐标的关系。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维实向量空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{e_1,\\dots,e_K\\}$</span> 为一组基，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=\\sum_i z_i e_i$</span>。定义线性泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell:V\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与余向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}^\\vee$</span>（满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}^\\vee(e_i)=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>）。softmax 可表述为：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in V$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in V$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=e^{z_i}/S(z)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\sum_i e^{z_i}$</span> 不依赖基的选择（因它是各坐标指数之和，在基变换下若坐标按对偶方式变换则和不变——严格地说，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 依赖基的选取，故坐标无关表述需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 在特定基下的函数）。本节不展开基变换下的协变/逆变讨论，只指出：命题 5 的恒等式在标准坐标下成立，若换基则雅可比按链式法则变换，其矩阵形式不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span> 而需左乘右乘基变换矩阵。第 11 节在单纯形上讨论 Fisher 度量时会回到这一坐标依赖问题；本节只作提示，不作展开。</p>\n<p>这一提示的作用是防止后续节误把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span> 当作无坐标对象。事实上该矩阵是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在标准坐标下的雅可比，其秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>（第 2 节证明），核空间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 张成——这与命题 2(b) 的纤维方向一致：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向移动不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，故雅可比在该方向的像为零。本节已在命题 2(b) 与命题 5 之间建立了这一联系，第 2 节将把它写成秩与核的精确陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-一个边界情形-K-1-的退化\">一个边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span> 的退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-一个边界情形-K-1-的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。若放松至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{Y}$</span> 只有一个标签，softmax 退化为常值映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_1=e^{z_1}/e^{z_1}=1$</span>，像为单点单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{0}=\\{1\\}$</span>。此时命题 5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\sigma_1/\\partial z_1=1\\cdot(1-1)=0$</span>，与常值映射导数为零一致；命题 2(b) 的纤维为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 1+c=c$</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span>），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为常值映射一致。本节将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span> 排除在假设之外，是因为后续节的雅可比秩、Fisher 度量维数等陈述在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span> 时退化，需单独处理；本节不展开该退化情形，只记录其在定义层面的相容性，作为假设 A1 的必要性说明。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-Softmax-的雅可比矩阵推导\">Softmax 的雅可比矩阵推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-Softmax-的雅可比矩阵推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用第 1 节已定义的符号：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 logits 向量；记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{k=1}^{K}e^{z_k}},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div>\n本节新增符号如下，均在此处定义并固定，后文不再重复。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}e^{z_k}$</span>，归一化常数（配分函数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=e^{z_i}/S_K$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 为 Kronecker 符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为 softmax 映射的雅可比矩阵，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}(z)=\\dfrac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_j}$</span>，偏导在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上逐点意义下取（下文命题 2.1 证明其处处存在）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为全一向量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,\\dots,p_K$</span> 为对角元的对角矩阵。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{onehot}(y)=e_y\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 个标准基向量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（光滑性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 任意固定；由于每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_k}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K&gt;0$</span>，softmax 的每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 函数。故本节所有偏导数在每一点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处存在且连续，无需额外正则性。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K$</span> 在任何紧集上被正常数从下方控制、被常数从上方控制，商法则求导合法。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（维度约定）</strong>：本节所有矩阵均按“行指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 为输出分量、列指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 为输入分量”排列，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j$</span>；这与深度学习框架中“雅可比第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 列”的约定一致。向量均视为列向量。</p>\n<p>下面先陈述主定理并给出逐步证明，再给出两个可检验的推论与一个具体数值例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-1-Softmax-雅可比的主公式\">命题 2.1（Softmax 雅可比的主公式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-1-Softmax-雅可比的主公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\,\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i}{\\partial z_j}\n=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i\\bigl(\\delta_{ij}-\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_j\\bigr).$$</div>\n等价地，以矩阵形式写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-p\\,p^{\\top},\\qquad p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=e^{z_i}/S_K$</span>。分两种情形计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>情形一：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span>。</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=e^{z_i}/S_K$</span> 用商法则，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K$</span> 中含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 一项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_i}\n=\\frac{e^{z_i}S_K-e^{z_i}\\cdot e^{z_i}}{S_K^{2}}\n=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S_K}\\cdot\\frac{S_K-e^{z_i}}{S_K}\n=p_i\\cdot\\frac{S_K-e^{z_i}}{S_K}.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{S_K-e^{z_i}}{S_K}=1-\\dfrac{e^{z_i}}{S_K}=1-p_i$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_i}=p_i(1-p_i)=p_i(\\delta_{ii}-p_i).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>情形二：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>。</em> 此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span>，故分子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 的偏导为零，仅分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_j}\n=e^{z_i}\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{e^{z_j}}{S_K^{2}}\\right)\n=-\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S_K}\\cdot\\frac{e^{z_j}}{S_K}\n=-p_i p_j.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p_ip_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。</p>\n<p>合并两情形即得逐元公式。矩阵形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 的对角元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\delta_{ij}$</span> 部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-pp^{\\top}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p_ip_j$</span>，两者相加正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>关键结构性观察</strong>（供后续节使用，本节只陈述不展开）：对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的每一行之和为零，因为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=1}^{K}J_{ij}(z)=\\sum_{j=1}^{K}p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)=p_i\\Bigl(1-\\sum_{j=1}^{K}p_j\\Bigr)=p_i(1-1)=0.$$</div>\n同理每一列之和亦为零。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)\\mathbf{1}_K=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\top}J(z)=0^{\\top}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的零空间至少包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>。这与“softmax 对加性常数平移不变”一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto z+c\\mathbf{1}_K$</span> 不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，方向导数沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K$</span> 必为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-推论-2-2-雅可比的秩与对称性\">推论 2.2（雅可比的秩与对称性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-推论-2-2-雅可比的秩与对称性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在命题 2.1 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 且所有分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>（这在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 下恒成立）。</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 是对称矩阵：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)^{\\top}=J(z)$</span>。\n(ii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\top}J(z)v=\\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_i v_i^{2}-\\bigl(\\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_i v_i\\bigr)^{2}\\ge 0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 半正定。\n(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(J(z))=K-1$</span>，零空间恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 对称，<span class=\"math-inline\">$pp^{\\top}$</span> 对称，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 对称。(ii) 直接计算二次型：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\top}Jv=v^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)v-v^{\\top}pp^{\\top}v=\\sum_{i}p_iv_i^{2}-\\Bigl(\\sum_{i}p_iv_i\\Bigr)^{2}.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为概率向量，右端是随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>（取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>）的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(V)\\ge 0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-加权下为常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>。(iii) 由 (ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的零空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\mathrm{Var}_p(V)=0\\}=\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>，维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；由秩—零化度定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(J)=K-1$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 2.2(ii) 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 是某个协方差矩阵，这为第 11 节“单纯形上的 Fisher 度量”提供了直接对象：softmax 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 映到概率单纯形，其诱导度量正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的二次型在切空间上的限制。本节不展开该度量，仅指出接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-3-链式法则下的梯度恒等式\">命题 2.3（链式法则下的梯度恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-3-链式法则下的梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 复合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde L(z)=L(p)$</span>。则在假设 A1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z\\tilde L(z)=J(z)^{\\top}\\nabla_p L(p)=J(z)\\nabla_p L(p),$$</div>\n其中第二个等号用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的对称性（推论 2.2(i)）。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(p)=-\\log p_y$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 固定），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p L(p)=-\\mathrm{onehot}(y)/p_y$</span>，代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=J(z)\\cdot\\Bigl(-\\frac{e_y}{p_y}\\Bigr)=-\\,J(z)_{:,y}\\big/p_y,$$</div>\n其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个分量为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{J_{iy}(z)}{p_y}=-\\frac{p_i(\\delta_{iy}-p_y)}{p_y}=\\begin{cases}p_i,&amp;i\\ne y,\\\\[2pt] -(1-p_y),&amp;i=y,\\end{cases}$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=p-\\mathrm{onehot}(y)$</span>。这与本章 canonical claim 一致；完整推导留给第 7 节“交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度”，本节只作为链式法则的验证性推论给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：复合函数求导的链式法则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 情形下逐点成立（假设 A1 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 可微），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\tilde L/\\partial z_j=\\sum_i(\\partial L/\\partial p_i)(\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j)$</span>，写成矩阵即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\tilde L=J^{\\top}\\nabla_p L$</span>。对称性由推论 2.2(i)。第二段的逐分量计算已在上文逐步写出，直接代入命题 2.1 的逐元公式即可。证毕。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的数值验证\">具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的数值验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(1,0,-1)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z}=(e,1,e^{-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_3=e+1+e^{-1}$</span>。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e\\approx 2.71828$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1}\\approx 0.36788$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_3\\approx 4.08616$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p\\approx(0.66524,\\;0.24473,\\;0.09003).$$</div>\n按命题 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{11}=p_1(1-p_1)\\approx 0.66524\\times 0.33476\\approx 0.22270$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{12}=-p_1p_2\\approx -0.16280$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{13}=-p_1p_3\\approx -0.05989$</span>。逐行求和应为零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.22270-0.16280-0.05989\\approx 0.00001$</span>（舍入误差内）。下节代码节将用有限差分核验这些数值，并断言最大绝对误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与相邻概念的区别\">与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>需要强调三点区别，以免与后续节混淆。</p>\n<p>第一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 是 softmax <strong>映射本身</strong>的雅可比，不是交叉熵损失的 Hessian。后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}$</span> 等因子的组合（见第 7 节），二者不可混用。</p>\n<p>第二，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 半正定但<strong>奇异</strong>（秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>），因此不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{-1}$</span>；任何试图写“<span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{-1}$</span>”的表达式都必须先商掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K$</span> 方向，或在单纯形切空间上取伪逆。这一点在第 11 节 Fisher 度量中会正式处理。</p>\n<p>第三，逐元公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 是<strong>指标</strong>上的 Kronecker 符号，不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的某个函数的导数；不要把它与“对角矩阵”混淆——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 的对角元是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 只出现在逐元展开里。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-4-雅可比的二阶导与-Hessian-结构\">命题 2.4（雅可比的二阶导与 Hessian 结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-4-雅可比的二阶导与-Hessian-结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j,k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，softmax 分量的二阶偏导为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial^{2}p_i}{\\partial z_j\\,\\partial z_k}\n=p_i\\Bigl[\\delta_{ij}\\delta_{ik}-\\delta_{ij}p_k-\\delta_{ik}p_j-p_j\\delta_{jk}+2p_jp_k\\Bigr].$$</div>\n等价地，以三阶张量形式写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial J_{ij}}{\\partial z_k}=J_{ij}\\bigl(\\delta_{ik}-p_k\\bigr)+p_i\\bigl(\\delta_{jk}-p_k\\bigr)\\cdot(\\text{此处需逐项核对}),$$</div>\n其中右端第二项的正确形式由下文逐步推出，不采用张量缩写。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：从命题 2.1 的逐元公式出发，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_k$</span> 求偏导，用乘积法则：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial J_{ij}}{\\partial z_k}\n=\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_k}(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)+p_i\\cdot\\frac{\\partial(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)}{\\partial z_k}.$$</div>\n第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_k=p_i(\\delta_{ik}-p_k)$</span>，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(\\delta_{ik}-p_k)(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_j/\\partial z_k=p_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)$</span>，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p_i p_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)$</span>。合并：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial J_{ij}}{\\partial z_k}\n=p_i(\\delta_{ik}-p_k)(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)-p_ip_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k).$$</div>\n展开第一项中的乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\delta_{ik}-p_k)(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)=\\delta_{ik}\\delta_{ij}-\\delta_{ik}p_j-\\delta_{ij}p_k+p_jp_k$</span>，再乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，减去第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_ip_j\\delta_{jk}-p_ip_jp_k$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial J_{ij}}{\\partial z_k}\n=p_i\\bigl[\\delta_{ij}\\delta_{ik}-\\delta_{ik}p_j-\\delta_{ij}p_k+p_jp_k\\bigr]-p_ip_j\\delta_{jk}+p_ip_jp_k.$$</div>\n把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p_ip_j\\delta_{jk}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+p_ip_jp_k$</span> 并入方括号：方括号内变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}\\delta_{ik}-\\delta_{ik}p_j-\\delta_{ij}p_k-p_j\\delta_{jk}+2p_jp_k$</span>。这正是命题所陈述的形式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.5（Hessian 与 Fisher 信息的关系）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(p)=-\\sum_{i}q_i\\log p_i$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\ge 0$</span>）为目标的交叉熵，复合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde L(z)=L(\\mathrm{softmax}(z))$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde L$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的 Hessian 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z^{2}\\tilde L(z)=J(z)^{\\top}\\,\\mathrm{diag}(q)\\,\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-2}\\,J(z),$$</div>\n其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(j,k)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i}q_i\\,J_{ij}J_{ik}/p_i^{2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p L(p)$</span>，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-q_i/p_i$</span>。再算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p^{2}L(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(q)\\,\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-2}$</span>（对角，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i/p_i^{2}$</span>）。复合函数 Hessian 的链式法则为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z^{2}\\tilde L=J^{\\top}(\\nabla_p^{2}L)J+\\sum_{i}(\\partial_{p_i}L)\\,\\nabla_z^{2}p_i.$$</div>\n右端第二项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z^{2}p_i$</span>，由命题 2.4 给出，一般不为零；因此上式<strong>不是</strong>单纯的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(q)\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-2}J$</span>。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span>（即目标分布等于当前 softmax 输出，交叉熵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处取极小），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{p_i}L=-p_i/p_i=-1$</span>，第二项变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i\\nabla_z^{2}p_i$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\nabla_z^{2}p_i=0$</span>（逐元求和为零向量），故第二项整体为零，此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z^{2}\\tilde L(z)\\big|_{q=p}=J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J.$$</div>\n又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>，直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}=J$</span>，即 Hessian 在极小点处恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 本身。这一恒等式是第 11 节 Fisher 度量的入口：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处，交叉熵 Hessian 与 softmax 雅可比重合，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 同时是映射的雅可比与统计流形的 Fisher 信息矩阵（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 坐标下）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注（区别）</strong>：推论 2.5 强调，一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ne p$</span> 时 Hessian 含二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\partial_{p_i}L)\\nabla_z^{2}p_i$</span>，不能把“交叉熵 Hessian”与“softmax 雅可比”混为一谈；只有在极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处二者才重合。这一点在第 7 节会正式展开，本节仅作为雅可比结构的推论记录。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-6-方向导数与单纯形切空间\">命题 2.6（方向导数与单纯形切空间）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-6-方向导数与单纯形切空间\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=J(z)$</span>。对任意方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，softmax 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的方向导数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_v\\,\\mathrm{softmax}(z)=J(z)\\,v=\\mathrm{diag}(p)v-p\\,(p^{\\top}v).$$</div>\n其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(v_i-\\bar v)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v=\\sum_{k}p_kv_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-加权平均。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：方向导数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv$</span>，由命题 2.1 的矩阵形式直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)v-pp^{\\top}v$</span>。逐分量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{diag}(p)v)_i=p_iv_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(pp^{\\top}v)_i=p_i\\sum_k p_kv_k=p_i\\bar v$</span>，相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(v_i-\\bar v)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.7（切空间刻画）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:p_i&gt;0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为开单纯形。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的像恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处的切空间\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}=\\Bigl\\{w\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:\\sum_{i}w_i=0\\Bigr\\}.$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 限制在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 上是线性同构，映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先证像含于切空间。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(Jv)_i=\\sum_i p_i(v_i-\\bar v)=\\sum_i p_iv_i-\\bar v\\sum_i p_i=\\bar v-\\bar v=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv\\in T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。再证满射。任取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i=0$</span>），构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=w/\\text{（对角缩放）}$</span>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i=w_i/p_i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Jv)_i=p_i(v_i-\\bar v)=p_i(w_i/p_i-\\bar v)=w_i-p_i\\bar v$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v=\\sum_k p_k(w_k/p_k)=\\sum_k w_k=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Jv)_i=w_i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv=w$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>（推论 2.2(iii)），由秩—零化度定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 诱导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)\\to T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的同构。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 2.7 说明，softmax 的雅可比把“logits 空间模去常数平移”这一商空间，线性同构地送到概率单纯形的切空间。这正是第 11 节在单纯形上定义 Fisher 度量时所需的坐标无关表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 是切映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J$</span> 是其拉回度量，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处该拉回度量恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 本身（推论 2.5）。本节只建立这一接口，不展开度量性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-8-对数域的雅可比-log-softmax-的梯度\">命题 2.8（对数域的雅可比：log-softmax 的梯度）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-8-对数域的雅可比-log-softmax-的梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：定义 log-softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(z)_i=\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i=z_i-\\log S_K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,K$</span>。则在假设 A1 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的雅可比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\ell_i}{\\partial z_j}=\\delta_{ij}-p_j,\\qquad\\text{即}\\quad J_\\ell(z)=I_K-\\mathbf{1}_K p^{\\top},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 单位矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_Kp^{\\top}$</span> 为每行均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\top}$</span> 的秩一矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_i=z_i-\\log S_K$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求偏导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial z_i/\\partial z_j=\\delta_{ij}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\log S_K/\\partial z_j=(1/S_K)\\cdot e^{z_j}=p_j$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\ell_i/\\partial z_j=\\delta_{ij}-p_j$</span>。矩阵形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_Kp^{\\top}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span>，相减即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.9（与 softmax 雅可比的关系）</strong>：在命题 2.8 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\ell(z)=J(z)\\,\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=J_\\ell(z)\\,\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}=(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top})\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}=I_K-\\mathbf{1}_Kp^{\\top}=J_\\ell(z)$</span>。右乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 即得第二式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 2.9 给出一个实用恒等式：log-softmax 的雅可比是 softmax 雅可比右乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}$</span>，即“除以概率”再取。这解释了为什么在数值实现中，先算 log-softmax 再算其梯度，可以避免显式构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 的逆（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 很小时该逆数值上危险）；第 10 节“反例：softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”会正式处理这一数值病态。本节只记录代数关系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-10-温度缩放的雅可比链式法则\">命题 2.10（温度缩放的雅可比链式法则）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-10-温度缩放的雅可比链式法则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span>。则在假设 A1 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的雅可比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J^{(\\tau)}(z)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\,J\\bigl(z/\\tau\\bigr)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\Bigl(\\mathrm{diag}(p^{(\\tau)})-p^{(\\tau)}p^{(\\tau)\\top}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(\\tau)}(z)\\to 0$</span>（逐元），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^{+}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(\\tau)}(z)$</span> 在非最大分量方向趋于零、在最大分量方向趋于退化（第 10 节反例）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/\\tau$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial u_k/\\partial z_j=\\delta_{kj}/\\tau$</span>。由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p^{(\\tau)}_i/\\partial z_j=\\sum_k(\\partial p_i/\\partial u_k)(\\partial u_k/\\partial z_j)=(1/\\tau)(\\partial p_i/\\partial u_j)=(1/\\tau)J_{ij}(u)$</span>。矩阵形式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(\\tau)}=(1/\\tau)J(z/\\tau)$</span>。代入命题 2.1 的矩阵形式得第二等式。极限行为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z/\\tau\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}\\to\\mathbf{1}_K/K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z/\\tau)\\to\\mathrm{diag}(\\mathbf{1}_K/K)-(\\mathbf{1}_K/K)(\\mathbf{1}_K/K)^{\\top}$</span> 有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(\\tau)}\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^{+}$</span> 的行为涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的退化，留给第 10 节。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 2.10 是第 5 节“温度缩放与分布锐化”的雅可比接口：温度只做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 的整体缩放与自变量缩放，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的代数结构（对称、半正定、秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>、零空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 全部保持）。因此第 5 节讨论锐化时，可以直接引用本节的结构性结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-11-复合-softmax-的雅可比-两级链式法则\">命题 2.11（复合 softmax 的雅可比：两级链式法则）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-11-复合-softmax-的雅可比-两级链式法则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^m\\to\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=g(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(g(x))$</span>。则在假设 A1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的光滑性下，复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto p$</span> 的雅可比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial x_a}=\\sum_{j=1}^{K}p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)\\,\\frac{\\partial g_j}{\\partial x_a},\\qquad a=1,\\dots,m,$$</div>\n矩阵形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{x\\mapsto p}(x)=J(z)\\,J_g(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_g(x)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times m}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的雅可比。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>，由多元链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial x_a=\\sum_j(\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j)(\\partial g_j/\\partial x_a)$</span>，代入命题 2.1 的逐元公式即得。矩阵形式由矩阵乘法定义直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.12（复合映射的秩上界）</strong>：在命题 2.11 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(J_{x\\mapsto p})\\le\\min(K-1,m)$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge K-1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_g$</span> 的像不与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 完全重合时取等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(AB)\\le\\min(\\mathrm{rank}A,\\mathrm{rank}B)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(J(z))=K-1$</span>（推论 2.2(iii)），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(J_g)\\le m$</span>，故上界成立。取等号的条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_g$</span> 的像必须包含至少一个不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 中的向量，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)J_g=0$</span>；一旦包含，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 在该向量上非零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 在商空间上满射（推论 2.7），故秩达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 2.12 对“softmax 作为网络最后一层”的秩分析有用：无论前面网络多宽（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 多大），softmax 输出的雅可比秩不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，因为 softmax 本身把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维切空间。这一事实在第 10 节讨论饱和导致的梯度消失时会再次出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-K-4-的复合与温度验证\">具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span> 的复合与温度验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-K-4-的复合与温度验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-13-雅可比与-softmax-的交换图-与配分函数导数的关系\">命题 2.13（雅可比与 softmax 的交换图：与配分函数导数的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-13-雅可比与-softmax-的交换图-与配分函数导数的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K=\\sum_{k}e^{z_k}$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log S_K$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\log S_K=p$</span>。则 softmax 的雅可比可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-\\nabla_z\\log S_K\\;\\bigl(\\nabla_z\\log S_K\\bigr)^{\\top},$$</div>\n且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_j}=p_i\\Bigl(\\delta_{ij}-\\frac{\\partial\\log S_K}{\\partial z_j}\\Bigr).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\log S_K/\\partial z_j$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K=\\sum_k e^{z_k}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial S_K/\\partial z_j=e^{z_j}$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\log S_K}{\\partial z_j}=\\frac{1}{S_K}\\cdot e^{z_j}=p_j.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\log S_K=p$</span>。代入命题 2.1 的逐元公式，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}-p_j=\\delta_{ij}-\\partial\\log S_K/\\partial z_j$</span>，即得逐元形式。矩阵形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$pp^{\\top}=(\\nabla_z\\log S_K)(\\nabla_z\\log S_K)^{\\top}$</span> 直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注（区别）</strong>：这一命题把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的秩一修正项识别为“配分函数对数梯度的外积”。它给出一个结构性解释：softmax 雅可比 = 对角缩放（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 给出）减去一个秩一投影（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log S_K$</span> 的梯度给出）。第 3 节“指数族的自然参数”将利用这一分解：在指数族坐标下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log S_K$</span> 是累积量函数，其梯度是充分统计量的期望，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 正是该期望关于自然参数的导数（即协方差矩阵）。本节只建立代数恒等式，不展开指数族语言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-14-雅可比的对角占优与谱界\">命题 2.14（雅可比的对角占优与谱界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-14-雅可比的对角占优与谱界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=J(z)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}=\\max_i p_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}=\\min_i p_i$</span>（有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<p>(i) 对角元满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ii}=p_i(1-p_i)\\in[0,1/4]$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ii}\\ge 0$</span>。\n(ii) 非对角元满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=-p_ip_j&lt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>）。\n(iii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ii}\\ge\\sum_{j\\ne i}|J_{ij}|$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 退化为 one-hot，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=0$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 是弱对角占优矩阵。\n(iv) 谱半径满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(J)=\\lambda_{\\max}(J)\\le\\tfrac12$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}(J)=2p_1p_2$</span>；零特征值对应特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)\\in(0,1/4]$</span>，最大值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1/2$</span> 取到。(ii) 由命题 2.1 逐元公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=-p_ip_j&lt;0$</span>。(iii) 计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j\\ne i}|J_{ij}|=\\sum_{j\\ne i}p_ip_j=p_i(1-p_i)=J_{ii},$$</div>\n故弱对角占优成立；等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1$</span>，此时其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=0$</span>。(iv) 由推论 2.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 对称半正定，秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，零空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>。非零特征值对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 上的二次型\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\top}Jv=\\mathrm{Var}_p(v)=\\sum_i p_iv_i^{2}-\\Bigl(\\sum_i p_iv_i\\Bigr)^{2},\\qquad \\|v\\|_2=1,\\ \\sum_i v_i=0.$$</div>\n由 Popoviciu 方差不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(v)\\le\\tfrac14(\\max_i v_i-\\min_i v_i)^2$</span>。又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|_2=1$</span>，极差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\max_i v_i-\\min_i v_i)^2\\le2$</span>（取到极值的两个坐标贡献全部范数），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}\\le\\tfrac12$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(1,-1)/\\sqrt2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(v)=2p_1p_2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}=2p_1p_2$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的谱由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个非零特征值组成，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(v)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 上的驻值，一般没有仅用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}$</span> 表示的闭式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2p_1p_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均匀时为重特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>。上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2)$</span> 取到。第 10 节讨论饱和时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}\\to1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\to0$</span>，全部特征值趋于零，这是梯度消失的谱解释。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-15-雅可比的逆问题-给定切向量求-logits-方向\">命题 2.15（雅可比的逆问题：给定切向量求 logits 方向）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-15-雅可比的逆问题-给定切向量求-logits-方向\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=J(z)$</span>。给定目标切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i=0$</span>），存在唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv=w$</span>，其代表元可取\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_i=\\frac{w_i}{p_i},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iv_i=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 2.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 上是线性同构映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，故存在唯一性成立。构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i=w_i/p_i$</span>：先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv=w$</span>。由命题 2.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Jv)_i=p_i(v_i-\\bar v)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v=\\sum_k p_kv_k=\\sum_k p_k(w_k/p_k)=\\sum_k w_k=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Jv)_i=p_iv_i=w_i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv=w$</span>。再验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的代表元选择：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'=v+c\\mathbf{1}_K$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv'=Jv+0=w$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在商空间中的等价类唯一；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v=0$</span> 的代表元即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i=w_i/p_i$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题给出 softmax 雅可比的“显式逆”（在商空间意义下），是第 7 节反向传播与第 11 节自然梯度的代数基础：自然梯度更新在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 坐标下正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i=w_i/p_i$</span> 的形式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是欧氏梯度在切空间上的投影。本节只建立逆问题，不展开自然梯度算法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-16-雅可比的行列式与体积元\">命题 2.16（雅可比的行列式与体积元）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-16-雅可比的行列式与体积元\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=J(z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的线性映射，其行列式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det J=0$</span>（因秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1&lt;K$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 上的限制记作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\det A=K\\prod_{i=1}^{K}p_i.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\notin\\{p_i\\}$</span>，用矩阵行列式引理展开特征多项式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\det(\\lambda I-J)=\\det\\bigl((\\lambda I-\\mathrm{diag}(p))+pp^{\\top}\\bigr)=\\Bigl(\\prod_i(\\lambda-p_i)\\Bigr)\\Bigl(1+\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^{2}}{\\lambda-p_i}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\lambda)=\\prod_i(\\lambda-p_i)+\\sum_i p_i^{2}\\prod_{j\\ne i}(\\lambda-p_j)$</span>，则右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\lambda)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 是首一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次多项式，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(\\lambda I-J)$</span> 在除有限个点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_i\\}$</span> 外处处相等，故二者恒等。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\mathbf{1}_K=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 是特征值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(0)=(-1)^{K}\\prod_i p_i+(-1)^{K-1}\\prod_i p_i=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\lambda)=\\lambda Q(\\lambda)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 首一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 次，其根即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的非零特征值，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\det A=\\prod_{a=1}^{K-1}\\lambda_a=(-1)^{K-1}Q(0)=(-1)^{K-1}P'(0).$$</div>\n求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P'(\\lambda)=\\sum_i\\prod_{j\\ne i}(\\lambda-p_j)+\\sum_i p_i^{2}\\sum_{k\\ne i}\\prod_{j\\ne i,k}(\\lambda-p_j)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 处，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P'(0)=(-1)^{K-1}\\Bigl[\\sum_i\\prod_{j\\ne i}p_j-\\sum_{i\\ne k}p_i^{2}\\prod_{j\\ne i,k}p_j\\Bigr]=(-1)^{K-1}\\Bigl(\\prod_i p_i\\Bigr)\\Bigl[\\sum_i\\frac{1}{p_i}-\\sum_{i\\ne k}\\frac{p_i}{p_k}\\Bigr].$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ne k}p_i/p_k=\\sum_k(1-p_k)/p_k=\\sum_k 1/p_k-K$</span>，方括号等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P'(0)=(-1)^{K-1}K\\prod_i p_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det A=K\\prod_i p_i$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det A\\le K^{1-K}$</span>，等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 AM–GM，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i p_i\\le(\\frac{1}{K}\\sum_i p_i)^{K}=K^{-K}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det A\\le K^{1-K}$</span>；等号条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=\\cdots=p_K=1/K$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det A=2p_1p_2$</span>，与命题 2.14(iv) 中唯一非零特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}=2p_1p_2$</span> 一致（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 是一维的）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 均匀分布时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det A=1/9$</span>，与特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>（二重）之积一致。体积元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\det A}$</span> 在第 11 节 Fisher 度量中按此式使用，均匀分布处取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^{(1-K)/2}$</span>，越靠近单纯形边界越小，与“边界处概率坐标退化”的直觉相符。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-17-雅可比与-softmax-的微分几何-切映射的显式坐标\">命题 2.17（雅可比与 softmax 的微分几何：切映射的显式坐标）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-17-雅可比与-softmax-的微分几何-切映射的显式坐标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 视为 logits 空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 视为概率单纯形。softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F(z)=p$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处的切映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_zF:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 给出。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T_zF(v)=J(z)v=\\mathrm{diag}(p)v-p(p^{\\top}v).$$</div>\n若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上取标准欧氏度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 上取诱导度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_p(w,w')=\\sum_i w_iw_i'/p_i$</span>（即 Fisher 度量的坐标形式），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_zF$</span> 的拉回度量为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(T_zF)^{*}g_p(v,v')=v^{\\top}J(z)^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J(z)v'=v^{\\top}J(z)v',$$</div>\n其中第二个等号用到推论 2.9 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J=J$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：切映射由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 给出是命题 2.1 的直接推论。拉回度量的定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(T_zF)^{*}g_p(v,v')=g_p(Jv,Jv')=\\sum_i(Jv)_i(Jv')_i/p_i$</span>。写成矩阵即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\top}J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}Jv'$</span>。由推论 2.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J=(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top})\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top})$</span>。计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top})=I_K-\\mathbf{1}_Kp^{\\top}=J_\\ell$</span>（命题 2.8）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J=J^{\\top}J_\\ell=J^{\\top}(I_K-\\mathbf{1}_Kp^{\\top})=J^{\\top}-J^{\\top}\\mathbf{1}_Kp^{\\top}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathbf{1}_K=0$</span>（列和为零），故第二项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J=J^{\\top}=J$</span>（对称性）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题把第 11 节“单纯形上的 Fisher 度量”与本节雅可比直接连接：在 logits 坐标下，Fisher 度量的拉回恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 本身。这是“softmax 雅可比 = Fisher 信息矩阵”的精确表述，也是自然梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 坐标下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{-1}$</span>（在商空间意义下）的依据。本节只建立这一恒等式，不展开自然梯度算法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-18-雅可比在数值实现中的稳定计算\">命题 2.18（雅可比在数值实现中的稳定计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-18-雅可比在数值实现中的稳定计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=\\max_i z_i$</span>，定义平移后的 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z=z-z_{\\max}\\mathbf{1}_K$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(\\tilde z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)=p$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J(z)=J(\\tilde z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top},$$</div>\n即雅可比对加性平移不变。因此数值实现中可先减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 再计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span>，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 上溢；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的逐元公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的绝对尺度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z+c\\mathbf{1}_K)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 成立（分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{c}$</span>）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=-z_{\\max}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(\\tilde z)=p$</span>。雅可比公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=J(\\tilde z)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题是第 4 节“Log-sum-exp 的数值稳定”的雅可比接口：数值稳定不仅保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不溢出，也保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的逐元计算不溢出，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\in(0,1)$</span>。第 4 节将正式处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log S_K$</span> 的稳定计算，本节只记录雅可比的平移不变性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-19-雅可比与-one-hot-极限-饱和的代数刻画\">命题 2.19（雅可比与 one-hot 极限：饱和的代数刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-19-雅可比与-one-hot-极限-饱和的代数刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(t)}=t\\,e_y$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 个标准基向量）。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(t)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z^{(t)})\\to e_y$</span>（one-hot），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z^{(t)})\\to 0$</span>（零矩阵），收敛速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-t})$</span>（非对角元）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-t})$</span>（对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{yy}=p_y(1-p_y)\\to 0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(t)}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，其余分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K=e^{t}+(K-1)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=e^{t}/(e^{t}+K-1)\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1/(e^{t}+K-1)\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne y$</span>）。雅可比逐元：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{yy}=p_y(1-p_y)\\to 0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ii}=p_i(1-p_i)\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne y$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=-p_ip_j\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>）。收敛速度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_y=(K-1)/(e^{t}+K-1)=O(e^{-t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=O(e^{-t})$</span>，故所有元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-t})$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题是第 10 节“反例：softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”的代数准备：当 logits 沿 one-hot 方向趋于无穷时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 趋于 one-hot，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 趋于零矩阵，故任何通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的梯度（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log p_y)=p-e_y$</span> 的雅可比作用）趋于零。第 10 节将给出具体的梯度消失反例与数值边界，本节只建立极限的代数刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-20-雅可比的行列式引理与秩一更新的逆\">命题 2.20（雅可比的行列式引理与秩一更新的逆）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-20-雅可比的行列式引理与秩一更新的逆\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，定义正则化雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\epsilon=J+\\epsilon I_K$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\epsilon$</span> 可逆，且其逆为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\epsilon^{-1}=\\frac{1}{\\epsilon}\\Bigl(I_K-\\frac{1}{\\epsilon^{-1}+\\|p\\|_2^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}pp^{\\top}\\Bigr)\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}\\cdot\\ldots$$</div>\n这一表达式需逐步推导；正确的秩一更新逆由 Sherman–Morrison 公式给出。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{diag}(p)+\\epsilon I_K$</span>（可逆，对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i+\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\epsilon=A-pp^{\\top}$</span>。由 Sherman–Morrison，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_\\epsilon^{-1}=A^{-1}+\\frac{A^{-1}pp^{\\top}A^{-1}}{1-p^{\\top}A^{-1}p}.$$</div>\n分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p^{\\top}A^{-1}p=1-\\sum_i p_i^{2}/(p_i+\\epsilon)&gt;0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^{2}/(p_i+\\epsilon)&lt;\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\epsilon^{-1}$</span> 存在且显式可算。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{diag}(p)+\\epsilon I_K$</span> 对角且对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i+\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，故可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-1}=\\mathrm{diag}(1/(p_i+\\epsilon))$</span>。Sherman–Morrison 公式适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p^{\\top}A^{-1}p\\ne 0$</span> 的情形。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\top}A^{-1}p=\\sum_i p_i^{2}/(p_i+\\epsilon)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/(p_i+\\epsilon)&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{2}/(p_i+\\epsilon)&lt;p_i$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>，分母严格正。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\epsilon^{-1}$</span> 存在，公式成立。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题给出 softmax 雅可比的正则化逆的显式公式，是第 11 节 Fisher 度量数值实现与第 7 节自然梯度正则化的代数基础。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 0^{+}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\epsilon^{-1}$</span> 发散（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 奇异），发散方向正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K$</span>（零空间），这与推论 2.2(iii) 一致。本节只建立正则化逆，不展开数值稳定性分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-21-雅可比与-softmax-的复合-两级-softmax-的雅可比\">命题 2.21（雅可比与 softmax 的复合：两级 softmax 的雅可比）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-21-雅可比与-softmax-的复合-两级-softmax-的雅可比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathrm{softmax}(p)$</span>（即对概率向量再做一次 softmax）。则复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto q$</span> 的雅可比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial q_i}{\\partial z_j}=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}q_i(\\delta_{ik}-q_k)\\,p_k(\\delta_{kj}-p_j),$$</div>\n矩阵形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{q\\circ p}(z)=J(q)\\,J(p)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(q)=\\mathrm{diag}(q)-qq^{\\top}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2.11（复合映射的链式法则），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\mathrm{softmax}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=z$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{q\\circ p}=J(q)J(p)$</span>。逐元展开即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.22（两级 softmax 的秩）</strong>：在命题 2.21 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(J_{q\\circ p})\\le K-1$</span>，且一般取等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(p)$</span> 的像不与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 完全重合时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 2.12，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(J(q)J(p))\\le\\min(\\mathrm{rank}J(q),\\mathrm{rank}J(p))=K-1$</span>。取等号条件同推论 2.12。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：两级 softmax 在层次 softmax 与混合 softmax 中出现（第 12 节），本节只建立复合雅可比的代数形式，不展开层次结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-23-雅可比与交叉熵的-Fisher-恒等式-完整推导\">命题 2.23（雅可比与交叉熵的 Fisher 恒等式：完整推导）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-23-雅可比与交叉熵的-Fisher-恒等式-完整推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 为任意目标分布（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i=1$</span>），交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q,p)=-\\sum_i q_i\\log p_i$</span> 复合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde H(z)=H(q,\\mathrm{softmax}(z))$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde H$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的梯度与 Hessian 分别为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z\\tilde H(z)=J(z)\\Bigl(-\\frac{q}{p}\\Bigr)=p-q,\\qquad\n\\nabla_z^{2}\\tilde H(z)=J(z)^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(q)\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-2}J(z)+\\sum_i\\Bigl(-\\frac{q_i}{p_i}\\Bigr)\\nabla_z^{2}p_i.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时，第二项为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\nabla_z^{2}p_i=0$</span> 逐元），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z^{2}\\tilde H(z)=J(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p H(q,p)=-q/p$</span>（逐元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-q_i/p_i$</span>），由命题 2.3 的链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\tilde H=J^{\\top}(-q/p)=J(-q/p)$</span>（对称性）。逐元计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(J(-q/p))_i=\\sum_j J_{ij}(-q_j/p_j)=\\sum_j p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)(-q_j/p_j)=p_i(-q_i/p_i+\\sum_j p_jq_j/p_j)=p_i(-q_i/p_i+\\sum_j q_j)=p_i(-q_i/p_i+1)=p_i-q_i$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\tilde H=p-q$</span>。Hessian：由复合函数 Hessian 链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z^{2}\\tilde H=J^{\\top}(\\nabla_p^{2}H)J+\\sum_i(\\partial_{p_i}H)\\nabla_z^{2}p_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p^{2}H=\\mathrm{diag}(q)\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-2}$</span>（对角，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i/p_i^{2}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{p_i}H=-q_i/p_i$</span>。故第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(q)\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-2}J$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(-q_i/p_i)\\nabla_z^{2}p_i$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时，第二项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-q_i/p_i=-1$</span>，故第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i\\nabla_z^{2}p_i$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\nabla_z^{2}p_i=0$</span>（逐元求和为零向量），故第二项为零。第一项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-2}J=J^{\\top}\\mathrm{diag}(p)^{-1}J=J$</span>（命题 2.17）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题是第 7 节“交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度”的完整代数准备：梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-q$</span> 是 canonical claim 的推广（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathrm{onehot}(y)$</span> 时即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-y$</span>），Hessian 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 是 Fisher 恒等式的精确表述。本节只建立代数恒等式，不展开优化算法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-24-雅可比与-softmax-的-Lipschitz-常数\">命题 2.24（雅可比与 softmax 的 Lipschitz 常数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-24-雅可比与-softmax-的-Lipschitz-常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 关于欧氏范数满足 Lipschitz 条件，Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathrm{softmax}(z)-\\mathrm{softmax}(z')\\|_2\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\|z-z'\\|_2,\\qquad\\forall z,z'\\in\\mathbb{R}^K.$$</div>\n且常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 不可改进（存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,z'$</span> 使等号逼近）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由多元中值定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathrm{softmax}(z)-\\mathrm{softmax}(z')\\|_2\\le\\sup_{\\xi\\in[z,z']}\\|J(\\xi)\\|_2\\|z-z'\\|_2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|J\\|_2$</span> 为谱范数。由命题 2.14(iv)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|J\\|_2=\\lambda_{\\max}(J)\\le 1/2$</span>，故 Lipschitz 常数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>紧性</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(t,-t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z'=(t+h,-t-h)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=z'-z=h(1,-1)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to(1/2,1/2)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J=\\begin{pmatrix}1/4&amp;-1/4\\\\-1/4&amp;1/4\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad Jv=\\frac{h}{2}(1,-1),$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F(z')-F(z)\\|_2/\\|z'-z\\|_2\\to\\|Jv\\|_2/\\|v\\|_2=1/2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span>），常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 不可改进。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 2.14(iv) 给出的谱界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}\\le1/2$</span> 与这里的 Lipschitz 常数是同一个量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的均匀分布恰好饱和。饱和区（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}\\to1$</span>）则相反：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}\\to0$</span>，谱范数趋于零，softmax 在极端 logits 处几乎是局部常值映射——这正是第 10 节梯度消失的几何来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-25-雅可比与-softmax-的微分同胚-商空间上的同构\">命题 2.25（雅可比与 softmax 的微分同胚：商空间上的同构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-25-雅可比与-softmax-的微分同胚-商空间上的同构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 诱导商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的微分同胚。具体地，映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar F:\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)\\to\\Delta^{K-1},\\qquad [z]\\mapsto\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$$</div>\n是良定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 微分同胚，其切映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 在商空间上的诱导映射（推论 2.7），且该切映射处处可逆（秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：良定义：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z'=z+c\\mathbf{1}_K$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z')=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar F$</span> 不依赖代表元。光滑性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 光滑，商映射光滑，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar F$</span> 光滑。单射：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z')$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-z_i'=\\log S_K-\\log S_K'$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z-z'\\in\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[z]=[z']$</span>。满射：任取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\log p_i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)=p$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K=\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar F([z])=p$</span>。切映射可逆：由推论 2.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 在商空间上线性同构到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，故切映射处处可逆。由反函数定理（商空间形式），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar F$</span> 是微分同胚。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题是本章推导链的几何总结：softmax 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的微分同胚（因核非平凡），但诱导商空间上的微分同胚。第 16 节“本章推导链：softmax 是条件分布的参数化”将利用这一结论说明：条件分布的参数化在商空间意义下是一一的，logits 的常数平移是冗余参数，这正是指数族自然参数化的几何根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-26-雅可比与-softmax-的伴随-转置的显式形式\">命题 2.26（雅可比与 softmax 的伴随：转置的显式形式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-26-雅可比与-softmax-的伴随-转置的显式形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的转置（伴随）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J(z)^{\\top}=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}=J(z),$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 自伴。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)w$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(w_i-\\bar w)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar w=\\sum_k p_kw_k$</span>。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 上的限制与在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上的作用通过投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mapsto w-\\bar w\\mathbf{1}_K$</span> 联系：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J(z)w=\\mathrm{diag}(p)\\,(w-\\bar w\\mathbf{1}_K).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：自伴由推论 2.2(i)。逐元：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Jw)_i=p_i(w_i-\\bar w)$</span>（命题 2.6）。写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)(w-\\bar w\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的“中心化”解释：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-加权中心化（减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar w$</span>），再逐分量乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。这一解释在第 11 节 Fisher 度量的坐标变换中会用到：中心化对应切空间投影，逐分量乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 对应度量张量的对角部分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-2-27-雅可比与-softmax-的核与像的完整刻画\">命题 2.27（雅可比与 softmax 的核与像的完整刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-2-27-雅可比与-softmax-的核与像的完整刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=J(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ker J=\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>。\n(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{im}\\,J=\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}=\\{w\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:\\sum_i w_i=0\\}=T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。\n(iii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Jw$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 上的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-加权投影”再逐分量乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Jw=\\mathrm{diag}(p)(w-\\bar w\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>。\n(iv) <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，零度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 由推论 2.2(iii)。(ii) 由推论 2.7。 (iii) 由命题 2.26。(iv) 由秩—零化度定理与 (i)(ii)。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题汇总了本节关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的核与像的全部结论，是第 11 节 Fisher 度量与第 16 节推导链的代数基础。核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 对应 logits 的常数平移冗余，像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 对应概率单纯形的切空间，二者共同刻画了 softmax 的几何结构。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Softmax 的雅可比逐元公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，矩阵形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上处处存在且连续。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 对称、半正定、秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，零空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>，对应 softmax 的加性平移不变性；其二次型是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-加权方差。</li>\n<li>链式法则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L(\\mathrm{softmax}(z))=J(z)\\nabla_p L(p)$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=-\\log p_y$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=p-\\mathrm{onehot}(y)$</span>，与本章 canonical claim 一致。</li>\n<li>Softmax 的雅可比逐元公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，矩阵形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上处处存在且连续；其核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span>，像为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}=T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 对称、半正定、弱对角占优，谱范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}(1-p_{\\max})\\le 1/4$</span>，softmax 映射的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_K^{\\perp}$</span> 上的诱导映射可逆，softmax 诱导商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1}_K)$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的微分同胚。</li>\n<li>链式法则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L(\\mathrm{softmax}(z))=J(z)\\nabla_p L(p)$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=-\\log p_y$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=p-\\mathrm{onehot}(y)$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-指数族的自然参数\">指数族的自然参数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-指数族的自然参数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 logits 向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为类别数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i=\\dfrac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 为 Kronecker 符号。前序节已证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\partial\\,\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i}{\\partial z_j}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\partial p}{\\partial z}=J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>参考类</strong>：固定一个下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，称第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 类为参考类。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=K$</span> 不损失一般性（若需换参考类，只需对坐标作置换）。</li>\n<li><strong>自然参数</strong>：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_1,\\dots,\\theta_{K-1})\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 为去掉第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 个坐标后的 logits，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=z_a-z_r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=K$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=z_a-z_K$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>充分统计量</strong>：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(i)=(\\mathbb{1}\\{i=1\\},\\dots,\\mathbb{1}\\{i=K-1\\})$</span>，即类别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的 one-hot 指示向量去掉第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 个坐标。</li>\n<li><strong>对数配分函数</strong>：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\log\\!\\left(1+\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}e^{\\theta_a}\\right)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>指数族密度</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(i)=\\exp\\!\\big(\\langle\\theta,T(i)\\rangle-A(\\theta)\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 上的标准内积。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为有限整数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 任意（无界），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 可能上溢，但本节所有代数恒等式均在实数域上作为形式恒等式成立，数值稳定问题留待第 4 节处理；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的对应是满秩仿射映射，其像为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：证明 softmax 恰好是某个指数族的均值参数化，其自然参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，并给出自然参数与均值参数之间的双向映射及其雅可比关系。这与第 2 节的雅可比推导是不同层面的对象：第 2 节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto p$</span> 的雅可比，本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p$</span> 的雅可比，并说明二者相差一个秩亏的线性映射。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-定义-指数族与均值参数化\">定义：指数族与均值参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-定义-指数族与均值参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（指数族）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为有限样本空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 为充分统计量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 为自然参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)$</span> 为对数配分函数。若概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp\\!\\big(\\langle\\theta,T(x)\\rangle-A(\\theta)\\big),\\qquad x\\in\\mathcal{X},$$</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta\\}_{\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}}$</span> 为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 生成的指数族。<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 由归一化条件唯一确定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(\\theta)=\\log\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal{X}}\\exp\\!\\big(\\langle\\theta,T(x)\\rangle\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义 2（均值参数）</strong>。定义均值参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T(X)]\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span>，其分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_a(\\theta)=p_\\theta(a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>。第 1 节把 softmax 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto p$</span> 的归一化映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维的，存在平移冗余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto z+c\\mathbf{1}$</span> 不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；本节把 softmax 重新组织为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p$</span> 的映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维的，平移冗余被商掉。因此自然参数化是<strong>满秩</strong>的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在单纯形内部一一对应，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是多对一的。这一区别是本节全部结论的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-主定理-softmax-的指数族表示\">主定理：softmax 的指数族表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-主定理-softmax-的指数族表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（softmax 即指数族的均值参数化）</strong>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=z_a-z_K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,\\dots,K-1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 如符号表所定义。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(i)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。分两种情形。</p>\n<p>情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\theta,T(i)\\rangle=\\theta_i=z_i-z_K$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(\\theta)=\\log\\!\\left(1+\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}e^{z_a-z_K}\\right)=\\log\\!\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j-z_K}\\right)=\\log\\!\\left(e^{-z_K}\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}\\right)=-\\!z_K+\\log\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(i)=\\exp\\!\\big(z_i-z_K-A(\\theta)\\big)=\\exp\\!\\left(z_i-z_K+z_K-\\log\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}\\right)=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i.$$</div>\n<p>情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=K$</span>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(K)=\\mathbf{0}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\theta,T(K)\\rangle=0$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(K)=\\exp\\!\\big(0-A(\\theta)\\big)=\\exp\\!\\left(z_K-\\log\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}\\right)=\\frac{e^{z_K}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_K.$$</div>\n<p>两种情形合起来即得结论。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（双向映射）</strong>。在命题 1 的假设下，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\mu(\\theta)=(\\mu_1,\\dots,\\mu_{K-1})$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 到开单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+=\\{p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}:p_i&gt;0\\ \\forall i\\}$</span> 去掉第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个坐标后的像的双射，其逆映射为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta_a=\\log\\frac{\\mu_a}{\\mu_K}=\\log\\frac{\\mu_a}{1-\\sum_{b=1}^{K-1}\\mu_b},\\qquad a=1,\\dots,K-1.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_a(\\theta)=p_\\theta(a)=\\dfrac{e^{\\theta_a}}{1+\\sum_{b}e^{\\theta_b}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_K=p_\\theta(K)=\\dfrac{1}{1+\\sum_{b}e^{\\theta_b}}$</span>。两式相除得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_a/\\mu_K=e^{\\theta_a}$</span>，取对数即得逆映射公式。正向映射显然连续；逆映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_K&gt;0$</span> 时连续。单射性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta)=\\mu(\\theta')$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta_a}=e^{\\theta'_a}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta'$</span>。满射性：任给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 去掉第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 坐标，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=\\log(\\mu_a/\\mu_K)$</span>，直接代入可验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta)=\\mu$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>。推论 1 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的平移冗余在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下被完全消除；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在单纯形内部的<strong>全局坐标</strong>。这与第 2 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的秩亏性质（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)\\mathbf{1}=0$</span>）互为对偶：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的零空间恰是平移方向，商掉它即得满秩的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mu/\\partial\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-自然参数下的雅可比\">自然参数下的雅可比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-自然参数下的雅可比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\mu$</span> 的雅可比）</strong>。在命题 1 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=\\dfrac{\\partial\\mu}{\\partial\\theta}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{(K-1)\\times(K-1)}$</span>，其分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ab}=\\dfrac{\\partial\\mu_a}{\\partial\\theta_b}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M(\\theta)=\\mathrm{diag}(\\mu_{1:K-1})-\\mu_{1:K-1}\\mu_{1:K-1}^{\\top},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{1:K-1}=(\\mu_1,\\dots,\\mu_{K-1})^{\\top}$</span>。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)$</span> 是第 2 节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 去掉第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 行与第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 列后的主子矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_a=\\dfrac{e^{\\theta_a}}{1+\\sum_{b=1}^{K-1}e^{\\theta_b}}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_b$</span> 求偏导，分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=b$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ne b$</span>。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=b$</span> 时，用商法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\mu_a}{\\partial\\theta_a}=\\frac{e^{\\theta_a}\\left(1+\\sum_{c}e^{\\theta_c}\\right)-e^{\\theta_a}\\cdot e^{\\theta_a}}{\\left(1+\\sum_{c}e^{\\theta_c}\\right)^2}=\\mu_a-\\mu_a^2=\\mu_a(1-\\mu_a).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ne b$</span> 时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\mu_a}{\\partial\\theta_b}=\\frac{0\\cdot\\left(1+\\sum_{c}e^{\\theta_c}\\right)-e^{\\theta_a}\\cdot e^{\\theta_b}}{\\left(1+\\sum_{c}e^{\\theta_c}\\right)^2}=-\\mu_a\\mu_b.$$</div>\n<p>合并即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ab}=\\mu_a(\\delta_{ab}-\\mu_b)$</span>，写成矩阵形式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\mathrm{diag}(\\mu_{1:K-1})-\\mu_{1:K-1}\\mu_{1:K-1}^{\\top}$</span>。</p>\n<p>与第 2 节对照：第 2 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\mu_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)_{ij}=M_{ij}$</span>。即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的主子矩阵。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（两个雅可比的关系）</strong>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\in\\mathbb{R}^{(K-1)\\times K}$</span> 为差分算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{aj}=\\delta_{aj}-\\delta_{Kj}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=Dz$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M(\\theta)=D\\,J(z)\\,D^{\\top}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\partial\\mu}{\\partial\\theta}=\\dfrac{\\partial\\mu}{\\partial z}\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial\\theta}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{1:K-1}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个坐标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\partial\\mu}{\\partial z}=J(z)_{1:K-1,\\,1:K}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 行）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=Dz$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\partial\\theta}{\\partial z}=D$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial\\theta}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 的一个右逆。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$DJD^{\\top}$</span> 的分量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(DJD^{\\top})_{ab}=\\sum_{i,j}D_{ai}J_{ij}D_{bj}=J_{ab}-J_{aK}-J_{Kb}+J_{KK}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j=1$</span>，逐项化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_a(\\delta_{ab}-p_b)=M_{ab}$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>。推论 2 给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 通过差分算子共轭。这也解释了为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 秩亏而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 满秩：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 的核是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>，恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的零空间，商掉后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 可逆（在单纯形内部）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的显式验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的显式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,z_2,z_3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_1,\\theta_2)=(z_1-z_3,z_2-z_3)$</span>。此时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_1=\\frac{e^{\\theta_1}}{1+e^{\\theta_1}+e^{\\theta_2}},\\qquad \\mu_2=\\frac{e^{\\theta_2}}{1+e^{\\theta_1}+e^{\\theta_2}},\\qquad \\mu_3=\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\theta_1}+e^{\\theta_2}}.$$</div>\n<p>命题 2 给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M=\\begin{pmatrix}\\mu_1(1-\\mu_1) &amp; -\\mu_1\\mu_2\\\\ -\\mu_1\\mu_2 &amp; \\mu_2(1-\\mu_2)\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>取具体数值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(0,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\begin{pmatrix}2/9 &amp; -1/9\\\\ -1/9 &amp; 2/9\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det M=4/81-1/81=3/81=1/27&gt;0$</span>，可逆。第 2 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 在此点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{3}I-\\frac{1}{9}\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^{\\top}$</span>，其秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，零空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 去掉第 3 行第 3 列，与推论 2 一致。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(1,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta_1}=e$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta_2}=1$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+e+1=2+e$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=e/(2+e)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2=1/(2+e)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{11}=\\mu_1(1-\\mu_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{12}=-\\mu_1\\mu_2$</span>，可直接与数值差分对照（见下方代码节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-自然参数的几何意义\">自然参数的几何意义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-自然参数的几何意义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（自然参数是 Fisher 度量的势坐标）</strong>。在命题 1 的假设下，考虑开单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 上的 Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\mu)$</span>，其分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{ab}(\\mu)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\mu}\\!\\left[\\partial_a\\log p_\\mu(X)\\,\\partial_b\\log p_\\mu(X)\\right]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\mu)=M(\\theta(\\mu))^{-1},$$</div>\n<p>即 Fisher 度量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下是 Hessian 度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{ab}=\\partial_a\\partial_b A(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。指数族的标准恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_a A(\\theta)=\\mu_a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_a\\partial_b A(\\theta)=\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\theta}(T_a,T_b)=M_{ab}$</span>。另一方面，对数似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x)=\\langle\\theta,T(x)\\rangle-A(\\theta)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_a\\log p_\\theta(x)=T_a(x)-\\mu_a$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{ab}=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[(T_a-\\mu_a)(T_b-\\mu_b)\\right]=\\mathrm{Cov}(T_a,T_b)=M_{ab}.$$</div>\n<p>但需注意坐标：上式给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下的 Fisher 度量，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{\\theta}_{ab}=M_{ab}$</span>。若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 坐标，由坐标变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{\\mu}=(\\partial\\theta/\\partial\\mu)^{\\top}G^{\\theta}(\\partial\\theta/\\partial\\mu)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\theta/\\partial\\mu=M^{-1}$</span>（由推论 1 与命题 2），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{\\mu}=M^{-\\top}MM^{-1}=M^{-1}$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>。命题 3 把第 11 节（单纯形上的 Fisher 度量）的核心恒等式提前以势函数形式给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)$</span> 是 Fisher 度量的势，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\nabla A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\nabla^2 A$</span>。这解释了为什么自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是\"好\"坐标：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下 Fisher 度量是 Hessian，Christoffel 符号由三阶导数给出，对偶坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 下度量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1}$</span>。本节只陈述这一恒等式，不展开联络与测地线，留待第 11 节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（自然参数下的 Bregman 散度）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'\\in\\Theta$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\nabla A(\\theta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu'=\\nabla A(\\theta')$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=A(\\theta')-A(\\theta)-\\langle\\mu,\\theta'-\\theta\\rangle.$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x)=\\langle\\theta,T(x)\\rangle-A(\\theta)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=\\mathbb{E}_\\theta\\big[\\langle\\theta-\\theta',T(X)\\rangle\\big]-A(\\theta)+A(\\theta')=\\langle\\theta-\\theta',\\mu\\rangle-A(\\theta)+A(\\theta'),$$</div>\n最后一步用了矩匹配恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\theta[T(X)]=\\nabla A(\\theta)=\\mu$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>右端正是凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 与其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处一阶 Taylor 展开之差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的 Bregman 散度。由此立刻得到三条推论：KL 非负；KL 等于零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta'$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 严格凸）；KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta$</span> 附近的二阶展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta'-\\theta)^\\top\\nabla^2A(\\theta)(\\theta'-\\theta)/2$</span>，其二次型矩阵正是 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)=\\nabla^2A(\\theta)$</span>。这条恒等式把第 2 节的 Fisher 度量与散度统一在同一凸函数下：自然参数坐标中，散度是 Bregman 散度，度量是 Bregman 散度的 Hessian。</p>\n<p>同一恒等式在均值参数化下给出对偶形式：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为坐标时 KL 等于凸共轭 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^*$</span> 的 Bregman 散度，方向相反。自然参数与均值参数互为 Legendre 对偶，两种坐标下的散度只差一个符号与自变量替换，这解释了为什么 Fisher 度量在两种坐标下互为逆矩阵。</p>\n<p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的 Hessian 读成协方差还有一层含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2A(\\theta)=\\mathrm{Cov}_\\theta(T(X))$</span>，即 Fisher 信息等于充分统计量的协方差。这一等式把“估计精度”与“分布曲率”绑定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 越弯曲，参数越容易被区分，Cramér–Rao 下界越紧。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 退化（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的某个分量是其余分量的线性组合）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2A$</span> 奇异，参数不可辨识，指数族在该方向上的 Fisher 度量退化。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Softmax 是有限样本空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 上由 one-hot 充分统计量生成的指数族的均值参数化；自然参数为去掉参考类后的差分 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=z_a-z_K$</span>，对数配分函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\log(1+\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}e^{\\theta_a})$</span>，均值参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta)$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量。</li>\n<li>自然参数下的雅可比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=\\mathrm{diag}(\\mu_{1:K-1})-\\mu_{1:K-1}\\mu_{1:K-1}^{\\top}$</span>，它是第 2 节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的主子矩阵，并满足共轭恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=DJD^{\\top}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在单纯形内部满秩可逆，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 秩亏，二者之差恰为平移冗余。</li>\n<li>对数配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)$</span> 是 Fisher 度量的势：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\nabla A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\nabla^2 A=M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 坐标下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=M^{-1}$</span>；这一恒等式是第 11 节单纯形 Fisher 度量的出发点，本节仅以势函数形式陈述并验证。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-自然参数与充分统计量的对偶-累积量母函数\">自然参数与充分统计量的对偶：累积量母函数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-自然参数与充分统计量的对偶-累积量母函数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的一阶与二阶导数。为把自然参数的结构补足，本节再给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的完整累积量展开，并说明它为何是\"自然\"坐标的判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（累积量母函数）</strong>。在命题 1 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\theta(t)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\!\\left[e^{\\langle t,T(X)\\rangle}\\right]$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_\\theta(t)=\\exp\\!\\big(A(\\theta+t)-A(\\theta)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处的各阶导数给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(X)$</span> 的各阶累积量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_{a_1}\\cdots\\partial_{a_n}A(\\theta)=\\kappa_n\\!\\left(T_{a_1}(X),\\dots,T_{a_n}(X)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 阶联合累积量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_1,\\dots,a_n\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由定义 1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_\\theta(t)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal{X}}\\exp\\!\\big(\\langle\\theta,T(x)\\rangle-A(\\theta)\\big)\\,e^{\\langle t,T(x)\\rangle}=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal{X}}\\exp\\!\\big(\\langle\\theta+t,T(x)\\rangle-A(\\theta)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>把分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{A(\\theta+t)}$</span>，利用归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\exp(\\langle\\theta+t,T(x)\\rangle-A(\\theta+t))=1$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_\\theta(t)=e^{A(\\theta+t)-A(\\theta)}\\sum_{x}\\exp\\!\\big(\\langle\\theta+t,T(x)\\rangle-A(\\theta+t)\\big)=e^{A(\\theta+t)-A(\\theta)}.$$</div>\n<p>累积量展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log M_\\theta(t)=A(\\theta+t)-A(\\theta)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的各分量求偏导，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处的各阶偏导等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(X)$</span> 的联合累积量。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注（自然坐标的判据）</strong>。命题 4 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下累积量母函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的平移差，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数项被吸收；这正是\"自然\"一词的数学内容——在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下，充分统计量的各阶累积量就是势函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的各阶导数，无需额外的坐标变换因子。作为对照，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 坐标下累积量母函数不是平移差形式，一阶累积量（均值）恒等于坐标本身，二阶累积量（协方差）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1}$</span>，三阶及以上累积量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的三阶导数组合给出。这一对照是第 11 节对偶坐标下测地线方程的来源，本节只记录判据，不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-自然参数的仿射不变性\">自然参数的仿射不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-自然参数的仿射不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 1 节的 softmax 对 logits 的平移不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z+c\\mathbf{1})=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。本节的自然参数把这一不变性显式化为商映射。下面给出一个更强的陈述：自然参数在参考类置换下的变换是仿射的，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的变换只差一个常数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（参考类置换）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r,r'\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为两个参考类，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(r)}_a=z_a-z_r$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ne r$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(r')}_a=z_a-z_{r'}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ne r'$</span>），两个坐标向量各自去掉参考类坐标后按原顺序排列。则存在仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{r\\to r'}:\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}\\to\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(r')}=\\Phi_{r\\to r'}(\\theta^{(r)})$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_{r'}(\\theta^{(r')})=A_r(\\theta^{(r)})-z_{r'}+z_r,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_r$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{r'}$</span> 分别为两个参考类下的对数配分函数。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta^{(r)})=\\mu(\\theta^{(r')})$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 中的点相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。不失一般性设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r'=1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(K)}_a=z_a-z_K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,\\dots,K-1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(1)}_a=z_{a+1}-z_1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,\\dots,K-1$</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_2,\\dots,z_K$</span> 排列）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,\\dots,K-2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(1)}_a=z_{a+1}-z_1=(z_{a+1}-z_K)-(z_1-z_K)=\\theta^{(K)}_{a+1}-\\theta^{(K)}_1$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=K-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(1)}_{K-1}=z_K-z_1=-\\theta^{(K)}_1$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{K\\to1}$</span> 是线性映射，矩阵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 &amp; \\cdots &amp; 0\\\\ -1 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 &amp; \\cdots &amp; 0\\\\ \\vdots &amp; &amp; &amp; \\ddots &amp; \\vdots\\\\ -1 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\cdots &amp; 1\\\\ -1 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\cdots &amp; 0\\end{pmatrix}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{(K-1)\\times(K-1)},$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(1)}=P\\theta^{(K)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 可逆（第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 行给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(K)}_1=-\\theta^{(1)}_{K-1}$</span>，其余行回代），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 是仿射双射（此处线性部分即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>，平移部分为零）。</p>\n<p>对数配分函数：由命题 1 的证明，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_K(\\theta^{(K)})=\\log\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}-z_K,\\qquad A_1(\\theta^{(1)})=\\log\\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}-z_1.$$</div>\n<p>两式相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_1(\\theta^{(1)})=A_K(\\theta^{(K)})-z_1+z_K$</span>，即命题所述（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r'=1$</span>）。均值参数相等由命题 1 直接得到：两个坐标下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(i)$</span> 的表达式都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>。命题 5 的常数差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_r-z_{r'}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 坐标下不可见，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\nabla A$</span> 在常数平移下不变。这再次说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 本身不是坐标不变的，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla A$</span> 是；自然参数化在差一个常数的意义下唯一。这一观察是第 6 节讨论 softmax 梯度性质时\"梯度对 logits 平移不变\"的代数根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-可检验恒等式-A-的-Legendre-变换\">可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的 Legendre 变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-可检验恒等式-A-的-Legendre-变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\nabla A$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\nabla^2 A$</span>。下面补一个可数值检验的恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 坐标下的熵联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（Legendre 对偶与熵）</strong>。在命题 1 的假设下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 坐标下的负熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mu)=-\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\mu_i\\log\\mu_i$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>）。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(\\theta)+H(\\mu(\\theta))=\\langle\\theta,\\mu(\\theta)\\rangle,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的 Legendre 变换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\sup_{\\mu\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+}\\big(\\langle\\theta,\\mu_{1:K-1}\\rangle+H(\\mu)\\big)$</span>，上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\mu(\\theta)$</span> 处取到。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\theta,\\mu(\\theta)\\rangle-A(\\theta)=\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\theta_a\\mu_a-A(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_a=e^{\\theta_a-A(\\theta)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_K=e^{-A(\\theta)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mu_a=\\theta_a-A(\\theta)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,\\dots,K-1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mu_K=-A(\\theta)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\theta_a\\mu_a-A(\\theta)=\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\mu_a(\\log\\mu_a+A(\\theta))-A(\\theta)=\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\mu_a\\log\\mu_a+A(\\theta)\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\mu_a-A(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\mu_a=1-\\mu_K$</span>，上式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\mu_a\\log\\mu_a+A(\\theta)(1-\\mu_K)-A(\\theta)=\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}\\mu_a\\log\\mu_a-A(\\theta)\\mu_K$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_K\\log\\mu_K=-\\mu_K A(\\theta)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\theta,\\mu(\\theta)\\rangle-A(\\theta)=\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\mu_i\\log\\mu_i=-H(\\mu(\\theta)).$$</div>\n<p>移项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A+H=\\langle\\theta,\\mu\\rangle$</span>。</p>\n<p>Legendre 变换：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>，考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\mu)=\\langle\\theta,\\mu_{1:K-1}\\rangle+H(\\mu)$</span>。由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\mu_{1:K-1}}f=\\theta-\\nabla_{\\mu_{1:K-1}}H$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\mu_{1:K-1}}H$</span> 的分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\mu_a+\\log\\mu_K$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,\\dots,K-1$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_K=1-\\sum_b\\mu_b$</span> 求导）。令梯度为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=\\log(\\mu_a/\\mu_K)$</span>，即推论 1 的逆映射，故驻点唯一为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 上严格凹，故驻点为全局最大。代回得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\mu(\\theta))=\\langle\\theta,\\mu(\\theta)\\rangle+H(\\mu(\\theta))=A(\\theta)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>。命题 6 给出一个纯代数恒等式，可在代码中直接断言：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)+H(\\mu(\\theta))-\\langle\\theta,\\mu(\\theta)\\rangle=0$</span>。它同时说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是凸函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 凹的 Legendre 变换），与命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\nabla^2 A\\succ0$</span> 一致。第 4 节讨论 log-sum-exp 数值稳定时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的凸性是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 平移技巧保持数值不变的几何原因；本节只记录恒等式，不展开数值细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-自然参数与温度缩放的接口\">自然参数与温度缩放的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-自然参数与温度缩放的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节将讨论温度缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto z/\\tau$</span>。本节的自然参数化给出一个精确的代数接口：温度缩放是自然参数与对数配分函数的同步缩放。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（温度缩放的自然参数表述）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(\\tau)}=z/\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(\\tau)}=Dz^{(\\tau)}=\\theta/\\tau$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(\\theta^{(\\tau)})=\\log\\!\\left(1+\\sum_{a=1}^{K-1}e^{\\theta_a/\\tau}\\right),\\qquad \\mu(\\theta^{(\\tau)})=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)_{1:K-1}.$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta^{(\\tau)})\\to(\\tfrac{1}{K},\\dots,\\tfrac{1}{K})$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\theta^{(\\tau)})$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大分量对应的顶点（若最大分量唯一）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的定义直接代入；第二式由命题 1 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z/\\tau$</span> 得到。极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a/\\tau\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\to\\log K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_a\\to e^0/K=1/K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star=\\arg\\max_a\\theta_a$</span>（唯一），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta_a/\\tau}/e^{\\theta_{a^\\star}/\\tau}\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ne a^\\star$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{0/\\tau}=1$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta_{a^\\star}/\\tau}$</span> 可忽略，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{a^\\star}\\to1$</span>，其余分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>。命题 7 说明温度缩放不改变自然参数化的结构，只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的尺度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的形状；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 的极限对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的\"硬\"版本（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sum\\exp$</span>），这是第 4 节 log-sum-exp 数值稳定与第 10 节 softmax 饱和反例的共同代数背景。本节只给出接口陈述，不展开极限的收敛速率与饱和导致的梯度消失，后者留待第 10 节以反例形式处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与第-2-节雅可比的对照表\">与第 2 节雅可比的对照表<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与第-2-节雅可比的对照表\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把本节与第 2 节的关系一次说清，下面用一张纯代数的对照表收束，不引入新符号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>第 2 节（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 坐标）</th>\n<th>本节（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>参数维度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冗余</td>\n<td>平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto z+c\\mathbf{1}$</span></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雅可比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>，秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=\\mathrm{diag}(\\mu_{1:K-1})-\\mu_{1:K-1}\\mu_{1:K-1}^{\\top}$</span>，满秩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零空间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0\\}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与另一坐标的关系</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$M=DJD^{\\top}$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的零延拓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>势函数</td>\n<td>无（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 非势坐标）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\nabla A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\nabla^2 A$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累积量</td>\n<td>需商掉平移后才良定义</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的各阶导数直接给出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>这张表是本节全部命题的浓缩：自然参数化把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 坐标下的秩亏雅可比商成满秩雅可比，代价是引入一个参考类与一个常数差；收益是势函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 与累积量母函数的干净结构。第 3 节的任务到此完成，后续各节在此结构上分别处理数值稳定、温度、梯度、交叉熵与 Fisher 度量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-Log-sum-exp-的数值稳定\">Log-sum-exp 的数值稳定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-Log-sum-exp-的数值稳定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 logits 向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为类别数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i = e^{z_i}/\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}:=\\max_{1\\le j\\le K} z_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\star:=\\arg\\max_j z_j$</span>（若最大值不唯一，任取一个下标，以下所有结论与选取无关）。</li>\n<li>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，平移向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z-c\\mathbf{1}:=(z_1-c,\\dots,z_K-c)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z):=\\log\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}$</span>，称为 log-sum-exp 函数。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}_\\epsilon(z_{\\max}):=\\{z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K: \\max_j z_j - \\min_j z_j \\le \\epsilon\\}$</span> 为“窄动态范围”区域；其补集称为“宽动态范围”区域。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{z_j}\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 且有限。此假设在本节情境下恒成立，因为 softmax 的输入是有限维实向量。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 浮点模型</strong>：设浮点运算的指数范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[e_{\\min},e_{\\max}]$</span>（例如 IEEE-754 双精度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\max}=1023$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\min}=-1022$</span>），尾数相对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>（单位舍入误差）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j&gt;e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 上溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j&lt;e_{\\min}\\ln 2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。本节讨论的“数值稳定”即指在该模型下避免上述上溢/下溢，并控制相对误差。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 平移不变性所需条件</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z-c\\mathbf{1}$</span> 的每个分量仍在浮点可表示范围内（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|z_j-c|\\le e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span>），以保证平移后的指数运算不溢出。当取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=z_{\\max}$</span> 时，该条件等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_j z_j-\\min_j z_j\\le e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span>，在本节情境下对常规 logits 成立；若动态范围超过该阈值，则需在宽动态范围区域另行处理（见本节推论 2 的注记）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 求导与极限交换</strong>：本节涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 求导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 函数（因指数与对数在正实数上光滑，且分母恒正），故链式法则与 Leibniz 法则可直接应用，无需交换积分与极限。此假设在本节情境下恒成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 误差度量</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}$</span> 为浮点计算得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span> 为精确值。相对误差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rel}(\\hat{s},s):=|\\hat{s}-s|/s$</span>。浮点求和的标准前向误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rel}(\\hat{s},s)\\le (K-1)u/(1-(K-1)u)$</span>（Higham 的标准结果，通常归于 Wilkinson），本节引用该界时明确标注。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-1-定义与相邻概念的区别\">1. 定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-1-定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（Log-sum-exp）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z):=\\log\\Big(\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（LSE 与 softmax 的关系）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A4)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\,\\mathrm{LSE}(z)}{\\partial z_i}\n=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}\n=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i.$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span> 求偏导，链式法则给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z_i}\\log\\Big(\\sum_j e^{z_j}\\Big)\n=\\frac{1}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z_i}\\sum_j e^{z_j}\n=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}.$$</div>\n最后一个等号因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial e^{z_j}/\\partial z_i=\\delta_{ij}e^{z_i}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的梯度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span>，这是本节数值稳定讨论的出发点——计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的梯度即计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 本身在数值上比直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}$</span> 更稳定。与相邻概念的区别在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 是标量函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个输入、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个输出），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 是向量值函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个输入、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个输出），二者通过梯度联系，但不可混为一谈；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 也不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i$</span>（后者等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)$</span>，是另一个量）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-2-主定理-平移不变性与数值稳定恒等式\">2. 主定理：平移不变性与数值稳定恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-2-主定理-平移不变性与数值稳定恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（LSE 的平移不变性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z-c\\mathbf{1})=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-c.$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j-c}$</span> 均有限正。直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j-c}=e^{-c}\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j},$$</div>\n两边取对数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z-c\\mathbf{1})=\\log\\Big(e^{-c}\\sum_j e^{z_j}\\Big)=-c+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-c.$$</div>\n(A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z-c\\mathbf{1}$</span> 的各分量在浮点可表示范围内，故该恒等式在浮点模型下可作为算法设计的依据。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（数值稳定恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=z_{\\max}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}.$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：在定理 1 中令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=z_{\\max}$</span>，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z-z_{\\max}\\mathbf{1})=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-z_{\\max}$</span>，移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 即本章 canonical claim 中的稳定恒等式。其数值意义在于：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j-z_{\\max}\\le 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}\\in(0,1]$</span>，不会上溢；至少有一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_{j^\\star}-z_{\\max}}=1$</span>，故求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 1$</span>，不会下溢为零。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}\\in[0,\\log K]$</span>，整个计算在浮点模型下无上溢、无下溢至零。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（稳定恒等式的误差界）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A5)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{L}$</span> 为按推论 1 计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)$</span> 的浮点值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)$</span> 为精确值。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat{L}-L|\\le u\\,|z_{\\max}|+\\frac{(K-1)u}{1-(K-1)u}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}}+\\big|\\log(1+\\mathrm{rel}(\\hat{s},s))\\big|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{L}-L|\\le (K-1)u/(1-(K-1)u)+O(u^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明思路与关键步骤：浮点计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{L}=\\mathrm{fl}(z_{\\max})+\\mathrm{fl}(\\log\\hat{s})$</span>。第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(z_{\\max})=z_{\\max}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 是输入分量，无舍入）。第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}$</span> 的相对误差由 (A5) 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的浮点误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u|\\log\\hat{s}|$</span>（标准初等函数误差界，通常归于浮点运算模型）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat{L}-L|\\le u|\\log\\hat{s}|+|\\log\\hat{s}-\\log s|.$$</div>\n对第二项用中值定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\hat{s}-\\log s|=|\\log(\\hat{s}/s)|=|\\log(1+\\mathrm{rel}(\\hat{s},s))|$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rel}(\\hat{s},s)=(\\hat{s}-s)/s$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\hat{s}\\le\\log K$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}\\le K(1+O(u))$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u|\\log\\hat{s}|\\le u\\log K+O(u^2)$</span>。合并即得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 表明：稳定恒等式的误差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|z_{\\max}|$</span> 指数放大，只随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 线性增长（对数因子），这是“数值稳定”的定量含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-3-具体例子验证\">3. 具体例子验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-3-具体例子验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(1000, 1001, 999)$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{z_j}$</span> 在双精度下上溢（<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{1001}\\approx 10^{434}$</span>，超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\max}\\ln 2\\approx 709$</span>），得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 为 NaN。按推论 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=1001$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$z-z_{\\max}\\mathbf{1}=(-1,0,-2),\\quad\n\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}=e^{-1}+1+e^{-2}\\approx 0.3679+1+0.1353=1.5032,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=1001+\\log 1.5032\\approx 1001+0.4076=1001.4076.$$</div>\n精确值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(e^{1000}+e^{1001}+e^{999})=1001+\\log(e^{-1}+1+e^{-2})$</span>，与上述一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)=(e^{-1},1,e^{-2})/1.5032\\approx(0.2447,0.6652,0.0900)$</span>，与直接计算（若可行）一致。此例验证推论 1 在宽动态范围下避免上溢。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(0,0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}=\\log 2\\approx 0.6931$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}=(1/2,1/2)$</span>。此例验证窄动态范围下恒等式仍成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的梯度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span>（命题 1）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-4-代码验证\">4. 代码验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-4-代码验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在双精度下验证推论 1 的恒等式与命题 1 的梯度关系，并对比直接计算的上溢行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef lse_naive(z):\n    return np.log(np.sum(np.exp(z)))\n\ndef lse_stable(z):\n    zmax = np.max(z)\n    return zmax + np.log(np.sum(np.exp(z - zmax)))\n\ndef softmax_stable(z):\n    zmax = np.max(z)\n    e = np.exp(z - zmax)\n    return e / np.sum(e)\n\n# 例 1：宽动态范围\nz1 = np.array([1000.0, 1001.0, 999.0])\nwith np.errstate(over='ignore'):\n    naive1 = lse_naive(z1)\nstable1 = lse_stable(z1)\nexpected1 = 1001.0 + np.log(np.exp(-1.0) + 1.0 + np.exp(-2.0))\nprint(&quot;例1 naive:&quot;, naive1, &quot;stable:&quot;, stable1, &quot;expected:&quot;, expected1)\nassert np.isinf(naive1)  # 直接计算上溢\nassert np.isclose(stable1, expected1, rtol=1e-12)\n\n# 例 2：窄动态范围\nz2 = np.array([0.0, 0.0])\nassert np.isclose(lse_stable(z2), np.log(2.0), rtol=1e-15)\n\n# 命题 1：LSE 的梯度等于 softmax（有限差分验证）\nz3 = np.array([0.3, -1.2, 2.0, 0.7])\neps = 1e-6\ngrad_fd = np.zeros_like(z3)\nfor i in range(len(z3)):\n    zp = z3.copy(); zp[i] += eps\n    zm = z3.copy(); zm[i] -= eps\n    grad_fd[i] = (lse_stable(zp) - lse_stable(zm)) / (2 * eps)\nsm = softmax_stable(z3)\nprint(&quot;softmax:&quot;, sm, &quot;shape:&quot;, sm.shape)\nprint(&quot;finite-diff grad:&quot;, grad_fd, &quot;shape:&quot;, grad_fd.shape)\nassert np.allclose(grad_fd, sm, atol=1e-8)\n\n# 平移不变性：LSE(z - c) = LSE(z) - c\nc = 3.7\nassert np.isclose(lse_stable(z3 - c), lse_stable(z3) - c, rtol=1e-12)\n\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：例 1 的 <code>naive1</code> 为 <code>inf</code>，<code>stable1</code> 与 <code>expected1</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 相对误差内一致；例 2 的 <code>lse_stable</code> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2$</span>；有限差分梯度与 <code>softmax_stable</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 绝对误差内一致；平移不变性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 相对误差内成立。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，最后打印 <code>all assertions passed</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>注记（宽动态范围边界）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_j z_j-\\min_j z_j$</span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span>（双精度约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.4\\times 10^3$</span>），则 (A3) 失效，平移后仍可能下溢至零的项对求和无贡献，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的浮点值退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}+\\log(\\text{非零项之和})$</span>，相对误差不再由命题 2 控制。该边界情形在反例节集中处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-5-稳定恒等式的条件数分析\">5. 稳定恒等式的条件数分析<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-5-稳定恒等式的条件数分析\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出了误差的绝对上界，但未说明该界是否“紧”。本节进一步给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 关于输入扰动的条件数，说明稳定恒等式不仅避免上溢，而且在良态区域内不放大相对扰动。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（LSE 的条件数）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A4)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。对任意扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，一阶展开给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z+\\delta z)-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=p^\\top\\delta z+O(\\|\\delta z\\|^2).$$</div>\n因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处的绝对条件数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_{\\mathrm{abs}}(z):=\\sup_{\\delta z\\neq 0}\\frac{|\\mathrm{LSE}(z+\\delta z)-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)|}{\\|\\delta z\\|_\\infty}=\\|p\\|_1=1,$$</div>\n而相对条件数（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 自身量级归一）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_{\\mathrm{rel}}(z)=\\frac{\\|p\\|_\\infty\\|\\delta z\\|_\\infty}{|\\mathrm{LSE}(z)|}\\Big/\\frac{\\|\\delta z\\|_\\infty}{\\|z\\|_\\infty}=\\frac{\\|z\\|_\\infty}{|\\mathrm{LSE}(z)|}\\cdot\\|p\\|_\\infty.$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=p$</span>。一阶 Taylor 展开即得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta z\\|_\\infty\\le 1$</span> 的扰动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|p^\\top\\delta z|\\le\\|p\\|_1\\|\\delta z\\|_\\infty=\\|\\delta z\\|_\\infty$</span>，且取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同号且集中在最大分量上可达等号，故绝对条件数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。相对条件数按定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{\\mathrm{rel}}=\\sup_{\\delta z}\\frac{|\\mathrm{LSE}(z+\\delta z)-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)|/|\\mathrm{LSE}(z)|}{\\|\\delta z\\|_\\infty/\\|z\\|_\\infty}$</span>，代入一阶项即得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的绝对条件数恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关；相对条件数中的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_\\infty\\le 1$</span> 表明 softmax 越接近均匀（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_\\infty\\to 1/K$</span>），相对条件数越小。这与稳定恒等式的数值行为一致：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的动态范围窄时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 对扰动不敏感；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的动态范围宽时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近 one-hot，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_\\infty\\to 1$</span>，相对条件数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|z\\|_\\infty/|\\mathrm{LSE}(z)|$</span> 主导。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)\\ge z_{\\max}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|z\\|_\\infty/|\\mathrm{LSE}(z)|\\le 1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}&gt;0$</span> 时），相对条件数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}&lt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)$</span> 可能小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|z\\|_\\infty$</span>，但此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|z_{\\max}|$</span> 小，绝对误差仍受命题 2 控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-6-与直接计算的对比-为何必须平移\">6. 与直接计算的对比：为何必须平移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-6-与直接计算的对比-为何必须平移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（直接计算的失效模式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}&gt;e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span>。则直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}=\\mathrm{fl}(\\sum_j e^{z_j})$</span> 在浮点模型下等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(\\log\\hat{s})=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i)=\\mathrm{fl}(e^{z_i}/\\hat{s})$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span> 型（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 也上溢）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/\\infty=0$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 未上溢）。两种情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 的浮点值均不等于精确值。</p>\n<p>证明：由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}&gt;e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_{\\max}}$</span> 上溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。浮点求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}$</span> 至少包含一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}=+\\infty$</span>（浮点加法中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 吸收有限项）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\hat{s}=+\\infty$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个分量：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 也上溢，则分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>、分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，浮点除法给出 NaN；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 未上溢（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i\\le e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span>），则分子有限、分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，浮点除法给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。而精确值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i=e^{z_i}/\\sum_j e^{z_j}&gt;0$</span>，故浮点值与精确值不等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 说明：直接计算在宽动态范围下不仅损失精度，而且产生 NaN 或错误的零，这是必须平移的根本原因。稳定恒等式通过将指数输入平移至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\infty,0]$</span>，使分子与分母均落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1,K]$</span> 内，从而在 (A3) 成立时避免命题 4 的两种失效模式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（稳定计算的充分条件）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_j z_j-\\min_j z_j\\le e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span>，则按推论 1 计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 在浮点模型下无上溢、无下溢至零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 的每个分量落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[e^{-e_{\\max}\\ln 2}/K,\\,1]$</span> 内。</p>\n<p>证明：平移后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j-z_{\\max}\\in[-e_{\\max}\\ln 2,\\,0]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}\\in[e^{-e_{\\max}\\ln 2},\\,1]$</span>，无上溢；求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}\\in[1,\\,K]$</span>，无下溢至零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}/\\hat{s}\\in[e^{-e_{\\max}\\ln 2}/K,\\,1]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 给出了稳定恒等式在浮点模型下“安全”的显式阈值：动态范围不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span> 时，指数运算的输入落在浮点可表示区间内，分子分母均不溢出。该阈值在双精度下约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$709\\ln 2\\approx 491$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\max}=1023$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{1023}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln(e^{1023})=1023\\ln 2\\approx 709$</span>，故阈值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$709$</span>，而非注记中误写的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.4\\times 10^3$</span>；注记中的数值应以此处为准）。当动态范围超过该阈值时，平移后仍有项下溢至零，但这些项对求和的贡献本就小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-709}$</span>，在双精度下可忽略，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的浮点值退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}+\\log(\\text{非零项之和})$</span>，相对误差不再由命题 2 控制——这正是注记所指的边界情形，留待反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-7-稳定恒等式的算法表述与复杂度\">7. 稳定恒等式的算法表述与复杂度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-7-稳定恒等式的算法表述与复杂度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>算法 1（稳定 LSE 与 softmax）</strong>：</p>\n<p>输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>。步骤：(i) 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=\\max_j z_j$</span>；(ii) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j=e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>；(iii) 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\sum_j u_j$</span>；(iv) 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}=z_{\\max}+\\log s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_j=u_j/s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（算法 1 的复杂度与数值性质）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>算法 1 的时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>，空间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>（若原地计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j$</span> 则额外空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>）。在 (A3) 成立时，算法 1 的每个浮点运算均不产生上溢或下溢至零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的绝对误差由命题 2 控制。</p>\n<p>证明：步骤 (i) 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 次比较，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>；步骤 (ii) 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次减法与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次指数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>；步骤 (iii) 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 次加法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>；步骤 (iv) 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 次对数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次除法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>。总计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>。空间上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j$</span> 可覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 原地存储，故额外空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。数值性质由推论 2 与命题 2 直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>算法 1 与直接计算的区别仅在于步骤 (i) 的一次最大值扫描与步骤 (ii) 的一次平移，代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 的额外比较与减法，但换来了 (A3) 成立时的无溢出保证。这一代价在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 较大时（如语言模型的词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\sim 10^5$</span>）可忽略，因为指数运算本身已是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 的主导项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-8-稳定恒等式在反向传播中的对应\">8. 稳定恒等式在反向传播中的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-8-稳定恒等式在反向传播中的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后说明稳定恒等式与本章后续节（Softmax 的梯度性质、交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度）的接口。设损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}=-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-z_y.$$</div>\n按命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}=p-e_y$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 为 one-hot 向量。在浮点实现中，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 按稳定恒等式计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal{L}}=\\hat{z}_{\\max}+\\log\\hat{s}-z_y$</span>，则反向传播时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\hat{\\mathcal{L}}/\\partial z_j$</span> 的浮点值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{u}_j/\\hat{s}-\\delta_{jy}$</span> 给出，与精确梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span> 的误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{u}_j/\\hat{s}$</span> 的相对误差控制。由推论 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{u}_j/\\hat{s}\\in[e^{-709}/K,\\,1]$</span>，故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时（宽动态范围），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_j$</span> 可能下溢至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此时梯度分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span> 对非目标类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq y$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，而精确梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j&gt;0$</span> 但极小。这一差异的绝对量小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-709}$</span>，在双精度下不影响训练；但在低精度（如 float16，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\max}\\approx 15$</span>）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-15}\\approx 3\\times 10^{-7}$</span> 不可忽略，此时需在反例节讨论的边界情形中另行处理。本节不展开低精度分析，仅指出稳定恒等式在双精度下对反向传播的梯度计算同样提供无溢出保证，其误差由命题 2 与推论 2 联合控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-9-稳定恒等式的逐分量误差分解\">9. 稳定恒等式的逐分量误差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-9-稳定恒等式的逐分量误差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 整体的误差界，但反向传播（第 8 小节）需要的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 每个分量的误差。本节将命题 2 的证明拆解到逐分量层面，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 的显式误差界，这是第 8 小节中“误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{u}_j/\\hat{s}$</span> 的相对误差控制”一句的定量依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（softmax 分量的相对误差界）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A5)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_j$</span> 为精确值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_j=\\hat{u}_j/\\hat{s}$</span> 为算法 1 的浮点输出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{u}_j=\\mathrm{fl}(e^{z_j-z_{\\max}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}=\\mathrm{fl}(\\sum_k \\hat{u}_k)$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{|\\hat{p}_j-p_j|}{p_j}\\le \\frac{u}{1-u}+\\frac{(K-1)u}{1-(K-1)u}.$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j=e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\sum_k u_k$</span>。浮点指数运算的相对误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{u}_j-u_j|/u_j\\le u/(1-u)$</span>（标准初等函数误差界，通常归于浮点运算模型；在 (A3) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j-z_{\\max}\\in[-e_{\\max}\\ln 2,0]$</span>，指数运算无溢出，该界适用）。浮点求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}$</span> 相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k \\hat{u}_k$</span> 的相对误差由 (A5) 给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{s}-\\sum_k\\hat{u}_k|/\\sum_k\\hat{u}_k\\le (K-1)u/(1-(K-1)u)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{p}_j=\\frac{\\hat{u}_j}{\\hat{s}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\hat{p}_j}{p_j}=\\frac{\\hat{u}_j/u_j}{\\hat{s}/s}.$$</div>\n取绝对值并用三角不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\frac{\\hat{p}_j}{p_j}-1\\right|\n=\\left|\\frac{\\hat{u}_j/u_j}{\\hat{s}/s}-1\\right|\n\\le \\left|\\frac{\\hat{u}_j}{u_j}-1\\right|+\\left|\\frac{s}{\\hat{s}}-1\\right|+O(u^2),$$</div>\n其中交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{u}_j/u_j-1|\\cdot|s/\\hat{s}-1|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(u^2)$</span>，在双精度下可并入高阶项。代入两个相对误差界即得所述不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 每个分量的相对误差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 的大小无关，只与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 有关。这与第 8 小节中“当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_j$</span> 可能下溢至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>”并不矛盾——命题 6 控制的是“未下溢”情形下的相对误差；下溢是 (A2) 中指数范围限制导致的绝对失效，不属于相对误差范畴。二者共同刻画了宽动态范围下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_j$</span> 的两种误差来源：相对误差（由命题 6 控制，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Ku$</span>）与下溢（由推论 2 的阈值控制，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-709}$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（梯度分量的误差界）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A5)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-z_y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{g}_j=\\hat{p}_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span> 为浮点梯度分量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j=p_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span> 为精确梯度分量。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq y$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat{g}_j-g_j|\\le p_j\\cdot\\frac{Ku}{1-Ku},$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=y$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat{g}_y-g_y|\\le (1-p_y)\\cdot\\frac{Ku}{1-Ku}.$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{jy}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{g}_j-g_j=\\hat{p}_j-p_j$</span>，由命题 6 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{p}_j-p_j|\\le p_j\\cdot Ku/(1-Ku)$</span>（将命题 6 右端两个分式合并，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-1)u/(1-(K-1)u)\\le Ku/(1-Ku)$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{g}_y-g_y=(\\hat{p}_y-1)-(p_y-1)=\\hat{p}_y-p_y$</span>，但此时需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_y=\\sum_{j\\neq y}p_j$</span>，命题 6 给出的界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y\\cdot Ku/(1-Ku)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y$</span> 可能接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_y$</span> 归一更紧：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{p}_y-p_y|/(1-p_y)$</span> 的界可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_y=1-\\sum_{j\\neq y}\\hat{p}_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\neq y}p_j=1-p_y$</span> 推出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{p}_y-p_y|\\le\\sum_{j\\neq y}|\\hat{p}_j-p_j|\\le (1-p_y)\\cdot Ku/(1-Ku)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 与本章 canonical claim 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=p-y$</span> 一致：精确梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span>，浮点梯度为其扰动，扰动幅度对非目标类正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span>、对目标类正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_y$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近 one-hot（宽动态范围）时，非目标类的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 极小，其梯度分量的绝对误差也极小；目标类的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_y$</span> 极小，其梯度分量的绝对误差同样极小。因此宽动态范围下梯度计算在绝对误差意义上是良态的，这与第 8 小节“这一差异的绝对量小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-709}$</span>”的论断一致，且推论 3 给出了更精确的、正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_y$</span> 的界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-10-与直接计算-softmax-的误差对比\">10. 与直接计算 softmax 的误差对比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-10-与直接计算-softmax-的误差对比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为说明稳定恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 计算上的必要性，本节给出直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}^{\\mathrm{dir}}_j=\\mathrm{fl}(e^{z_j})/\\mathrm{fl}(\\sum_k e^{z_k})$</span> 在窄动态范围下的误差界，并与命题 6 对比。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（直接计算的误差界）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A5)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}\\le e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\min}\\ge e_{\\min}\\ln 2$</span>（即所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 均在浮点可表示范围内，无上溢、无下溢至零）。则直接计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}^{\\mathrm{dir}}_j$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{|\\hat{p}^{\\mathrm{dir}}_j-p_j|}{p_j}\\le \\frac{u}{1-u}+\\frac{(K-1)u}{1-(K-1)u}+O(u^2).$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：与命题 6 的证明结构相同，只是将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j=e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j=e^{z_j}$</span>。在所述条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j$</span> 无上溢、无下溢至零，浮点指数运算的相对误差界仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u/(1-u)$</span>，浮点求和的相对误差界仍由 (A5) 给出。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\hat{p}^{\\mathrm{dir}}_j}{p_j}=\\frac{\\hat{v}_j/v_j}{\\hat{s}^{\\mathrm{dir}}/s^{\\mathrm{dir}}},$$</div>\n取绝对值并用三角不等式即得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 与命题 6 的相对误差界形式完全相同。这说明：在窄动态范围下，直接计算与稳定计算在相对误差上无本质差别；稳定恒等式的优势不在窄动态范围，而在宽动态范围——此时直接计算上溢（命题 4），而稳定计算仍保持命题 6 的误差界（在未下溢的分量上）。因此稳定恒等式不是“更精确”，而是“在更广的输入范围内保持相同的相对精度”。这一区分对工程实践重要：不应期望稳定恒等式在窄动态范围下改善精度，它的作用是扩展可计算域。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-11-稳定恒等式的可微性保持\">11. 稳定恒等式的可微性保持<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-11-稳定恒等式的可微性保持\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>反向传播要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的浮点计算对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 可微，且其浮点导数与精确导数的误差受控。本节说明算法 1 的浮点导数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}$</span>，从而第 8 小节的梯度计算无需额外的数值微分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（算法 1 的浮点导数）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{L}(z)=\\hat{z}_{\\max}+\\log\\hat{s}(z)$</span> 为算法 1 的浮点输出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{s}(z)=\\mathrm{fl}(\\sum_k \\mathrm{fl}(e^{z_k-\\hat{z}_{\\max}}))$</span>。在 (A3) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{z}_{\\max}=z_{\\max}$</span>（最大值是输入分量，无舍入），且浮点指数与求和运算对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的导数在忽略舍入的连续化模型中恰为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\hat{L}}{\\partial z_j}=\\frac{\\hat{u}_j}{\\hat{s}}=\\hat{p}_j.$$</div></p>\n<p>证明：在连续化模型中，将浮点运算视为精确运算的扰动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{z}_{\\max}=z_{\\max}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分段线性函数（在最大值唯一时局部为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{j^\\star}$</span>，导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial z_{\\max}/\\partial z_j=\\delta_{jj^\\star}$</span>）。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{L}=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_k e^{z_k-z_{\\max}}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 出现在两项中，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求导时两项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 导数相消：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\hat{L}}{\\partial z_j}\n=\\frac{\\partial z_{\\max}}{\\partial z_j}\n+\\frac{1}{\\hat{s}}\\sum_k e^{z_k-z_{\\max}}\\Big(\\delta_{kj}-\\frac{\\partial z_{\\max}}{\\partial z_j}\\Big)\n=\\frac{\\partial z_{\\max}}{\\partial z_j}+\\frac{\\hat{u}_j}{\\hat{s}}-\\frac{\\hat{s}}{\\hat{s}}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial z_{\\max}}{\\partial z_j}\n=\\frac{\\hat{u}_j}{\\hat{s}}.$$</div>\n最后一步中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial z_{\\max}/\\partial z_j$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-1=0$</span>，故结果与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\star$</span> 的选取无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 说明：稳定恒等式的浮点导数在连续化模型下恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}$</span>，与命题 1 的精确关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathrm{LSE}=p$</span> 在形式上一致。因此第 8 小节的反向传播可直接使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}$</span>，无需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{L}$</span> 做数值微分；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的误差由命题 6 控制。这一性质是稳定恒等式在自动微分框架下可直接使用的前提：计算图上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 节点，其反向函数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 节点，二者共享同一份平移后的指数值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{u}_j$</span>，无需重复计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-12-稳定恒等式与本章后续节的接口\">12. 稳定恒等式与本章后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-12-稳定恒等式与本章后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节至此完成了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 数值稳定的定义、主定理、误差界、条件数、算法与可微性的推导。这些结果向本章后续节提供三个接口。</p>\n<p>第一，向“Softmax 的梯度性质”节：命题 1 与命题 8 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathrm{LSE}=p$</span> 及浮点对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\hat{L}=\\hat{p}$</span>，后者是前者在浮点模型下的扰动，扰动界由命题 6 给出。该节讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 时，可直接引用命题 6 说明浮点雅可比与精确雅可比的逐元素误差。</p>\n<p>第二，向“交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度”节：第 8 小节已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-z_y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}=p-e_y$</span>，推论 3 给出浮点梯度分量的误差界。该节推导组合梯度时，可将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 的浮点计算视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{L}-z_y$</span>，其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}-e_y$</span>，误差由推论 3 控制，无需重新推导数值稳定性。</p>\n<p>第三，向“反例：softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”节：推论 2 的阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\max}\\ln 2$</span> 与命题 4 的上溢失效模式，是饱和导致梯度消失的数值侧边界。该节将从概率侧（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近 one-hot 时雅可比接近零）讨论梯度消失，本节从数值侧（宽动态范围下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}_j$</span> 下溢至零）给出对应现象，二者在反例节汇合。本节不展开该汇合的完整论证，仅指出稳定恒等式在阈值内的保证与阈值外的失效，为反例节提供精确的边界条件。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}$</span> 的梯度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>（命题 1），二者通过求导联系但为不同对象；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 是标量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 是向量值函数。</li>\n<li>平移不变性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z-c\\mathbf{1})=\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-c$</span>（定理 1）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=z_{\\max}$</span> 给出稳定恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>（推论 1），使指数运算的输入落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\infty,0]$</span>，避免上溢并保证求和不下溢为零。</li>\n<li>稳定恒等式的浮点误差由命题 2 定量控制：不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|z_{\\max}|$</span> 指数放大，只随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 线性（对数因子）增长；当动态范围超过浮点指数上限时 (A3) 失效，该边界情形留待反例节处理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 的梯度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span>（命题 1），稳定恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>（推论 1）在浮点模型下避免上溢、保证求和不下溢为零，其逐分量误差由命题 6 控制、梯度分量误差由推论 3 控制，二者均正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_y$</span>。</li>\n<li>稳定恒等式的优势不在窄动态范围（命题 7 表明此时直接计算与稳定计算的相对误差界相同），而在宽动态范围：直接计算上溢失效（命题 4），稳定计算在 (A3) 阈值内保持命题 6 的精度，阈值外则退化为非零项求和，边界留待反例节处理。</li>\n<li>算法 1 的浮点导数在连续化模型下恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}$</span>（命题 8），与精确关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathrm{LSE}=p$</span> 形式一致，故反向传播可直接使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{p}$</span>；本节结果向本章“Softmax 的梯度性质”“交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度”“反例：softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”三节提供数值侧的精确接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放与分布锐化\">温度缩放与分布锐化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放与分布锐化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 logits 向量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K: p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形；<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为 one-hot 标签的索引；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}$</span> 为 log-sum-exp 函数。本节引入的新符号如下，均先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，无量纲标量；温度缩放后的分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/T)$</span>。</li>\n<li>逆温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/T\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，在指数族表述中作为自然参数的正标量因子。</li>\n<li>锐化算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_\\beta:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_\\beta(z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\beta z)$</span>。</li>\n<li>分布锐化程度用 Shannon 熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>）与最大分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}=\\max_i p_i$</span> 两个标量刻画。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一列出，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j/T}$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 均有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 的各分量均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 函数。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 求导时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 限制在紧区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\underline{T},\\overline{T}]\\subset(0,\\infty)$</span> 上，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta z$</span> 的每个分量有界，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_\\beta(z)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的导数在紧区间上一致有界，可逐项求导。</p>\n<p>(A3) 熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^{(T)})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 在紧区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\underline{T},\\overline{T}]$</span> 上各分量有正下界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_i p_i^{(T)}\\ge e^{-\\|z\\|_\\infty/\\underline{T}}/K&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i^{(T)}$</span> 在紧区间上有界，Leibniz 法则适用。</p>\n<p>(A4) 讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限时，只陈述逐点极限与熵的极限，不交换极限与求导；涉及单调性时用 (A2) 的紧区间一致性。</p>\n<p>下面先给出温度缩放的定义并说明它与相邻概念的区别，再证明锐化单调性主定理，随后给出熵的导数恒等式与一个具体数值例子，最后用代码验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-定义-温度缩放与锐化算子\">定义：温度缩放与锐化算子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-定义-温度缩放与锐化算子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 5.1（温度缩放）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>。温度缩放分布定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{(T)}_i=\\frac{e^{z_i/T}}{\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j/T}},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div>\n<p>等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathcal{S}_{1/T}(z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\beta z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> 温度缩放不是对概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 做幂运算后再归一化（后者写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{\\beta}/\\sum_j p_j^{\\beta}$</span>，是另一种锐化方式，与 softmax 温度缩放仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span> 时一致，一般不等同）；温度缩放作用在 logits 上，属于指数族自然参数的仿射重参数化，而幂锐化作用在概率单纯形上，是非线性映射。温度缩放也不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 归一化或逐分量截断：它保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的方向、只改变尺度，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的光滑函数。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)}=p$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to$</span> 均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大分量上的 one-hot（并列最大时在并列集合上均匀）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.2（极限行为）</strong> 在 (A1) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{T\\to\\infty}p^{(T)}_i=1/K$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立；</p>\n<p>(ii) 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\arg\\max_j z_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{T\\to 0^+}p^{(T)}_i=\\mathbf{1}\\{i\\in M\\}/|M|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j/T\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j/T}\\to 1$</span>，分子分母各趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，由有限和连续性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i\\to 1/K$</span>。(ii) 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=\\max_j z_j$</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i=e^{(z_i-z_{\\max})/T}/\\sum_j e^{(z_j-z_{\\max})/T}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in M$</span>，指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\notin M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-z_{\\max}&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(z_i-z_{\\max})/T}\\to 0$</span>。分母趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|M|$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i\\to \\mathbf{1}\\{i\\in M\\}/|M|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-主定理-锐化单调性与熵的单调下降\">主定理：锐化单调性与熵的单调下降<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-主定理-锐化单调性与熵的单调下降\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 5.3（温度降低使分布锐化）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}T}\\,H\\big(p^{(T)}\\big)\\ \\ge\\ 0,$$</div>\n<p>即熵随温度单调不增；等价地，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 增大（温度降低）熵单调不增。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 不是常向量，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 严格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}T}H(p^{(T)})&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=p^{(\\beta)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\beta z)$</span>。先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial\\beta$</span>。由本章第 2 节已证的雅可比公式（canonical claim），对 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\beta z$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial u_j}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j).$$</div>\n<p>链式法则给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial\\beta}=\\sum_{j=1}^K p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)\\,z_j=p_i\\Big(z_i-\\sum_{j=1}^K p_j z_j\\Big)=p_i\\,(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[z]=\\sum_j p_j z_j$</span>。这是关键等式，逐步写出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_i\\delta_{ij}z_j=p_i z_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_i p_j z_j=p_i\\sum_j p_j z_j$</span>，合并即得。</p>\n<p>再计算熵的导数。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span> 在紧区间上可逐项求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta}=-\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial\\beta}\\big(\\log p_i+1\\big).$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial\\beta=p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta}=-\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])\\log p_i-\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]).$$</div>\n<p>第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])=\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]=0$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta}=-\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])\\log p_i.$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=\\beta z_i-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 的关系可整理为协方差形式。更直接地，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])+\\big(\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)\\big)$</span>，其中括号内与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关，在加权和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])(\\cdot)$</span> 中因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])=0$</span> 而消失。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta}=-\\beta\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])^2=-\\beta\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\ \\le\\ 0.$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)=\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])^2\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支持上为常数；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（softmax 分量恒正），等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 为常向量。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta\\le 0$</span>，且非常向量时严格小于零。</p>\n<p>最后换回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}T=\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\beta/\\mathrm{d}T=-\\beta^2\\,\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta=\\beta^3\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\ge 0$</span>。非常向量时严格为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.4（最大分量的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star=\\arg\\max_i z_i$</span> 唯一，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_{i^\\star}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调不增，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 单调不减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定理 5.3 证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial\\beta=p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=i^\\star$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star$</span> 唯一最大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{i^\\star}&gt;\\mathbb{E}_p[z]$</span>（加权平均严格小于最大值，除非所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 相等），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_{i^\\star}/\\partial\\beta&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.5（与雅可比公式的关系）</strong> 定理 5.3 的证明只用到了本章第 2 节的雅可比公式与链式法则，没有引入新的求导规则；温度缩放因此可视为在 logits 空间沿射线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto \\beta z$</span> 的运动，其速度场由雅可比矩阵作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 上给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta p=J_p(z)\\,z$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_p$</span> 为第 2 节的雅可比矩阵。这一恒等式在后续第 6 节讨论梯度性质时会再次用到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-熵导数的可检验恒等式与具体例子\">熵导数的可检验恒等式与具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-熵导数的可检验恒等式与具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.6（熵的温度导数恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}T}H\\big(p^{(T)}\\big)=\\frac{1}{T^3}\\,\\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(T)}}(z).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定理 5.3 证明末尾，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}T=\\beta^3\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/T$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是可检验的：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，右侧可直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 计算，左侧可用有限差分近似验证（代码节执行）。</p>\n<p><strong>例 5.7（三分类数值验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(2,0,-1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e^2\\approx 7.3891,\\quad e^0=1,\\quad e^{-1}\\approx 0.3679,\\quad \\textstyle\\sum\\approx 8.7570,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p\\approx(0.8438,\\ 0.1142,\\ 0.0420).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[z]=0.8438\\cdot 2+0.1142\\cdot 0+0.0420\\cdot(-1)\\approx 1.6456$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)=0.8438(2-1.6456)^2+0.1142(0-1.6456)^2+0.0420(-1-1.6456)^2\\approx 0.1060+0.3092+0.2939\\approx 0.7091$</span>。由命题 5.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}T|_{T=1}=\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)/1^3\\approx 0.7091$</span>。另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\approx -(0.8438\\log 0.8438+0.1142\\log 0.1142+0.0420\\log 0.0420)\\approx 0.5854$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1.01$</span> 重算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\approx 0.5924$</span>，差商 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.5924-0.5854)/0.01\\approx 0.70$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7091$</span> 在有限差分误差内一致。此例同时验证了定理 5.3 的符号（熵随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而增大）与命题 5.6 的数值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-代码验证-温度对分布与熵的影响\">代码验证：温度对分布与熵的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-代码验证-温度对分布与熵的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码对例 5.7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 计算不同温度下的分布、熵与熵的温度导数，并用有限差分核对命题 5.6；同时验证命题 5.2 的两个极限与推论 5.4 的单调性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z, T=1.0):\n    u = z / T\n    u = u - u.max()\n    e = np.exp(u)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.clip(p, 1e-300, None)\n    return -np.sum(p * np.log(p))\n\ndef entropy_T_derivative(z, T):\n    p = softmax(z, T)\n    mean = np.sum(p * z)\n    var = np.sum(p * (z - mean) ** 2)\n    return var / T ** 3\n\nz = np.array([2.0, 0.0, -1.0])\nT_list = [0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 10.0]\nfor T in T_list:\n    p = softmax(z, T)\n    print(f&quot;T={T:5.2f}  p={np.round(p, 4)}  H={entropy(p):.4f}  dH/dT={entropy_T_derivative(z, T):.4f}&quot;)\n    assert np.isclose(p.sum(), 1.0)\n\n# 有限差分核对命题 5.6\nT0, h = 1.0, 1e-4\nfd = (entropy(softmax(z, T0 + h)) - entropy(softmax(z, T0 - h))) / (2 * h)\nexact = entropy_T_derivative(z, T0)\nprint(&quot;finite-diff dH/dT =&quot;, round(fd, 6), &quot; exact =&quot;, round(exact, 6))\nassert abs(fd - exact) &lt; 1e-4\n\n# 命题 5.2 极限\np_inf = softmax(z, 1e6)\nassert np.allclose(p_inf, np.ones(3) / 3)\np_zero = softmax(z, 1e-6)\nassert np.argmax(p_zero) == 0 and p_zero[0] &gt; 0.999\n\n# 推论 5.4 单调性：最大分量随 T 增大不增\npmax = [softmax(z, T)[0] for T in np.linspace(0.2, 5.0, 50)]\nassert all(pmax[i] &gt;= pmax[i + 1] - 1e-12 for i in range(len(pmax) - 1))\n\n# 熵随 T 单调不减\nHs = [entropy(softmax(z, T)) for T in np.linspace(0.2, 5.0, 50)]\nassert all(Hs[i] &lt;= Hs[i + 1] + 1e-12 for i in range(len(Hs) - 1))\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, softmax(z).shape, &quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：四行分布与熵的数值；有限差分与解析导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 内一致；极限、单调性与形状断言全部通过。代码中 <code>softmax</code> 先减去最大值再取指数，与本章第 4 节的 log-sum-exp 数值稳定写法一致，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 很小时也不会溢出。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>温度缩放定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/T)=\\mathcal{S}_{1/T}(z)$</span>，它是 logits 空间沿射线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto\\beta z$</span> 的指数族重参数化，区别于对概率向量做幂锐化；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 趋于最大分量上的 one-hot（并列时在并列集上均匀）。</li>\n<li>主定理 5.3 证明熵随温度单调不增，且非常向量时严格单调；证明只用本章第 2 节雅可比公式与链式法则，得到关键等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta p_i=p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta=-\\beta\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>，换回温度得可检验恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}T=T^{-3}\\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(T)}}(z)$</span>。</li>\n<li>推论 5.4 给出唯一最大分量随温度降低单调不减；例 5.7 与代码节用有限差分核对了熵导数恒等式，并验证了两个极限与两条单调性，为后续第 6 节梯度性质与第 10 节饱和反例提供了温度方向的定量接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放的二阶导数与熵的凸性\">温度缩放的二阶导数与熵的凸性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放的二阶导数与熵的凸性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}T=T^{-3}\\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(T)}}(z)$</span> 只涉及熵的一阶导数。要进一步刻画锐化过程，需要二阶信息：熵关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 是否凸？其凸性由什么量决定？本小节在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下回答这两个问题，并给出一个可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8（熵关于逆温度的二阶导数）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=p^{(\\beta)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[z]=\\sum_j p_j z_j$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2}=-\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i\\,(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])^2\\Big(\\beta\\,(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])+1\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定理 5.3 证明中的一阶导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta=-\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])\\log p_i$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 再求导，三项来源需分别处理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 变化、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 变化、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 变化。由 (A2)(A3)，每一项在紧区间上一致有界，Leibniz 法则适用，可逐项求导。</p>\n<p>先记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta p_i=p_i w_i$</span>（定理 5.3 证明中的关键等式）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]=\\sum_j\\partial_\\beta p_j\\,z_j=\\sum_j p_j w_j z_j=\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j w_j=0$</span>），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_\\beta w_i=\\partial_\\beta z_i-\\partial_\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]=0-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z).$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta w_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关，这是关键的结构性事实。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta\\log p_i=\\partial_\\beta(\\beta z_i-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z))=z_i-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]=w_i$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)=\\mathbb{E}_p[z]$</span>，这是指数族自然参数的标准恒等式，本章第 3 节已建立）。</p>\n<p>于是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta=-\\sum_i p_i w_i\\log p_i$</span> 逐项求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2}=-\\sum_i\\Big[(\\partial_\\beta p_i)\\,w_i\\log p_i+p_i(\\partial_\\beta w_i)\\log p_i+p_i w_i(\\partial_\\beta\\log p_i)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta p_i=p_iw_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta w_i=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta\\log p_i=w_i$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2}=-\\sum_i p_i w_i^2\\log p_i+\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i-\\sum_i p_i w_i^2.$$</div>\n<p>第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i=-H(p)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)H(p)$</span>。第一项与第三项合并：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i p_iw_i^2(\\log p_i+1)$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=\\beta w_i+\\big(\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)\\big)$</span>，其中括号内与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关，在加权和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i^2(\\cdot)$</span> 中不能直接消去（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i^2\\neq 0$</span>），需保留。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i^2=\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>，故括号内常数项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\big(\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)\\big)$</span>。整理得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2}=-\\beta\\sum_i p_iw_i^3-\\sum_i p_iw_i^2-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\big(\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)\\big)-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)H(p).$$</div>\n<p>这个表达式虽正确但不够简洁。改用命题陈述中的形式：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=\\beta w_i+c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i p_iw_i^2(\\log p_i+1)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta\\sum_i p_iw_i^3-\\sum_i p_iw_i^2-c\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)=\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)(\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z))$</span>。注意恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(\\beta z)=\\beta\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-H(p)$</span>（本章第 3 节指数族配分函数与熵的关系），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=-H(p)$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)H(p)$</span>，与上面第二项合并后恰好抵消。事实并非如此：第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)H(p)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)H(p)$</span> 相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)H(p)$</span>，这与直接代入不符。问题出在逐项求导时第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span> 已经包含了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的部分贡献，重复计算了。</p>\n<p>正确做法是直接从一阶导数出发，不再拆分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta=-\\sum_i p_iw_i\\log p_i$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=\\beta w_i+c$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta=-\\beta\\sum_i p_iw_i^2-c\\sum_i p_iw_i=-\\beta\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i=0$</span>），这与定理 5.3 一致。对此式再求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}^2H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)-\\beta\\,\\partial_\\beta\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)=\\partial_\\beta\\sum_i p_iw_i^2=\\sum_i(\\partial_\\beta p_i)w_i^2+2\\sum_i p_iw_i(\\partial_\\beta w_i)=\\sum_i p_iw_i^3-2\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)\\sum_i p_iw_i=\\sum_i p_iw_i^3$</span>（第二项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i=0$</span> 消失）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2H}{\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2}=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)-\\beta\\sum_i p_iw_i^3.$$</div>\n<p>这与命题陈述中的形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i p_iw_i^2(\\beta w_i+1)$</span> 完全一致，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i^2=\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.9（熵关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的凸性判据）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的三阶中心矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i^3\\le 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}^2H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2\\le 0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在该点凹；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_iw_i^3&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 充分大，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}^2H/\\mathrm{d}\\beta^2$</span> 可能变号。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 取值于两点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b\\}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 只取两个值，三阶中心矩与偏度同号，熵关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的凸性由偏度符号决定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一句由命题 5.8 的表达式直接读出。第二句：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1w_1^3+p_2w_2^3=p_1p_2(p_1-p_2)(z_1-z_2)^3$</span>（直接计算），其符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1-p_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1-z_2$</span> 的符号共同决定，即偏度符号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论说明：熵关于逆温度并非全局凸，锐化过程的“加速度”由分布的三阶中心矩控制。这一点在第 10 节讨论饱和反例时会以另一种形式出现（梯度消失与三阶矩无直接关系，但饱和区的曲率退化与本节二阶导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\infty$</span> 的行为相关）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放与-KL-散度-锐化作为投影\">温度缩放与 KL 散度：锐化作为投影<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放与-KL-散度-锐化作为投影\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>温度缩放还可从信息几何角度理解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在指数族内的一个“缩放”，它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL 散度有闭式表达，且该散度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调。本小节给出这一恒等式，它把温度缩放与本章第 11 节单纯形上的 Fisher 度量衔接起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.10（温度缩放与自身的 KL 散度）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p^{(T)}\\,\\|\\,p\\big)=\\frac{1}{T}\\,\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]\\cdot 0,$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p^{(T)}\\,\\|\\,p\\big)=\\frac{1}{T}\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z)-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]+\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z],$$</div>\n<p>其中最后两项相消，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p^{(T)}\\,\\|\\,p\\big)=\\frac{1}{T}\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)=\\sum_i q_i\\log(q_i/p_i)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p^{(T)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_i=z_i/T-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=z_i-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q_i}{p_i}=\\frac{z_i}{T}-z_i-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=\\Big(\\frac{1}{T}-1\\Big)z_i-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z).$$</div>\n<p>加权求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i\\log(q_i/p_i)=(1/T-1)\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z)$</span>。命题陈述中的形式是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/T-1)\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{T}\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span> 后与后面两项合并，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span> 并未与任何项相消，故陈述中的“最后两项相消”是错误表述。正确闭式是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p^{(T)}\\,\\|\\,p\\big)=\\Big(\\frac{1}{T}-1\\Big)\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.11（陈述修正）</strong> 命题 5.10 的陈述在动笔时出现了冗余项，正确形式为上式。该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|p)=0$</span>（直接验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-1)\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)+\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=0$</span>），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\text{uniform}\\|p)=\\log K-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)+\\mathbb{E}_{\\text{uniform}}[z]=\\log K-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)+\\bar z$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar z$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的算术平均，这正是均匀分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL。此式可作为代码节的附加断言。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.12（KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p^{(T)}\\|p)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 上单调不增、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1,\\infty)$</span> 上单调不减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 的非负性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|p)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 是最小值点。单调性由 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的凸性以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的几何直观给出；严格证明需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 求导，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}/\\mathrm{d}T\\,\\mathrm{KL}(p^{(T)}\\|p)$</span> 的表达式涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span> 的导数，计算较繁，此处从略，完整推导见后续第 11 节 Fisher 度量一节（该节将把 KL 的二阶展开与 Fisher 信息矩阵联系起来）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.13（与 Fisher 度量的接口）</strong> 推论 5.12 的“从略”不是回避，而是本节篇幅所限的明确边界：KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的单调性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 沿指数族测地线远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 时 KL 增大，而 Fisher 度量正是该 KL 的二阶近似。第 11 节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p^{(T)}\\|p)=\\frac{1}{2}(T-1)^2\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)+O((T-1)^3)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的 Fisher 信息（对自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的度量）。这一展开与命题 5.6 的熵导数恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 处一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}H/\\mathrm{d}T|_{T=1}=\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>，而 KL 的二阶系数也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span>，两者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}^2/\\mathrm{d}T^2\\,\\mathrm{KL}|_{T=1}=\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)$</span> 联系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放下的交叉熵梯度\">温度缩放下的交叉熵梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放下的交叉熵梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出温度缩放与交叉熵组合的梯度，它是本章第 7 节“交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度”在温度参数下的推广。本小节只给出温度方向的导数，不重复第 7 节对 logits 方向的推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.14（温度方向上的交叉熵梯度）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，交叉熵损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(T)=-\\log p^{(T)}_y$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\ell}{\\mathrm{d}T}=\\frac{1}{T^2}\\Big(z_y-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{(T)}_y=z_y/T-\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}/\\mathrm{d}T(z_y/T)=-z_y/T^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}/\\mathrm{d}T\\,\\mathrm{LSE}(z/T)=\\sum_j p^{(T)}_j\\cdot(-z_j/T^2)=-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]/T^2$</span>（链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{u_j}\\mathrm{LSE}(u)=p_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_T u_j=-z_j/T^2$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\ell/\\mathrm{d}T=-(-z_y/T^2)-(-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]/T^2)=(z_y-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z])/T^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.15（温度梯度的符号）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_y&gt;\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span>（即标签对应的 logit 高于当前分布的期望），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\ell/\\mathrm{d}T&gt;0$</span>，降低温度（减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>）会减小损失；反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_y&lt;\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\ell/\\mathrm{d}T&lt;0$</span>，升高温度会减小损失。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 5.14 直接读出符号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论给出一个可操作的结论：温度作为超参数，其最优方向由标签 logit 与当前分布期望的相对位置决定，而非固定地“越低越好”。这与第 10 节饱和反例的结论一致：在饱和区，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_y$</span> 可能远低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span>，此时降低温度反而增大损失，梯度消失与温度选择需联合分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放与采样-与后续章的接口\">温度缩放与采样：与后续章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放与采样-与后续章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>温度缩放在生成动力学中不仅是训练时的正则化手段，也是采样时的分布调节手段。本小节只给出与采样章衔接所需的数学事实，不展开采样算法本身（后者属于后续章）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.16（温度缩放后的采样分布）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p^{(T)}$</span>，则对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[f(X)]=\\sum_{i=1}^K f(i)\\,\\frac{e^{z_i/T}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j/T}}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[f(X)]\\to \\frac{1}{|M|}\\sum_{i\\in M}f(i)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为最大分量集合），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[f(X)]\\to\\frac{1}{K}\\sum_i f(i)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式是有限和的定义展开。两个极限由命题 5.2 的逐点收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界（有限状态空间上必有界）及有限和连续性直接得到，无需 Dominated Convergence（状态空间有限，求和即有限和）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.17（温度作为采样退火参数）</strong> 命题 5.16 说明温度缩放是采样分布的一个单参数族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 从大到小对应从探索（接近均匀）到利用（接近 one-hot）的连续过渡。后续采样章将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 视为退火日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_t$</span> 的瞬时值，并讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_t\\to 0$</span> 时采样分布的极限与本章命题 5.2 的一致性。本节不展开退火日程的收敛性，只指出：命题 5.2 的逐点极限是退火分析的点态基础，而一致收敛需要额外的紧性论证，属于采样章的范围。</p>\n<p><strong>注 5.18（本节与第 6 节的边界）</strong> 本节证明了温度方向的梯度（命题 5.14）与熵的二阶导数（命题 5.8），但未涉及 logits 方向的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\ell$</span>。后者是本章第 6 节“Softmax 的梯度性质”与第 7 节“交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度”的内容，本节刻意不重复。两节的接口是：第 6 节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log p_y)=p-y$</span>（canonical claim），而本节命题 5.14 是该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto z/T$</span> 重参数化下的温度分量；两者通过链式法则联系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\ell/\\mathrm{d}T=\\nabla_z\\ell\\cdot(-\\beta^2 z)$</span>，读者可在第 6 节读到完整推导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-Softmax-的梯度性质\">Softmax 的梯度性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-Softmax-的梯度性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 logits 向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为类别数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}\\subset\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为概率单纯形上的点，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i=e^{z_i}/\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 为 Kronecker 符号；<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为标签，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 one-hot 向量；温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 已在第 5 节定义，本节仅在需要时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span> 形式引用。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处的雅可比矩阵，其元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}(z)=\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为全一分量向量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的分量为对角元的对角矩阵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z)=-\\log \\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y$</span> 为单样本交叉熵损失（仅在本节作为梯度恒等式的左端出现，其组合梯度的完整推导留给第 7 节）。</p>\n<p>假设方面：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 有限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 且分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{z_j}&gt;0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>；(A2) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的每个分量求偏导时，指数函数与有限和运算均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上实解析，雅可比存在且连续；(A3) 本节所有梯度恒等式均在逐点意义下成立，不涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分布取期望，因此无需可积性假设；若第 7 节需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mu$</span> 取期望再交换梯度，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 具有足够阶矩并引用 Dominated Convergence，届时另行声明。</p>\n<p>本节与相邻概念的区别须先厘清：雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 描述的是<strong>参数化映射</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的局部线性化，它把 logits 空间的扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}z$</span> 映为概率空间的扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}p=J(z)\\,\\mathrm{d}z$</span>；而交叉熵的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L$</span> 描述的是<strong>标量损失</strong>对参数的敏感度，二者通过链式法则联系但不可混同。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 是奇异矩阵（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 的值域是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维流形），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L$</span> 是余切向量，二者维数相同但几何角色不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-雅可比的显式表达与秩\">雅可比的显式表达与秩<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-雅可比的显式表达与秩\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（雅可比恒等式）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_{ij}(z)=\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_j}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j).$$</div>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=e^{z_i}/S$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\sum_{k}e^{z_k}$</span>）关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求偏导。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq j$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 无关，仅分母依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_j}=e^{z_i}\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{S^2}\\right)\\frac{\\partial S}{\\partial z_j}=e^{z_i}\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{S^2}\\right)e^{z_j}=-p_i p_j.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 时，商法则给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_j}{\\partial z_j}=\\frac{e^{z_j}S-e^{z_j}e^{z_j}}{S^2}=\\frac{e^{z_j}}{S}-\\left(\\frac{e^{z_j}}{S}\\right)^2=p_j-p_j^2=p_j(1-p_j).$$</div>\n<p>两式合并即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。矩阵形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{diag}(p))_{ij}=p_i\\delta_{ij}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(pp^\\top)_{ij}=p_ip_j$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（秩与零空间）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，零空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)\\mathbf{1}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Jv)_i=p_i(v_i-p^\\top v)=p_i(v_i-\\sum_k p_k v_k)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\mathbf{1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J\\mathbf{1})_i=p_i(1-1)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}\\in\\ker J$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 的值域落在超平面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p:\\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 内，该超平面的切空间维数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 作为该映射的微分，其像含于切空间，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}\\,J\\le K-1$</span>。又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i-\\sum_k p_k w_k\\neq 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Jw)_i\\neq 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ker J$</span> 恰为一维，由秩-零化度定理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}\\,J=K-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：logits 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向的整体平移不改变 softmax 输出，这与第 1 节的归一化不变性一致；雅可比的奇异结构正是该不变性的微分表现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-梯度恒等式-交叉熵对-logits-的梯度\">梯度恒等式：交叉熵对 logits 的梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-梯度恒等式-交叉熵对-logits-的梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（单样本交叉熵梯度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z)=-\\log p_y$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z L(z)=p-e_y.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=e^{z_y}/S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_y=z_y-\\log S$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z)=-z_y+\\log S$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求偏导：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=y$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial z_j=-1+\\partial(\\log S)/\\partial z_j=-1+e^{z_j}/S=p_j-1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq y$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial z_j=0+e^{z_j}/S=p_j$</span>。合并即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial z_j=p_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span>，写成向量形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（链式法则接口）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意可微标量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell:\\Delta^{K-1}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(z)=\\ell(\\mathrm{softmax}(z))$</span> 的梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z F(z)=J(z)^\\top\\nabla_p\\ell(p)\\big|_{p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(p)=-\\log p_y$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\ell=-e_y/p_y$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z F=J^\\top(-e_y/p_y)$</span>。逐分量验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(J^\\top(-e_y/p_y))_j=\\sum_i J_{ij}(-e_y)_i/p_y=-J_{yj}/p_y=-p_y(\\delta_{yj}-p_j)/p_y=p_j-\\delta_{yj}$</span>，与命题 2 一致。此恒等式表明命题 2 并非孤立技巧，而是雅可比转置作用于概率空间梯度的特例；第 7 节将用同一接口处理标签平滑。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放下的梯度缩放\">温度缩放下的梯度缩放<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放下的梯度缩放\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（温度对梯度的影响）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(z)=-\\log p^{(\\tau)}_y$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z L_\\tau(z)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\left(p^{(\\tau)}-e_y\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/\\tau$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial u_j/\\partial z_j=1/\\tau$</span>，由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L_\\tau/\\partial z_j=(1/\\tau)\\cdot\\partial L/\\partial u_j$</span>，而命题 2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial u=p^{(\\tau)}-e_y$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验的定量结论：温度升高（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span>）时梯度整体缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 倍，同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 趋于均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}-e_y$</span> 的各分量绝对值也减小，二者叠加使梯度以快于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 的速率衰减；温度降低（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span>）时梯度被放大，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 趋于 one-hot，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_y\\to 1$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}-e_y\\to 0$</span>，饱和效应将抵消放大因子。这一竞争关系是第 10 节反例的定量基础，本节只建立恒等式，不展开饱和分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的数值验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(1.0,\\,2.0,\\,0.5)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=e^{1}+e^{2}+e^{0.5}\\approx 2.7183+7.3891+1.6487=11.7561$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\approx(0.2312,\\,0.6285,\\,0.1402)$</span>。按命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{11}=p_1(1-p_1)\\approx 0.2312\\times 0.7688\\approx 0.1777$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{12}=-p_1p_2\\approx -0.1453$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{13}=-p_1p_3\\approx -0.0324$</span>；行和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{11}+J_{12}+J_{13}=0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\mathbf{1}=0$</span> 一致。按命题 2，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_2\\approx(0.2312,\\,-0.3715,\\,0.1402)$</span>，其分量和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 的分量和均为 1。这些数值将在第 13 节代码节以 <code>assert</code> 形式复核。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-可运行验证代码\">可运行验证代码<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-可运行验证代码\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = np.asarray(z, dtype=np.float64)\n    e = np.exp(z - z.max())\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef jacobian_analytic(z):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    K = p.size\n    return np.diag(p) - np.outer(p, p)\n\ndef jacobian_numeric(z, h=1e-6):\n    z = np.asarray(z, dtype=np.float64)\n    K = z.size\n    J = np.zeros((K, K))\n    for j in range(K):\n        zp = z.copy(); zp[j] += h\n        zm = z.copy(); zm[j] -= h\n        J[:, j] = (softmax(zp) - softmax(zm)) / (2 * h)\n    return J\n\nz = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 0.5])\np = softmax(z)\nJ = jacobian_analytic(z)\nJn = jacobian_numeric(z)\n\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape, &quot;p:&quot;, p)\nprint(&quot;J shape:&quot;, J.shape)\nprint(&quot;J @ 1 (should be ~0):&quot;, J @ np.ones(3))\nprint(&quot;max |J - Jn|:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(J - Jn)))\n\nassert p.shape == (3,)\nassert J.shape == (3, 3)\nassert np.allclose(J @ np.ones(3), 0.0, atol=1e-12)\nassert np.allclose(J, Jn, atol=1e-5)\n\n# 命题 2：交叉熵梯度\ny = 1  # 0-indexed，对应 one-hot e_2\ne_y = np.zeros(3); e_y[y] = 1.0\ngrad_analytic = p - e_y\n# 数值梯度\nh = 1e-6\ngrad_num = np.zeros(3)\nfor j in range(3):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[j] += h\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[j] -= h\n    Lp = -np.log(softmax(zp)[y])\n    Lm = -np.log(softmax(zm)[y])\n    grad_num[j] = (Lp - Lm) / (2 * h)\n\nprint(&quot;grad analytic:&quot;, grad_analytic)\nprint(&quot;grad numeric :&quot;, grad_num)\nprint(&quot;max |grad diff|:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(grad_analytic - grad_num)))\nassert np.allclose(grad_analytic, grad_num, atol=1e-5)\nassert np.allclose(grad_analytic.sum(), 0.0, atol=1e-12)\n\n# 命题 3：温度缩放\ntau = 2.0\np_tau = softmax(z / tau)\ngrad_tau_analytic = (p_tau - e_y) / tau\ngrad_tau_num = np.zeros(3)\nfor j in range(3):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[j] += h\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[j] -= h\n    Lp = -np.log(softmax(zp / tau)[y])\n    Lm = -np.log(softmax(zm / tau)[y])\n    grad_tau_num[j] = (Lp - Lm) / (2 * h)\n\nprint(&quot;grad_tau analytic:&quot;, grad_tau_analytic)\nprint(&quot;grad_tau numeric :&quot;, grad_tau_num)\nassert np.allclose(grad_tau_analytic, grad_tau_num, atol=1e-5)\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>p</code> 形状 <code>(3,)</code>，<code>J</code> 形状 <code>(3, 3)</code>，<code>J @ 1</code> 三元素绝对值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，解析雅可比与数值雅可比最大偏差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span>，交叉熵梯度与数值梯度一致且分量和为零，温度缩放梯度与数值梯度一致。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过后打印 <code>all assertions passed</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-雅可比与-Fisher-信息矩阵的接口\">雅可比与 Fisher 信息矩阵的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-雅可比与-Fisher-信息矩阵的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 11 节将讨论单纯形上的 Fisher 度量，本节在此仅建立必要的接口恒等式，以便后续节引用时不必重述。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mu$</span>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\mu[\\|J(z)\\|_F^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>（此条件在本节情境下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的有界性自动满足：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|J_{ij}|\\le p_i(1-p_i)\\le 1/4$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|J\\|_F^2\\le K^2/16$</span>，无需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 另加矩条件）。定义 Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(z)=J(z)^\\top J(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（Fisher 矩阵的显式形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top.$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(z)=J(z)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(z)$</span> 对称半正定，秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，零空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^\\top J$</span>：注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 对称，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(pp^\\top)^\\top=pp^\\top$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J^\\top J=(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top)(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)^2-\\mathrm{diag}(p)pp^\\top-pp^\\top\\mathrm{diag}(p)+pp^\\top pp^\\top.$$</div>\n<p>逐项化简：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)^2=\\mathrm{diag}(p^2)$</span>（分量平方）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)pp^\\top=p\\,p^\\top$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)p=p\\circ p$</span>，而此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 左乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\circ p$</span>，再与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\top$</span> 外积，但更直接地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{diag}(p)pp^\\top)_{ij}=p_i p_i p_j=p_i^2p_j$</span>）；同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$pp^\\top\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 的元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_ip_j^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$pp^\\top pp^\\top=(p^\\top p)\\,pp^\\top=pp^\\top$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_k^2=p^\\top p$</span>，但此处须注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\top p=\\sum_k p_k^2$</span> 并非 1）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J^\\top J)_{ij}=p_i^2\\delta_{ij}-p_i^2p_j-p_ip_j^2+p_ip_j\\sum_k p_k^2.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top)_{ij}=p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j$</span>。二者相等需验证：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 时，左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=p_i^2-p_i^3-p_i^3+p_i^2\\sum_k p_k^2$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=p_i-p_i^2$</span>；这并不显然相等。故上述展开有误，须重新计算。</p>\n<p>正确计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J^\\top J=(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top)^\\top(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top)=(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top)(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top).$$</div>\n<p>展开四项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)\\mathrm{diag}(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(p^2)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)pp^\\top=p\\,p^\\top$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)p=p\\circ p$</span>，但左乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 得向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\circ p$</span>，再右乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\top$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p\\circ p)p^\\top$</span>，其元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^2p_j$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$pp^\\top\\mathrm{diag}(p)=p\\,(p\\circ p)^\\top$</span>，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_ip_j^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$pp^\\top pp^\\top=(p^\\top p)pp^\\top$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J^\\top J)_{ij}=p_i^2\\delta_{ij}-p_i^2p_j-p_ip_j^2+p_ip_j\\sum_k p_k^2.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^2-p_i^3-p_i^3+p_i^2\\sum_k p_k^2=p_i^2(1-2p_i+\\sum_k p_k^2)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top)_{ii}=p_i-p_i^2=p_i(1-p_i)$</span>。二者一般不相等，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span> 时左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=(1/9)(1-2/3+1/3)=2/27$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=2/9$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^\\top J\\neq J$</span> 一般成立。</p>\n<p>因此命题 4 中的 Fisher 信息矩阵应取如下形式：Fisher 信息矩阵并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^\\top J$</span>，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{y\\sim p}[\\nabla_z\\log p_y\\,\\nabla_z\\log p_y^\\top]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 抽取的类别。由命题 2 的推导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\log p_y=p-e_y$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F(z)=\\sum_{y=1}^K p_y\\,(p-e_y)(p-e_y)^\\top.$$</div>\n<p>展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p-e_y)(p-e_y)^\\top=pp^\\top-p e_y^\\top-e_y p^\\top+e_y e_y^\\top$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y p_y pp^\\top=pp^\\top$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y p_y p e_y^\\top=p(\\sum_y p_y e_y)^\\top=p\\,p^\\top$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y p_y e_y p^\\top=(\\sum_y p_y e_y)p^\\top=pp^\\top$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y p_y e_y e_y^\\top=\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F(z)=pp^\\top-pp^\\top-pp^\\top+\\mathrm{diag}(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top=J(z).$$</div>\n<p>此即 Fisher 信息矩阵等于雅可比本身，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^\\top J$</span>。这一恒等式是 softmax 作为指数族参数化的特有性质：对一般参数化，Fisher 矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^\\top J$</span> 仅在参数到分布的映射为等距嵌入时成立；softmax 的情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[\\nabla\\log p\\,\\nabla\\log p^\\top]$</span> 恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\log p_y=p-e_y$</span> 的协方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\sim p$</span> 下正好重现雅可比。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（Fisher 矩阵的二次型）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v,w\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\top F(z)w=\\sum_i p_i v_i w_i-\\left(\\sum_i p_i v_i\\right)\\left(\\sum_i p_i w_i\\right)=\\mathrm{Cov}_{i\\sim p}(v_i,w_i).$$</div>\n<p>特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top F(z)v=\\mathrm{Var}_{i\\sim p}(v_i)\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑上为常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>。此推论给出 Fisher 矩阵的统计解释：它是 logits 扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在类别分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的方差，度量了参数扰动对分布的可区分程度。第 11 节将以此为起点定义单纯形上的 Riemann 度量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-梯度恒等式的坐标无关表述\">梯度恒等式的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-梯度恒等式的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述命题均在标准坐标下陈述。为与后续流形节衔接，此处给出坐标无关表述并验证其自洽性。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:p_i&gt;0,\\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为开单纯形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 为光滑满射（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 且和为 1，像确为开单纯形）。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\,\\mathrm{softmax}_z:T_z\\mathbb{R}^K\\to T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 表示，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（微分的像与核）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\,\\mathrm{softmax}_z$</span> 的像恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 像含于切空间：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(Jv)_i=\\sum_i p_i(v_i-\\sum_k p_k v_k)=\\sum_i p_i v_i-(\\sum_i p_i)(\\sum_k p_k v_k)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jv\\in T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。满射性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dim T_p\\Delta^{K-1}=K-1=\\mathrm{rank}\\,J$</span>（推论 1），且像含于该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维空间，故像等于切空间。核由推论 1 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 softmax 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 到开单纯形的淹没（submersion），每个纤维为沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向的直线。因此交叉熵梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y$</span> 并非唯一：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向加任意常数不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的值，这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z+c\\mathbf{1})=L(z)$</span> 一致。在优化中这意味着梯度下降的更新方向自动落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 的正交补上（若初始化满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}^\\top z=0$</span>），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}^\\top(p-e_y)=1-1=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（梯度与切空间的配对）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y\\in T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，即交叉熵梯度本身就是一个切向量，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}^\\top\\nabla_z L=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分量和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(p_i-\\delta_{iy})=1-1=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L\\in T_p\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论有一个值得注意的几何后果：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的像空间重合，故存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jw=\\nabla_z L$</span>；事实上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=-e_y/p_y$</span> 即可（由推论 2 的验证）。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不唯一，沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向可加任意常数。这解释了为何在 softmax 参数化下，交叉熵的梯度下降在参数空间中的轨迹依赖于初始化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 分量，而损失值本身不受影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-二阶导数的存在性与一个恒等式\">二阶导数的存在性与一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-二阶导数的存在性与一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“梯度性质”，但为第 10 节的反例分析预备，此处给出二阶导数的显式表达并验证一个恒等式。假设 (A1)–(A2) 保证 softmax 实解析，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的二阶偏导存在且连续。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（交叉熵的 Hessian）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z)=-\\log p_y$</span> 的 Hessian 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z^2 L(z)=J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial z_j=p_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_k$</span> 再求偏导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_j/\\partial z_k=J_{jk}=p_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{jy}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_k$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^2 L/\\partial z_j\\partial z_k=J_{jk}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个简洁的恒等式：交叉熵的 Hessian 恰等于 softmax 的雅可比。其几何意义是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处的局部二次近似由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)$</span> 半正定且秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 在沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向是平的（二阶导为零），在其他方向上是凸的。这解释了为何交叉熵在 softmax 参数化下是凸函数（在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span> 上严格凸），但在全空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上仅为半正定。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（Hessian 与 Fisher 的一致性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z^2 L(z)=F(z)$</span>，即交叉熵的 Hessian 与 Fisher 信息矩阵逐点相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4 的修正结论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(z)=J(z)$</span> 与命题 6 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是指数族参数化的一个标准性质：负对数似然的 Hessian 等于 Fisher 信息，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z^2(-\\log p_y)=\\nabla_z^2(-\\log e^{z_y}+\\log S)=\\nabla_z^2\\log S$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log S$</span> 的 Hessian 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>。这一恒等式将在第 11 节用于说明自然梯度下降与 Newton 法的关系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式\">一个可检验的数值恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为给第 13 节的代码验证提供解析基准，此处给出一个不依赖数值微分的恒等式，可直接由命题 1 与命题 2 推出。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（梯度与雅可比的乘积恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J(z)\\,(p-e_y)=p\\circ(p-e_y)-p\\,(p^\\top(p-e_y)).$$</div>\n<p>右端可化简为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\circ(p-e_y)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\top(p-e_y)=\\sum_i p_i(p_i-\\delta_{iy})=\\sum_i p_i^2-p_y$</span>，一般不为零。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(p-e_y)\\neq p-e_y$</span> 一般成立，这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的奇异性一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的像中，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 作用于它并不返回自身（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的不动点，这仅在特定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下发生）。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(1,2,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=2$</span>（0-indexed 为 1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\approx(0.2312,0.6285,0.1402)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y\\approx(0.2312,-0.3715,0.1402)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(p-e_y)$</span> 的第一分量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1((p-e_y)_1-p^\\top(p-e_y))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\top(p-e_y)=\\sum_i p_i^2-p_y$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2\\approx 0.0534+0.3950+0.0197=0.4681$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=0.6285$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\top(p-e_y)\\approx -0.1604$</span>。于是第一分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0.2312\\times(0.2312+0.1604)\\approx 0.0905$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p-e_y)_1\\approx 0.2312$</span>，二者不等，验证了上述论断。第 13 节代码将复核此数值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与第-7-节的接口-期望梯度的交换条件\">与第 7 节的接口：期望梯度的交换条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与第-7-节的接口-期望梯度的交换条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有命题均为逐点恒等式，未涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分布取期望。第 7 节将处理批量交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{(x,y)\\sim\\nu}[L(f_\\theta(x),y)]$</span> 对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 输出 logits。届时需要交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\nu$</span>，其合法性由 Dominated Convergence 保证，条件为：(i) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto L(f_\\theta(x),y)$</span> 可微；(ii) 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span>-可积的支配函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,y)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta L(f_\\theta(x),y)\\|\\le g(x,y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在紧集上一致成立。本节不预设这些条件，仅指出命题 2 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y$</span> 是第 7 节链式法则的中间因子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\bar L=\\mathbb{E}_\\nu[J(f_\\theta(x))^\\top(p-e_y)\\cdot\\nabla_\\theta f_\\theta(x)]$</span>（在交换合法时）。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(f_\\theta(x))^\\top$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 的结果由推论 2 给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 本身（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 对称），故该表达式可进一步化简，但完整推导留待第 7 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-梯度恒等式的坐标变换协变性\">梯度恒等式的坐标变换协变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-梯度恒等式的坐标变换协变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述命题均在标准欧氏坐标下陈述，但 softmax 的梯度性质在 logits 的仿射变换下如何变化，是后续与流形节衔接时必须澄清的一点。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，作仿射重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=A\\tilde z+b$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(A\\tilde z+b)$</span> 定义了一个新的参数化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathrm{softmax}}(\\tilde z)$</span>。其雅可比由链式法则给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde J(\\tilde z)=J(A\\tilde z+b)\\,A.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 7（仿射重参数化下的梯度变换）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=A\\tilde z+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\tilde z)=-\\log\\widetilde{\\mathrm{softmax}}(\\tilde z)_y$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{\\tilde z}L=A^\\top\\,(p-e_y),\\qquad p=\\mathrm{softmax}(A\\tilde z+b).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y$</span>；由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\tilde z}L=A^\\top\\nabla_z L$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题有两个直接推论。其一，梯度在仿射重参数化下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^\\top$</span> 协变，这与余切向量的变换律一致；其二，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的某列平行于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span>，则对应方向的梯度分量为零，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}^\\top(p-e_y)=0$</span>。特别地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=c\\mathbf{1}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\tilde z}L=\\nabla_z L$</span>，验证了平移不变性；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为对角矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(\\tau^{-1})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span> 时退化为命题 3 的温度缩放。因此命题 3 可视为命题 7 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\tau^{-1}I$</span> 时的特例，而命题 7 给出了更一般的协变结构：任何可逆线性重参数化都保持梯度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 的形式，只是左乘了变换矩阵的转置。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 本身在仿射重参数化下<strong>不</strong>协变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde J=JA$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的对称性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 非正交时丢失。这意味着 Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=J$</span> 的对称性依赖于坐标选择；在自然梯度框架下，正确的协变对象是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde J^\\top\\tilde J=A^\\top J^\\top J A=A^\\top J A$</span>（用命题 4 的修正结论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^\\top J\\neq J$</span>，此处须用 Fisher 的协变定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[\\nabla\\log p\\,\\nabla\\log p^\\top]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z$</span> 坐标下的表达式）。这一区别将在第 11 节单纯形 Fisher 度量中正式处理，本节仅指出：命题 1–6 的恒等式在标准坐标下成立，跨坐标使用时须经命题 7 的变换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-逐样本梯度与批梯度的关系\">逐样本梯度与批梯度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-逐样本梯度与批梯度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节将处理批量交叉熵，本节在此预备一个不涉及期望交换的纯代数恒等式，以便第 7 节直接引用而不必重述。设样本集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(x_n,y_n)\\}_{n=1}^N$</span>，每个样本的 logits 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_n=f_\\theta(x_n)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，批损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=1}^N L(z_n,y_n)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z,y)=-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（批梯度的分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n=\\mathrm{softmax}(z_n)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\bar L=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=1}^N J_n^\\top\\,(p_n-e_{y_n})\\,\\nabla_\\theta z_n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_n=J(z_n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta z_n\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times d}$</span> 为 logits 对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的雅可比。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_n$</span> 对称（标准坐标下成立），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_n^\\top(p_n-e_{y_n})=J_n(p_n-e_{y_n})$</span>，该因子可并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta z_n$</span> 之前。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L(z_n,y_n)=(\\nabla_{z_n}L)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta z_n=(p_n-e_{y_n})^\\top\\nabla_\\theta z_n$</span>；写成矩阵形式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_n^\\top(p_n-e_{y_n})$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta z_n$</span> 的列。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 求和并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：批梯度是逐样本梯度的算术平均，<strong>不涉及</strong>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 分布的期望，因此无需 Dominated Convergence。只有当第 7 节将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L$</span> 替换为总体期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\nu[L]$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导时，才需要交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\nu$</span>，届时须验证支配条件。命题 8 的作用是把“逐样本因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n-e_{y_n}$</span>”与“参数雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta z_n$</span>”分离，使第 7 节的标签平滑推导可以只修改前一个因子而不触碰后一个。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-一个边界情形-K-2-的标量化简\">一个边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的标量化简<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-一个边界情形-K-2-的标量化简\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时，softmax 退化为 logistic 函数，雅可比与梯度均可化为标量形式，这为验证一般公式提供了一个独立基准。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,z_2)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=z_1-z_2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=\\sigma(\\Delta)=e^{\\Delta}/(1+e^{\\Delta})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=1-p_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（二分类的标量梯度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y=(1,0)$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z_1}=p_1-1=-\\sigma(-\\Delta),\\qquad \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z_2}=p_2=\\sigma(-\\Delta),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial z_1+\\partial L/\\partial z_2=0$</span>，与推论 4 一致。雅可比的非零独立分量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_{11}=p_1p_2=\\sigma(\\Delta)\\sigma(-\\Delta),\\qquad J_{12}=-p_1p_2,\\qquad J_{21}=-p_1p_2,\\qquad J_{22}=p_1p_2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y=(p_1-1,p_2)$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{11}=p_1(1-p_1)=p_1p_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{12}=-p_1p_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{21}=-p_1p_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{22}=p_2(1-p_2)=p_1p_2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{11}+J_{12}=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{21}+J_{22}=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\mathbf{1}=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时的具体表现；同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的两个特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2p_1p_2$</span>（对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,-1)$</span>），后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=1/2$</span> 时取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1\\to 0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时趋于零。这定量地显示了饱和区域雅可比退化，为第 10 节的反例分析提供了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的显式基准。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=p_2=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{11}=1/4$</span>，与命题 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|J_{ij}|\\le 1/4$</span> 的上界吻合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-梯度恒等式在数值稳定实现下的保持\">梯度恒等式在数值稳定实现下的保持<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-梯度恒等式在数值稳定实现下的保持\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 4 节已建立 log-sum-exp 的数值稳定形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>。一个自然的问题是：若在实现中先减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 再计算 softmax，命题 1 与命题 2 的恒等式是否仍然逐点成立？答案是肯定的，因为减去常数不改变 softmax 输出，但需注意数值实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，其梯度贡献须被正确抵消。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（平移实现的梯度不变性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(z)=\\max_j z_j$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=e^{z_i-m(z)}/\\sum_j e^{z_j-m(z)}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 逐点成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\hat p_y)=p-e_y$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一个断言：分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-m(z)}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=e^{z_i}/\\sum_j e^{z_j}=p_i$</span>。第二个断言：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 恒等，其对数梯度与命题 2 相同。但若在自动微分中直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 的表达式求导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m(z)$</span> 的梯度（几乎处处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\arg\\max}$</span>）会出现在中间步骤；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，这些中间项必须相互抵消。逐项验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\hat p_i/\\partial z_k=\\hat p_i(\\delta_{ik}-\\hat p_k)$</span> 与命题 1 相同，故抵消成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：数值稳定实现不改变梯度恒等式，但自动微分引擎若未正确处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(z)$</span> 的不可微点（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分量相等处），可能在测度零集上产生数值噪声。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 几乎处处可微且其梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 的恒等式中被抵消，实际训练中该噪声不影响期望梯度，但逐点严格性须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 分量互异的开集上陈述。本节的所有命题均默认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 分量互异（或更弱地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 可微），这一条件在 (A1) 下不自动成立，但在测度意义下几乎处处成立；若需逐点严格性，须将命题限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z:z_i\\neq z_j,\\forall i\\neq j\\}$</span> 上，该集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的开稠密集。</p>\n<p>至此，本节已建立 softmax 梯度性质的完整链条：雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span> 的显式表达与秩结构（命题 1、推论 1）、交叉熵梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 及其链式法则接口（命题 2、推论 2）、温度缩放下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 缩放（命题 3）、Fisher 矩阵与 Hessian 的三重一致性（命题 4 修正、命题 6、推论 5）、坐标无关的淹没结构与切向量性质（命题 5、推论 4）、仿射重参数化的协变性（命题 7）、批梯度的代数分解（命题 8）、二分类标量基准（命题 9）以及数值稳定实现的梯度保持（命题 10）。这些恒等式均为逐点意义，不依赖对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分布取期望；第 7 节及后续节在需要期望梯度时，须按本节末段声明的支配条件另行验证交换合法性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Softmax 的雅可比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>，元素形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>；它是秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 的奇异矩阵，零空间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 张成，对应 logits 整体平移的不变性。</li>\n<li>单样本交叉熵对 logits 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span>，它是雅可比转置作用于概率空间梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-e_y/p_y$</span> 的链式法则特例；温度缩放使该梯度乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>，同时改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 的锐度。</li>\n<li>本节所有恒等式在逐点意义下成立，无需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分布取期望；当第 7 节需要对样本分布取期望并交换梯度时，须另行声明矩条件并引用 Dominated Convergence，本节不预设该条件。</li>\n<li>Softmax 的雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span> 同时是交叉熵的 Hessian 与 Fisher 信息矩阵，这一三重一致性是指数族参数化的特有性质；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 半正定、秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>、零空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>，对应 logits 平移不变性。</li>\n<li>交叉熵梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y$</span> 本身是切向量（分量和为零），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的像空间重合；softmax 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 到开单纯形的淹没，每个纤维为沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 的直线，故梯度下降在参数空间的轨迹依赖于初始化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 分量而损失值不变。</li>\n<li>本节恒等式均为逐点意义，Fisher 矩阵的二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top Fv=\\mathrm{Var}_{i\\sim p}(v_i)$</span> 给出统计解释；第 7 节对样本分布取期望并交换梯度时须另声明 Dominated Convergence 的支配条件，本节不预设。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-交叉熵与-softmax-的组合梯度\">交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-交叉熵与-softmax-的组合梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用前序节已建立的符号：设类别数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，logits 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z)_i=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。设标签 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，one-hot 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_y)_i=\\delta_{iy}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅有：交叉熵损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(z;y):=-\\log \\sigma(z)_y$</span>；以及组合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\ell\\circ\\sigma$</span> 在标签意义下的梯度记法。所有符号均在前序节符号表内可追溯，无其他新符号。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中核验：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限维与非退化。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的各分量有限（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|z_i|&lt;\\infty$</span>）。这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{z_j}\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)$</span> 良定义且每个分量严格为正。若某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=+\\infty$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 退化，本节不处理该边界（属第 10 节反例范围）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可微性。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>（由指数函数与除法在分母非零处光滑得到，而 (A1) 保证分母为正）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_y&gt;0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_y&gt;0$</span> 恒成立，故复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(z)=\\ell(\\sigma(z))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 求和与求导的交换。</strong> 本节出现的所有导数均为有限和（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项）上的逐分量偏导，有限和与偏导可交换，无需 Dominated Convergence；这一点在证明中显式引用为“有限和线性性”。若将来推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=\\infty$</span> 的可数类别情形，则须改用 Dominated Convergence 并验证可和性，本节不涉及。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 标签固定。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 视为常数指标，不参与求导；<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 为常向量。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 (A1)–(A4) 下陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-组合映射的链式法则结构\">组合映射的链式法则结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-组合映射的链式法则结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心对象是复合映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G:\\mathbb{R}^K\\xrightarrow{\\ \\sigma\\ }\\Delta^{K-1}\\xrightarrow{\\ \\ell(\\cdot;y)\\ }\\mathbb{R},\\qquad G(z)=-\\log\\sigma(z)_y.$$</div>\n其梯度由链式法则给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z G(z)=\\big(J_\\sigma(z)\\big)^{\\top}\\nabla_p\\ell(p;y)\\Big|_{p=\\sigma(z)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 是前序节已推导的 softmax 雅可比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)_{ij}=\\partial \\sigma(z)_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（交叉熵对概率的梯度）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathrm{int}\\,\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>（各分量严格为正），有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial \\ell(p;y)}{\\partial p_i}=-\\frac{\\delta_{iy}}{p_i},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(p;y)=-\\log p_y$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 求偏导：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=y$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{p_y}(-\\log p_y)=-1/p_y$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne y$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。合并即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{p_i}\\ell=-\\delta_{iy}/p_i$</span>。这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y&gt;0$</span>（由 (A1) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span> 保证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p_y$</span> 有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意此命题与相邻概念的区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\ell$</span> 是损失在概率坐标下的梯度，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/p_y$</span>，其余为零；它不是 logits 空间的梯度，二者相差一个雅可比转置的复合。混淆二者正是“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”的典型错误来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-主定理-组合梯度的闭式表达\">主定理：组合梯度的闭式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-主定理-组合梯度的闭式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 7.2（交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z\\big(-\\log\\sigma(z)_y\\big)=p-e_y,$$</div>\n即第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i-\\delta_{iy}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,K$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 按链式法则逐分量计算。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，由多元复合函数求导（有限和线性性，(A3)）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial G}{\\partial z_j}=\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{\\partial \\ell}{\\partial p_i}\\bigg|_{p=\\sigma(z)}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial \\sigma(z)_i}{\\partial z_j}.$$</div>\n代入命题 7.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{p_i}\\ell=-\\delta_{iy}/p_i$</span> 与前序节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_j}\\sigma(z)_i=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial G}{\\partial z_j}=\\sum_{i=1}^K\\left(-\\frac{\\delta_{iy}}{p_i}\\right)p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j).$$</div>\n因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>（(A1)），可约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial G}{\\partial z_j}=-\\sum_{i=1}^K\\delta_{iy}(\\delta_{ij}-p_j).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{iy}$</span> 的筛选性质，和式只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=y$</span> 一项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial G}{\\partial z_j}=-(\\delta_{yj}-p_j)=p_j-\\delta_{yj}.$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z G=(p_1-\\delta_{y1},\\dots,p_K-\\delta_{yK})=p-e_y$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键步骤有二：其一是约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 时依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，这正是假设 (A1) 的作用；其二是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{iy}$</span> 的筛选把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项和坍缩为一项，这一步把雅可比的“行和为零”结构与 one-hot 的稀疏性对齐。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 允许为零（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i\\to-\\infty$</span> 的饱和极限），约分步骤失效，梯度公式需以极限意义理解，此即第 10 节反例的入口。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.3（梯度消失的定量刻画）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 为真实标签，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla_z G\\|_2^2=\\sum_{i=1}^K(p_i-\\delta_{iy})^2=(1-p_y)^2+\\sum_{i\\ne y}p_i^2.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y\\to 1$</span>（模型对正确标签高度自信）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z G\\|_2\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定理 7.2，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y-1$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne y$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。平方和即得第一等式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y\\to 1$</span> 时，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ne y}p_i=1-p_y\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_y)^2\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ne y}p_i^2\\le(\\sum_{i\\ne y}p_i)^2\\to 0$</span>，从而范数趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：梯度平方范数恰为“错误概率质量”的某种二次聚集。它与前序节“Softmax 的梯度性质”中雅可比行和为零的结论相容——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma$</span> 的像落在切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 恰满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(p_i-\\delta_{iy})=1-1=0$</span>，故组合梯度自动位于该切空间内。这一点在数值验证节可作断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的逐分量核验\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的逐分量核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的逐分量核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(1,0,-1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z}=(e,1,e^{-1})$</span>，配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=e+1+e^{-1}$</span>。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e\\approx2.71828$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1}\\approx0.36788$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\approx4.08616$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p=\\sigma(z)\\approx(0.66524,\\ 0.24473,\\ 0.09003).$$</div>\n由定理 7.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z G=p-e_1\\approx(0.66524-1,\\ 0.24473,\\ 0.09003)=(-0.33476,\\ 0.24473,\\ 0.09003)$</span>。</p>\n<p>独立核验：直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(z)=-\\log\\sigma(z)_1=-z_1+\\log(e^{z_1}+e^{z_2}+e^{z_3})$</span> 求偏导。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_1}G=-1+\\dfrac{e^{z_1}}{Z}=-1+p_1\\approx-0.33476$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_2}G=\\dfrac{e^{z_2}}{Z}=p_2\\approx0.24473$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_3$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_3}G=p_3\\approx0.09003$</span>。与定理 7.2 一致。此例同时验证了推论 7.3：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|^2\\approx0.11206+0.05989+0.00811\\approx0.18006$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_1)^2+\\sum_{i\\ne1}p_i^2\\approx(0.33476)^2+(0.24473)^2+(0.09003)^2$</span>，数值相符。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与温度缩放的相容性\">与温度缩放的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与温度缩放的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已定义温度缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T(z)=\\sigma(z/T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>。组合梯度在温度下的形式可直接由定理 7.2 与链式法则得到，无需重复雅可比推导：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.4（温度下的组合梯度）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\sigma(z/T)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z\\big(-\\log\\sigma_T(z)_y\\big)=\\frac{1}{T}\\big(p^{(T)}-e_y\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/T$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T(z)=\\sigma(u)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial z_j/\\partial u_j=1/T$</span> 对角。由定理 7.2 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u(-\\log\\sigma(u)_y)=p^{(T)}-e_y$</span>，再经对角缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z=\\frac{1}{T}\\nabla_u$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明温度以标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 整体缩放梯度，不改变其方向（在切空间内）；高温 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to$</span> 均匀分布，梯度方向趋于均匀减 one-hot，低温 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to$</span> one-hot，梯度幅值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 放大但方向趋近零向量所在的退化配置——这与推论 7.3 的饱和现象互为补充，具体饱和反例留待第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-数值验证代码\">数值验证代码<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-数值验证代码\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=5$</span> 上随机取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，用中心差分核验定理 7.2，并断言推论 7.3 的恒等式与切空间条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i \\nabla_i=0$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = z - z.max()\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef cross_entropy_grad_analytic(z, y):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    e_y = np.zeros_like(z)\n    e_y[y] = 1.0\n    return p - e_y\n\ndef cross_entropy(z, y):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    return -np.log(p[y])\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nK = 5\nz = rng.normal(size=K)\ny = int(rng.integers(0, K))\n\ng = cross_entropy_grad_analytic(z, y)\neps = 1e-6\ng_num = np.zeros(K)\nfor j in range(K):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[j] += eps\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[j] -= eps\n    g_num[j] = (cross_entropy(zp, y) - cross_entropy(zm, y)) / (2 * eps)\n\nprint(&quot;analytic grad:&quot;, g)\nprint(&quot;numeric  grad:&quot;, g_num)\nprint(&quot;max abs diff:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(g - g_num)))\nassert np.allclose(g, g_num, atol=1e-5)\n\np = softmax(z)\nlhs = np.sum(g**2)\nrhs = (1 - p[y])**2 + np.sum(np.delete(p, y)**2)\nprint(&quot;grad sq norm:&quot;, lhs, &quot;identity rhs:&quot;, rhs)\nassert np.isclose(lhs, rhs, atol=1e-10)\n\nprint(&quot;sum of grad components:&quot;, g.sum())\nassert np.isclose(g.sum(), 0.0, atol=1e-10)\nprint(&quot;shape check:&quot;, g.shape, &quot;expected:&quot;, (K,))\nassert g.shape == (K,)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：解析梯度与数值梯度最大绝对差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级；梯度平方范数与推论 7.3 右端一致；分量和为零（切空间条件）；形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(5,)$</span>。三个 <code>assert</code> 全部通过即验证了定理 7.2、推论 7.3 与切空间结构。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>交叉熵对概率的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\delta_{iy}/p_i$</span>，与 softmax 雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 复合后约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，得到组合梯度闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\sigma(z)_y)=p-e_y$</span>，其推导仅依赖有限和线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li>组合梯度自动落在单纯形切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span> 内，其平方范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_y)^2+\\sum_{i\\ne y}p_i^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y\\to1$</span> 时趋于零，定量刻画了饱和导致的梯度消失趋势。</li>\n<li>温度缩放以标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 整体缩放组合梯度而不改变其切空间方向，该结论由定理 7.2 经对角链式法则直接得到，与温度对分布锐化的作用互为补充。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-批量与样本平均下的梯度恒等式\">批量与样本平均下的梯度恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-批量与样本平均下的梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序推导针对单个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(z,y)$</span>。在自回归生成的训练语境中，一个批次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 内各样本的 logits 与标签独立给出，损失取平均。本节在此建立平均梯度的恒等式，它把定理 7.2 从单样本提升到批次层面，并给出一个可检验的期望形式。</p>\n<p>设批次大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，样本索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=1,\\dots,B$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 个样本的 logits 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(b)}\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(b)}\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(b)}=\\sigma(z^{(b)})$</span>。批次损失定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{\\mathcal{B}}(z^{(1)},\\dots,z^{(B)})=\\frac{1}{B}\\sum_{b=1}^B \\ell(z^{(b)};y^{(b)}).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.5（批次梯度的逐样本解耦）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，且各样本的 logits 相互独立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(b)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathcal{B}}$</span> 的独立自变量），则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_{\\mathcal{B}}}{\\partial z^{(b)}}=\\frac{1}{B}\\big(p^{(b)}-e_{y^{(b)}}\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathcal{B}}$</span> 的定义，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(b)}$</span> 求偏导时只有第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 项含该变量，其余项对其偏导为零（有限和线性性，(A3)）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_{\\mathcal{B}}}{\\partial z^{(b)}}=\\frac{1}{B}\\frac{\\partial \\ell(z^{(b)};y^{(b)})}{\\partial z^{(b)}}.$$</div>\n再由定理 7.2 应用于第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 个样本，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z^{(b)}}\\ell=p^{(b)}-e_{y^{(b)}}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/B$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明批次平均只引入标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/B$</span>，不改变每个样本梯度在切空间中的方向；因此推论 7.3 的范数恒等式对每个样本仍逐项成立，只是整体被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/B$</span> 缩放。这一点在实现中对应“损失取 mean 而非 sum”的选择，二者梯度相差常数倍，但梯度消失的定性行为不变。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.6（期望梯度与经验分布的关系）。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Z,Y)$</span> 为随机样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 取值于某概率空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|Z\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(Y=y)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\sigma(Z)$</span>。则在 (A1)–(A4) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\nabla_Z(-\\log\\sigma(Z)_Y)\\big]=\\mathbb{E}[P]-\\mathbb{E}[e_Y].$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定理 7.2，对每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_Z\\ell(Z(\\omega);Y(\\omega))=P(\\omega)-e_{Y(\\omega)}$</span>。两边取期望，需验证可积性以交换期望与有限和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P(\\omega)-e_{Y(\\omega)}\\|\\le\\|P(\\omega)\\|+\\|e_{Y(\\omega)}\\|\\le 1+\\sqrt{K}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P\\|_2\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_Y$</span> 单位向量），故被积函数有界，期望存在且有限。由期望的线性性（有限维向量值期望逐分量线性），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[P-e_Y]=\\mathbb{E}[P]-\\mathbb{E}[e_Y]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把梯度期望分解为“平均预测分布”与“标签经验分布”之差。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的边缘分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[e_Y]=\\pi$</span>，于是期望梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[P]-\\pi$</span>。这正是交叉熵在总体层面的驻点条件：当且仅当模型平均预测与标签边缘一致时，期望梯度为零。此恒等式与“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”的错误形成对照——它说的是梯度期望为零当且仅当两个分布的均值相等，而非单个样本的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与-log-sum-exp-数值稳定的接口\">与 log-sum-exp 数值稳定的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与-log-sum-exp-数值稳定的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>。本节说明组合梯度的计算如何依赖该恒等式，并给出一个不引入新符号的推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.7（稳定形式下的梯度不变性）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\max_j z_j$</span>，定义平移后的 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z=z-m\\mathbf{1}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tilde z)=\\sigma(z)$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{\\tilde z}\\big(-\\log\\sigma(\\tilde z)_y\\big)=\\nabla_z\\big(-\\log\\sigma(z)_y\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 先证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tilde z)=\\sigma(z)$</span>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(\\tilde z)_i=\\frac{e^{z_i-m}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j-m}}=\\frac{e^{-m}e^{z_i}}{e^{-m}\\sum_j e^{z_j}}=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}=\\sigma(z)_i,$$</div>\n其中约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-m}$</span> 用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-m}\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>（由 (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 有限）。再证梯度不变：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tilde z)=\\sigma(z)$</span>，复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在两个变量下的函数值逐点相等，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\tilde z)=G(z)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求偏导，由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_j}G(\\tilde z)=\\sum_k\\partial_{\\tilde z_k}G(\\tilde z)\\cdot\\partial z_j\\tilde z_k$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z_k=z_k-m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\max_j z_j$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的某个开邻域内（最大值指标唯一时）为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_j}\\tilde z_k=\\delta_{jk}$</span>（在最大值指标不唯一的边界处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 不可微，但该处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 仍光滑且梯度由连续性延拓，本节 (A1) 排除无穷边界，不排除并列最大值，此时以单侧导数或次梯度理解；为避免此技术细节，本节约定在最大值指标唯一的开集上论证，一般点由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 连续性延拓）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_j}G(\\tilde z)=\\partial_{\\tilde z_j}G(\\tilde z)$</span>，即两梯度逐分量相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实际含义是：数值稳定实现中先减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 再计算 softmax 与梯度，所得梯度与未平移的梯度完全相同，因此“稳定化”不改变优化轨迹。若不做平移而直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 较大时溢出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，梯度公式失去意义——这正是第 10 节饱和反例的数值侧入口。命题 7.7 保证只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 有限（(A1)），平移是恒等变换而非近似。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.8（稳定形式下梯度分量的显式表达）。</strong> 在命题 7.7 的设定下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 为唯一最大值指标对应的值，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial G}{\\partial z_j}=\\frac{e^{\\tilde z_j}}{\\sum_k e^{\\tilde z_k}}-\\delta_{yj},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z=z-m\\mathbf{1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 7.7，梯度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tilde z)_j-\\delta_{yj}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tilde z)_j=e^{\\tilde z_j}/\\sum_k e^{\\tilde z_k}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把梯度计算完全化为“平移后的指数除以平移后的指数和再减 one-hot”，与 log-sum-exp 的稳定计算共用同一中间量，故实现中可复用配分函数的计算，无需为梯度单独做一次稳定化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-一个可检验的恒等式-梯度与损失的海森关系\">一个可检验的恒等式：梯度与损失的海森关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-一个可检验的恒等式-梯度与损失的海森关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7.9（组合损失的海森矩阵）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(z)=-\\log\\sigma(z)_y$</span> 的海森矩阵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_G(z)=J_\\sigma(z)^{\\top}\\,\\mathrm{diag}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\delta_{iy}}{p_i^2}\\right)_{i=1}^K\\,J_\\sigma(z),$$</div>\n其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(j,k)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)$</span>。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_G$</span> 对称半正定，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_G\\mathbf{1}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由链式法则对梯度再求一次导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_k}\\partial_{z_j}G=\\sum_i\\partial_{z_k}\\big(\\partial_{p_i}\\ell\\cdot\\partial_{z_j}\\sigma_i\\big)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{p_i}\\ell=-\\delta_{iy}/p_i$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，需用乘积法则。但更直接地，由定理 7.2 的闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z G=p-e_y$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_k$</span> 求偏导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{z_k}(p_j-\\delta_{yj})=\\partial_{z_k}p_j=p_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)$</span>，此即前序节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(j,k)$</span> 元。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_G=J_\\sigma$</span>。对称性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j,k$</span> 对称，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{jk}$</span> 对称且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_jp_k$</span> 对称。半正定性：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\top}H_Gv=\\sum_{j,k}v_jp_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)v_k=\\sum_j p_jv_j^2-(\\sum_j p_jv_j)^2\\ge0$</span>，由加权方差非负（Cauchy–Schwarz）。零空间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_G\\mathbf{1}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_j(\\delta_{jk}-p_k)=p_j-p_j\\sum_k p_k=p_j-p_j=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}\\in\\ker H_G$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把组合损失的海森与 softmax 雅可比等同起来，说明二阶信息完全由雅可比承载；半正定性保证损失在 logits 空间是凸的（尽管 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 非线性），零空间为全一向量方向对应 logits 的整体平移不变性——这与命题 7.7 的平移不变性互为表里。此恒等式可用于检验实现：数值海森应与解析雅可比逐元一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-数值验证-海森-平移不变性与批次解耦\">数值验证：海森、平移不变性与批次解耦<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-数值验证-海森-平移不变性与批次解耦\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span> 上核验命题 7.5、7.7、7.9：批次梯度等于单样本梯度除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>；平移后梯度不变；数值海森等于解析雅可比。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = z - z.max()\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef jacobian_softmax(z):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    return np.diag(p) - np.outer(p, p)\n\ndef grad_single(z, y):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    e_y = np.zeros_like(z); e_y[y] = 1.0\n    return p - e_y\n\ndef loss_single(z, y):\n    return -np.log(softmax(z)[y])\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nK, B = 4, 6\nZs = rng.normal(size=(B, K))\nys = rng.integers(0, K, size=B)\n\n# 命题 7.5：批次梯度 = 单样本梯度 / B\nbatch_grads = np.zeros((B, K))\nfor b in range(B):\n    batch_grads[b] = grad_single(Zs[b], ys[b]) / B\nfor b in range(B):\n    assert np.allclose(batch_grads[b], grad_single(Zs[b], ys[b]) / B)\nprint(&quot;batch decoupling ok, shape:&quot;, batch_grads.shape)\n\n# 命题 7.7：平移不变性\nz = rng.normal(size=K); y = int(rng.integers(0, K))\nm = z.max()\ng1 = grad_single(z, y)\ng2 = grad_single(z - m, y)\nprint(&quot;shift invariance max diff:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(g1 - g2)))\nassert np.allclose(g1, g2, atol=1e-12)\n\n# 命题 7.9：数值海森 = 解析雅可比\neps = 1e-5\nH_num = np.zeros((K, K))\nfor k in range(K):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[k] += eps\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[k] -= eps\n    H_num[:, k] = (grad_single(zp, y) - grad_single(zm, y)) / (2 * eps)\nH_ana = jacobian_softmax(z)\nprint(&quot;hessian max diff:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(H_num - H_ana)))\nassert np.allclose(H_num, H_ana, atol=1e-6)\nassert np.allclose(H_ana, H_ana.T)\nassert np.allclose(H_ana @ np.ones(K), 0.0, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;hessian shape:&quot;, H_ana.shape, &quot;eigs min:&quot;, np.linalg.eigvalsh(H_ana).min())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：批次解耦断言通过，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(6,4)$</span>；平移不变性最大差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 量级；数值海森与解析雅可比最大差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级；海森对称、乘全一向量为零、最小特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge -10^{-12}$</span>（数值零）。这些断言共同验证了本节三个命题的解析结论与实现一致性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-组合梯度在自回归分解中的位置\">组合梯度在自回归分解中的位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-组合梯度在自回归分解中的位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节结论需与本章第 16 节“softmax 是条件分布的参数化”衔接。在自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{1:T})=\\prod_{t=1}^T p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 中，每个条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 由 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_t=\\phi(x_{&lt;t})$</span> 经 softmax 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为网络。对单个时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，其交叉熵对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_t$</span> 的梯度由定理 7.2 给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t-e_{x_t}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\sigma(z_t)$</span>。由于自回归分解中不同时间步的条件分布相互独立地以各自 logits 为自变量（前序 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{&lt;t}$</span> 视为常数），整条序列的损失梯度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_t$</span> 的偏导恰为单步梯度，无需跨步复合——跨步的复合只发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的参数上，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial\\theta=\\sum_t(\\partial z_t/\\partial\\theta)^{\\top}(p_t-e_{x_t})$</span>。这一步把定理 7.2 作为“最后一层”的局部梯度，与反向传播的其余部分解耦，正是本节标题“组合梯度”的含义：softmax 与交叉熵的组合在 logits 层给出一个结构极简的梯度，其形式不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的大小，只依赖预测分布与 one-hot 之差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.10（序列损失的逐时间步解耦）。</strong> 设序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，各时间步 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 相互独立（作为损失的自变量），序列损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\ell(z_t;x_t)$</span>。则在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z_t}=p_t-e_{x_t},\\qquad p_t=\\sigma(z_t).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 与命题 7.5 同构：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_t$</span> 的偏导只涉及第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项，其余项偏导为零（有限和线性性），再由定理 7.2 得第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t-e_{x_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与命题 7.5 的区别在于：批次平均引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/B$</span> 因子，而序列求和（不平均）不引入因子；若序列损失取平均则引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span>。二者共同说明组合梯度在“求和/平均”两种聚合下仅差标量，逐样本/逐时间步的切空间结构不变。这也解释了为何实现中批次与序列的聚合方式只影响学习率标定，不影响梯度消失的定性结论（推论 7.3 逐项成立）。</p>\n<p>至此，本节从单样本组合梯度出发，经批次解耦、期望恒等式、数值稳定接口、海森结构到序列分解，完成了对“交叉熵与 softmax 组合梯度”的完整刻画。所有命题均在显式假设 (A1)–(A4) 下陈述并证明，未使用“适当条件下”的模糊表述；数值稳定与平移不变性由命题 7.7 严格化为恒等变换而非近似；海森与雅可比的等同由命题 7.9 给出可数值检验的恒等式。饱和导致的梯度退化作为边界情形不在本节展开，其完整反例构造见第 10 节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-标签平滑的数学\">标签平滑的数学<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-标签平滑的数学\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 为 logits 向量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形；<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为 one-hot 标签的索引；<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 为其 one-hot 向量；交叉熵损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{CE}}(z,y)=-\\log p_y$</span>，其梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_{\\mathrm{CE}}=p-e_y$</span> 已在前节证明。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平滑系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in[0,1)$</span>，标签平滑分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i=(1-\\varepsilon)\\,\\delta_{iy}+\\frac{\\varepsilon}{K},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div></li>\n<li>标签平滑损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)=-\\sum_{i=1}^{K}q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\log p_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。</li>\n<li>均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_i=1/K$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为有限整数；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in[0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(0)}=e_y$</span>，退化为 one-hot）；(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 任意，无界性不影响本节代数恒等式的逐点成立；(A4) 本节所有求导均为逐点普通导数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 由 softmax 定义保证，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 处处有定义且光滑。本节不涉及积分与极限交换，因此无需 Dominated Convergence 或 Fubini；唯一涉及的求导法则是链式法则与商法则，均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{\\infty}$</span> 意义下逐点成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-定义与相邻概念的区别\">定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>标签平滑（label smoothing）是在训练目标上把 one-hot 目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 替换为混合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(1-\\varepsilon)e_y+\\varepsilon u$</span> 的正则化手段。它与温度缩放（第 5 节）有本质区别：温度缩放改变的是模型输出分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span> 的锐度，作用于 logits；标签平滑改变的是目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，作用于损失。二者可以独立叠加，叠加后的损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)_i$</span>，其梯度结构由本节定理与第 5、7 节结果复合得到，本节不重复展开温度部分。</p>\n<p>与“给 logits 加噪声”“权重衰减”等正则化相比，标签平滑的特殊性在于它保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 仍在单纯形内且严格正，从而使损失对每个类别的 logit 都有非零的有限梯度贡献——这一点在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 时消除了 one-hot 目标下“只惩罚正确类、不奖励错误类”的刚性结构。下面的命题把这一直觉精确化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（标签平滑损失的梯度恒等式）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)=p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(1-\\varepsilon)(p-e_y)+\\varepsilon(p-u).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)=-\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\log p_i$</span> 及链式法则，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_{\\varepsilon}}{\\partial z_j}=-\\sum_{i=1}^{K}q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\frac{1}{p_i}\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_j}.$$</div>\n<p>代入第 2 节已证的雅可比恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_{\\varepsilon}}{\\partial z_j}=-\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)=-q^{(\\varepsilon)}_j+p_j\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i.$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L_{\\varepsilon}/\\partial z_j=p_j-q^{(\\varepsilon)}_j$</span>。写成向量形式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}=p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。再将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(1-\\varepsilon)e_y+\\varepsilon u$</span> 代入并按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 分组，得第二等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span> 的退化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to 1$</span> 的极限）</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_0=p-e_y$</span>，与第 7 节组合梯度一致；(ii) 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\varepsilon\\to 1}\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}=p-u$</span>，且该极限逐点成立无需额外假设。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(0)}=e_y$</span> 的直接代入。(ii) 由命题 1 第二等式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的连续性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 是仿射函数，故极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-u$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1(ii) 揭示了一个值得注意的事实：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to 1$</span> 时，梯度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与均匀分布之差，与真实标签 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 无关——这解释了为何过大的平滑系数会削弱监督信号。但需强调，这是逐点极限，不是训练动力学的极限；后者涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 随训练演化，不在本节范围内。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-主定理-标签平滑的梯度有界性与非饱和性\">主定理：标签平滑的梯度有界性与非饱和性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-主定理-标签平滑的梯度有界性与非饱和性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>标签平滑最常被引用的性质是“防止梯度爆炸/改善校准”，但其可严格证明的数学内容是一个上界估计与一个非退化条件。下面给出。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 1（梯度上界与非退化下界）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}=\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)=p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|g^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2\\le \\sqrt{2}\\max\\{(1-\\varepsilon),\\ \\varepsilon\\},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span> 时，对每个坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 有严格下界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j|\\ge \\min\\left\\{\\frac{\\varepsilon}{K},\\ (1-\\varepsilon)\\min_{i\\ne y}p_i+\\frac{\\varepsilon}{K}\\right\\}&gt;0\\quad\\text{当 } p_j \\text{ 取相应极端值时}.$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=y$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_y=p_y-\\left[(1-\\varepsilon)+\\varepsilon/K\\right]$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne y$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=p_j-\\varepsilon/K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 先写坐标表达式。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}_y=(1-\\varepsilon)+\\varepsilon/K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=\\varepsilon/K\\ (j\\ne y)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_y=p_y-(1-\\varepsilon)-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{K},\\qquad g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=p_j-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{K}\\ (j\\ne y).$$</div>\n<p>上界：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，二者差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_2\\le\\|p\\|_2+\\|q\\|_2\\le 1+1=2$</span> 的粗糙界不够精细；改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_2^2=\\sum_i(p_i-q_i)^2\\le\\sum_i p_i^2+\\sum_i q_i^2\\le 2$</span>（因每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum p_i^2\\le 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum q_i^2\\le 1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2\\le\\sqrt{2}$</span>。进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(1-\\varepsilon)e_y+\\varepsilon u$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\varepsilon)^2(1-1/K)+\\varepsilon^2/K+(1-\\varepsilon)\\varepsilon\\cdot 2/K$</span> 的展开可验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2\\le\\max\\{(1-\\varepsilon),\\varepsilon\\}+\\text{交叉项}$</span>；直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2\\le\\sqrt{2}\\max\\{(1-\\varepsilon),\\varepsilon\\}$</span> 的精细界需注意交叉项非负，故取保守形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}\\max\\{(1-\\varepsilon),\\varepsilon\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 时略松，但作为上界成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_2^2\\le 2\\max_i(p_i-q_i)^2\\cdot K$</span> 不成立，此处采用逐项界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|p_i-q_i|\\le\\max\\{(1-\\varepsilon),\\varepsilon\\}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=y$</span> 成立当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y\\le 1$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne y$</span> 成立当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=\\varepsilon/K\\le\\varepsilon$</span>；故每坐标绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\max\\{(1-\\varepsilon),\\varepsilon\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sqrt{K}\\max\\{\\cdot\\}$</span>，比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}$</span> 更松。为得到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 无关的界，改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_2\\le\\|p\\|_2+\\|q\\|_2\\le 1+\\|q\\|_2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q\\|_2^2=(1-\\varepsilon)^2(1-1/K)+\\varepsilon^2/K+2(1-\\varepsilon)\\varepsilon/K\\le(1-\\varepsilon)^2+\\varepsilon^2+2\\varepsilon(1-\\varepsilon)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q\\|_2\\le 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g\\|\\le 2$</span>。要得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}\\max\\{\\cdot\\}$</span> 需更细分析，此处从略为保守界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g\\|_2\\le 2$</span>；下界部分不依赖上界。）</p>\n<p>下界：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}_j&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=p_j-\\varepsilon/K$</span>，其绝对值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=0$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/K$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=1$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\varepsilon/K$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j|\\ge\\varepsilon/K$</span> 不成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=\\varepsilon/K$</span> 时为零！）。更精确地说，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j$</span> 可为零当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=\\varepsilon/K$</span>，故不存在统一正下界。正确的非退化陈述是：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_y=p_y-(1-\\varepsilon)-\\varepsilon/K$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_y\\approx -(1-\\varepsilon)(1-1/K)&lt;0$</span> 有界远离零当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&lt;1$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j$</span> 的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/K$</span> 比较决定，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=\\varepsilon/K$</span> 处为零。因此定理 1 的下界应表述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span> 时不会因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 饱和而整体消失，具体地当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=e_y$</span>（完全饱和）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2^2=(1-(1-\\varepsilon)-\\varepsilon/K)^2+(K-1)(\\varepsilon/K)^2$</span>，计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx(1-\\varepsilon)^2(1-1/K)^2+(K-1)\\varepsilon^2/K^2&gt;0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&lt;1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上述证明中下界部分的反复说明：<strong>不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关的统一坐标下界</strong>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j$</span> 可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=\\varepsilon/K$</span> 处过零。这是标签平滑梯度的真实结构，不应被掩盖。定理 1 的可靠内容只有上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2\\le 2$</span> 与“饱和点处梯度非零”这一条件性陈述。下面把后者写成精确命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（饱和点处的梯度非退化）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=e_y$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_y\\to+\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j\\to-\\infty\\ (j\\ne y)$</span> 的极限点，形式上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=1,p_j=0$</span>）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_y=-(1-\\varepsilon)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{K}\\right),\\qquad g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=\\frac{\\varepsilon}{K}\\ (j\\ne y),$$</div>\n<p>从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2^2=(1-\\varepsilon)^2(1-1/K)^2+(K-1)\\varepsilon^2/K^2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span> 时严格为正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=0$</span> 到命题 1 的坐标表达式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_y=1-(1-\\varepsilon)-\\varepsilon/K=\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon/K=\\varepsilon(1-1/K)$</span>——注意符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y-q^{(\\varepsilon)}_y=1-[(1-\\varepsilon)+\\varepsilon/K]=\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon/K=\\varepsilon(1-1/K)$</span>，为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=0-\\varepsilon/K=-\\varepsilon/K$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g\\|_2^2=\\varepsilon^2(1-1/K)^2+(K-1)\\varepsilon^2/K^2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 时正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 与第 10 节（反例节）将讨论的 one-hot 饱和梯度消失形成对照：one-hot 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=e_y$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla L_{\\mathrm{CE}}=p-e_y=0$</span>，梯度精确消失；标签平滑下同一饱和点梯度非零。这是标签平滑“缓解饱和”的严格数学内容，其代价是引入与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 无关的偏置项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\varepsilon/K$</span> 于所有错误类坐标。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-可检验恒等式-损失值与梯度的关系\">可检验恒等式：损失值与梯度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-可检验恒等式-损失值与梯度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2（损失-梯度恒等式）</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,y$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=1}^{K}z_j\\,g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)-H(q^{(\\varepsilon)}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=-\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的 Shannon 熵，且约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}=p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j p_j=\\sum_j z_j\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_j$</span>。利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j p_j=\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}-H(p)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=e^{z_j}/Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_j=z_j-\\log Z$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j\\log p_j=\\sum_j p_j z_j-\\log Z$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(p)=\\sum_j p_j z_j-\\log Z$</span>，移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j p_j=\\log Z+H(p)$</span>？核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j z_j=\\log Z+\\sum_j p_j\\log p_j=\\log Z-H(p)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j p_j=\\log Z-H(p)$</span>）。类似地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j q^{(\\varepsilon)}_j$</span> 无简化。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=\\sum_j z_j p_j-\\sum_j z_j q^{(\\varepsilon)}_j$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}=-\\sum_i q_i\\log p_i=-\\sum_i q_i(z_i-\\log Z)=\\log Z-\\sum_i q_i z_i$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=\\sum_j z_j p_j-(\\log Z-L_{\\varepsilon})=\\sum_j z_j p_j-\\log Z+L_{\\varepsilon}=L_{\\varepsilon}-H(p)$</span>。故恒等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)-H(p)$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>修正后的恒等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=L_{\\varepsilon}-H(p)$</span>。这是一个可数值检验的恒等式（见下方代码），它把梯度与 logits 的内积和损失、模型分布熵联系起来。注意它不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 的熵，故与标签平滑系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的关系仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 进入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的数值验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-K-3-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(2.0,\\,0.5,\\,-1.0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.1$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{2}=7.389$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{0.5}=1.649$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1}=0.368$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=9.406$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.7856,\\,0.1753,\\,0.0391)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(0.9+0.0333,\\,0.0333,\\,0.0333)=(0.9333,\\,0.0333,\\,0.0333)$</span>。梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=p-q=(-0.1477,\\,0.1420,\\,0.0058)$</span>。损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}=-\\sum_i q_i\\log p_i=-[0.9333\\log 0.7856+0.0333\\log 0.1753+0.0333\\log 0.0391]=-[0.9333(-0.2413)+0.0333(-1.741)+0.0333(-3.242)]=0.2252+0.0580+0.1080=0.3912$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-[0.7856\\log 0.7856+0.1753\\log 0.1753+0.0391\\log 0.0391]=0.1896+0.3053+0.1265=0.6214$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j g_j=2(-0.1477)+0.5(0.1420)+(-1)(0.0058)=-0.2954+0.0710-0.0058=-0.2302$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}-H(p)=0.3912-0.6214=-0.2302$</span>。恒等式成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-代码-标签平滑梯度与恒等式的数值验证\">代码：标签平滑梯度与恒等式的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-代码-标签平滑梯度与恒等式的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = z - np.max(z)\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef label_smooth_grad(z, y, eps, K):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    q = np.full(K, eps / K)\n    q[y] += (1 - eps)\n    return p - q, p, q\n\ndef label_smooth_loss(z, y, eps, K):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    q = np.full(K, eps / K)\n    q[y] += (1 - eps)\n    return -np.sum(q * np.log(p))\n\nK, y, eps = 3, 0, 0.1\nz = np.array([2.0, 0.5, -1.0])\ng, p, q = label_smooth_grad(z, y, eps, K)\nL = label_smooth_loss(z, y, eps, K)\nH = -np.sum(p * np.log(p))\nlhs = np.dot(z, g)\nrhs = L - H\n\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape, &quot;expected (3,)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;g:&quot;, np.round(g, 4))\nprint(&quot;L:&quot;, round(L, 4), &quot;H(p):&quot;, round(H, 4))\nprint(&quot;sum z_j g_j:&quot;, round(lhs, 4), &quot;L - H(p):&quot;, round(rhs, 4))\nassert p.shape == (3,)\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-10\nassert abs(g.sum()) &lt; 1e-12  # 梯度分量和为零，因 p 与 q 均为概率向量\n# 数值雅可比验证：有限差分对比解析梯度\nh = 1e-6\nnum_grad = np.zeros(K)\nfor j in range(K):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[j] += h\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[j] -= h\n    num_grad[j] = (label_smooth_loss(zp, y, eps, K) - label_smooth_loss(zm, y, eps, K)) / (2*h)\nprint(&quot;numeric grad:&quot;, np.round(num_grad, 6))\nassert np.allclose(num_grad, g, atol=1e-6)\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>p shape: (3,) expected (3,)</code>，<code>g: [-0.1477  0.142   0.0058]</code>，<code>L: 0.3912 H(p): 0.6214</code>，<code>sum z_j g_j: -0.2302 L - H(p): -0.2302</code>，<code>numeric grad</code> 与 <code>g</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 内一致，最后打印 <code>all asserts passed</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-标签平滑的雅可比与二阶结构\">标签平滑的雅可比与二阶结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-标签平滑的雅可比与二阶结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 给出了一阶梯度，但标签平滑在训练中常与自适应优化器、Hessian 近似方法配合，因此需要二阶信息。本节推导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 的 Hessian，并说明它与 one-hot 交叉熵 Hessian 的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（标签平滑损失的 Hessian）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的 Hessian 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{\\varepsilon}(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{\\varepsilon}(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}-J_{q}^{(\\varepsilon)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{q}^{(\\varepsilon)}=\\mathrm{diag}(q^{(\\varepsilon)})-q^{(\\varepsilon)}q^{(\\varepsilon)\\top}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{CE}}$</span> 的 Hessian。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(\\varepsilon)}=p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial g^{(\\varepsilon)}_i/\\partial z_j=\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j$</span>。第 2 节的雅可比恒等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{\\varepsilon}(z)_{ij}=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z_j}\\big(p_i-q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\big)=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j).$$</div>\n<p>写成矩阵形式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{\\varepsilon}(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>。这与 one-hot 交叉熵的 Hessian 完全相同，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 是常数向量，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 求导后消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 有一个直接且重要的推论：<strong>标签平滑不改变损失的 Hessian</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{\\varepsilon}(z)=H_{0}(z)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 成立。这与命题 1 的一阶梯度形成鲜明对比——一阶梯度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 线性变化，二阶结构却完全不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。这一非对称性说明标签平滑的作用是“平移梯度场”而非“改变曲率”，因此它不会改变损失在 logits 空间中的局部几何（如临界点的稳定性类型），但会移动临界点的位置。下面把这一点精确化。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（临界点的偏移）</strong> 在命题 3 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{*}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 的临界点当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z^{*})=q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 的临界点集合与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{0}$</span> 的临界点集合不相交（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{0}$</span> 的临界点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=e_y$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 方向趋于无穷的极限点，而非有限点）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 临界点条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>），存在唯一（在 softmax 的平移不变性意义下）的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{*}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{*}_i=\\log q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i+C$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 任意。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{0}$</span> 的临界点要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=e_y$</span>，这只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_y-z_j\\to+\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne y$</span> 时成立，是无穷远处的极限点而非有限临界点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 揭示了一个常被忽略的事实：标签平滑把最优 logits 从“正确类趋于无穷、错误类趋于负无穷”的退化结构，变为有限的、由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 决定的确定值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{*}_i=\\log q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i$</span>（模平移）。这解释了标签平滑为何能改善校准：模型不再被推向极端置信度。但需注意，这是<strong>总体损失</strong>的临界点，训练动力学是否收敛到该点取决于优化器与数据分布，不在本节代数范围内。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-标签平滑与-KL-散度的等价表述\">标签平滑与 KL 散度的等价表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-标签平滑与-KL-散度的等价表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>标签平滑损失可以写成 KL 散度加一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关的常数，这一表述在理论分析中比原始形式更方便。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（KL 分解）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,y$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\,\\|\\,p\\big)+H(q^{(\\varepsilon)}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)=\\sum_i q_i\\log(q_i/p_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q^{(\\varepsilon)})=-\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\log q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|p)=\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\log q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i-\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\log p_i=-H(q^{(\\varepsilon)})+L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y).$$</div>\n<p>移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的推论是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}=\\nabla_z\\mathrm{KL}(q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|p)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q^{(\\varepsilon)})$</span> 是常数。这与命题 1 一致，但提供了不同的视角——标签平滑等价于最小化平滑目标分布与模型分布之间的 KL 散度。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\ge 0$</span> 且等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 时成立，这再次确认了推论 3 的临界点刻画。</p>\n<p>进一步，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(1-\\varepsilon)e_y+\\varepsilon u$</span> 代入 KL，可得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|p)=(1-\\varepsilon)\\mathrm{KL}(e_y\\|p)+\\varepsilon\\,\\mathrm{KL}(u\\|p)-\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|(1-\\varepsilon)e_y+\\varepsilon u\\big)$$</div>\n<p>不成立——KL 关于第一个参数不是线性的。正确的分解是利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i$</span> 的分段结构，但这不产生简洁的线性组合。因此命题 4 的价值在于把损失写成“KL + 常数”，而非把 KL 拆成 one-hot 与均匀两部分之和。这一点必须明确，避免误用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-平滑系数对梯度范数的影响\">平滑系数对梯度范数的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-平滑系数对梯度范数的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出了饱和点处梯度非零的条件，但没有回答一个实际问题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取何值时梯度范数最大？这关系到超参数选择的理论依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（梯度范数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的凸性）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,y$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(\\varepsilon)=\\|p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的二次函数，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\phi(\\varepsilon)=\\|p-e_y\\|_2^2-2\\varepsilon\\langle p-e_y,\\,e_y-u\\rangle+\\varepsilon^2\\|e_y-u\\|_2^2.$$</div>\n<p>其最小值点在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{*}=\\langle p-e_y,\\,e_y-u\\rangle/\\|e_y-u\\|_2^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_y-u\\|_2^2=1-1/K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}=e_y+\\varepsilon(u-e_y)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(p-e_y)-\\varepsilon(u-e_y)$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数平方即得二次表达式。二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u-e_y\\|_2^2=\\sum_i(u_i-\\delta_{iy})^2=(1-1/K)^2+(K-1)(1/K)^2=1-1/K$</span>。最小点由对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 求导置零得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，梯度范数作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的函数是开口向上的抛物线，存在唯一最小值。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=e_y$</span>（饱和）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p-e_y,e_y-u\\rangle=0$</span>，最小值点在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>，即 one-hot 梯度为零、平滑梯度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 增大而增大——这与命题 2 一致。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 时，最小值点可能为正，意味着适度平滑反而减小梯度范数。这提示标签平滑的梯度效应依赖于模型当前置信度，不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关的最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与第-7-节组合梯度的接口\">与第 7 节组合梯度的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与第-7-节组合梯度的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节证明了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=p-e_y$</span>。本节命题 1 把它推广为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。二者关系可写成算子形式：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 为把 one-hot 目标替换为平滑目标的线性算子，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}=\\mathcal{P}_{\\varepsilon}(\\nabla_z L_{0})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_{\\varepsilon}(v)=(1-\\varepsilon)v+\\varepsilon(p-u)$</span>——注意右端依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 不是作用在梯度向量上的固定线性算子，而是作用在“目标分布”上的算子后再与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 相减。正确的表述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 的梯度等于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{0}$</span> 的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 后的梯度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)=\\nabla_z L_{\\mathrm{CE}}(z,q^{(\\varepsilon)})$</span>，其中右端表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 为软目标的交叉熵梯度。这一恒等式由命题 1 直接得到，无需额外假设。它把标签平滑纳入第 7 节建立的“交叉熵—softmax 组合梯度”框架，而非另立一套符号。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>标签平滑损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}=-\\sum_i q^{(\\varepsilon)}_i\\log p_i$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_{\\varepsilon}=p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}=(1-\\varepsilon)(p-e_y)+\\varepsilon(p-u)$</span>，它是 one-hot 交叉熵梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 与均匀目标梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-u$</span> 的凸组合；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span> 退化为第 7 节结果。</li>\n<li>在饱和点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=e_y$</span> 处，one-hot 梯度精确为零，而标签平滑梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_y=\\varepsilon(1-1/K)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j=-\\varepsilon/K\\ (j\\ne y)$</span>，范数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^2(1-1/K)^2+(K-1)\\varepsilon^2/K^2&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>）；这给出“标签平滑缓解饱和梯度消失”的严格内容，代价是错误类坐标获得与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 无关的偏置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\varepsilon/K$</span>。</li>\n<li>恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j z_j g^{(\\varepsilon)}_j=L_{\\varepsilon}(z,y)-H(p)$</span> 把梯度与 logits 的内积、平滑损失与模型分布熵联系起来，可作为实现正确性的数值检验；本节代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的例子中同时验证了该恒等式与有限差分雅可比的一致性。</li>\n<li>标签平滑损失的 Hessian 与 one-hot 交叉熵完全相同，均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>；标签平滑只平移梯度场、不改变曲率，其临界点由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z^{*})=q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 刻画，对应有限 logits 而非 one-hot 的无穷远退化点。</li>\n<li>损失可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\varepsilon}=\\mathrm{KL}(q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|p)+H(q^{(\\varepsilon)})$</span>，故最小化标签平滑损失等价于最小化平滑目标与模型分布的 KL 散度；但 KL 关于第一参数非线性，不能拆成 one-hot 与均匀两部分 KL 的线性组合。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 时梯度范数平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q^{(\\varepsilon)}\\|_2^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的开口向上抛物线，最小值点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{*}=\\langle p-e_y,e_y-u\\rangle/(1-1/K)$</span> 依赖当前置信度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关的最优平滑系数；标签平滑梯度恒等于以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 为软目标的交叉熵梯度，从而无缝接入第 7 节的组合梯度框架。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-分布外检测的-softmax-得分\">分布外检测的 softmax 得分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-分布外检测的-softmax-得分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 为 logits 向量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为类别数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为温度参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/T)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为标签，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 为其 one-hot 向量。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\max_i p_i$</span> 为最大 softmax 得分（MSP），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span> 为 Shannon 熵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MaxLogit}(z)=\\max_i z_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LogSumExp}(z)=\\log\\sum_i e^{z_i}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的各分量有限，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i|z_i|&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 的每个分量严格为正且有限；(A2) 当讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的扰动或求导时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 的开集上取值，使 softmax 在该开集上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{\\infty}$</span> 光滑（由指数函数与除法在分母非零处光滑保证，而分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i e^{z_i}&gt;0$</span> 恒成立）；(A3) 当对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 取期望时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 为概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 上的随机向量，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|z\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>，以便应用 Dominated Convergence 处理期望与梯度的交换（本节仅在需要处显式引用）。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把“分布外检测”这一工程任务翻译成关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的精确泛函，给出这些泛函的梯度恒等式，并证明 MSP 得分在温度缩放下的单调变换性质。与相邻概念的区别须先行澄清：MSP 得分是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的标量泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\circ\\mathrm{softmax}$</span>，它<strong>不是</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的线性泛函，也<strong>不是</strong>似然比；熵得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 与 MSP 在二分类时单调等价（见推论 2），但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 时不等价，这一区别是本节推论 3 的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-定义-softmax-得分泛函及其与相邻概念的区别\">定义：softmax 得分泛函及其与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-定义-softmax-得分泛函及其与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（softmax 得分）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。称\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(z)=\\max_{1\\le i\\le K}p_i,\\qquad H(z)=-\\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_i\\log p_i$$</div>\n分别为最大 softmax 概率得分（MSP）与熵得分。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MaxLogit}(z)=\\max_i z_i$</span> 为最大 logit 得分。</p>\n<p>三者的区别在于对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的依赖方式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MaxLogit}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 凸函数（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty$</span>），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 无关地只取一个坐标；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 经过非线性压缩后的最大值，其值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1/K,1)$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的平移不变（<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z+c\\mathbf{1})=S(z)$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(z)$</span> 同样平移不变，值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\log K]$</span>。平移不变性使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K}/\\mathbb{R}\\mathbf{1}$</span> 上的投影，这是它们区别于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MaxLogit}$</span> 的结构性事实（命题 1）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（平移不变性）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(z+c\\mathbf{1})=S(z),\\qquad H(z+c\\mathbf{1})=H(z),\\qquad \\mathrm{MaxLogit}(z+c\\mathbf{1})=\\mathrm{MaxLogit}(z)+c.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 softmax 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z+c\\mathbf{1})_i=e^{z_i+c}/\\sum_j e^{z_j+c}=e^{z_i}/\\sum_j e^{z_j}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i$</span>，逐分量相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的泛函不变。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i(z_i+c)=\\max_i z_i+c$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的直接后果是：任何仅基于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的 OOD 得分对 logits 的整体平移不敏感，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MaxLogit}$</span> 敏感。这解释了为何在工程实践中对 logits 做归一化（如减去均值）会改变 MSP 的数值但不改变其排序——排序不变性由命题 1 保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-主定理-MSP-得分关于-logits-的梯度恒等式\">主定理：MSP 得分关于 logits 的梯度恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-主定理-MSP-得分关于-logits-的梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（MSP 梯度）</strong> 假设 (A1)、(A2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处最大 softmax 分量唯一，即存在指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star(z)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}&gt;p_i$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne i^\\star$</span> 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的某邻域内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z S(z)=p_{i^\\star}\\big(e_{i^\\star}-p\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{i^\\star}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star$</span> 个标准基向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由唯一性假设与 softmax 的连续性，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的开邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上恒定。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=p_{i^\\star}(z)$</span>，故只需计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z p_{i^\\star}$</span>。由本章第 2 节已证的雅可比公式（canonical claim）\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial z_j}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j),$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=i^\\star$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 排列成行向量：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z p_{i^\\star}=\\big(p_{i^\\star}(\\delta_{i^\\star j}-p_j)\\big)_{j=1}^{K}=p_{i^\\star}\\big(e_{i^\\star}-p\\big).$$</div>\n逐分量即得。光滑性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上为指数与除法的复合而保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（MSP 梯度的正交分解）</strong> 在定理 1 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z S(z)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 正交，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_z S(z),\\mathbf{1}\\rangle=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z S(z)\\|_2^2=p_{i^\\star}^2(1-2p_{i^\\star}+\\|p\\|_2^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 正交性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p_{i^\\star}(e_{i^\\star}-p),\\mathbf{1}\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}(1-\\sum_j p_j)=0$</span>。范数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_{i^\\star}-p\\|_2^2=1-2p_{i^\\star}+\\|p\\|_2^2$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 与命题 1 自洽：梯度落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 的正交补上，正是平移不变泛函的梯度必须满足的结构（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(z+c\\mathbf{1})=f(z)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla f,\\mathbf{1}\\rangle=0$</span>）。这也给出了一个可检验的恒等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\partial_j S(z)=0$</span>，可用于第 13 节代码节的雅可比数值验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放下的得分单调性\">温度缩放下的得分单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放下的得分单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（温度对 MSP 的单调作用）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分量不全相等。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_T=\\max_i p^{(T)}_i$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_T$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调不增；若最大分量唯一，则严格递减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大分量指标（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 分量不全相等故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star$</span> 存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_{i^\\star}$</span> 为最大，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i/T$</span> 的序与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span> 的序一致）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=z_{i^\\star}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\max_{j\\ne i^\\star}z_j&lt;a$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_T=\\frac{e^{a/T}}{e^{a/T}+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}e^{z_j/T}}=\\frac{1}{1+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}e^{(z_j-a)/T}}.$$</div>\n每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j-a&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(z_j-a)/T}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调递增（指数为负、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 递减），分母关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_T$</span> 单调不增。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star$</span> 唯一，则至少一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j-a&lt;0$</span> 严格，分母严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_T$</span> 严格递减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 说明：降低温度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\downarrow$</span>）使分布锐化、MSP 上升；升高温度使 MSP 下降。这与本章第 5 节温度缩放节的结论一致，但此处给出的是<strong>得分泛函</strong>层面的单调性，而非分布层面的锐化陈述。工程上常用的“温度校准后再做 OOD 检测”正是利用这一单调性：校准温度不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的排序，但改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_T$</span> 的数值尺度，从而影响阈值选择。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-熵得分与-MSP-的等价性边界\">熵得分与 MSP 的等价性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-熵得分与-MSP-的等价性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2（二分类等价）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,1-p_1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\max(p_1,1-p_1)$</span> 的严格单调函数，具体地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=-\\big(S\\log S+(1-S)\\log(1-S)\\big)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH}{dS}=\\log\\frac{1-S}{S}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 二分类时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\max(p_1,1-p_1)$</span>，而二元熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_1)=-[p_1\\log p_1+(1-p_1)\\log(1-p_1)]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1/2,1]$</span> 上严格递减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1\\ge 1/2$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1&lt;1/2$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的函数且严格单调。求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dS}[-S\\log S-(1-S)\\log(1-S)]=-\\log S+\\log(1-S)=\\log\\frac{1-S}{S}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 时不等价）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>。存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,z'\\in\\mathbb{R}^{3}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=S(z')$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(z)\\ne H(z')$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(0,0,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=1/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=\\log 3$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z'$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span> 之外的分布满足最大分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>：例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=(1/3,1/6,1/2)$</span> 的最大分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2\\ne 1/3$</span>，不满足。改为构造：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span> 唯一使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=1/3$</span> 且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的分布（因三项均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1/3$</span> 且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 迫使全为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>）。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=1/3$</span> 只对应均匀分布。改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=0.5$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.25,0.25)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=(0.5,0.5,0)$</span>（后者非严格正，但可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=(0.5,0.49,0.01)$</span> 逼近）。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-[0.5\\log 0.5+2\\times 0.25\\log 0.25]=\\log 2\\approx 0.693$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p')=-[0.5\\log 0.5+0.49\\log 0.49+0.01\\log 0.01]\\approx 0.5\\times 0.693+0.49\\times 0.713+0.01\\times 4.605\\approx 0.3465+0.3494+0.0461\\approx 0.742$</span>。两者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span>）而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 不同，故不等价。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的工程含义：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 时，MSP 与熵得分给出不同的 OOD 排序，选择哪一个不是无关紧要的约定，而是改变了检测器的归纳偏置。这一点必须在理论层面显式记录，而非以“通常二者相近”含混带过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-公式验证\">具体例子：公式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-公式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(2,1,0)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^2\\approx 7.389$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^1\\approx 2.718$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^0=1$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 11.107$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\approx(0.665,0.245,0.090)$</span>。最大分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}\\approx 0.665$</span>。由定理 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z S\\approx 0.665\\big((1,0,0)-(0.665,0.245,0.090)\\big)\\approx(0.223,-0.163,-0.060).$$</div>\n验证推论 1 的正交性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.223-0.163-0.060=0.000$</span>（舍入）。验证范数公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_2^2\\approx 0.665^2+0.245^2+0.090^2\\approx 0.442+0.060+0.008=0.510$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2\\times 0.665+0.510\\approx 1-1.330+0.510=0.180$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.665^2\\approx 0.442$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0796$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla S\\|_2^2\\approx 0.223^2+0.163^2+0.060^2\\approx 0.0497+0.0266+0.0036=0.0799$</span>，一致（舍入误差内）。温度效应：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z/T=(1,0.5,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(2)}\\approx(0.506,0.307,0.186)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_2\\approx 0.506&lt;S_1\\approx 0.665$</span>，与命题 2 的单调性一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-代码-MSP-梯度与温度单调性的数值验证\">代码：MSP 梯度与温度单调性的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-代码-MSP-梯度与温度单调性的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z, T=1.0):\n    z = np.asarray(z, dtype=float) / T\n    z = z - z.max()                      # 数值稳定（本章第 4 节）\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef msp_grad(z):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    i = int(np.argmax(p))\n    g = np.zeros_like(p)\n    g[i] = p[i]\n    g -= p[i] * p\n    return g, p, i\n\nz = np.array([2.0, 1.0, 0.0])\ng, p, i = msp_grad(z)\nprint(&quot;p =&quot;, p, &quot;shape&quot;, p.shape)          # 预期 (0.665, 0.245, 0.090)\nprint(&quot;grad =&quot;, g, &quot;shape&quot;, g.shape)       # 预期 (0.223, -0.163, -0.060)\nassert abs(g.sum()) &lt; 1e-12                # 推论 1：与 1 正交\nassert np.allclose(g, p[i] * (np.eye(3)[i] - p))\n\n# 数值雅可比验证：有限差分对比解析式\neps = 1e-6\nJ_num = np.zeros((3, 3))\nfor j in range(3):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[j] += eps\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[j] -= eps\n    J_num[:, j] = (softmax(zp) - softmax(zm)) / (2 * eps)\nJ_ana = np.diag(p) - np.outer(p, p)        # canonical claim 的矩阵形式\nprint(&quot;max |J_num - J_ana| =&quot;, np.abs(J_num - J_ana).max())\nassert np.abs(J_num - J_ana).max() &lt; 1e-8\n\n# 温度单调性：S_T 随 T 增大而减小\nTs = [0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 4.0]\nSs = [softmax(z, T).max() for T in Ts]\nprint(&quot;S_T =&quot;, Ss)\nassert all(Ss[k] &gt; Ss[k+1] for k in range(len(Ss)-1))   # 命题 2 严格递减\n\n# 二分类等价性（推论 2）：H 是 S 的严格单调函数\nz2 = np.array([1.5, -0.5])\np2 = softmax(z2)\nS2 = p2.max()\nH2 = -(p2 * np.log(p2)).sum()\nH_from_S = -(S2 * np.log(S2) + (1 - S2) * np.log(1 - S2))\nprint(&quot;H2 =&quot;, H2, &quot;H_from_S =&quot;, H_from_S)\nassert abs(H2 - H_from_S) &lt; 1e-12\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>p</code> 形状 <code>(3,)</code>，<code>grad</code> 形状 <code>(3,)</code>，<code>max |J_num - J_ana|</code> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>，<code>S_T</code> 严格递减序列，<code>H2</code> 与 <code>H_from_S</code> 相等至机器精度。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>定义了 MSP 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\max_i\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i$</span> 与熵得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(z)$</span>，并证明二者对 logits 整体平移不变（命题 1），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MaxLogit}$</span> 平移敏感；这一结构性区别是选择 OOD 得分时的首要理论依据。</li>\n<li>在最大分量唯一的假设下证明了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z S(z)=p_{i^\\star}(e_{i^\\star}-p)$</span>（定理 1），并由此得到梯度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 正交、范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}^2(1-2p_{i^\\star}+\\|p\\|_2^2)$</span> 的可检验恒等式（推论 1），该恒等式在第 13 节代码节中作为数值验证的判据。</li>\n<li>证明了温度缩放使 MSP 得分关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调不增、唯一最大时严格递减（命题 2），并划定了 MSP 与熵得分的等价性边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时严格单调等价（推论 2），<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 时存在同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的显式构造（推论 3），故二者不可互相替代。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-得分泛函的-Lipschitz-常数与阈值稳定性\">得分泛函的 Lipschitz 常数与阈值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-得分泛函的-Lipschitz-常数与阈值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>OOD 检测在工程上表现为阈值判定：给定阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，判定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{S(z)&lt;\\tau\\}$</span> 为分布外。阈值判定的可靠性取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 扰动的敏感度，而这由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数刻画。命题 1 已表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 对平移不变，故其 Lipschitz 常数只能在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K}/\\mathbb{R}\\mathbf{1}$</span> 上讨论；下面给出显式常数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（MSP 的 Lipschitz 常数）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,z'\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|S(z)-S(z')|\\le \\tfrac{1}{2}\\|z-z'\\|_\\infty .$$</div>\n且常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 不可改进：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,z'$</span> 使比值任意接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathrm{softmax}(z')$</span>。由本章第 2 节雅可比公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，故对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla_z p_i\\|_1=\\sum_j p_i|\\delta_{ij}-p_j|=p_i\\big((1-p_i)+\\sum_{j\\ne i}p_j\\big)=2p_i(1-p_i)\\le \\tfrac{1}{2},$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)\\le 1/4$</span>。由中值定理沿线段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\to z'$</span> 积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|p_i(z)-p_i(z')|\\le \\tfrac{1}{2}\\|z-z'\\|_\\infty$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\max_i p_i-\\max_i q_i|\\le\\max_i|p_i-q_i|$</span>（最大值函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 的），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S(z)-S(z')|\\le \\tfrac{1}{2}\\|z-z'\\|_\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>不可改进性：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(0,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z'=(\\epsilon,-\\epsilon)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=1/2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathrm{softmax}(z')$</span> 的第一分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\epsilon}/(e^{\\epsilon}+e^{-\\epsilon})\\to 1/2+\\epsilon/2$</span>（一阶展开），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z')-S(z)\\to \\epsilon/2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|z-z'\\|_\\infty=\\epsilon$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 1/2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的直接后果是阈值稳定性：若输入 logits 的扰动幅度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty$</span> 下），则 MSP 得分的漂移不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta/2$</span>。这意味着以 MSP 为得分的 OOD 检测器，其判定边界在 logits 扰动下的移动量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 无关——这是一个在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 很大时仍成立的非平凡事实，因为朴素地看 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个分量、每个都可能漂移。对比之下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MaxLogit}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，是 MSP 的两倍；这给出了二者在对抗扰动鲁棒性上的定量差异。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（熵得分的 Lipschitz 常数）</strong> 在命题 3 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|H(z)-H(z')|\\le \\big(1+\\log K\\big)\\|z-z'\\|_\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial H/\\partial p_i=-(\\log p_i+1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_p H\\|_\\infty\\le 1+\\max_i|\\log p_i|$</span>。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge e^{-\\|z\\|_\\infty}/\\sum_j e^{z_j}$</span>，但更直接地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log p_i|\\le \\log K+\\|z\\|_\\infty$</span> 不给出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z'$</span> 无关的界。改用链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial H/\\partial z_j=\\sum_i(\\partial H/\\partial p_i)(\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j)$</span>，代入雅可比公式得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial z_j}=\\sum_i-(\\log p_i+1)\\,p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)=-p_j(\\log p_j+1)+p_j\\sum_i p_i(\\log p_i+1)=p_j\\big(H-(\\log p_j+1)\\big),$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i(\\log p_i+1)=-H+1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z H\\|_1=\\sum_j p_j|H-\\log p_j-1|$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le H\\le\\log K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_j\\le\\log K$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j\\ge$</span> 最小值，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_j p_j$</span> 可任意小，故此界需谨慎）。改为逐项估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|H-\\log p_j-1|\\le |H|+|\\log p_j|+1\\le \\log K+\\log K+1$</span> 不紧。取更精细的界：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j|\\log p_j|=H$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j|H-\\log p_j-1|\\le H+\\sum_j p_j|\\log p_j|+1=2H+1\\le 2\\log K+1$</span>。这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|H(z)-H(z')|\\le(2\\log K+1)\\|z-z'\\|_\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注：推论 4 给出的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2\\log K+1)$</span> 并非最优，但它是显式的、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关的，足以支撑阈值稳定性论证；最优常数涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 上熵函数的精确 Lipschitz 模，属于本章第 11 节 Fisher 度量的范畴，此处不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-得分泛函沿梯度流的演化率\">得分泛函沿梯度流的演化率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-得分泛函沿梯度流的演化率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>OOD 检测的另一理论问题是：当模型在训练中沿交叉熵梯度更新 logits 时，MSP 得分如何演化。这需要把定理 1 的梯度与本章第 7 节交叉熵组合梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log p_y)=p-e_y$</span> 联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（MSP 沿交叉熵梯度的方向导数）</strong> 假设 (A1)、(A2) 与定理 1 的唯一性假设成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\ne i^\\star$</span>（即真实标签不是最大 softmax 分量）。记交叉熵梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\mathrm{CE}}=p-e_y$</span>。则 MSP 得分沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\mathrm{CE}}$</span> 的方向导数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,g_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}\\big(p_{i^\\star}-p_y\\big)\\ \\ge 0,$$</div>\n等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}=p_y$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z S=p_{i^\\star}(e_{i^\\star}-p)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,p-e_y\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}\\big(\\langle e_{i^\\star},p\\rangle-\\langle e_{i^\\star},e_y\\rangle-\\langle p,p\\rangle+\\langle p,e_y\\rangle\\big).$$</div>\n逐项计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle e_{i^\\star},p\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle e_{i^\\star},e_y\\rangle=\\delta_{i^\\star y}=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\ne i^\\star$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,p\\rangle=\\|p\\|_2^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,e_y\\rangle=p_y$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,g_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}\\big(p_{i^\\star}-\\|p\\|_2^2+p_y\\big).$$</div>\n又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_2^2=\\sum_j p_j^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}^2$</span> 是其中一项，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_2^2=p_{i^\\star}^2+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j^2$</span>。代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{i^\\star}-\\|p\\|_2^2+p_y=p_{i^\\star}-p_{i^\\star}^2-\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j^2+p_y.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j=1-p_{i^\\star}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y$</span> 是其中一项，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j^2\\le p_y\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j=p_y(1-p_{i^\\star})$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j\\le p_y$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i^\\star$</span> 不必然成立，需要精确表述）。改用直接展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}-p_{i^\\star}^2=p_{i^\\star}(1-p_{i^\\star})$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,g_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}\\big(p_{i^\\star}(1-p_{i^\\star})-\\textstyle\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j^2+p_y\\big).$$</div>\n此式符号不显然。改走另一条路：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\mathbf{1}\\rangle=0$</span>（推论 1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,g_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\rangle=\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,p-e_y\\rangle=\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,p\\rangle-\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,e_y\\rangle$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,p\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}(\\langle e_{i^\\star},p\\rangle-\\langle p,p\\rangle)=p_{i^\\star}(p_{i^\\star}-\\|p\\|_2^2)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,e_y\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}(\\delta_{i^\\star y}-p_y)=-p_{i^\\star}p_y$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,g_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}\\big(p_{i^\\star}-\\|p\\|_2^2+p_y\\big).$$</div>\n现在用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_2^2\\le p_{i^\\star}^2+(1-p_{i^\\star})p_y$</span>？不成立。正确的界是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_2^2=p_{i^\\star}^2+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j^2\\le(\\max_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j)\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j=p_y(1-p_{i^\\star})$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i^\\star$</span> 中使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 最大的指标？未必）。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 是任意标签，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y$</span> 未必是次大分量。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}p_j^2\\le(1-p_{i^\\star})^2$</span>（因平方和不超过和的平方）。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{i^\\star}-\\|p\\|_2^2+p_y\\ge p_{i^\\star}-p_{i^\\star}^2-(1-p_{i^\\star})^2+p_y=p_{i^\\star}(1-p_{i^\\star})-(1-p_{i^\\star})^2+p_y=(1-p_{i^\\star})(2p_{i^\\star}-1)+p_y.$$</div>\n此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}&gt;1/2$</span> 时为正（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2p_{i^\\star}-1&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y\\ge 0$</span>），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}\\le 1/2$</span> 时符号不定。故命题 4 的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>”陈述在一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 下不成立，需要精确表述为条件陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>修正命题 4</strong> 在定理 1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}&gt;1/2$</span>（即最大分量占优），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,g_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\rangle\\ge 0$</span>；等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=0$</span>（退化情形）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_z S,\\,g_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\rangle=p_{i^\\star}(p_{i^\\star}-\\|p\\|_2^2+p_y)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}&gt;1/2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_2^2\\le p_{i^\\star}^2+(1-p_{i^\\star})^2$</span>（平方和在给定最大分量与总和约束下最大时其余质量集中于一个分量），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{i^\\star}-\\|p\\|_2^2+p_y\\ge p_{i^\\star}-p_{i^\\star}^2-(1-p_{i^\\star})^2+p_y=(1-p_{i^\\star})(2p_{i^\\star}-1)+p_y\\ge 0.$$</div>\n等号需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-p_{i^\\star})(2p_{i^\\star}-1)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}=1/2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1/2$</span> 矛盾）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>修正命题 4 的含义是：当模型对某样本的预测已经占优（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}&gt;1/2$</span>）且真实标签不是该最大类时，沿交叉熵梯度下降会<strong>增大</strong> MSP 得分——即模型在把错误的最大类推得更高，这正是过自信（overconfidence）的梯度机制。这一现象与本章第 10 节反例节“softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”互补：那里讨论的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}\\to 1$</span> 时梯度趋于零，这里讨论的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\star}$</span> 中等偏大时梯度仍推动得分上升。二者共同刻画了 softmax 参数化在训练中的得分动力学。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-得分泛函的期望与-Dominated-Convergence-验证\">得分泛函的期望与 Dominated Convergence 验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-得分泛函的期望与-Dominated-Convergence-验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程上报告的 OOD 得分是样本期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[S(z(X))]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为输入随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z(X)$</span> 为网络输出的 logits。若要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布做微扰并交换期望与梯度，须验证 Dominated Convergence 的条件。下面给出一个显式的充分条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（期望梯度的交换）</strong> 假设 (A3) 成立，且存在可积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(X)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z S(z(X))\\|_\\infty\\le M(X)$</span> 几乎必然、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}M(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[S(z_\\theta(X))\\big]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\nabla_z S(z_\\theta(X))^\\top\\,\\nabla_\\theta z_\\theta(X)\\big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为网络参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\circ z_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微（链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_\\theta(X)$</span> 处光滑由 (A2) 与唯一性假设保证；非唯一点上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 仍连续但可能不可微，此时用次梯度或几乎必然唯一性假设）。由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z S\\|_\\infty\\le p_{i^\\star}\\le 1$</span>，故可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(X)=\\|\\nabla_\\theta z_\\theta(X)\\|_\\infty$</span>，其可积性由 (A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性保证。由 Dominated Convergence（对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的每个分量取差商序列），导数与期望可交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的价值在于它把“得分期望的梯度”化为“逐样本得分梯度”的期望，后者正是第 13 节代码节中可数值验证的对象。注意此处引用的是 Dominated Convergence 而非 Leibniz 积分法则：因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布未必有密度，期望是关于概率测度的积分，差商序列的极限交换由控制收敛定理保证，控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的可积性是唯一实质条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与本章后续节的接口\">与本章后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与本章后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的三个对象——<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的梯度（定理 1）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的温度单调性（命题 2）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的等价性边界（推论 2、3）——分别对接本章后续节：定理 1 的梯度公式在第 13 节代码节作为雅可比数值验证的解析基准；命题 2 的温度单调性在第 14 节代码节作为温度扫描的断言；推论 3 的不等价性在第 10 节反例节作为“以熵替代 MSP 不改变排序”这一常见误解的反例边界。此外，命题 3 的 Lipschitz 常数与第 11 节单纯形上的 Fisher 度量存在定量联系：Fisher 度量给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 空间中的局部距离，而命题 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 空间中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的全局 Lipschitz 界，二者的比较留待第 11 节展开。本节不重复这些后续内容，仅在此标明接口位置，以保证推导链的闭合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-反例-softmax-饱和导致梯度消失\">反例：softmax 饱和导致梯度消失<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-反例-softmax-饱和导致梯度消失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 logits，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为 one-hot 标签；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为温度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/T)$</span>；交叉熵损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(z)=-\\log p_y$</span>。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 表示 logit 间隔（margin），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 表示数值饱和阈值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(\\cdot)$</span> 表示条件数，其余均在出现处定义。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设逐条列出：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上处处可微。</p>\n<p>(A2) 梯度下降的步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 固定，更新规则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(t+1)}=z^{(t)}-\\eta\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}(z^{(t)})$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 数值实现采用第 4 节的稳定 log-sum-exp：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span>，并在浮点精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 下计算。本节的反例正是要拆掉“<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 有限即梯度可用”这一隐含假设，展示 (A1) 在浮点意义下的失效。</p>\n<p>本节的目标不是重复第 6、7 节已证的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}=p-y$</span>，而是构造一个具体参数配置，使该梯度在浮点与优化两个层面同时退化，并定量刻画退化速率。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-反例构造-间隔驱动的饱和\">反例构造：间隔驱动的饱和<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-反例构造-间隔驱动的饱和\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.1（饱和反例）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(\\delta,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>。在假设 (A1) 下，交叉熵梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}=\\big(p_1-1,\\;p_2\\big)=\\Big(-\\frac{1}{1+e^{-\\delta}},\\;\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\delta}}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由第 7 节 canonical claim，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log p_y)=p-y$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(1,0)$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=e^{\\delta}/(e^{\\delta}+1)=1/(1+e^{-\\delta})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=1/(1+e^{\\delta})$</span>。两分量相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10.10.2（梯度范数的定量衰减）</strong> 在上述配置下，梯度范数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}\\|_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\,e^{-\\delta}}{1+e^{-\\delta}}\\;\\le\\;\\sqrt{2}\\,e^{-\\delta}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。<strong>证明</strong>：由命题 10.10.1，第一分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/(1+e^{-\\delta})$</span>，第二分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}/(1+e^{-\\delta})$</span>，故平方和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+e^{-2\\delta})/(1+e^{-\\delta})^2$</span>。利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+e^{-2\\delta})=(1+e^{-\\delta})^2-2e^{-\\delta}$</span>，得平方和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1-\\frac{2e^{-\\delta}}{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2}$</span>。直接验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}e^{-\\delta}}{1+e^{-\\delta}}$</span> 的平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2e^{-2\\delta}}{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2}$</span>，与上式之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2-2e^{-\\delta}-2e^{-2\\delta}}{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2}=\\frac{1-e^{-2\\delta}}{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2}\\ge 0$</span>，故不等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定量结论：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=20$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}\\|_2\\le\\sqrt{2}\\,e^{-20}\\approx 2.06\\times 10^{-9}$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=40$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4.25\\times 10^{-18}$</span>。在 float32（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 1.19\\times 10^{-7}$</span>）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\gtrsim 16$</span> 时梯度第二分量已低于机器精度，更新量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\|\\nabla\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的量级相比不可分辨。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-拆掉假设-A1-有限-logit-并不保证梯度可算\">拆掉假设 (A1)：有限 logit 并不保证梯度可算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-拆掉假设-A1-有限-logit-并不保证梯度可算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 10.10.1 的推导只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 有限。但浮点实现中，第 4 节的稳定 LSE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 很大时仍会饱和。考虑 float32 下的实际计算路径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z)=z_{\\max}+\\log\\Big(\\textstyle\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}\\Big),\\qquad p_i=\\exp(z_i-\\mathrm{LSE}(z)).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.3（浮点饱和的失效模式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(\\delta,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=100$</span>，float32 精度。则计算所得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_2=0$</span>（下溢），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}}=(0,0)$</span>，与命题 10.10.1 的真值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-1, e^{-100})$</span> 在第二分量上相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-100}\\approx 3.7\\times 10^{-44}$</span>，该真值本身也低于 float32 的最小次正规数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.4\\times 10^{-45}$</span> 的可表示范围之外（实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-100}$</span> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.7\\times 10^{-44}$</span>，仍可表示为次正规数，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 的实现通常直接返回 0）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：浮点运算满足 IEEE 754 单精度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-100)$</span> 的库实现返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-100}&lt;2^{-149}$</span> 的判定在多数 libm 中触发下溢刷新）。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1-z_{\\max}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_2-z_{\\max}=-100$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}=100+\\log(1+e^{-100})$</span>，浮点下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-100}$</span> 刷新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}=100$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_2=\\exp(-100)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_1=\\exp(0)=1$</span>。梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p-y=(1-1,0-0)=(0,0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：该反例拆掉的是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 梯度非零”这一推理。正确表述需要补充条件：梯度可用的充分条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le -\\log\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}\\ge\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>），在 float32 下约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le 15.9$</span>。超过此阈值，命题 10.10.1 的代数真值仍成立，但数值梯度不可用；此时若需训练，必须改用 logit 归一化、梯度裁剪或标签平滑（第 8 节）来约束有效间隔。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-优化层面的退化-步长与条件数\">优化层面的退化：步长与条件数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-优化层面的退化-步长与条件数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>即使梯度在代数上非零，优化也会因梯度尺度失配而停滞。设损失曲面在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 坐标下的 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z^2\\mathcal{L}=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>（第 6 节已证）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(\\delta,0)$</span> 处，Hessian 的两个特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（沿全一向量方向，对应 softmax 的平移不变性）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1p_2=\\frac{e^{-\\delta}}{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.4（有效条件数与步长约束）</strong> 在假设 (A2)、(A1) 下，若采用固定步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，则使更新稳定的必要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\cdot p_1p_2\\le 2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1p_2\\sim e^{-\\delta}$</span>，故稳定步长上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_{\\max}\\sim 2e^{\\delta}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 指数增长；反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\gtrsim\\log(2/\\eta)$</span> 后更新量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\|\\nabla\\|\\lesssim\\eta\\sqrt{2}e^{-\\delta}$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的比值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-\\delta}/\\delta)$</span>，优化实质停滞。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，Hessian 由第 6 节给出。<strong>证明</strong>：梯度下降的局部线性化误差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\eta^2}{2}\\nabla^\\top\\nabla^2\\mathcal{L}\\,\\nabla$</span>，稳定要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\lambda_{\\max}(\\nabla^2\\mathcal{L})\\le 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}=p_1p_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时成立（另一特征值为 0）。比值估计由命题 10.10.2 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补什么</strong>：命题 10.10.4 说明“梯度消失”在优化语境下不是梯度为零，而是梯度相对参数尺度的信噪比衰减。补救条件是显式的：采用自适应步长（如按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\lambda_{\\max}$</span> 缩放）、或在损失中加入第 8 节的标签平滑把目标从 one-hot 改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\epsilon,\\epsilon)$</span>，从而把有效间隔上界钳制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{1-\\epsilon}{\\epsilon}$</span> 量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放下的同一反例\">温度缩放下的同一反例<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放下的同一反例\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/T)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(\\delta,0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span> 下，梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}-y$</span>，其第二分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{1+e^{\\delta/T}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.5（温度对饱和阈值的平移）</strong> 在假设 (A1) 下，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|_2\\le\\sqrt{2}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 的间隔阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge T\\log(1/\\varepsilon)$</span>。即温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 把饱和阈值按比例放大：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 越大，同样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 下梯度越大，饱和越晚出现。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定。<strong>证明</strong>：由推论 10.10.2 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta/T$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|\\le\\sqrt{2}e^{-\\delta/T}$</span>，令其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sqrt{2}\\varepsilon$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta/T\\ge\\log(1/\\varepsilon)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出一个可操作的边界：在 float32 下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\approx 15.9$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10$</span> 时阈值升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\approx 159$</span>。这说明温度缩放不是消除饱和，而是把饱和点沿 logit 轴平移；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 同步增长，饱和依旧。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-拆掉假设-A2-自适应步长下的梯度噪声\">拆掉假设 (A2)：自适应步长下的梯度噪声<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-拆掉假设-A2-自适应步长下的梯度噪声\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 10.10.4 的结论依赖于固定步长。若改用自适应方法（如按 Hessian 特征值缩放），饱和是否仍构成障碍？答案取决于梯度估计的噪声结构。设单样本梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=p-y$</span>，小批量大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，则批量梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat g=\\frac{1}{B}\\sum_{b=1}^B(p^{(b)}-y^{(b)})$</span>。在饱和区 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(b)}\\approx y^{(b)}$</span>，每个样本的梯度分量均落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}},\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}]$</span> 内。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.6（批量梯度的信噪比上界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(b)}=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(b)}=(\\delta_b,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_b\\ge\\delta_0$</span>。在假设 (A1) 下，批量梯度的第二分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat g_2=\\frac{1}{B}\\sum_b e^{-\\delta_b}/(1+e^{-\\delta_b})$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\hat g_2\\le e^{-\\delta_0}$</span>，且其相对标准差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{Std}(\\hat g_2)}{\\mathbb{E}[\\hat g_2]}\\;\\ge\\;\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{B}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Var}(e^{-\\delta_b})}}{\\mathbb{E}[e^{-\\delta_b}]}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_b$</span> 独立同分布且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_b\\ge\\delta_0$</span> 几乎必然。<strong>证明</strong>：由命题 10.10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat g_2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta_b}/(1+e^{-\\delta_b})$</span> 的样本均值。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_b\\ge\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta_b}\\le e^{-\\delta_0}$</span>，故上界成立。标准差之比由样本均值的标准误公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Std}(\\hat g_2)=\\mathrm{Std}(e^{-\\delta_b}/(1+e^{-\\delta_b}))/\\sqrt{B}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat g_2]=\\mathbb{E}[e^{-\\delta_b}/(1+e^{-\\delta_b})]$</span> 相除得到；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0$</span> 较大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1+e^{-\\delta})\\to 1$</span>，比值退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Std}(e^{-\\delta_b})/(\\sqrt{B}\\,\\mathbb{E}[e^{-\\delta_b}])$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0\\gtrsim 16$</span>（float32 饱和阈值），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat g_2]\\lesssim\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Std}(\\hat g_2)$</span> 的下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_b$</span> 的离散度决定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_b$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\delta_0,\\delta_0+1]$</span> 上均匀分布，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Std}/\\mathbb{E}\\approx 0.6$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Std}(\\hat g_2)/\\mathbb{E}[\\hat g_2]\\gtrsim 0.6/\\sqrt{B}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=32$</span> 时该比值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.11$</span>，看似可控；但绝对尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat g_2]\\lesssim 10^{-7}$</span> 意味着任何自适应方法的分母（梯度平方的滑动平均）也被压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span> 量级，与权重衰减、动量等项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 量级相比，梯度信号被淹没。这正是 (A2) 被拆掉后的失效模式：自适应步长不能恢复被浮点下溢抹去的信号，只能放大噪声。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-拆掉假设-A1-的边界-K-增大时的饱和加速\">拆掉假设 (A1) 的边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大时的饱和加速<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-拆掉假设-A1-的边界-K-增大时的饱和加速\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面的反例固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大时，饱和阈值并非不变，而是随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 收缩。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1=\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ge 2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=1/(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})$</span>，梯度第一分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1-1=-(K-1)e^{-\\delta}/(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})$</span>，其余分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}/(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 依赖的饱和阈值）</strong> 在假设 (A1) 下，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}\\|_2\\le\\sqrt{K}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 的间隔阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge\\log\\frac{K-1}{\\varepsilon}$</span>。即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 每翻倍，阈值上移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2\\approx 0.69$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：梯度范数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-1)e^{-2\\delta}/(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})^2+(K-1)e^{-2\\delta}/(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})^2$</span> 的第一项加其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量之和，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(K-1)^2e^{-2\\delta}+(K-1)e^{-2\\delta}}{(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})^2}=\\frac{K(K-1)e^{-2\\delta}}{(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})^2}$</span>。取平方根得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|=\\sqrt{K(K-1)}\\,e^{-\\delta}/(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta})\\le\\sqrt{K(K-1)}\\,e^{-\\delta}$</span>。令其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sqrt{K}\\varepsilon$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}\\le\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{K-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge\\log\\frac{\\sqrt{K-1}}{\\varepsilon}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：命题 10.10.7 的阈值比命题 10.10.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 情形多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\log(K-1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1000$</span> 时该修正约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.4$</span>，把 float32 阈值从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$15.9$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$19.3$</span>。这说明大词表语言模型的 softmax 饱和比二分类更早发生，且饱和点随类别数对数增长。该命题同时拆掉了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的反例可无损推广到任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>”的推理：正确表述必须显式写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 依赖项，否则定量估计会低估饱和风险。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-构造性补救-logit-归一化的显式界\">构造性补救：logit 归一化的显式界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-构造性补救-logit-归一化的显式界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 10.10.3 指出浮点下溢使梯度为零。一个构造性的补救是训练前对 logits 做中心化与缩放，使有效间隔被钳制。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z=z-\\bar z\\cdot\\mathbf{1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar z=\\frac{1}{K}\\sum_j z_j$</span>，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat z=\\tilde z/\\|\\tilde z\\|_\\infty\\cdot c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 为钳制常数。由于 softmax 对平移不变（第 1 节），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(\\hat z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\tilde z/c\\cdot\\|\\tilde z\\|_\\infty)$</span>，故中心化不改变分布，缩放改变温度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.8（钳制后的梯度下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat z$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat z\\|_\\infty\\le c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>。在假设 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}(\\hat z)\\|_2\\ge\\sqrt{2}\\,e^{-2c}/(1+(K-1)e^{-c})$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时取等号形式）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat z\\|_\\infty\\le c$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时由命题 10.10.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|=\\sqrt{2}e^{-\\hat\\delta}/(1+e^{-\\hat\\delta})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\delta=\\hat z_1-\\hat z_2\\le 2c$</span>。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\delta)=e^{-\\delta}/(1+e^{-\\delta})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge 0$</span> 上单调递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|\\ge\\sqrt{2}e^{-2c}/(1+e^{-2c})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 时由命题 10.10.7 的范数表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\delta\\le 2c$</span> 给出同样的下界形式，分母中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-1)$</span> 使下界更小但不为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补什么</strong>：命题 10.10.8 说明，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 有限，梯度范数就有正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}e^{-2c}/(1+e^{-2c})$</span>，在 float32 下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=7$</span> 得下界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.7\\times 10^{-6}$</span>，高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。因此“梯度消失”的完整条件是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde z\\|_\\infty$</span> 无界且未被钳制。补救不是修改 softmax 本身（其雅可比与梯度公式不变），而是在参数化层面加一个显式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\infty$</span> 约束，使命题 10.10.3 的下溢条件不成立。这与第 8 节标签平滑的路径不同：后者改目标分布，前者改 logit 尺度；两者可叠加，叠加后的有效间隔上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(2c,\\log\\frac{1-\\epsilon}{\\epsilon})$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与第-6-节梯度性质的接口-饱和不是雅可比的失效\">与第 6 节梯度性质的接口：饱和不是雅可比的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与第-6-节梯度性质的接口-饱和不是雅可比的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>需要澄清一个常见混淆：命题 10.10.3 的零梯度是否意味着第 2 节雅可比公式失效？答案是否定的。雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1,0)$</span> 处取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，这是代数上正确的极限：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1\\to 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{11}=p_1(1-p_1)\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{12}=-p_1p_2\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{21}=-p_2p_1\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{22}=p_2(1-p_2)\\to 0$</span>。雅可比趋于零矩阵是 softmax 在单纯形顶点处的真实行为，不是数值误差。数值误差只发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 被刷新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的那一步：代数上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=e^{-\\delta}&gt;0$</span>，浮点上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=0$</span>。因此正确的表述是：雅可比公式在浮点下仍被正确计算（零矩阵），但它对应的连续极限与离散实现之间的差距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}$</span> 被浮点精度吞掉。这与第 6 节“softmax 的梯度性质”不矛盾：该节证明的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的代数形式，本节指出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 在饱和区的数值可实现性边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-饱和区的-Fisher-信息退化与可辨识性\">饱和区的 Fisher 信息退化与可辨识性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-饱和区的-Fisher-信息退化与可辨识性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>饱和不仅使梯度数值不可用，也在统计层面使参数不可辨识。第 11 节将建立单纯形上的 Fisher 度量，本节先在反例配置下给出其退化速率，作为该节的前置边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.9（饱和区 Fisher 信息的定量衰减）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(\\delta,0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>，参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_1,\\theta_2)=z$</span>。在假设 (A1) 下，交叉熵损失关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Fisher 信息矩阵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{I}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{y\\sim p(\\cdot\\mid\\theta)}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_y\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_y^\\top\\big]=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top,$$</div>\n<p>其非零特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1p_2=\\dfrac{e^{-\\delta}}{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}^{+}(\\mathcal{I})\\sim e^{-\\delta}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_y$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 可微。<strong>证明</strong>：由第 2 节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 与第 7 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_y=J_{y\\cdot}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 行），Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y p_y\\,J_{y\\cdot}J_{y\\cdot}^\\top=J^\\top\\mathrm{diag}(p)J$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^\\top\\mathrm{diag}(p)J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>（利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\mathbf{1}=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的对称性）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时该矩阵的两个特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向，对应 softmax 平移不变性）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1p_2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：Fisher 信息的非零特征值即命题 10.10.4 中 Hessian 的特征值，二者在交叉熵下重合。饱和区 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}^{+}(\\mathcal{I})\\sim e^{-\\delta}$</span> 意味着参数估计的 Cramér–Rao 下界按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\delta}$</span> 发散：任何无偏估计量的方差下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\lambda_{\\min}^{+}\\sim e^{\\delta}$</span>。这与命题 10.10.2 的梯度衰减是同一现象的两个侧面——梯度是 Fisher 信息对参数的一阶响应，Fisher 信息是其二阶（统计）度量。</p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补什么</strong>：命题 10.10.9 拆掉的是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 即参数可辨识”的推理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 只保证 Fisher 信息正定（除平移方向外），不保证其条件数有界。可辨识性的完整条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}^{+}(\\mathcal{I})\\ge\\varsigma&gt;0$</span>，在 softmax 参数化下等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le\\log(1/\\varsigma)$</span> 量级；超出此界，参数在统计上不可区分，即便代数上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>。这为第 11 节的 Fisher 度量节提供了显式的退化边界：单纯形上的度量在顶点附近退化，退化速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}$</span> 刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与第-9-节分布外得分的接口-饱和使得分失去分辨力\">与第 9 节分布外得分的接口：饱和使得分失去分辨力<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与第-9-节分布外得分的接口-饱和使得分失去分辨力\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节用 softmax 得分（如最大概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i p_i$</span>）做分布外检测。饱和反例直接给出该得分的失效模式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.10（饱和区最大概率得分的饱和）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(\\delta,0)$</span>。在假设 (A1) 下，最大概率得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(z)=\\max_i p_i=\\dfrac{1}{1+e^{-\\delta}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-s(z)=\\dfrac{e^{-\\delta}}{1+e^{-\\delta}}\\le e^{-\\delta}$</span>。故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge\\log(1/\\varsigma)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(z)\\ge 1-\\varsigma$</span>，得分对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的变化率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{ds}{d\\delta}=p_1p_2\\le e^{-\\delta}$</span> 趋于零。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(z)=p_1=1/(1+e^{-\\delta})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-s=e^{-\\delta}/(1+e^{-\\delta})$</span>。导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{ds}{d\\delta}=\\frac{e^{-\\delta}}{(1+e^{-\\delta})^2}=p_1p_2$</span>，由命题 10.10.9 即 Fisher 信息非零特征值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le e^{-\\delta}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：命题 10.10.10 说明，在饱和区，分布内样本与分布外样本的最大概率得分都被压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 附近，二者之差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}$</span> 量级淹没。第 9 节的得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\lesssim\\log(1/\\varsigma)$</span> 时有效，超出后失去分辨力。正确表述需补充的条件是：得分比较必须在 logit 间隔有界的区域内进行，或改用对饱和不敏感的统计量（如 logit 间隔本身 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，或第 4 节的 LSE 残差）。这与命题 10.10.3 的数值下溢是同一阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\approx 16$</span>（float32）既是梯度消失点，也是得分饱和点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-饱和反例的不可约性-为何不能靠重参数化消除\">饱和反例的不可约性：为何不能靠重参数化消除<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-饱和反例的不可约性-为何不能靠重参数化消除\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个自然的疑问是：既然 softmax 平移不变，能否通过固定一个参考分量（如令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_K=0$</span>）来消除饱和？答案是否定的，且可给出定量论证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.10.11（参考分量固定的无效性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_2=0$</span>、仅优化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1=\\delta$</span>。在假设 (A1)、(A2) 下，梯度下降的更新量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\,(p_1-1)$</span>，其绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta/(1+e^{\\delta})\\le\\eta e^{-\\delta}$</span>。故固定参考分量不改变饱和速率，只把参数空间从二维降到一维，饱和阈值仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\approx\\log(1/\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_2$</span> 固定不更新。<strong>证明</strong>：损失对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1-1=-1/(1+e^{\\delta})$</span>，绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le e^{-\\delta}$</span>。更新量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta|p_1-1|\\le\\eta e^{-\\delta}$</span>，与命题 10.10.2 的范数衰减同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：饱和是 softmax 参数化的内禀性质，源于指数映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i\\mapsto e^{z_i}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i\\to\\infty$</span> 时的平坦化，而非参数冗余。重参数化（固定参考、中心化、白化）只改变饱和发生的坐标方向，不改变饱和阈值随间隔指数衰减的速率。真正改变速率的是命题 10.10.8 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\infty$</span> 钳制（限制间隔上界）或第 8 节标签平滑（限制目标间隔），二者都是对间隔本身的约束，而非对坐标的变换。</p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补什么</strong>：命题 10.10.11 拆掉的是“平移不变性可用来规避饱和”的推理。平移不变性只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z+c\\mathbf{1})$</span>，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|$</span> 在平移下不变——事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\|$</span> 在平移下不变（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不变），但间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 在平移下不变，故饱和阈值不变。规避饱和的必要条件是约束间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的上界，这无法由任何保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不变的坐标变换实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-饱和反例的边界总结-哪些条件必须显式写出\">饱和反例的边界总结：哪些条件必须显式写出<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-饱和反例的边界总结-哪些条件必须显式写出\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合本节各命题，饱和导致梯度消失的完整条件可归纳为三条显式不等式，缺任一条则结论失效：</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>数值条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le-\\log\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>（命题 10.10.3）。缺此条，代数梯度非零但浮点梯度为零；float32 下阈值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$15.9$</span>，float64 下约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$36.7$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong>类别数条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le\\log\\frac{\\sqrt{K-1}}{\\varepsilon}$</span>（命题 10.10.7）。缺此条，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的阈值被低估；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1000$</span> 时阈值上移约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.4$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) <strong>间隔上界条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde z\\|_\\infty\\le c$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 有限（命题 10.10.8）。缺此条，梯度范数无正下界，自适应步长与批量估计均无法恢复信号（命题 10.10.6）。</p>\n<p>这三条不等式共同刻画了“梯度可用”的充要边界。命题 10.10.9–10.10.11 进一步说明，同一阈值同时是 Fisher 信息退化点、分布外得分饱和点、以及重参数化无法规避的内禀点。因此，饱和不是 softmax 雅可比公式的错误，而是该公式在单纯形顶点附近的真实退化在浮点实现下的放大；正确的理论表述必须把这三条不等式写入假设，而非以“<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 有限”一笔带过。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>饱和反例的精确形态是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(\\delta,0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\mathcal{L}=(-1/(1+e^{-\\delta}),\\,e^{-\\delta}/(1+e^{-\\delta}))$</span>，范数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}e^{-\\delta}$</span> 指数衰减；代数上梯度恒非零，但 float32 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\gtrsim 16$</span> 即跌破机器精度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=100$</span> 时数值梯度精确为零，拆掉了“有限 logit 保证梯度可用”的隐含假设。</li>\n<li>正确表述需补充的显式条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le-\\log\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>（float32 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$15.9$</span>），或等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta}\\ge\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>；温度缩放把该阈值平移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\log(1/\\varepsilon)$</span>，标签平滑把有效间隔钳制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{1-\\epsilon}{\\epsilon}$</span>，二者都是对条件的工程性补足而非消除饱和。</li>\n<li>优化层面的退化由 Hessian 特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1p_2\\sim e^{-\\delta}$</span> 刻画：固定步长下更新量与参数尺度之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-\\delta}/\\delta)$</span>，故“梯度消失”应表述为梯度相对参数尺度的信噪比衰减，而非梯度恒为零；这一区分是后续 Fisher 度量节与采样接口节讨论数值稳定性的前提。</li>\n<li>拆掉 (A2) 后，自适应步长无法恢复被浮点下溢抹去的梯度信号：批量梯度的绝对尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat g_2]\\lesssim\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 使自适应方法的分母与动量项失配，信噪比下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Std}/\\mathbb{E}\\gtrsim 0.6/\\sqrt{B}$</span> 只描述相对噪声，不解决绝对尺度问题。</li>\n<li>拆掉“<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 可无损推广”的推理后，饱和阈值随类别数对数上移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge\\log\\frac{\\sqrt{K-1}}{\\varepsilon}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1000$</span> 时 float32 阈值从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$15.9$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$19.3$</span>；大词表 softmax 的饱和比二分类更早发生，定量估计必须显式写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 依赖项。</li>\n<li>构造性补救是在参数化层加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\infty$</span> 钳制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde z\\|_\\infty\\le c$</span>，给出梯度范数正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}e^{-2c}/(1+e^{-2c})$</span>；这与标签平滑改目标分布的路径正交，可叠加为有效间隔上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(2c,\\log\\frac{1-\\epsilon}{\\epsilon})$</span>，且不修改 softmax 的雅可比公式本身——饱和是数值可实现性问题，不是代数公式的失效。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-单纯形上的-Fisher-度量\">单纯形上的 Fisher 度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-单纯形上的-Fisher-度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为 logits，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}\\subset\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为概率向量，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K: p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_i=e^{z_i}/\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}$</span>。前序节已证雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，并已建立 softmax 作为指数族参数化的视角：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\exp(\\theta_i-\\psi(\\theta))$</span>，自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=z$</span>，对数配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(\\theta)=\\log\\sum_j e^{\\theta_j}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K: p_i&gt;0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为开单纯形（相对内部），它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维光滑流形。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span>，定义 Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>，其元素为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{ij}(p)=\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim p}\\!\\left[\\partial_i \\log p_x\\,\\partial_j\\log p_x\\right]=\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k\\,(\\partial_i\\log p_k)(\\partial_j\\log p_k),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i=\\partial/\\partial p_i$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j,k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上的矩阵是奇异的（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span> 约束），其在切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}=\\{v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span> 上的限制才是正定的，这是本节要精确陈述的事实。</p>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为有限整数；(A2) 所有讨论的点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 良定义且光滑；(A3) 涉及求导与期望交换时，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 有正下界，求和为有限和，Leibniz 法则与 Dominated Convergence 的条件自动满足（有限测度空间上的一致有界性），下文不再逐次引用；(A4) 讨论切空间时取定欧氏内积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_i u_i v_i$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的参照度量，Fisher 度量是相对于它的另一 Riemann 度量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-Fisher-信息矩阵的坐标表达与正定性\">Fisher 信息矩阵的坐标表达与正定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-Fisher-信息矩阵的坐标表达与正定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Fisher 矩阵的对角加秩一结构）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span>，Fisher 矩阵满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{ij}(p)=\\frac{\\delta_{ij}}{p_i}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\log p_k=\\frac{1}{p_k}\\partial_i p_k=\\frac{\\delta_{ik}}{p_k}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 坐标下把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,\\dots,p_K$</span> 视为独立变量求偏导，暂不施加约束）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_{ij}(p)=\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k\\cdot\\frac{\\delta_{ik}}{p_k}\\cdot\\frac{\\delta_{jk}}{p_k}=\\sum_{k=1}^K \\frac{\\delta_{ik}\\delta_{jk}}{p_k}=\\frac{\\delta_{ij}}{p_i}.$$</div>\n<p>关键步骤是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i p_k=\\delta_{ik}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span> 的约分，二者均为逐项恒等，无交换极限问题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（切空间上的正定性）</strong> 在命题 1 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上正定当且仅当限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}=\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span> 上正定；事实上对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in T_p\\mathcal{M}\\setminus\\{0\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\top G(p)v=\\sum_{i=1}^K \\frac{v_i^2}{p_i}&gt;0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top G v=\\sum_i v_i^2/p_i$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，每项非负，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\ne 0$</span> 时至少一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i\\ne 0$</span>，故和严格为正。另一方面，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(1,\\dots,1)\\notin T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top G v=\\sum_i 1/p_i&gt;0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上并非正定：向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Gw=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i/p_i=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上其实正定——这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 奇异”的常见说法需澄清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_i)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上正定，但在约束流形上我们只用其切向限制；真正奇异的是将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 与约束投影复合后的诱导度量在嵌入坐标下的表示。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong> Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)$</span> 是概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处 score 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\log p$</span> 的协方差，度量的是分布参数微小扰动下 KL 散度的二阶展开；它与 softmax 雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\partial p/\\partial z$</span> 是两个不同对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 是参数化映射的微分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 是单纯形内蕴的 Riemann 度量。二者的联系由下一小节的拉回公式给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-从-logits-到单纯形的拉回度量\">从 logits 到单纯形的拉回度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-从-logits-到单纯形的拉回度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Fisher 度量的拉回）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=\\partial p/\\partial z$</span> 为前序节已证的雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>。则 logits 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上由 Fisher 度量拉回的二次型为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J(z)^\\top G(p)\\,J(z))_{ij}=p_i\\,\\delta_{ij}-p_i p_j.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=J^\\top G J$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ij}=\\sum_{a,b}J_{ai}G_{ab}J_{bj}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{ab}=\\delta_{ab}/p_a$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ai}=p_a(\\delta_{ai}-p_i)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{bj}=p_b(\\delta_{bj}-p_j)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_{ij}=\\sum_{a,b}\\frac{\\delta_{ab}}{p_a}\\,p_a(\\delta_{ai}-p_i)\\,p_b(\\delta_{bj}-p_j).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ab}$</span> 约去对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的求和并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=a$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_{ij}=\\sum_{a}p_a(\\delta_{ai}-p_i)(\\delta_{aj}-p_j).$$</div>\n<p>展开三项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_{ij}=\\sum_a p_a\\delta_{ai}\\delta_{aj}-p_j\\sum_a p_a\\delta_{ai}-p_i\\sum_a p_a\\delta_{aj}+p_i p_j\\sum_a p_a.$$</div>\n<p>逐项计算：第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=p_i\\delta_{ij}$</span>；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-p_j p_i$</span>；第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-p_i p_j$</span>；第四项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=p_i p_j\\cdot 1=p_i p_j$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ij}=p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_i p_j$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（拉回度量的核）</strong> 在命题 2 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)=J^\\top G J$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)\\mathbf{1}=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top$</span>；且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\top M u=\\sum_i p_i u_i^2-(\\sum_i p_i u_i)^2=\\mathrm{Var}_{i\\sim p}(u_i)\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支持上为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(M\\mathbf{1})_i=\\sum_j(p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j)=p_i-p_i\\sum_j p_j=0$</span>。第二断言：直接展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\top M u=\\sum_{ij}u_i(p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j)u_j=\\sum_i p_i u_i^2-(\\sum_i p_i u_i)^2$</span>，这是随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_I$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\sim p$</span>）的方差，非负，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_i$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 处为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（几何意义）</strong> 推论 2 表明：softmax 参数化下，logits 空间中沿“全 1 方向”的平移不改变分布（softmax 的平移不变性），故该方向落在拉回度量的核中；这与前序节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的零空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span> 一致。Fisher 度量在 logits 空间诱导的伪度量正是“分布方差”，这与单纯形上 Fisher 度量的内蕴表述等价。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与-KL-散度的二阶展开恒等式\">与 KL 散度的二阶展开恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与-KL-散度的二阶展开恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（KL 的二阶展开给出 Fisher 度量）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span> 考虑 KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_i p_i\\log(p_i/q_i)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p+\\epsilon v$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=0$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 充分小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p+\\epsilon v)=\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2}\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{v_i^2}{p_i}+o(\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=p_i+\\epsilon v_i$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=0$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i=\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 仍在单纯形仿射包内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span>。展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_i p_i\\log\\frac{p_i}{p_i+\\epsilon v_i}=-\\sum_i p_i\\log\\!\\left(1+\\frac{\\epsilon v_i}{p_i}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，用 Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+x)=x-\\frac{x^2}{2}+O(x^3)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\epsilon v_i/p_i$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\log\\!\\left(1+\\frac{\\epsilon v_i}{p_i}\\right)=-\\frac{\\epsilon v_i}{p_i}+\\frac{\\epsilon^2 v_i^2}{2p_i^2}+O(\\epsilon^3).$$</div>\n<p>乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=-\\epsilon\\sum_i v_i+\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2}\\sum_i\\frac{v_i^2}{p_i}+O(\\epsilon^3)\\sum_i\\frac{|v_i|^3}{p_i^2}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=0$</span> 消失。余项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 有正下界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i$</span> 有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon^3)$</span> 项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\epsilon^3$</span> 控制，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\epsilon^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（Fisher 度量作为 Hessian）</strong> 在命题 3 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的 Hessian 限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)$</span>，即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v,w\\in T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial s\\,\\partial t}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p+s v+t w)\\right|_{s=t=0}=v^\\top G(p)\\,w.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3 的展开，二阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}(sv+tw)^\\top G(sv+tw)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t$</span> 混合偏导在原点取值即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top G w$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（可检验恒等式）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(1,-1,0)\\in T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i^2/p_i=1/(1/2)+1/(1/3)+0=2+3=5$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p+\\epsilon v)=\\frac{5}{2}\\epsilon^2+o(\\epsilon^2)$</span>。数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-3}$</span>，KL 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.5\\times 10^{-6}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{5}{2}\\epsilon^2=2.5\\times 10^{-6}$</span> 吻合到相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-二分类的-Fisher-度量\">具体例子：二分类的 Fisher 度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-二分类的-Fisher-度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的显式计算）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,p_2)=(p,1-p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>。切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 是一维的，基可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(1,-1)$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p,1/(1-p))$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\top G v=\\frac{1}{p}+\\frac{1}{1-p}=\\frac{1}{p(1-p)}.$$</div>\n<p>这正是 Bernoulli 分布的 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(p(1-p))$</span>。另一方面，用 logit 参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\log\\frac{p}{1-p}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(\\eta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dp}{d\\eta}=p(1-p)$</span>，拉回度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left(\\frac{dp}{d\\eta}\\right)^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{p(1-p)}=p(1-p)$</span>，与命题 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=p_1\\delta_{11}-p_1^2=p(1-p)$</span>（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j=1$</span>）一致。两个表达通过重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 相联系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是自然参数，Fisher 度量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 坐标下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1-p)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 坐标下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(p(1-p))$</span>，二者互为倒数，体现坐标变换下张量的协变规律。</p>\n<p><strong>验证代码</strong> 下述代码数值验证命题 1、命题 2 与命题 3 的恒等式，并检查维度与正定性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = z - z.max()\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef fisher_diag(p):\n    # 命题 1: G = diag(1/p_i)\n    return np.diag(1.0 / p)\n\ndef jacobian_softmax(z):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    K = len(z)\n    J = np.zeros((K, K))\n    for i in range(K):\n        for j in range(K):\n            J[i, j] = p[i] * ((1.0 if i == j else 0.0) - p[j])\n    return J, p\n\n# 命题 1 与命题 2 的数值验证\nz = np.array([0.3, -0.7, 1.1, 0.2])\nJ, p = jacobian_softmax(z)\nG = fisher_diag(p)\nM_direct = J.T @ G @ J\nM_formula = np.diag(p) - np.outer(p, p)\nassert np.allclose(M_direct, M_formula), &quot;命题 2 拉回公式不成立&quot;\nassert np.allclose(M_formula.sum(axis=1), 0.0), &quot;M 的核应含全 1 向量&quot;\nprint(&quot;J shape:&quot;, J.shape, &quot;G shape:&quot;, G.shape, &quot;M shape:&quot;, M_direct.shape)\nprint(&quot;M @ 1 =&quot;, M_formula @ np.ones(len(p)))\n\n# 推论 2: u^T M u = Var_p(u)\nu = np.array([1.0, -2.0, 0.5, 3.0])\nvar_u = np.sum(p * u**2) - (np.sum(p * u))**2\nassert np.isclose(u @ M_formula @ u, var_u), &quot;方差恒等式不成立&quot;\nprint(&quot;u^T M u =&quot;, u @ M_formula @ u, &quot; Var_p(u) =&quot;, var_u)\n\n# 命题 3: KL 二阶展开\np0 = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2])\nv = np.array([1.0, -1.0, 0.0])  # sum v = 0\neps = 1e-4\nq = p0 + eps * v\nassert np.all(q &gt; 0)\nKL = np.sum(p0 * np.log(p0 / q))\nquad = 0.5 * eps**2 * np.sum(v**2 / p0)\nassert abs(KL - quad) / quad &lt; 1e-2, &quot;KL 二阶展开偏差过大&quot;\nprint(&quot;KL =&quot;, KL, &quot; 0.5*eps^2*sum(v^2/p) =&quot;, quad, &quot; ratio =&quot;, KL / quad)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>J shape: (4, 4) G shape: (4, 4) M shape: (4, 4)</code>；<code>M @ 1</code> 为四个零（数值误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-17}$</span> 量级）；<code>u^T M u</code> 与 <code>Var_p(u)</code> 相等；KL 与二次型之比接近 1（偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-本节小结\">本节小结<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-本节小结\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>在开单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上，Fisher 信息矩阵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 坐标下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_i)$</span>，其在切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}=\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span> 上的限制正定，二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top G v=\\sum_i v_i^2/p_i$</span> 严格为正（命题 1、推论 1）。</li>\n<li>softmax 雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 将 Fisher 度量拉回 logits 空间，得到伪度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=J^\\top G J$</span>，其元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j$</span>，核为全 1 方向，二次型等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{i\\sim p}(u_i)$</span>，与 softmax 的平移不变性一致（命题 2、推论 2）。</li>\n<li>KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p+\\epsilon v)$</span> 沿切向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的二阶展开系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}v^\\top G(p)v$</span>，故 Fisher 度量是 KL 散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处的 Hessian 限制，这给出单纯形上 Fisher 度量的内蕴刻画，并与二分类情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(p(1-p))$</span> 的 Bernoulli 信息量吻合（命题 3、推论 3、例 1）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-测地线与指数映射的显式形式\">测地线与指数映射的显式形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-测地线与指数映射的显式形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把 Fisher 度量刻画为 KL 散度的 Hessian。本节进一步给出该度量的两条可计算结构：测地线方程的解，以及指数映射的显式表达。这两者是“单纯形上的 Fisher 度量”区别于任意 Riemann 度量的关键——它来自指数族，因而具有闭式解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（测地线：与球面的等距与闭式解）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb S^{K-1}_2=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^K:\\|x\\|_2=2,\\ x_i&gt;0\\}$</span> 为正卦限内的半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 球面。映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\mathcal M\\to\\mathbb S^{K-1}_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(p)_i=2\\sqrt{p_i}$</span> 是等距同构。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 的测地线恰为球面大圆在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}$</span> 下的像：取定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal M$</span> 与切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in T_p\\mathcal M$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=0$</span>），令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega=\\frac12\\sqrt{v^\\top G(p)v}$</span>，则满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(0)=p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma(0)=v$</span> 的测地线为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\gamma_i(t)=\\left(\\sqrt{p_i}\\cos(\\omega t)+\\frac{v_i}{2\\omega\\sqrt{p_i}}\\sin(\\omega t)\\right)^2,\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i=2\\sqrt{p_i}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dx_i=\\mathrm dp_i/\\sqrt{p_i}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\mathrm dx_i^2=\\sum_i\\mathrm dp_i^2/p_i=\\mathrm ds^2_G$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 是等距映射。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i x_i^2=4\\sum_i p_i=4$</span>，故像落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb S^{K-1}_2$</span> 内；两者维数同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，且像的正性与开性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 保证，故为等距同构。球面测地线为大圆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=2\\big(a\\cos(\\omega t)+b\\sin(\\omega t)\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span> 为单位向量且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\top b=0$</span>。初值给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i=\\sqrt{p_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_i(0)=2\\omega b_i$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_i=\\dot\\gamma_i/\\sqrt{\\gamma_i}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\omega b_i=v_i/\\sqrt{p_i}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i=v_i/(2\\omega\\sqrt{p_i})$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b\\|=1$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\sum_i v_i^2/p_i}=\\frac12\\sqrt{v^\\top Gv}$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\top b=\\sum_i v_i/(2\\omega)=0$</span>，正交性自动成立。代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_i=p_i=x_i^2/4$</span> 即得所述闭式解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（约束测地线方程与 Christoffel 符号）</strong> 在命题 4 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 上 Fisher 度量的非零 Christoffel 符号只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma^k_{kk}=-1/(2p_k)$</span>，测地线方程带约束力项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ddot\\gamma_i-\\frac{\\dot\\gamma_i^2}{2\\gamma_i}=\\lambda\\,\\gamma_i,\\qquad \\lambda=-\\frac12\\,v^\\top G(p)\\,v,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 沿曲线为常数。特别地，无约束方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot\\gamma_i-\\dot\\gamma_i^2/(2\\gamma_i)=0$</span> 的平方仿射解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_i(t)=(a_i+b_it)^2$</span> 在按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\gamma_i=1$</span> 归一化后<strong>不是</strong>单纯形的测地线——归一化不是等距映射，约束流形上不能“先解无约束再投影”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}=\\delta_{ij}/p_i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{kl}=\\delta_{kl}p_k$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_l g_{ij}=-\\delta_{ij}\\delta_{il}/p_i^2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Gamma^k_{ij}=\\frac12 p_k\\left(\\partial_i g_{jk}+\\partial_j g_{ik}-\\partial_k g_{ij}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>逐项计算：仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j=k$</span> 时三项均非零，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma^k_{kk}=\\frac12p_k(-1/p_k^2-1/p_k^2+1/p_k^2)=-1/(2p_k)$</span>；其余组合全为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ii}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne k$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_k g_{ii}=0$</span>，而含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{jk}$</span> 的项要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=k$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i g_{kk}$</span> 又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne k$</span> 为零）。故无约束测地线方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot\\gamma_i-\\dot\\gamma_i^2/(2\\gamma_i)=0$</span>。带约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\gamma_i=1$</span> 时，Lagrange 乘子给出右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\gamma_i$</span>。由命题 4 的闭式解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i=2\\sqrt{\\gamma_i}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot x_i=-\\omega^2x_i$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot x_i=\\ddot\\gamma_i/\\sqrt{\\gamma_i}-\\dot\\gamma_i^2/(2\\gamma_i^{3/2})$</span>，两边乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\gamma_i}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot\\gamma_i-\\dot\\gamma_i^2/(2\\gamma_i)=-2\\omega^2\\gamma_i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=-2\\omega^2=-\\frac12v^\\top Gv$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 沿大圆为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为常数。平方仿射解满足无约束方程，但其归一化曲线在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 空间是径向投影到球面的轨迹而非大圆，故一般不是测地线。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与欧氏测地线及 softmax 直线的区别）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 欧氏度量下测地线是直线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t)=p+tv$</span>；在 Fisher 度量下测地线是球面大圆的原像，周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\pi/\\omega$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的各分量全为正，曲线在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\pi/(2\\omega)$</span> 处到达单纯形内的点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_i=b_i^2$</span>；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 含负分量，曲线会在有限时刻撞到单纯形边界。自然参数下的直线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(t)=z(0)+t\\dot z(0)$</span> 经 softmax 得到的曲线一般也不是 Fisher 测地线，因为 softmax 不是等距映射——这由命题 2 中拉回度量为伪度量（非正定）已预示。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-Fisher-度量下的体积元与-Jeffreys-先验\">Fisher 度量下的体积元与 Jeffreys 先验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-Fisher-度量下的体积元与-Jeffreys-先验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（体积元）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，取图表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(p)=(p_1,\\dots,p_{K-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_K=1-\\sum_{i&lt;K}p_i$</span>，坐标 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma=dp_1\\cdots dp_{K-1}$</span>。Fisher 度量在该图表下的矩阵与体积元为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g^\\varphi_{ij}(p)=\\frac{\\delta_{ij}}{p_i}+\\frac{1}{p_K},\\qquad dV_G(p)=\\sqrt{\\det g^\\varphi(p)}\\;d\\sigma=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\prod_{i=1}^K p_i}}\\;d\\sigma,\\qquad i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 图表中切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial/\\partial p_i=e_i-e_K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i&lt;K$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^\\varphi_{ij}=(e_i-e_K)^\\top G(p)(e_j-e_K)=\\delta_{ij}/p_i+1/p_K$</span>。写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^\\varphi=A+\\frac{1}{p_K}\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_i)_{i&lt;K}$</span>。由矩阵行列式引理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(A+uv^\\top)=\\det A\\,(1+v^\\top A^{-1}u)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=v=\\mathbf 1/\\sqrt{p_K}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\det g^\\varphi=\\prod_{i&lt;K}\\frac{1}{p_i}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{p_K}\\sum_{i&lt;K}p_i\\right)=\\prod_{i&lt;K}\\frac{1}{p_i}\\cdot\\frac{p_K+\\sum_{i&lt;K}p_i}{p_K}=\\frac{1}{\\prod_{i=1}^K p_i}.$$</div>\n<p>开方即得体积元。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（两种测度的换算）</strong> 若改用超平面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_ip_i=1$</span> 的欧氏面测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma_S$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma_S=\\sqrt K\\,d\\sigma$</span>（基 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i-e_K$</span> 的 Gram 行列式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dV_G=\\prod_ip_i^{-1/2}K^{-1/2}d\\sigma_S$</span>。两种写法只差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt K$</span>，但混用会带来因子错误；本节统一采用坐标 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（Jeffreys 先验）</strong> 在命题 5 的条件下，Fisher 度量诱导的先验密度（Jeffreys 先验）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i=1}^K p_i^{-1/2}$</span>，其在单纯形上的积分为有限当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 时每个指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/2&gt;-1$</span>，故积分收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dV_G\\propto\\prod_i p_i^{-1/2}d\\sigma$</span>。在单纯形上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_K=1-\\sum_{i&lt;K}p_i$</span> 积分，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 的幂次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/2$</span>，Dirichlet 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\Delta^{K-1}}\\prod_i p_i^{a_i-1}d\\sigma$</span> 收敛当且仅当所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i&gt;0$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i=1/2&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与均匀先验的区别）</strong> 均匀先验对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i=1$</span>，Jeffreys 先验对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i=1/2$</span>，二者均为 Dirichlet 分布的特例。Fisher 度量给出的先验在参数化下不变，这是它区别于坐标体积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma$</span> 的根本性质：坐标体积依赖嵌入，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dV_G$</span> 是内蕴的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-与自然参数坐标的对照\">与自然参数坐标的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与自然参数坐标的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 softmax 的指数族视角：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\exp(\\theta_i-\\psi(\\theta))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(\\theta)=\\log\\sum_j e^{\\theta_j}$</span>。本小节把 Fisher 度量在这套自然参数下重新表达，以说明“单纯形上的 Fisher 度量”与“logits 空间的拉回伪度量”是同一几何对象的两种坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（自然参数下的 Fisher 度量）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为自然参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\theta)$</span>。则 Fisher 度量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下的矩阵元素为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde G_{ij}(\\theta)=\\frac{\\partial^2\\psi}{\\partial\\theta_i\\partial\\theta_j}=p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j,\\qquad i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(\\theta)=\\log\\sum_k e^{\\theta_k}$</span>，一阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\psi=e^{\\theta_i}/\\sum_k e^{\\theta_k}=p_i$</span>。二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j\\partial_i\\psi=\\partial_j p_i=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，即前序节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}$</span>。另一方面，Fisher 信息在自然参数下的定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[\\partial_i\\log p_x\\,\\partial_j\\log p_x]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_x=\\theta_x-\\psi(\\theta)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\log p_x=\\delta_{ix}-p_i$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[(\\delta_{ix}-p_i)(\\delta_{jx}-p_j)]=p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j$</span>。两路计算一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（坐标变换的协变律）</strong> 在命题 6 的条件下，命题 2 的拉回伪度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)$</span> 与命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)$</span> 通过雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\partial p/\\partial\\theta$</span> 相联系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=J^\\top G J$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G=J$</span> 本身（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G_{ij}=J_{ij}$</span>）。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G$</span> 奇异，核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>，对应 softmax 的平移不变性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(\\theta+c\\mathbf{1})=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一断言即命题 2。第二断言由命题 6 直接读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G=J$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\mathbf{1}=0$</span> 已在前序节雅可比推导中建立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（三个矩阵的关系）</strong> 至此本节出现三个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 矩阵：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_i)$</span>（正定，单纯形坐标下的 Fisher 度量）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>（奇异，softmax 的微分）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)=J^\\top GJ$</span>（奇异，logits 空间的拉回伪度量）。三者满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=J^\\top GJ$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G=J$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 相联系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的核与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的核相同，均为全 1 方向。这一关系链是本节的核心恒等式，也是后续“与采样章的接口”中把 Fisher 度量用于自然梯度采样的基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式-测地线与自然梯度\">一个可检验的数值恒等式：测地线与自然梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式-测地线与自然梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（自然梯度与 Fisher 预条件的等价）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，设损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(p)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上光滑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的普通梯度与关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z L=\\big(J(z)\\big)^\\top\\nabla_p L,\\qquad \\text{且}\\qquad \\big(J^\\top G J\\big)^{-1}\\nabla_z L=\\big(J^\\top\\big)^{-1}G^{-1}\\nabla_p L,$$</div>\n<p>其中右端的伪逆在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上取。特别地，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 坐标下做 Fisher 预条件（自然梯度）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\nabla_p L=G(p)^{-1}\\nabla_p L$</span>，拉回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 坐标后等价于用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)$</span> 的伪逆预条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式是链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial z_j=\\sum_i(\\partial L/\\partial p_i)(\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j)=\\sum_i J_{ij}\\partial_i L$</span>。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=J^\\top GJ$</span> 与伪逆性质 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J^\\top GJ)^+=J^+G^{-1}(J^\\top)^+$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 为满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在其上正定）得到；两端作用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=J^\\top\\nabla_p L$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 2（二次损失的显式计算）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(0,0,0)$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(p)=\\frac{1}{2}\\|p-p^\\star\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star=(1,0,0)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p L=p-p^\\star=(-2/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>。由命题 7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=J^\\top\\nabla_p L$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=\\frac{1}{3}(\\delta_{ij}-\\frac{1}{3})$</span>，计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=(-\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2}{9}+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot(-\\frac{1}{9})+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot(-\\frac{1}{9}),\\dots)$</span>，逐项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\frac{4}{27}-\\frac{1}{27}-\\frac{1}{27},\\frac{2}{27}+\\frac{2}{27}-\\frac{1}{27},\\frac{2}{27}-\\frac{1}{27}+\\frac{2}{27})=(-\\frac{6}{27},\\frac{3}{27},\\frac{3}{27})=(-\\frac{2}{9},\\frac{1}{9},\\frac{1}{9})$</span>。这与直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\mathrm{softmax}(z))$</span> 求导一致，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\nabla_z L_i=0$</span>，符合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的平移不变性。</p>\n<p><strong>验证代码</strong> 下述代码数值验证命题 4 的球面大圆闭式解与推论 4 的约束测地线方程、命题 5 的体积元，以及命题 7 的自然梯度恒等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = z - z.max()\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef fisher_diag(p):\n    return np.diag(1.0 / p)\n\ndef jacobian_softmax(z):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    K = p.size\n    J = np.zeros((K, K))\n    for i in range(K):\n        for j in range(K):\n            J[i, j] = p[i] * ((1.0 if i == j else 0.0) - p[j])\n    return J\n\n# 命题 4 / 推论 4: 球面大圆测地线与约束测地线方程\np0 = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2])\nv = np.array([1.0, -1.0, 0.0])          # sum(v)=0，故 v 在切空间\nG0 = fisher_diag(p0)\nomega = 0.5 * np.sqrt(v @ G0 @ v)\nlam = -0.5 * (v @ G0 @ v)\ndef geo(s):\n    return (np.sqrt(p0) * np.cos(omega * s)\n            + v / (2.0 * omega * np.sqrt(p0)) * np.sin(omega * s)) ** 2\nt = 0.05\ndt = 1e-5\ng0, gp, gm = geo(t), geo(t + dt), geo(t - dt)\nddot = (gp - 2.0 * g0 + gm) / dt ** 2\ndot = (gp - gm) / (2.0 * dt)\nresid = ddot - dot ** 2 / (2.0 * g0)     # 无约束部分的残差\nassert abs(g0.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;测地线应保持在单纯形上&quot;\nassert np.allclose(resid, lam * g0, atol=1e-4), &quot;约束测地线方程不成立&quot;\nprint(&quot;测地线残差 resid =&quot;, resid)\nprint(&quot;lambda*g =&quot;, lam * g0, &quot; lambda =&quot;, lam)\n\n# 命题 5: 图表度量与体积元\nK = 3\nG = fisher_diag(p0)\n# 图表切基: e1-e3, e2-e3\nB = np.zeros((K, K - 1))\nB[0, 0] = 1.0; B[2, 0] = -1.0\nB[1, 1] = 1.0; B[2, 1] = -1.0\nG_T = B.T @ G @ B\ndet_G_T = np.linalg.det(G_T)\nexpected = 1.0 / np.prod(p0)\nassert np.isclose(det_G_T, expected), &quot;体积元行列式不匹配&quot;\nprint(&quot;det(g_phi) =&quot;, det_G_T, &quot; 1/prod(p) =&quot;, expected)\n\n# 命题 7: 自然梯度恒等式\nz = np.array([0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\nJ = jacobian_softmax(z)\np = softmax(z)\np_star = np.array([1.0, 0.0, 0.0])\ngrad_p = p - p_star\ngrad_z = J.T @ grad_p\n# 直接对 L(softmax(z)) 数值求导\ndef L_of_z(zz):\n    pp = softmax(zz)\n    return 0.5 * np.sum((pp - p_star)**2)\neps = 1e-6\ngrad_z_num = np.zeros(3)\nfor i in range(3):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[i] += eps\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[i] -= eps\n    grad_z_num[i] = (L_of_z(zp) - L_of_z(zm)) / (2 * eps)\nassert np.allclose(grad_z, grad_z_num, atol=1e-5), &quot;链式法则梯度不匹配&quot;\nassert np.isclose(grad_z.sum(), 0.0), &quot;梯度应在切空间内&quot;\nprint(&quot;grad_z =&quot;, grad_z, &quot; grad_z_num =&quot;, grad_z_num, &quot; sum =&quot;, grad_z.sum())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>resid</code> 与 <code>lambda*g</code> 逐分量一致（有限差分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级），<code>lambda = -2.6667</code>，<code>g0</code> 各分量之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<code>det(g_phi) = 33.3333</code> 与 <code>1/prod(p)</code> 相等；<code>grad_z</code> 与数值梯度一致，且分量和为零。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Fisher 度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_i)$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i=2\\sqrt{p_i}$</span> 等距映到半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 球面的正卦限部分，故其测地线是球面大圆的原像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_i(t)=\\big(\\sqrt{p_i}\\cos\\omega t+v_i\\sin\\omega t/(2\\omega\\sqrt{p_i})\\big)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega=\\frac12\\sqrt{v^\\top Gv}$</span>；约束测地线方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot\\gamma_i-\\dot\\gamma_i^2/(2\\gamma_i)=\\lambda\\gamma_i$</span> 的乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=-\\frac12v^\\top Gv$</span> 沿曲线为常数，而无约束平方仿射解在归一化后不是测地线（命题 4、推论 4）。</li>\n<li>Fisher 度量诱导的体积元在图表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_K=1-\\sum_{i&lt;K}p_i$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dV_G=\\prod_i p_i^{-1/2}\\,dp_1\\cdots dp_{K-1}$</span>，对应 Jeffreys 先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i p_i^{-1/2}$</span>，在单纯形上可积；若换算到超平面欧氏面测度则需乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^{-1/2}$</span>，这一常数因子体现测度选取而非几何本身（命题 5、推论 5）。</li>\n<li>自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=z$</span> 下 Fisher 度量矩阵恰为 softmax 雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G=J$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=J^\\top GJ$</span>，三者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 相联系且共享核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>；链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=J^\\top\\nabla_p L$</span> 与 Fisher 预条件的伪逆恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J^\\top GJ)^+=J^+G^{-1}(J^\\top)^+$</span> 给出自然梯度在两种坐标下的等价表达（命题 6、推论 6、命题 7）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-Fisher-度量与-KL-散度的对偶-从-Hessian-到-Bregman-散度\">Fisher 度量与 KL 散度的对偶：从 Hessian 到 Bregman 散度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-Fisher-度量与-KL-散度的对偶-从-Hessian-到-Bregman-散度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 已把 Fisher 度量刻画为 KL 散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处的 Hessian 限制。本小节把这一局部刻画提升为整体恒等式：KL 散度是负熵在单纯形上的 Bregman 散度，而 Fisher 度量正是负熵的 Hessian。这给出“单纯形上的 Fisher 度量”的一个不依赖坐标的内蕴定义，并与前序节的指数族视角闭合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（KL 作为负熵的 Bregman 散度）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义负熵函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i\\log p_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal{M}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=H(p)-H(q)-\\langle\\nabla H(q),\\,p-q\\rangle,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 欧氏内积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla H(q)=(\\log q_i+1)_{i=1}^K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算右端。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)-H(q)=\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i-\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i$</span>。内积项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla H(q),p-q\\rangle=\\sum_i(\\log q_i+1)(p_i-q_i)=\\sum_i p_i\\log q_i-\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i+\\sum_i(p_i-q_i)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=\\sum_i q_i=1$</span>，末项为零。故右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i-\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i-\\sum_i p_i\\log q_i+\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i=\\sum_i p_i\\log(p_i/q_i)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（Fisher 度量是负熵的 Hessian）</strong> 在命题 8 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上的 Hessian 限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\partial^2 H}{\\partial p_i\\partial p_j}\\right|_{T_p\\mathcal{M}}=\\frac{\\delta_{ij}}{p_i}=G_{ij}(p).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i H=\\log p_i+1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j\\partial_i H=\\delta_{ij}/p_i$</span>，即命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span>。由命题 8，Bregman 散度的 Hessian 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的 Hessian，与命题 3 的 KL 二阶展开一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（内蕴定义）</strong> 推论 8 给出 Fisher 度量的第三种刻画：它是负熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在单纯形上的 Hessian。这一表述不依赖 softmax 参数化，也不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 嵌入，仅用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 与切空间；命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_i)$</span> 是它在坐标下的显式表达。三种刻画——score 协方差（命题 1）、KL 二阶展开（命题 3）、负熵 Hessian（推论 8）——在开单纯形上等价，这构成本节的核心闭合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-度量在标签平滑下的形变\">度量在标签平滑下的形变<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-度量在标签平滑下的形变\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立标签平滑：把 one-hot 目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^\\epsilon=(1-\\epsilon)y+\\epsilon\\mathbf{1}/K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in[0,1)$</span>。本小节说明标签平滑不改变 Fisher 度量的函数形式，只改变其评估点，从而给出一个可检验的形变恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（标签平滑下的度量不变性）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\epsilon=\\mathrm{softmax}(z^\\epsilon)$</span> 为标签平滑后的预测分布。则 Fisher 度量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\epsilon$</span> 处仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p^\\epsilon)=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p^\\epsilon_i)$</span>，且拉回伪度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z^\\epsilon)=J(z^\\epsilon)^\\top G(p^\\epsilon)J(z^\\epsilon)$</span> 的元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\epsilon_i\\delta_{ij}-p^\\epsilon_ip^\\epsilon_j$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\epsilon\\to\\mathbf{1}/K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\to K\\cdot I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\to\\frac{1}{K}(I-\\frac{1}{K}\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^\\top)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一、二断言由命题 1、命题 2 直接应用于点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\epsilon$</span>，无需新计算。第三断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\epsilon_i\\to 1/K$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{ij}\\to\\delta_{ij}/(1/K)=K\\delta_{ij}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ij}\\to(1/K)\\delta_{ij}-(1/K)(1/K)=(1/K)(\\delta_{ij}-1/K)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{K}(I-\\frac{1}{K}\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^\\top)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（均匀点的度量退化）</strong> 在命题 9 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathbf{1}/K$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，非零特征值均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上的限制的特征值均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\frac{1}{K}(I-\\frac{1}{K}\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^\\top)$</span> 是到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 的正交投影乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>，投影秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，故非零特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>（重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=KI$</span> 限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 倍恒等，特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>（重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与温度缩放的对照）</strong> 命题 9 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 1$</span> 极限与温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 的 softmax 极限给出同一均匀分布，但二者路径不同：标签平滑改变目标分布，温度缩放改变预测分布的锐度。二者在 Fisher 度量上的效果都是把评估点推向均匀点，故度量趋于退化形式；这为后续“温度对分布的影响”代码节提供了理论对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-一个可检验的恒等式-Fisher-度量与熵的梯度流\">一个可检验的恒等式：Fisher 度量与熵的梯度流<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-一个可检验的恒等式-Fisher-度量与熵的梯度流\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（熵梯度流的度量表述）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，考虑熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p)=-\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i=-H(p)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上的梯度流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot p=-\\nabla_G S(p)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_G$</span> 为关于 Fisher 度量的梯度（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_G S=G^{-1}\\nabla S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上取）。则沿该流，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot p_i=p_i\\left(\\log p_i-\\sum_{j=1}^K p_j\\log p_j\\right),\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla S=-(\\log p_i+1)_{i=1}^K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}=\\mathrm{diag}(p_i)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_G S=G^{-1}\\nabla S=-(p_i(\\log p_i+1))_{i=1}^K$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_p\\mathcal{M}$</span> 上取投影，减去法向分量：法向为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span>，投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=I-\\frac{1}{K}\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^\\top$</span> 作用后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot p=-P\\nabla_G S$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i(\\log p_i+1)=1+\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i=1-S(p)$</span>，故投影后的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p_i(\\log p_i+1)+\\frac{1}{K}(1-S(p))$</span>。整理并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\dot p_i=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot p_i=p_i(\\log p_i-\\sum_j p_j\\log p_j)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10（均匀点是流的平衡点）</strong> 在命题 10 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathbf{1}/K$</span> 是熵梯度流的唯一平衡点，且流保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 平衡要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot p=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 全相等，结合归一化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathbf{1}/K$</span>。保持归一化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\dot p_i=\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i-\\sum_i p_i\\sum_j p_j\\log p_j=0$</span> 直接验证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与自然梯度的联系）</strong> 命题 10 的流正是自然梯度下降在熵目标上的连续时间极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot p=-\\nabla_G S$</span> 与命题 7 的 Fisher 预条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\nabla_p L=G^{-1}\\nabla_p L$</span> 一致。这给出 Fisher 度量在优化动力学中的直接用途，也为后续“与采样章的接口”中把 Fisher 度量用于 Langevin 预条件埋下接口。</p>\n<p><strong>验证代码</strong> 下述代码数值验证命题 8 的 Bregman 恒等式、命题 9 的均匀极限与命题 10 的熵流平衡点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = z - z.max()\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef neg_entropy(p):\n    return np.sum(p * np.log(p))\n\ndef kl(p, q):\n    return np.sum(p * np.log(p / q))\n\n# 命题 8: KL = Bregman(负熵)\np = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2])\nq = np.array([0.4, 0.4, 0.2])\ngrad_H_q = np.log(q) + 1.0\nbregman = neg_entropy(p) - neg_entropy(q) - grad_H_q @ (p - q)\nassert np.isclose(bregman, kl(p, q)), &quot;Bregman 恒等式不成立&quot;\nprint(&quot;Bregman =&quot;, bregman, &quot; KL =&quot;, kl(p, q))\n\n# 推论 8: Hessian = diag(1/p)\nH_hess = np.diag(1.0 / p)\nG = np.diag(1.0 / p)\nassert np.allclose(H_hess, G), &quot;负熵 Hessian 与 Fisher 度量不匹配&quot;\nprint(&quot;Hessian diag:&quot;, np.diag(H_hess))\n\n# 命题 9: 标签平滑极限\nK = 3\neps = 0.999\np_eps = (1 - eps) * p + eps * np.ones(K) / K\nG_eps = np.diag(1.0 / p_eps)\nM_eps = np.diag(p_eps) - np.outer(p_eps, p_eps)\nassert np.allclose(G_eps, K * np.eye(K), atol=1e-2), &quot;G 均匀极限不匹配&quot;\nexpected_M = (1.0 / K) * (np.eye(K) - np.ones((K, K)) / K)\nassert np.allclose(M_eps, expected_M, atol=1e-2), &quot;M 均匀极限不匹配&quot;\nprint(&quot;G_eps diag:&quot;, np.diag(G_eps), &quot; M_eps rank:&quot;, np.linalg.matrix_rank(M_eps))\n\n# 命题 10: 熵流平衡点\np_uniform = np.ones(K) / K\ndot = p_uniform * (np.log(p_uniform) - np.sum(p_uniform * np.log(p_uniform)))\nassert np.allclose(dot, 0.0), &quot;均匀点应为平衡点&quot;\nprint(&quot;均匀点流速:&quot;, dot)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：Bregman 与 KL 相等；Hessian 对角与 Fisher 度量一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.999$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 对角接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{K}(I-\\frac{1}{K}\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^\\top)$</span> 且秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1=2$</span>；均匀点流速为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-本节小结-补充条目\">本节小结（补充条目）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-本节小结-补充条目\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>KL 散度是负熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span> 在单纯形上的 Bregman 散度，其 Hessian 限制在切空间上等于 Fisher 度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)=\\mathrm{diag}(1/p_i)$</span>，这给出 Fisher 度量的内蕴定义，与 score 协方差、KL 二阶展开两种刻画等价（命题 8、推论 8）。</li>\n<li>标签平滑不改变 Fisher 度量的函数形式，只把评估点推向均匀点；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\to K\\cdot I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\to\\frac{1}{K}(I-\\frac{1}{K}\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^\\top)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，非零特征值均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>（命题 9、推论 9）。</li>\n<li>熵在 Fisher 度量下的梯度流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot p_i=p_i(\\log p_i-\\sum_j p_j\\log p_j)$</span>，均匀点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}/K$</span> 是其唯一平衡点，该流与命题 7 的自然梯度预条件一致，为后续采样章的 Fisher 预条件 Langevin 动力学提供接口（命题 10、推论 10）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-混合-softmax-与层次-softmax\">混合 softmax 与层次 softmax<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-混合-softmax-与层次-softmax\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 为 logits，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为 one-hot 标签对应的索引，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 为 Kronecker 符号。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>混合 softmax（mixture softmax）</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个分量，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个分量的 logits 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span>，混合权重 logits 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{M}$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi=\\mathrm{softmax}(a)\\in\\Delta^{M-1},\\qquad p^{(m)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z^{(m)})\\in\\Delta^{K-1},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{mixsoftmax}(z^{(1)},\\dots,z^{(M)};a)=\\sum_{m=1}^{M}\\pi_m\\,p^{(m)}\\in\\Delta^{K-1}.$$</div>\n记该混合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=\\sum_m \\pi_m p^{(m)}_i$</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>层次 softmax（hierarchical softmax）</strong>：给定一棵以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个叶节点为目标的有限有根树 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span>，内部节点集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{I}$</span>，每个内部节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal{I}$</span> 有一个二分类 logit <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_v\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，其左、右子节点分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{L}(v),\\mathrm{R}(v)$</span>。从根到叶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的唯一路径记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{path}(k)=(v_1,\\dots,v_{d_k})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1=\\mathrm{root}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{d_k}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的父节点。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_k^{\\mathrm{hier}}(s)=\\prod_{v\\in\\mathrm{path}(k)}\\sigma\\!\\left(\\epsilon_{k,v}\\,s_v\\right),\\qquad \\sigma(u)=\\frac{1}{1+e^{-u}},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{k,v}=+1$</span> 若路径在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 处走向右子节点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{k,v}=-1$</span> 若走向左子节点。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（有限性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K,M&lt;\\infty$</span>，树 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 的深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=\\max_k d_k&lt;\\infty$</span>，每个内部节点恰有两个子节点，所有叶节点深度可以不同。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（正则性）</strong>：所有 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}_i,a_m,s_v$</span> 均为实数，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 及其各阶偏导数处处存在且有界；本节涉及的所有求导与求和均为有限维实分析运算，无需交换积分与极限。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（混合可分性）</strong>：混合模型中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge 2$</span>，且存在至少一对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ne m'$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(m)}\\ne p^{(m')}$</span>，以保证混合分布不退化到单一分量。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A4（树的可达性）</strong>：对每个叶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{path}(k)$</span> 非空且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k\\ge 1$</span>；根节点存在。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span>，树退化为单节点，本节结论按空乘积约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_1=1$</span> 平凡成立。</p>\n<p>下面先给出两个参数化的定义性区别，再证明主定理：混合 softmax 的雅可比关于分量 logits 的结构，以及层次 softmax 的归一化恒等式与梯度恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-1-定义与相邻概念的区别\">1. 定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-1-定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>混合 softmax 与层次 softmax 都是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 上的条件分布用<strong>多于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个实参数</strong>重新参数化。区别在于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标准 softmax 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个 logits 参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z+c\\mathbf{1})=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>，有效参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维，且映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto p$</span> 在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 上光滑、满射到单纯形内部。</li>\n<li>混合 softmax 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$MK+M$</span> 个参数（有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(K-1)+(M-1)$</span> 维）参数化，映射一般不满射：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p^{(m)}\\}$</span> 的凸包内。它是<strong>过参数化</strong>的，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z^{(m)}\\}$</span> 的角色不对称：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 只控制分量间的凸组合权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}$</span> 控制分量内部形状。</li>\n<li>层次 softmax 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{I}|$</span> 个标量参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个叶概率，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{I}|=K-1$</span>（满二叉树情形），恰与标准 softmax 的有效维数一致；但参数到分布的映射是<strong>双射到开单纯形</strong>（在满二叉树且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_v$</span> 取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span> 时），这与标准 softmax 的商映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto p$</span> 不同：层次 softmax 没有平移冗余。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一区别的直接后果是：标准 softmax 的雅可比有零空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>，而层次 softmax 的雅可比（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>）在满二叉树情形是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times(K-1)$</span> 的满列秩矩阵，无零空间；混合 softmax 的雅可比则同时具有分量内平移冗余与分量间权重冗余。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-2-主定理-混合-softmax-关于分量-logits-的雅可比\">2. 主定理：混合 softmax 关于分量 logits 的雅可比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-2-主定理-混合-softmax-关于分量-logits-的雅可比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（混合 softmax 的雅可比分解）</strong>：在假设 A1–A3 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathrm{mixsoftmax}(z^{(1)},\\dots,z^{(M)};a)$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\{1,\\dots,M\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial q_i}{\\partial z^{(m)}_j}=\\pi_m\\,p^{(m)}_i\\left(\\delta_{ij}-p^{(m)}_j\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=\\sum_{m'}\\pi_{m'}p^{(m')}_i$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}_j$</span> 求偏导，只有第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 项含该变量，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial q_i}{\\partial z^{(m)}_j}=\\pi_m\\frac{\\partial p^{(m)}_i}{\\partial z^{(m)}_j}.$$</div>\n由前序节已证的 softmax 雅可比公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.2（混合 softmax 的雅可比行和为零）</strong>：在命题 2.1 的条件下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\frac{\\partial q_i}{\\partial z^{(m)}_j}=\\pi_m\\sum_i p^{(m)}_i(\\delta_{ij}-p^{(m)}_j)=\\pi_m\\left(p^{(m)}_j-p^{(m)}_j\\sum_i p^{(m)}_i\\right)=0.$$</div>\n即混合分布关于任一分量 logits 的雅可比矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(m)}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 的每一列和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(m)}\\mathbf{1}=0$</span>，零空间至少包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span>，与标准 softmax 的平移冗余一致。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.3（混合权重的雅可比）</strong>：固定所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 求导，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial q_i}{\\partial a_{m'}}=\\sum_{m}\\frac{\\partial \\pi_m}{\\partial a_{m'}}p^{(m)}_i=\\pi_{m'}\\left(p^{(m')}_i-q_i\\right),$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\pi_m/\\partial a_{m'}=\\pi_m(\\delta_{mm'}-\\pi_{m'})$</span>。此式表明混合权重 logits 的梯度把第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m'$</span> 个分量与混合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的差异回传，是标准的 softmax 梯度在“分量空间”的对应物。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3,M=2$</span>）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(1)}=(0,0,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(2)}=(1,0,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=(0,0)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)}=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(2)}=(e/(e+2),1/(e+2),1/(e+2))$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac13+\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{e}{e+2}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(1)}_1$</span> 求导，按命题 2.1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\cdot\\frac13(1-\\frac13)=\\frac19$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(2)}_1$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{e}{e+2}(1-\\frac{e}{e+2})$</span>。数值上可验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\partial q_i/\\partial z^{(1)}_1=0$</span>，与推论 2.2 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-3-层次-softmax-的归一化恒等式与梯度\">3. 层次 softmax 的归一化恒等式与梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-3-层次-softmax-的归一化恒等式与梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3.1（层次 softmax 的归一化）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A4 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\mathbb{R}^{|\\mathcal{I}|}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^{K}p_k^{\\mathrm{hier}}(s)=1.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对树深 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 作归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 时树只有一个内部节点（根），两个叶，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{L}}=\\sigma(s_{\\mathrm{root}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{R}}=\\sigma(-s_{\\mathrm{root}})=1-\\sigma(s_{\\mathrm{root}})$</span>，和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。设深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le d-1$</span> 的子树结论成立。对深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的树，根的两个子树 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{L}},\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{R}}$</span> 深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le d-1$</span>，其叶概率和分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。根到左子树叶的路径概率含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(s_{\\mathrm{root}})$</span>，到右子树叶含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(-s_{\\mathrm{root}})$</span>，故总叶概率和为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(s_{\\mathrm{root}})\\cdot 1+\\sigma(-s_{\\mathrm{root}})\\cdot 1=\\sigma(s_{\\mathrm{root}})+(1-\\sigma(s_{\\mathrm{root}}))=1.\\qquad\\square$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.2（层次 softmax 关于内部节点 logit 的梯度）</strong>：在命题 3.1 的条件下，固定叶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(s)=-\\log p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_y(s)$</span>。则对每个内部节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial s_v}=-\\epsilon_{y,v}\\,\\sigma\\!\\left(-\\epsilon_{y,v}s_v\\right)\\cdot\\mathbf{1}\\{v\\in\\mathrm{path}(y)\\},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}\\{\\cdot\\}$</span> 为示性函数；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\notin\\mathrm{path}(y)$</span> 时偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_y=\\prod_{v\\in\\mathrm{path}(y)}\\sigma(\\epsilon_{y,v}s_v)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L(s)=-\\sum_{v\\in\\mathrm{path}(y)}\\log\\sigma(\\epsilon_{y,v}s_v).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_v$</span> 求偏导，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathrm{path}(y)$</span> 的项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_v$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{du}\\log\\sigma(u)=\\sigma(-u)$</span> 与链式法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial s_v}=-\\epsilon_{y,v}\\,\\sigma(-\\epsilon_{y,v}s_v),\\qquad v\\in\\mathrm{path}(y),$$</div>\n否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.3（与标准 softmax 梯度的结构对应）</strong>：若树为满二叉树且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2^{d}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{I}|=K-1$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto p^{\\mathrm{hier}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}\\to\\mathrm{int}(\\Delta^{K-1})$</span> 的光滑双射。此时命题 3.2 的梯度公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量，每个分量形如“路径上该节点的二分类交叉熵梯度”，与标准 softmax 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-y$</span> 梯度在信息几何上等价（二者都是指数族自然梯度在相应参数化下的像），但坐标不同：标准 softmax 的梯度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维带约束的，层次 softmax 的梯度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维无约束的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-4-混合与层次的比较-参数化冗余与计算代价\">4. 混合与层次的比较：参数化冗余与计算代价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-4-混合与层次的比较-参数化冗余与计算代价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4.1（混合 softmax 的过参数化核）</strong>：在假设 A1–A3 下，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:(z^{(1)},\\dots,z^{(M)},a)\\mapsto q$</span> 的微分在点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(z^{(1)},\\dots,z^{(M)},a)$</span> 处的核至少包含以下两个方向：(i) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}\\mapsto z^{(m)}+c_m\\mathbf{1}$</span> 不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>；(ii) 若某分量权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}$</span> 的任意扰动不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 由 softmax 平移不变性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(m)}$</span> 不变，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 不变。(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的表达式中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 项系数为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}$</span> 不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 中。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明混合 softmax 的有效参数维数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(K-1)+(M-1)$</span>，比名义参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$MK+M$</span> 少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M+1$</span> 维；当某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m\\to 0$</span> 时，核进一步扩大，优化景观出现平坦方向。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.2（层次 softmax 的计算代价）</strong>：在假设 A1、A4 下，计算单个叶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_k$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k$</span> 次 sigmoid 求值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k$</span> 次乘法；计算全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个叶概率的总代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k d_k$</span> 次 sigmoid，最坏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(Kd)$</span>，平均（平衡树）<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\log K)$</span>。相比之下，标准 softmax 计算全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个概率需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次指数与一次求和，代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>；混合 softmax 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$MK$</span> 次指数，代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(MK)$</span>。</p>\n<p>此命题仅为代价计数，不涉及证明：每次 sigmoid 为常数次浮点运算，路径长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k$</span> 为乘法次数，求和即得。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-5-代码-混合-softmax-雅可比的数值验证\">5. 代码：混合 softmax 雅可比的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-5-代码-混合-softmax-雅可比的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{3}$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2$</span>，用有限差分验证命题 2.1 与推论 2.2，并打印形状与断言结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = z - z.max(axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n    e = np.exp(z)\n    return e / e.sum(axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n\ndef mixsoftmax(zs, a):\n    pi = softmax(a)\n    ps = np.stack([softmax(z) for z in zs], axis=0)  # (M, K)\n    return pi @ ps  # (K,)\n\ndef jacobian_fd(f, x, eps=1e-6):\n    x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float)\n    n = x.size\n    J = np.zeros((f(x).size, n))\n    for i in range(n):\n        xp = x.copy(); xp[i] += eps\n        xm = x.copy(); xm[i] -= eps\n        J[:, i] = (f(xp) - f(xm)) / (2 * eps)\n    return J\n\nK, M = 3, 2\nzs = [np.array([0.3, -0.2, 0.7]), np.array([1.1, 0.0, -0.4])]\na = np.array([0.2, -0.5])\npi = softmax(a)\nps = [softmax(z) for z in zs]\n\n# 解析雅可比关于 z^(1)\nJ1_analytic = np.zeros((K, K))\nfor i in range(K):\n    for j in range(K):\n        J1_analytic[i, j] = pi[0] * ps[0][i] * ((1.0 if i == j else 0.0) - ps[0][j])\n\n# 有限差分：把 z^(1) 作为自变量，固定 z^(2), a\ndef f1(z1):\n    return mixsoftmax([z1, zs[1]], a)\n\nJ1_fd = jacobian_fd(f1, zs[0])\nprint(&quot;J1 analytic shape:&quot;, J1_analytic.shape)\nprint(&quot;J1 fd shape:&quot;, J1_fd.shape)\nprint(&quot;max |J1_analytic - J1_fd| =&quot;, np.abs(J1_analytic - J1_fd).max())\nassert J1_analytic.shape == (K, K)\nassert np.allclose(J1_analytic, J1_fd, atol=1e-5)\nassert np.allclose(J1_analytic.sum(axis=0), 0.0, atol=1e-12)  # 推论 2.2\n\n# 关于混合权重 a 的雅可比（推论 2.3）\ndef fa(a_vec):\n    return mixsoftmax(zs, a_vec)\n\nJa_analytic = np.zeros((K, M))\nfor i in range(K):\n    for m in range(M):\n        Ja_analytic[i, m] = pi[m] * (ps[m][i] - mixsoftmax(zs, a)[i])\nJa_fd = jacobian_fd(fa, a)\nprint(&quot;Ja analytic shape:&quot;, Ja_analytic.shape)\nprint(&quot;max |Ja_analytic - Ja_fd| =&quot;, np.abs(Ja_analytic - Ja_fd).max())\nassert np.allclose(Ja_analytic, Ja_fd, atol=1e-5)\nprint(&quot;expected: all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>J1 analytic shape: (3, 3)</code>，<code>J1 fd shape: (3, 3)</code>，有限差分与解析雅可比最大误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span> 量级，列和为零的断言通过；<code>Ja analytic shape: (3, 2)</code> 同样通过。这验证了命题 2.1、推论 2.2 与推论 2.3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-6-层次-softmax-的归一化数值验证\">6. 层次 softmax 的归一化数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-6-层次-softmax-的归一化数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef sigmoid(u):\n    return 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-u))\n\n# 满二叉树，K=4，内部节点 0(root),1(left),2(right)\n# 叶 0,1 在节点 1 下；叶 2,3 在节点 2 下\n# 路径编码：epsilon 为 +1 走右，-1 走左\npaths = {\n    0: [(0, -1), (1, -1)],\n    1: [(0, -1), (1, +1)],\n    2: [(0, +1), (2, -1)],\n    3: [(0, +1), (2, +1)],\n}\ns = np.array([0.4, -0.3, 0.8])  # 节点 0,1,2 的 logits\n\ndef hier_probs(s):\n    p = np.zeros(4)\n    for k, path in paths.items():\n        prod = 1.0\n        for v, eps in path:\n            prod *= sigmoid(eps * s[v])\n        p[k] = prod\n    return p\n\np = hier_probs(s)\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape)\nprint(&quot;sum p =&quot;, p.sum())\nassert p.shape == (4,)\nassert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12  # 命题 3.1\n\n# 命题 3.2：对 y=2 的损失梯度\ny = 2\nL = -np.log(p[y])\ngrad = np.zeros(3)\nfor v, eps in paths[y]:\n    grad[v] = -eps * sigmoid(-eps * s[v])\nprint(&quot;grad shape:&quot;, grad.shape)\nprint(&quot;grad =&quot;, grad)\n\n# 有限差分验证\neps_fd = 1e-6\ngrad_fd = np.zeros(3)\nfor v in range(3):\n    sp = s.copy(); sp[v] += eps_fd\n    sm = s.copy(); sm[v] -= eps_fd\n    grad_fd[v] = (-np.log(hier_probs(sp)[y]) + np.log(hier_probs(sm)[y])) / (2 * eps_fd)\nprint(&quot;max |grad - grad_fd| =&quot;, np.abs(grad - grad_fd).max())\nassert np.allclose(grad, grad_fd, atol=1e-5)\nprint(&quot;expected: all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>p shape: (4,)</code>，<code>sum p = 1.0</code>（浮点意义下），梯度有限差分与解析值一致，断言通过。这验证了命题 3.1 与命题 3.2。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>混合 softmax 是标准 softmax 在分量空间上的凸组合，其关于分量 logits 的雅可比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m p^{(m)}_i(\\delta_{ij}-p^{(m)}_j)$</span>，列和为零，保留了标准 softmax 的平移冗余；关于混合权重的雅可比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{m'}(p^{(m')}_i-q_i)$</span>，是分量空间上的标准 softmax 梯度。</li>\n<li>层次 softmax 用树路径上的二分类 sigmoid 乘积参数化叶分布，归一化恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_k=1$</span> 由对树深的归纳证明；其关于内部节点 logit 的梯度为路径上二分类交叉熵梯度之和，在满二叉树情形与标准 softmax 的有效维数一致但无平移冗余。</li>\n<li>两种参数化都是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的过参数化或重参数化：混合 softmax 的核包含分量内平移与零权重分量的任意扰动，层次 softmax 在满二叉树下为双射；二者的计算代价分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(MK)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\log K)$</span>（平衡树），与标准 softmax 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 形成对比，这一代价差异是与后续采样章接口时需要权衡的核心量。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-7-混合-softmax-与层次-softmax-的交叉熵梯度对比\">7. 混合 softmax 与层次 softmax 的交叉熵梯度对比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-7-混合-softmax-与层次-softmax-的交叉熵梯度对比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节给出了两种参数化各自的雅可比与梯度结构，但尚未回答一个对训练动力学至关重要的问题：在相同的目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>（one-hot）下，两种参数化的交叉熵梯度在<strong>几何</strong>上如何对应？本节给出精确的对照命题，并说明它为何影响优化景观。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（混合 softmax 的交叉熵梯度）</strong>：在假设 A1–A3 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{mix}}(z^{(1)},\\dots,z^{(M)})=-\\log q_y$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathrm{mixsoftmax}(z^{(1)},\\dots,z^{(M)};a)$</span>。则对每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 与每个坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_{\\mathrm{mix}}}{\\partial z^{(m)}_j}=\\frac{\\pi_m\\,p^{(m)}_j}{q_y}\\left(p^{(m)}_y\\,\\mathbf{1}\\{j=y\\}-p^{(m)}_j\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\mathbf{1}\\{q_y&gt;0\\}}.$$</div>\n更简洁地写成向量形式：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 为 one-hot，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{z^{(m)}}L_{\\mathrm{mix}}=\\frac{\\pi_m}{q_y}\\left(p^{(m)}_y e_y-p^{(m)}_y p^{(m)}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi_m\\,p^{(m)}_y}{q_y}\\left(e_y-p^{(m)}\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_y=\\sum_{m'}\\pi_{m'}p^{(m')}_y$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}_j$</span> 求偏导，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial q_y}{\\partial z^{(m)}_j}=\\pi_m\\,p^{(m)}_y\\left(\\delta_{yj}-p^{(m)}_j\\right),$$</div>\n其中用到命题 2.1 的雅可比（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=y$</span>）。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{mix}}=-\\log q_y$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_{\\mathrm{mix}}}{\\partial z^{(m)}_j}=-\\frac{1}{q_y}\\cdot\\pi_m\\,p^{(m)}_y\\left(\\delta_{yj}-p^{(m)}_j\\right)=\\frac{\\pi_m\\,p^{(m)}_y}{q_y}\\left(p^{(m)}_j-\\delta_{yj}\\right).$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{yj}$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 分量，即得向量形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\pi_m p^{(m)}_y}{q_y}(p^{(m)}-e_y)$</span>，与命题中写的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_y-p^{(m)})$</span> 相差一个整体符号，核对如下：上式括号内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(m)}_j-\\delta_{yj}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{z^{(m)}}L_{\\mathrm{mix}}=\\frac{\\pi_m p^{(m)}_y}{q_y}(p^{(m)}-e_y)$</span>。命题陈述中的符号应以此为准。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 7.2（与标准 softmax 梯度的关系）</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_1=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p^{(1)}$</span>，命题 7.1 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{z^{(1)}}L=p^{(1)}-e_y$</span>，正是本章 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=p-y$</span>。因此混合 softmax 的梯度是标准 softmax 梯度按<strong>分量后验权重</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m p^{(m)}_y/q_y$</span> 加权的结果：该权重恰是“在观测到标签 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的条件下，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个分量应承担的责任”（responsibility），这与混合模型 EM 算法中的后验责任完全同构。这一同构不是类比，而是同一个贝叶斯分解在两种语境下的同一公式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.3（混合梯度的责任归一）</strong>：在命题 7.1 的条件下，定义责任 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_m=\\pi_m p^{(m)}_y/q_y$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{m=1}^{M}r_m=1$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{z^{(m)}}L_{\\mathrm{mix}}=r_m\\left(p^{(m)}-e_y\\right).$$</div>\n即每个分量的梯度是标准 softmax 梯度乘以该分量的责任。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_m\\to 0$</span> 时该分量梯度消失，这与命题 4.1(ii) 的核扩大现象一致：零责任分量在优化中不再被更新。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.4（层次 softmax 梯度的行表示）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A4 下，设树为满二叉树，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2^{d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{I}|=K-1$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{hier}}$</span> 为命题 3.1 的叶分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{hier}}=-\\log p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B(s)$</span> 为叶概率对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的 Jacobian，即第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 行、第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_k/\\partial s_v$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times(K-1)$</span> 矩阵。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_s L_{\\mathrm{hier}}=-\\frac{1}{p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_y}\\,B(s)_{y,\\cdot}^{\\top},$$</div>\n即梯度是 Jacobian 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 行的负转置除以叶概率。一般地，它<strong>不能</strong>写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(s)^{\\top}(p^{\\mathrm{hier}}-e_y)$</span>：后者是“标准 softmax 梯度经 Jacobian 转置的像”，而层次 softmax 的梯度是路径局部的行向量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_s L_{\\mathrm{hier}}=-\\frac{1}{p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_y}\\nabla_s p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_y=-\\frac{1}{p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_y}B(s)_{y,\\cdot}^{\\top}.$$</div>\n与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(s)^{\\top}(p^{\\mathrm{hier}}-e_y)$</span> 比较：其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k B_{k,v}(p^{\\mathrm{hier}}_k-\\delta_{ky})$</span>，需要整列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{\\cdot,v}$</span> 的加权和；而行表示的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 分量只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{y,v}$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的单节点树为例，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(\\sigma(s),1-\\sigma(s))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=(\\sigma'(s),-\\sigma'(s))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y=\\sigma(s)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_s L_{\\mathrm{hier}}=-\\frac{\\sigma'(s)}{\\sigma(s)},\\qquad\nB^{\\top}(p-e_y)=\\sigma'(s)(\\sigma(s)-1)-\\sigma'(s)(1-\\sigma(s))=-2\\sigma'(s)(1-\\sigma(s)),$$</div>\n两者一般不等（仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(s)=1/2$</span> 等特殊点重合）。故行表示精确成立，坐标变换表示不成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span>\n<strong>注 7.5（为何这一否定性结论重要）</strong>：命题 7.4 的失败不是技术性的，而是结构性的。标准 softmax 的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-y$</span> 是<strong>全局</strong>量：每个坐标的梯度同时依赖所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个概率。层次 softmax 的梯度是<strong>路径局部</strong>量：每个内部节点的梯度只依赖该节点处的二分类边缘概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\epsilon s_v)$</span>，与路径外的节点无关。这意味着层次 softmax 的优化在参数空间中具有<strong>块对角</strong>结构（每个内部节点的梯度只由其子树叶的标签决定），而标准 softmax 的优化具有<strong>全耦合</strong>结构。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 很大时，这种块对角结构是层次 softmax 计算优势的来源，但也意味着它的损失景观与标准 softmax 的损失景观在 Fisher 度量下不等距——这一点将在与采样章的接口处再次出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-8-混合-softmax-的凸性与可辨识性\">8. 混合 softmax 的凸性与可辨识性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-8-混合-softmax-的凸性与可辨识性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（混合 softmax 像集的凸性）</strong>：在假设 A1–A3 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z^{(m)}\\}$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\mapsto q=\\sum_m\\pi_m p^{(m)}$</span> 的像集是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p^{(m)}\\}_{m=1}^{M}$</span> 的凸包，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{conv}(p^{(1)},\\dots,p^{(M)})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{M-1}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取遍该凸包。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(m)}$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_m\\pi_m=1$</span> 为系数的凸组合，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\mathrm{conv}$</span>。反之，凸包中任一点按定义可写成这样的凸组合，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(a)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{M}$</span> 上取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{M-1}$</span> 的内部（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 满射到开单纯形），闭包由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to\\pm\\infty$</span> 的极限给出，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 可取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{M-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.2（混合 softmax 不满射）</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;K$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{mixsoftmax}$</span> 的像集是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的真子集（低维凸包），故存在无法被该参数化表示的目标分布。即便 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge K$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p^{(m)}\\}$</span> 的凸包不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，像集仍可能不满射。这与标准 softmax 满射到开单纯形形成对比。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.3（混合 softmax 的可辨识性失效）</strong>：在假设 A1–A3 下，若存在置换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in S_M$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}=z^{(\\sigma(m))}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m=\\pi_{\\sigma(m)}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 成立，则两组参数给出同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。更一般地，混合 softmax 的参数化在分量置换下不可辨识，且当某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_m=0$</span> 时该分量的全部参数不可辨识。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一句由求和的交换性直接得到。第二句由命题 4.1(ii) 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明混合 softmax 的损失景观存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_M$</span> 对称性与平坦方向，这对基于梯度的优化意味着：初始化时若两个分量给出相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(m)}$</span>，则它们在训练中永远保持相同（梯度相同），形成“死分量”。这是混合 softmax 在实践中需要打破对称初始化（例如随机扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(m)}$</span>）的数学原因，而非工程惯例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-9-层次-softmax-的路径边缘概率与树结构选择\">9. 层次 softmax 的路径边缘概率与树结构选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-9-层次-softmax-的路径边缘概率与树结构选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（层次 softmax 的节点边缘概率）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A4 下，对每个内部节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，定义“到达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的概率” <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(v)=\\prod_{v'\\in\\mathrm{path}(v)\\setminus\\{v\\}}\\sigma(\\epsilon_{v,v'}s_{v'})$</span>（空乘积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的左、右子树承担的总概率分别为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P(\\mathrm{L}(v))=P(v)\\,\\sigma(s_v),\\qquad P(\\mathrm{R}(v))=P(v)\\,\\sigma(-s_v),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\mathrm{L}(v))+P(\\mathrm{R}(v))=P(v)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3.1 的归纳结构，子树总概率等于到达该子节点的路径概率乘以子树内归一化概率（子树内归一化和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。到达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{L}(v)$</span> 的路径在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 处取左，贡献因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(s_v)$</span>；到达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{R}(v)$</span> 取右，贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(-s_v)$</span>。相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(v)(\\sigma(s_v)+\\sigma(-s_v))=P(v)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.2（层次 softmax 的树结构影响梯度尺度）</strong>：在命题 9.1 下，若某内部节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(v)$</span> 很小（即该子树整体概率低），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 处 logit 的梯度量级被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(v)$</span> 调制：由命题 3.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial L/\\partial s_v$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\epsilon s_v)$</span>，但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 远离根且路径概率低时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的子树叶在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 中的总质量小，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的参数对整体损失的贡献被路径概率衰减。这意味着树的<strong>形状</strong>（哪些叶靠近根、哪些远离根）直接决定了各内部节点梯度的有效尺度：靠近根的节点梯度大，远离根的节点梯度小。标准 softmax 没有这种层次化的尺度差异，所有坐标的梯度量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i-y_i$</span> 统一控制。</p>\n<p>这一推论给出了层次 softmax 树结构选择的数学准则：高频标签应放在靠近根的位置，使它们的路径短、梯度不被路径概率衰减；低频标签可放在深处。这与信息论中 Huffman 编码按频率构造最优前缀码的思想同源，但此处的最优性准则是梯度尺度而非平均码长。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-10-混合与层次的组合-层次混合-softmax\">10. 混合与层次的组合：层次混合 softmax<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-10-混合与层次的组合-层次混合-softmax\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 10.1（层次混合 softmax）</strong>：在假设 A1、A4 下，给定树 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 与每个内部节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 处的混合权重 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^{(v)}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{M_v}$</span> 及分量 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(v,m)}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{2}$</span>（每个分量只区分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的左、右子节点），定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}(s)=\\sum_{m=1}^{M_v}\\pi^{(v)}_m\\,\\sigma\\!\\left(\\epsilon\\, z^{(v,m)}_{\\mathrm{side}}\\right),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=+1$</span> 对应右子节点、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 对应左子节点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(v)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(a^{(v)})$</span>。叶概率仍按路径乘积定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.2（层次混合 softmax 的归一化）</strong>：在定义 10.1 下，若每个内部节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}(+1)+\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}(-1)=1$</span>，则叶概率和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}(+1)=\\sum_m\\pi_m\\sigma(z^{(v,m)}_{\\mathrm{right}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}(-1)=\\sum_m\\pi_m\\sigma(z^{(v,m)}_{\\mathrm{left}})$</span>。若每个分量满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z_{\\mathrm{right}})+\\sigma(z_{\\mathrm{left}})=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\mathrm{left}}=-z_{\\mathrm{right}}$</span>，这是二分类 sigmoid 的对称性），则求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_m\\pi_m\\cdot 1=1$</span>。再由命题 3.1 的归纳即得叶概率和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：层次混合 softmax 的归一化要求每个内部节点的混合分量在左右两侧<strong>成对对称</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z^{(v,m)}_{\\mathrm{left}}=-z^{(v,m)}_{\\mathrm{right}}$</span>。若放弃这一对称性，归一化失效，必须显式除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}(+1)+\\sigma_{\\mathrm{mix}}^{(v)}(-1)$</span>。这一约束是层次混合 softmax 与“在每个节点独立做混合 softmax”之间的关键区别：后者不自动归一化，需要额外的配分函数，而前者的对称约束把配分函数吸收进了参数化。</p>\n<p><strong>注 10.3（与后续节的接口）</strong>：层次混合 softmax 的对称约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\mathrm{left}}=-z_{\\mathrm{right}}$</span> 把每个内部节点的有效参数从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M_v+M_v$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_v+M_v-1$</span>（每个分量一个标量加混合权重），这与命题 4.1 的核分析一致。当后续采样章需要在层次结构上做祖先采样（ancestral sampling）时，这一约束保证每步的二分类概率之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，从而采样无需拒绝步骤；若约束被破坏，采样必须引入拒绝或重归一化，这会改变采样章中“每步独立采样”的接口假设。因此本节把这一约束显式写入参数化，是为了让采样章的接口保持无拒绝的干净形式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-代码-softmax-雅可比的数值验证\">代码：softmax 雅可比的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-代码-softmax-雅可比的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 为 logits 向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}:p_i&gt;0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为开单纯形；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为 softmax 映射的雅可比矩阵，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。本节引入的数值符号如下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>形状/范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>z</code></td>\n<td>logits 数组</td>\n<td><code>(K,)</code>，<code>float64</code>，元素有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>p</code></td>\n<td><code>softmax(z)</code></td>\n<td><code>(K,)</code>，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\in(0,1)$</span>，和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 1$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>J</code></td>\n<td>雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_i/\\partial z_j$</span></td>\n<td><code>(K,K)</code>，<code>float64</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>eps</code></td>\n<td>数值稳定下界</td>\n<td>标量，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-300}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>h</code></td>\n<td>中心差分步长</td>\n<td>标量，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>m</code></td>\n<td>有限差分矩阵</td>\n<td><code>(K,K)</code>，<code>float64</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（有限性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的所有分量有限，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_j|z_j|&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(z_j)$</span> 不溢出、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 有定义。若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j=+\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 退化到单纯形边界，雅可比公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 仍形式上有意义但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 处出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot\\infty$</span> 型未定式，本节不处理该退化情形。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（数值稳定条件）</strong>：实现中采用减最大值的 log-sum-exp，即令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=\\max_j z_j$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z_j=z_j-z_{\\max}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z_j\\le 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\tilde z_j)\\in(0,1]$</span> 不溢出；分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\exp(\\tilde z_j)\\ge 1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}$</span> 对应项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），故不发生下溢除零。这与第 4 节 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}$</span> 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-数值契约-输入输出与误差来源\">数值契约：输入输出与误差来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-数值契约-输入输出与误差来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>输入</strong>：<code>z</code> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的一维 <code>float64</code> 数组，元素有限。<strong>输出</strong>：<code>p</code> 为同形状数组，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>（在浮点意义下误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le K\\cdot\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx K\\cdot 2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span>）；<code>J</code> 为 <code>(K,K)</code> 数组，元素由公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$$</div>\n<p>给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}$</span> 为 Kronecker 符号。</p>\n<p>数值误差有三个来源。（i）<strong>舍入误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 与除法的相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span>，经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次累加后归一化误差上界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\,\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。（ii）<strong>中心差分截断误差</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(z)=p_i(z)$</span> 用步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的中心差分，截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{6}f'''(\\xi)$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>；舍入误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}}{h}\\cdot|f|$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-6}$</span> 时两项分别约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>，故差分与解析雅可比的最大偏差应在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 量级，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 有充分余量。（iii）<strong>求和误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项求和的浮点误差上界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\,\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max_j\\exp(\\tilde z_j)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 5$</span> 时可忽略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-13-1-雅可比公式的数值可实现性\">命题 13.1（雅可比公式的数值可实现性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-13-1-雅可比公式的数值可实现性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 由减最大值实现计算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 计算。则对任意有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的每一行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j J_{ij}=0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（在浮点意义下误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le K\\,\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>）；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 与中心差分矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ij}=\\frac{p_i(z+h e_j)-p_i(z-h e_j)}{2h}$</span> 的最大元素偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2+\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：行和为零是恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)=p_i(1-\\sum_j p_j)=p_i(1-1)=0$</span>，用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j=1$</span>。浮点实现中该恒等式只在舍入误差内成立，误差界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次减法的舍入累积给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\,\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max_j|J_{ij}|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|J_{ij}|\\le p_i\\le 1$</span>，故界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\,\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。</p>\n<p>差分偏差：对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i(z)=p_i(z)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的光滑函数（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 光滑），其一阶偏导连续。中心差分公式的截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{6}\\partial_j^3 f_i(\\xi)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 位于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j-h$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j+h$</span> 之间；三阶偏导在紧集上有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 固定），故截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>。舍入误差来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i(z\\pm h e_j)$</span> 的计算误差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2h$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot|f_i|/h\\le\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h$</span>。两项相加即得偏差界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-6}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 5$</span>，差分与解析雅可比的最大偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 量级，故断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 可由误差阶推出，而非凭直觉放缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-13-2-交叉熵组合梯度的数值验证\">命题 13.2（交叉熵组合梯度的数值验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-13-2-交叉熵组合梯度的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为 one-hot 标签下标；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z)=-\\log p_y(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 个标准基向量。用中心差分验证时，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 个分量的差分值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{L(z+h e_j)-L(z-h e_j)}{2h}$</span> 与解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2+\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则与命题 13.1 的雅可比公式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z_j}=-\\frac{1}{p_y}\\frac{\\partial p_y}{\\partial z_j}=-\\frac{1}{p_y}p_y(\\delta_{yj}-p_j)=p_j-\\delta_{yj},$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=p-e_y$</span>，与第 7 节 canonical claim 一致。差分偏差的阶由与命题 13.1 相同的截断与舍入分析给出，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的三阶偏导在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y&gt;0$</span>（由 A1 保证）时有界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在单个块内自包含，仅使用 <code>numpy</code>，维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，全部断言值由上述公式手算得出：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(1,2,3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span> 的解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e^{-2},e^{-1},1)/(e^{-2}+e^{-1}+1)$</span>，数值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.09003057,0.24472847,0.66524096)$</span>；雅可比对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ii}=p_i(1-p_i)$</span>，非对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=-p_ip_j$</span>；行和为零；交叉熵梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom itertools import product\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    # 减最大值：A2 数值稳定条件，exp 输入 &lt;= 0，分母 &gt;= 1\n    zmax = np.max(z)\n    e = np.exp(z - zmax)\n    return e / np.sum(e)\n\ndef jacobian(z):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    K = p.shape[0]\n    # J_ij = p_i (delta_ij - p_j)，显式构造避免隐式广播歧义\n    J = np.zeros((K, K), dtype=np.float64)\n    for i in range(K):\n        for j in range(K):\n            J[i, j] = p[i] * ((1.0 if i == j else 0.0) - p[j])\n    return J\n\ndef cross_entropy(z, y):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    return -np.log(p[y])\n\nK = 3\nz = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0], dtype=np.float64)\nassert z.shape == (K,), &quot;logits 形状必须为 (K,)&quot;\nassert np.all(np.isfinite(z)), &quot;A1: logits 必须有限&quot;\n\np = softmax(z)\nassert p.shape == (K,), &quot;softmax 输出形状必须为 (K,)&quot;\nassert np.all(p &gt; 0.0), &quot;A2: 减最大值保证 p_i &gt; 0&quot;\nassert abs(np.sum(p) - 1.0) &lt;= K * np.finfo(np.float64).eps, &quot;归一化误差 &lt;= K*eps_mach&quot;\n\n# 手算解析值：p = (e^-2, e^-1, 1)/(e^-2+e^-1+1)\ndenom = np.exp(-2.0) + np.exp(-1.0) + 1.0\np_exact = np.array([np.exp(-2.0) / denom, np.exp(-1.0) / denom, 1.0 / denom])\nassert np.allclose(p, p_exact, atol=1e-15), &quot;softmax 与解析值一致&quot;\n\nJ = jacobian(z)\nassert J.shape == (K, K), &quot;雅可比形状必须为 (K,K)&quot;\n# 对角元 J_ii = p_i(1-p_i)，非对角 J_ij = -p_i p_j\nJ_exact = np.zeros((K, K))\nfor i, j in product(range(K), repeat=2):\n    J_exact[i, j] = p_exact[i] * ((1.0 if i == j else 0.0) - p_exact[j])\nassert np.allclose(J, J_exact, atol=1e-15), &quot;雅可比与解析值一致&quot;\n\n# 行和为零（恒等式，浮点误差 &lt;= K*eps_mach）\nrow_sums = np.sum(J, axis=1)\nassert np.all(np.abs(row_sums) &lt;= K * np.finfo(np.float64).eps), &quot;每行和为 0&quot;\n\n# 中心差分验证雅可比，h=1e-6，偏差界 O(h^2 + eps/h) ~ 1e-9\nh = 1e-6\nM = np.zeros((K, K))\nfor j in range(K):\n    ej = np.zeros(K); ej[j] = 1.0\n    M[:, j] = (softmax(z + h * ej) - softmax(z - h * ej)) / (2.0 * h)\nassert np.max(np.abs(M - J)) &lt;= 1e-7, &quot;差分与解析雅可比偏差 &lt;= 1e-7&quot;\n\n# 交叉熵梯度：nabla_z(-log p_y) = p - e_y\ny = 2\ngrad_analytic = p_exact - np.eye(K)[y]\ngrad_fd = np.zeros(K)\nfor j in range(K):\n    ej = np.zeros(K); ej[j] = 1.0\n    grad_fd[j] = (cross_entropy(z + h * ej, y) - cross_entropy(z - h * ej, y)) / (2.0 * h)\nassert np.max(np.abs(grad_fd - grad_analytic)) &lt;= 1e-7, &quot;交叉熵梯度差分与 p-e_y 偏差 &lt;= 1e-7&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape, &quot;p =&quot;, p)\nprint(&quot;J shape:&quot;, J.shape)\nprint(&quot;row_sums =&quot;, row_sums)\nprint(&quot;max |M - J| =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(M - J)))\nprint(&quot;grad_fd =&quot;, grad_fd, &quot; grad_analytic =&quot;, grad_analytic)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>预期输出</strong>（数值误差量级）：<code>p</code> 打印为约 <code>[0.09003057 0.24472847 0.66524096]</code>；<code>row_sums</code> 三个分量绝对值均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 5\\times2.2\\times10^{-16}\\approx 1.1\\times10^{-15}$</span>；<code>max |M - J|</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>；<code>grad_fd</code> 与 <code>grad_analytic</code> 的分量差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>。所有断言在 <code>float64</code> 下通过，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 由误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2+\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)\\approx 10^{-9}$</span> 留两个数量级余量得出。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>数值契约明确：输入 <code>z</code> 为有限 <code>(K,)</code> 数组，输出 <code>p</code> 在开单纯形内、<code>J</code> 为 <code>(K,K)</code> 矩阵；减最大值的 log-sum-exp 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 不溢出、分母不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，这是 A2 稳定条件的实现形式。</li>\n<li>命题 13.1 与 13.2 给出雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 与交叉熵梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 的解析式，并用中心差分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-6}$</span> 下验证，偏差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2+\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)$</span> 与断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 匹配，容差由误差阶推出而非放缩。</li>\n<li>三个断言分别覆盖形状（<code>(K,)</code>、<code>(K,K)</code>）、数值等价（解析值与差分值）与退化边界（行和为零、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>），全部期望值由本节公式手算得出，不依赖随机初始化。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-13-3-雅可比对称性与半负定性\">命题 13.3（雅可比对称性与半负定性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-13-3-雅可比对称性与半负定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为对角元的对角矩阵。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 对称，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=J_{ji}$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 半负定，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\top}Jv\\le 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^{\\top}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)=p_i\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j$</span>，逐元素即得矩阵恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span>。对称性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 对称，<span class=\"math-inline\">$pp^{\\top}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_ip_j=p_jp_i$</span>，故对称。</p>\n<p>半负定性：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\top}Jv=\\sum_i p_iv_i^2-\\Big(\\sum_i p_iv_i\\Big)^2.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=p_iv_i$</span>，则右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i^2/p_i-(\\sum_i w_i)^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>）。由加权 Jensen 不等式（或 Cauchy–Schwarz 于测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sum_i p_iv_i)^2\\le(\\sum_i p_i)(\\sum_i p_iv_i^2)=\\sum_i p_iv_i^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\top}Jv\\le 0$</span>。等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-加权内积下与常向量共线，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的各分量相等（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 处处正），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的核空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}(\\mathbf{1})$</span>，维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>。这与 softmax 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>（维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）的几何事实一致：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向平移 logits 不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，故该方向的导数为零。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的最小特征值应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（浮点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le K\\,\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>），其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个特征值非正。此性质在代码中可用 <code>np.linalg.eigvalsh(J)</code> 验证，最小特征值绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-13-4-温度缩放的雅可比与差分验证\">命题 13.4（温度缩放的雅可比与差分验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-13-4-温度缩放的雅可比与差分验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立；温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为标量；定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/T)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的雅可比为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J^{(T)}_{ij}=\\frac{1}{T}\\,p^{(T)}_i\\big(\\delta_{ij}-p^{(T)}_j\\big).$$</div>\n<p>即温度缩放等价于把原雅可比乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span>，并把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span>。中心差分验证时，若步长仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，则截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2/T^3)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'''$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T^3$</span> 因子），舍入误差仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时需相应调整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 或容差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/T$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(u)$</span>。由链式法则与命题 13.1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p^{(T)}_i}{\\partial z_j}=\\sum_k\\frac{\\partial\\,\\mathrm{softmax}(u)_i}{\\partial u_k}\\frac{\\partial u_k}{\\partial z_j}=\\frac{1}{T}\\,p^{(T)}_i(\\delta_{ij}-p^{(T)}_j),$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial u_k/\\partial z_j=\\delta_{kj}/T$</span>。截断误差阶：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的函数，其三阶偏导含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T^3$</span>（每次对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 求导产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span>），故中心差分截断项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{6}\\partial_j^3 p^{(T)}_i$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2/T^3$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^{+}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 趋于 one-hot（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大分量处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），雅可比元素在非最大分量处趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，在最大分量处对角元趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>、非对角元趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，整体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{(T)}\\to 0$</span>。这与第 10 节“softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”的反例一致：温度趋零即饱和极限，梯度以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 的倒数速率消失，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 的饱和使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i(1-p^{(T)}_i)$</span> 本身趋于零，两者相乘后整体趋零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-13-5-批量形状契约与索引一致性\">命题 13.5（批量形状契约与索引一致性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-13-5-批量形状契约与索引一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2 成立；输入为批量 logits 数组 <code>Z</code>，形状 <code>(B, K)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\ge 1$</span>，每行有限；标签数组 <code>Y</code>，形状 <code>(B,)</code>，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\in\\{0,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：逐行应用 softmax 得到 <code>P</code>，形状 <code>(B, K)</code>，每行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；逐样本雅可比为 <code>Jb</code>，形状 <code>(B, K, K)</code>，满足 <code>Jb[b] = diag(P[b]) - P[b]P[b]^T</code>。批量交叉熵梯度为 <code>G</code>，形状 <code>(B, K)</code>，满足 <code>G[b] = P[b] - e_{Y[b]}</code>。若用 <code>np.take_along_axis</code> 取每行标签概率，索引必须写成 <code>P[np.arange(B), Y]</code>，形状 <code>(B,)</code>，不得用 <code>P[:, Y]</code>（后者形状 <code>(B, B)</code>，是隐式广播陷阱）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：逐行 softmax 是命题 13.1 在每行的独立应用，行间无耦合，故 <code>P</code> 每行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 由命题 13.1 的行和为零的归一化前提保证（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j=1$</span>）。<code>Jb[b]</code> 的表达式由命题 13.3 的矩阵恒等式逐行给出。<code>G[b]</code> 由命题 13.2 逐行给出。索引形状：<code>P[np.arange(B), Y]</code> 是高级索引，<code>np.arange(B)</code> 与 <code>Y</code> 均为 <code>(B,)</code>，配对后取 <code>P[b, Y[b]]</code>，结果为 <code>(B,)</code>；而 <code>P[:, Y]</code> 取 <code>P</code> 的所有行与 <code>Y</code> 的所有列，结果为 <code>(B, B)</code>，与预期 <code>(B,)</code> 不符，是形状契约的违反。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：批量实现中必须显式 <code>assert P.shape == (B, K)</code> 与 <code>assert Jb.shape == (B, K, K)</code>，并在取标签概率前 <code>assert Y.shape == (B,)</code> 且 <code>assert np.all((Y &gt;= 0) &amp; (Y &lt; K))</code>。批量雅可比的行和为零可逐样本验证：<code>np.sum(Jb, axis=2)</code> 形状 <code>(B,)</code>，每元素绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le K\\,\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。批量梯度与逐样本差分的一致性可用 <code>np.max(np.abs(G - G_fd)) &lt;= 1e-7</code> 断言，其中 <code>G_fd[b, j]</code> 由 <code>cross_entropy(Z[b] + h*e_j, Y[b])</code> 的中心差分给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-命题-13-6-数值稳定性的边界情形\">命题 13.6（数值稳定性的边界情形）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-命题-13-6-数值稳定性的边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的分量可相差极大，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(0, 1000, -1000)$</span>，但均有限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：减最大值的 log-sum-exp 在该输入下仍给出有限、归一化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e^{-1000}, e^{-999}, 1)/(e^{-1000}+e^{-999}+1)$</span>，数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\approx(0,0,1)$</span>（前两分量下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或次正规数）。雅可比公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 在该点仍逐元素有定义，但因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,2$</span> 行全零，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 行仅对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_3(1-p_3)\\approx 0$</span>，整体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\approx 0$</span>。若不用减最大值而直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(z)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(1000)$</span> 溢出为 <code>inf</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-1000)$</span> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，归一化得 <code>nan</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：减最大值后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde z=( -1000, -999, 0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\tilde z)=(e^{-1000},e^{-999},1)$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=e^{-1000}+e^{-999}+1\\approx 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\approx(0,0,1)$</span>，无溢出、无 <code>nan</code>。直接计算时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(1000)=\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty/\\infty$</span> 为 <code>nan</code>，故 A2 的减最大值条件是必要的而非装饰性的。雅可比在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 处形式上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot(-1)=0$</span>，无未定式；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot(1-0)=0$</span>，仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 逐元素有定义且全零（除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_3(1-p_3)$</span> 的次正规量级）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：代码中应加入退化情形断言：对 <code>z = np.array([0.0, 1000.0, -1000.0])</code>，<code>p = softmax(z)</code> 应满足 <code>np.all(np.isfinite(p))</code>、<code>abs(np.sum(p)-1) &lt;= 1e-15</code>、<code>p[2] == 1.0</code>（在 <code>float64</code> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1000}$</span> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p[2]$</span> 精确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。雅可比 <code>J = jacobian(z)</code> 应满足 <code>np.all(np.isfinite(J))</code> 且 <code>np.max(np.abs(J)) &lt;= 1e-15</code>。此断言验证 A2 的稳定条件在极端 logits 下仍成立，且雅可比公式在单纯形边界附近连续延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与命题 13.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\to 0$</span> 饱和极限一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-误差量级的定量核对\">误差量级的定量核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-误差量级的定量核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 13.1 与 13.4，中心差分的总误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E(h,T)\\le\\frac{h^2}{6}\\max_{\\xi}\\big|\\partial_j^3 p_i(\\xi)\\big|+\\frac{\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}}{h}\\max|p_i|.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le 1$</span>，三阶偏导的量级可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的元素估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j^3 p_i$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 的乘积，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1$</span>，故截断项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le h^2/6\\approx 1.7\\times10^{-13}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-6}$</span>）；舍入项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2.2\\times10^{-16}/10^{-6}=2.2\\times10^{-10}$</span>。总误差上界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2\\times10^{-10}$</span>，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 留约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$450$</span> 倍余量，足以吸收实现中的常数因子与求和误差。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0.1$</span>，截断项放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^3$</span> 倍至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.7\\times10^{-10}$</span>，舍入项不变，总误差仍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-9}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 仍成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0.01$</span>，截断项放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^6$</span> 倍至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.7\\times10^{-7}$</span>，与容差同量级，此时应把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 缩小到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 使截断项降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.7\\times10^{-9}$</span>，舍入项升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2\\times10^{-9}$</span>，总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-8}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 重新成立。这给出步长选择的定量准则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{eps}_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/3}\\cdot T$</span> 的量级，使截断项与舍入项平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：代码中若验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ne 1$</span> 的雅可比，必须先按上述准则设定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，再断言 <code>np.max(np.abs(M - J)) &lt;= 1e-7</code>；不得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0.01$</span> 沿用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-6}$</span> 并放宽容差，否则断言失败源于步长选择而非公式错误，违反“容差只能由误差阶推出”的纪律。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-代码-温度对分布的影响\">代码：温度对分布的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-代码-温度对分布的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用本章前序各节已定义的符号：对数its向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为词表或类别数），softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^{K}\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形。温度参数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，温度缩放后的分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\sigma(z/T)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的基准分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为 one-hot 标签的索引，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{onehot}(y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{K}$</span> 为其向量表示。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span> 逐分量有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 数值实现中浮点运算满足 IEEE-754 双精度（或 float32）语义；所有涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 的输入先减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_j z_j$</span>，以保证被指数量非正，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 不溢出。</p>\n<p>(A3) 断言中的容差按双精度浮点相对误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 2.2\\times 10^{-16}$</span> 与运算步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 设定，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{rtol}=10^{-12}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{atol}=10^{-14}$</span> 量级；对 float32 相应放宽到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节只做标题承诺的事：用可运行代码量化温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 对分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 的影响，包括熵、最大概率、KL 散度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的单调性，并验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋向均匀分布、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^{+}$</span> 时趋向 one-hot 的极限行为。梯度与雅可比已在第 13 节数值验证，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度缩放的精确定义与极限\">温度缩放的精确定义与极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度缩放的精确定义与极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（温度缩放）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{(T)}_i=\\frac{\\exp(z_i/T)}{\\sum_{j=1}^{K}\\exp(z_j/T)},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div>\n<p>由本章第 1 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 对任意有限输入良定义且值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的相对内部（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 各分量有限时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>）。温度缩放只是把输入替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z/T$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\sigma(z/T)$</span> 仍是合法概率向量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（极限行为）</strong> 在 (A1) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to \\mathbf{1}/K$</span>（均匀分布），收敛速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|z\\|_\\infty/T)$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^{+}$</span> 时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_j z_j$</span> 唯一，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\star=\\arg\\max_j z_j$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to \\mathrm{onehot}(j^\\star)$</span>；若最大值在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\{j:z_j=\\max_k z_k\\}$</span> 上不唯一，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to \\mathbf{1}_M/|M|$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上均匀）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i/T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\infty$</span> 处展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i/T\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(z_i/T)=1+z_i/T+O((z_i/T)^2)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{(T)}_i=\\frac{1+z_i/T+O(T^{-2})}{K+\\sum_j z_j/T+O(T^{-2})}=\\frac{1}{K}\\Bigl(1+\\frac{z_i-\\bar z}{T}\\Bigr)+O(T^{-2}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar z=\\frac{1}{K}\\sum_j z_j$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|p^{(T)}_i-1/K|\\le \\|z\\|_\\infty/T+O(T^{-2})$</span>，一致于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，得 (i)。</p>\n<p>(ii) 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\star$</span> 唯一最大，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=z_{j^\\star}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\min_{j\\ne j^\\star}(m-z_j)&gt;0$</span>（由唯一性及有限性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne j^\\star$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p^{(T)}_j}{p^{(T)}_{j^\\star}}=\\exp\\Bigl(\\frac{z_j-m}{T}\\Bigr)\\le \\exp\\Bigl(-\\frac{\\delta}{T}\\Bigr)\\to 0.$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p^{(T)}_j=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_{j^\\star}\\le 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_{j^\\star}\\to 1$</span>，其余分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>。非唯一情形同理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 内各分量比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 外比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>，故极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上的均匀分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 是插值于“确定性”与“均匀”之间的连续旋钮，且两端极限均由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的序结构决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的绝对尺度无关（只依赖差值）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-熵-最大概率与-KL-随温度的行为\">熵、最大概率与 KL 随温度的行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-熵-最大概率与-KL-随温度的行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（Shannon 熵）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_i\\log p_i$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（熵的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\mapsto H(p^{(T)})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上单调不减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=z/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(q)$</span>。由本章第 6 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial H(p)}{\\partial q_j}=-\\sum_i\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial q_j}\\log p_i$</span>。代入雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial q_j}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial q_j}=-\\sum_i p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)\\log p_i=-p_j\\log p_j+p_j\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i=p_j\\bigl(\\log p_j-\\mathbb{E}_p[\\log p]\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d H}{d T}=\\sum_j\\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial q_j}\\cdot\\frac{d q_j}{dT}=\\sum_j p_j(\\log p_j-\\mathbb{E}_p[\\log p])\\cdot\\Bigl(-\\frac{z_j}{T^2}\\Bigr)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_j=\\log p_j-\\mathbb{E}_p[\\log p]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_j c_j=0$</span>。上式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{T^2}\\sum_j p_j c_j z_j$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=\\exp(z_j/T)/Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_j=z_j/T-\\log Z$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_j=(z_j-\\mathbb{E}_p[z])/T$</span>，从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH}{dT}=-\\frac{1}{T^2}\\sum_j p_j\\frac{z_j-\\mathbb{E}_p[z]}{T}z_j=-\\frac{1}{T^3}\\Bigl(\\mathbb{E}_p[z^2]-(\\mathbb{E}_p[z])^2\\Bigr)=-\\frac{\\mathrm{Var}_p(z)}{T^3}\\le 0.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^{(T)})$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而不减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的证明用到了求导与有限和交换，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限，无需 Dominated Convergence；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_j$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j&gt;0$</span> 时有限（(A1) 保证），无奇点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（最大概率的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\mapsto \\max_i p^{(T)}_i$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上单调不增。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(T)=\\max_i p^{(T)}_i$</span>，取达到最大值的指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star(T)$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_2&gt;T_1$</span>，需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(T_2)\\le M(T_1)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i\\propto \\exp(z_i/T)$</span>，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i/p^{(T)}_j=\\exp((z_i-z_j)/T)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 收缩：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i&gt;z_j$</span>，比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而减小；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i&lt;z_j$</span>，比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而增大。因此分布随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大而在随机序意义下更“平坦”，最大值不可能上升。形式化：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star=i^\\star(T_1)$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T_1)}_{i^\\star}\\ge p^{(T_1)}_i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((z_{i^\\star}-z_i)/T_1)\\ge 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{i^\\star}\\ge z_i$</span>。于是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_2&gt;T_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((z_{i^\\star}-z_i)/T_2)\\ge \\exp((z_{i^\\star}-z_i)/T_1)\\ge 1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T_2)}_{i^\\star}\\ge p^{(T_2)}_i$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(T_2)=p^{(T_2)}_{i^\\star}\\le p^{(T_1)}_{i^\\star}=M(T_1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 表明温度升高使分布更均匀，与命题 2 的熵增一致；两者互为佐证但证明路径独立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（KL 散度对温度的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，固定基准分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\mapsto \\mathrm{KL}(p\\,\\|\\,p^{(T)})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 1$</span> 上单调不减，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 1$</span> 上单调不增，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由本章第 7 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|p^{(T)})=\\sum_i p_i\\log(p_i/p^{(T)}_i)$</span>。因 (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i&gt;0$</span>，KL 有限（不触发本节禁止事项 6 中“支撑不相交”的无穷情形）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dT}\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|p^{(T)})=-\\sum_i p_i\\frac{d}{dT}\\log p^{(T)}_i.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{(T)}_i=z_i/T-\\log\\sum_j\\exp(z_j/T)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dT}\\log p^{(T)}_i=-\\frac{z_i}{T^2}-\\frac{\\sum_j\\exp(z_j/T)(-z_j/T^2)}{\\sum_j\\exp(z_j/T)}=-\\frac{z_i-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]}{T^2}.$$</div>\n<p>代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dT}\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac{1}{T^2}\\sum_i p_i(z_i-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z])=\\frac{1}{T^2}(\\mathbb{E}_p[z]-\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z])$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 更均匀（命题 3），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同向（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\propto e^{z_i}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_p[z]\\ge\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[z]$</span>，导数非负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 1$</span> 时反向。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=p$</span>，KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的求导与有限和交换同样因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限而平凡成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{(T)}_i$</span> 在 (A1) 下处处可微。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-数值稳定性-log-sum-exp-与温度\">数值稳定性：log-sum-exp 与温度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-数值稳定性-log-sum-exp-与温度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>温度缩放实现中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i/T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 很小时绝对值可极大（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^{-3}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=10$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i/T=10^4$</span>），直接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 溢出。按本章第 4 节的稳定公式，对任意输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\sum_j e^{u_j}=u_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_j e^{u_j-u_{\\max}},\\qquad u_{\\max}=\\max_j u_j.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/T$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}_i=\\exp(u_i-u_{\\max})/\\sum_j\\exp(u_j-u_{\\max})$</span>。被指数量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j-u_{\\max}\\le 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 不溢出（下溢到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 是可接受的，因为对应概率本就极小）。分母至少含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=\\arg\\max$</span> 的项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(0)=1$</span>，故分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 1$</span>，不会出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span>。这就是代码中必须减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max$</span> 的原因；不减去时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 小到使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i/T&gt;709$</span>（双精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 上溢阈值）即产生 <code>inf</code>，进而 <code>inf/inf=nan</code>。</p>\n<p>数值误差来源：(a) 减法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j-u_{\\max}$</span> 的舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|u\\|_\\infty$</span>；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 与求和的舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>；(c) 归一化除法的舍入。总相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 10^4$</span> 双精度约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，与本节 (A3) 的容差匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅依赖 numpy。三个断言分别覆盖：形状契约、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 与基准 softmax 的数值等价、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 的极限行为（含非唯一最大值的退化情形）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax_with_temperature(z, T):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;\n    输入: z shape (K,), dtype float64, 各分量有限; T &gt; 0 标量.\n    输出: p shape (K,), dtype float64, p_i &gt; 0, sum(p) == 1 (至浮点误差).\n    数值稳定: 先减 max 再 exp.\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;\n    assert z.ndim == 1 and z.size &gt;= 2\n    assert np.all(np.isfinite(z))\n    assert T &gt; 0\n    u = z / T\n    u = u - np.max(u)              # log-sum-exp 稳定化\n    e = np.exp(u)                  # 被指数量 &lt;= 0, 不溢出\n    p = e / np.sum(e)              # 分母 &gt;= 1, 无 0/0\n    return p\n\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=np.float64)\n    # p_i &gt; 0 由构造保证; 仍做 mask 以防外部传入含 0 的向量\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    return -np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask]))\n\ndef kl_divergence(p, q):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;KL(p||q), 要求 q 在 p 的正质量处全为正, 否则返回 inf.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=np.float64)\n    q = np.asarray(q, dtype=np.float64)\n    if np.any((p &gt; 0) &amp; (q &lt;= 0)):\n        return np.inf\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    return np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask] / q[mask]))\n\n# ---------- 断言 1: 形状与归一化契约 ----------\nz = np.array([2.0, 0.5, -1.0, 0.0])\nfor T in [0.1, 1.0, 10.0]:\n    p = softmax_with_temperature(z, T)\n    assert p.shape == z.shape, &quot;形状断言失败&quot;\n    assert np.all(p &gt; 0), &quot;正性断言失败&quot;\n    assert abs(np.sum(p) - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;归一化断言失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;断言1通过: 形状&quot;, p.shape, &quot;归一化和&quot;, np.sum(p))\n\n# ---------- 断言 2: T=1 与基准 softmax 数值等价 ----------\np1 = softmax_with_temperature(z, 1.0)\ne = np.exp(z - np.max(z))\np_ref = e / np.sum(e)\nassert np.allclose(p1, p_ref, rtol=1e-12, atol=1e-14), &quot;T=1 等价断言失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;断言2通过: T=1 与基准 softmax 最大偏差&quot;, np.max(np.abs(p1 - p_ref)))\n\n# ---------- 断言 3: 极限行为 ----------\n# T -&gt; 无穷: 趋向均匀\np_inf = softmax_with_temperature(z, 1e8)\nassert np.allclose(p_inf, np.ones_like(z) / z.size, atol=1e-6), &quot;T-&gt;inf 均匀断言失败&quot;\n# T -&gt; 0+: 唯一最大值 2.0 在索引 0, 趋向 one-hot\np_zero = softmax_with_temperature(z, 1e-8)\nassert p_zero[0] &gt; 1 - 1e-6 and np.sum(p_zero[1:]) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;T-&gt;0 one-hot 断言失败&quot;\n# 非唯一最大值退化: z2 的最大值在索引 0 和 2 上并列\nz2 = np.array([1.0, -1.0, 1.0, 0.0])\np_deg = softmax_with_temperature(z2, 1e-8)\nexpected = np.array([0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\nassert np.allclose(p_deg, expected, atol=1e-6), &quot;非唯一最大值退化断言失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;断言3通过: T-&gt;inf 分布&quot;, np.round(p_inf, 6))\nprint(&quot;           T-&gt;0  分布&quot;, np.round(p_zero, 6))\nprint(&quot;           退化  分布&quot;, np.round(p_deg, 6))\n\n# ---------- 熵、最大概率、KL 随 T 的单调性数值核对 ----------\nTs = np.array([0.05, 0.2, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 5.0, 20.0])\nH = np.array([entropy(softmax_with_temperature(z, T)) for T in Ts])\nM = np.array([np.max(softmax_with_temperature(z, T)) for T in Ts])\nK = np.array([kl_divergence(p1, softmax_with_temperature(z, T)) for T in Ts])\nassert np.all(np.diff(H) &gt;= -1e-12), &quot;熵单调不减断言失败&quot;\nassert np.all(np.diff(M) &lt;= 1e-12), &quot;最大概率单调不增断言失败&quot;\n# KL 在 T&gt;=1 单调不减, T&lt;=1 单调不增\nidx1 = np.where(Ts &gt;= 1.0)[0]\nidx0 = np.where(Ts &lt;= 1.0)[0]\nassert np.all(np.diff(K[idx1]) &gt;= -1e-12), &quot;KL T&gt;=1 单调断言失败&quot;\nassert np.all(np.diff(K[idx0]) &lt;= 1e-12), &quot;KL T&lt;=1 单调断言失败&quot;\nassert abs(K[np.where(Ts == 1.0)[0][0]]) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;KL(T=1)=0 断言失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;单调性核对通过: H =&quot;, np.round(H, 6))\nprint(&quot;                M =&quot;, np.round(M, 6))\nprint(&quot;                KL=&quot;, np.round(K, 6))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随浮点实现略有末位差异，量级如下）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>断言 1：形状 <code>(4,)</code>，归一化和 <code>1.0</code>；</li>\n<li>断言 2：最大偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span>；</li>\n<li>断言 3：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^8$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span> 的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-6}$</span>（由命题 1(i) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|z\\|_\\infty/T)=O(2/10^8)$</span> 界，实际更小）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^{-8}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0&gt;1-10^{-6}$</span>；退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\approx(0.5,0,0.5,0)$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-6}$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\delta/T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^{-8}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-2\\times10^8)$</span> 已下溢到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故实际为精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.5,0,0.5,0)$</span>）；</li>\n<li>单调性核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 从约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0.05$</span>，近 one-hot）升到约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.386$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=20$</span>，近均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 4\\approx 1.386$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 从约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.999$</span> 降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.25$</span>；KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，向两侧增大。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>误差量级说明：所有断言的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 对应命题 1 的解析界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|z\\|_\\infty/T)$</span> 与下溢后的精确退化，而非凭直觉设定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 等价断言的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 对应 (A3) 的双精度舍入量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度与采样的接口预告\">温度与采样的接口预告<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度与采样的接口预告\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只量化了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 的分布形状。第 15 节将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 作为采样章的输入分布，讨论从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 采样时温度对样本多样性与期望奖励的影响；本节不展开采样算法，也不涉及反向 SDE 或概率流 ODE 的速度场——那些属于后续章节的对象，与本节的正向 softmax 参数化无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度对交叉熵与梯度的影响\">温度对交叉熵与梯度的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度对交叉熵与梯度的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 7 节已给出组合梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(z)_y)=p-\\mathrm{onehot}(y)$</span>。温度缩放后，交叉熵损失变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T(z)=-\\log p^{(T)}_y$</span>，其梯度需重新推导，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 进入 softmax 前被除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（温度缩放的交叉熵梯度）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\sigma(u)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z L_T(z)=\\frac{1}{T}\\bigl(p^{(T)}-\\mathrm{onehot}(y)\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_T=J_u^{\\top}\\nabla_u L_T$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_u=\\partial u/\\partial z=\\frac{1}{T}I_K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 单位阵）。由第 7 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u(-\\log\\sigma(u)_y)=p^{(T)}-\\mathrm{onehot}(y)$</span>。代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L_T=\\frac{1}{T}I_K\\,(p^{(T)}-\\mathrm{onehot}(y))$</span>，即所证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明温度以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 因子整体缩放梯度，且梯度方向由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 与标签的差决定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to\\mathbf{1}/K$</span>，梯度趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbf{1}/K-\\mathrm{onehot}(y))/T\\to 0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=j^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to\\mathrm{onehot}(y)$</span>，梯度趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>——这与第 10 节“softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”的反例一致，温度只是把饱和点从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的尺度搬到了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z/T$</span> 的尺度。证明中链式法则的每一步均为有限维线性映射的复合，无需交换积分与极限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（Hessian 与温度）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的 Hessian 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z^2 L_T(z)=\\frac{1}{T^2}\\bigl(\\mathrm{diag}(p^{(T)})-p^{(T)}(p^{(T)})^{\\top}\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对命题 5 的梯度再求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\bigl(\\frac{1}{T}(p^{(T)}-\\mathrm{onehot}(y))\\bigr)=\\frac{1}{T}\\nabla_z p^{(T)}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\sigma(z/T)$</span>，由第 2 节雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial p_i}{\\partial u_j}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial u_j/\\partial z_k=\\delta_{jk}/T$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial p^{(T)}_i}{\\partial z_k}=\\frac{1}{T}p^{(T)}_i(\\delta_{ik}-p^{(T)}_k)$</span>，写成矩阵即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{T}(\\mathrm{diag}(p^{(T)})-p^{(T)}(p^{(T)})^{\\top})$</span>。再乘外层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 得所证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的 Hessian 是单纯形上 Fisher 度量（第 11 节）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T^2$</span> 倍缩放：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}$</span> 正是 softmax 参数化下协方差矩阵，半正定且秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>（零空间由全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 向量张成，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i(\\delta_{ik}-p_k)=p_k-p_k=0$</span>）。温度增大使 Hessian 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T^2$</span> 衰减，对应损失面更平坦；温度减小使 Hessian 放大，对应更尖锐的极小值。这与命题 2–4 的分布形状变化在二阶信息上自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度与标签平滑的复合\">温度与标签平滑的复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度与标签平滑的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节定义了标签平滑：把 one-hot 标签 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(\\epsilon)}=(1-\\epsilon)\\,\\mathrm{onehot}(y)+\\epsilon\\,\\mathbf{1}/K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in[0,1)$</span>。温度缩放与标签平滑是两种独立的“软化”手段，本节量化它们的复合效果。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（复合损失的梯度）</strong> 在 (A1) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in[0,1)$</span> 下，复合损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{T,\\epsilon}(z)=-\\sum_i y^{(\\epsilon)}_i\\log p^{(T)}_i$</span> 的梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z L_{T,\\epsilon}(z)=\\frac{1}{T}\\bigl(p^{(T)}-y^{(\\epsilon)}\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 8 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i y^{(\\epsilon)}_i\\log\\sigma(u)_i$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(u)-y^{(\\epsilon)}=p^{(T)}-y^{(\\epsilon)}$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的 softmax 交叉熵梯度公式逐分量线性组合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(\\epsilon)}$</span> 各分量和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，公式仍成立）。再经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_u=\\frac{1}{T}I_K$</span> 链式得所证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 表明温度与标签平滑在梯度层面可分离：温度只贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 因子，标签平滑只改变目标向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(\\epsilon)}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=j^\\star$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}\\to\\mathrm{onehot}(j^\\star)$</span>，梯度趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{T}(\\mathrm{onehot}(j^\\star)-y^{(\\epsilon)})$</span>，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\star$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\epsilon(K-1)}{KT}$</span>、其余分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\epsilon}{KT}$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon/T)$</span>——温度极小且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 时梯度反而发散，这是标签平滑阻止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 完全饱和的机制：目标分布本身不在单纯形顶点，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}$</span> 无法与之重合。该结论的推导只用有限和与链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&lt;1$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(\\epsilon)}$</span> 各分量严格为正，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{(T)}_i$</span> 的系数非零但不改变可微性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度对分布外得分的影响\">温度对分布外得分的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度对分布外得分的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节用最大 softmax 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)=\\max_i\\sigma(z)_i$</span> 作为分布外检测得分。温度缩放后得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T(z)=\\max_i p^{(T)}_i$</span>。由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调不增，故提高温度会系统性压低所有样本的得分，改变检测阈值。更关键的是，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的尺度不变性被温度破坏：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(cz)=M(z)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(cz)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的序与差值比例），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T(cz)=M_{T/c}(z)\\ne M_T(z)$</span>（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1$</span>）。因此若在训练时固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，推理时改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 会使得分分布整体平移，阈值需重新校准。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（得分对温度的解析依赖）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\star=\\arg\\max_i z_i$</span> 唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\min_{i\\ne j^\\star}(z_{j^\\star}-z_i)&gt;0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_T(z)=\\frac{1}{1+\\sum_{i\\ne j^\\star}\\exp\\bigl(-(z_{j^\\star}-z_i)/T\\bigr)}\\ge\\frac{1}{1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta/T}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分子分母同除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(z_{j^\\star}/T)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T=p^{(T)}_{j^\\star}=1/\\bigl(1+\\sum_{i\\ne j^\\star}\\exp((z_i-z_{j^\\star})/T)\\bigr)$</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j^\\star$</span> 的指数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\exp(-\\delta/T)$</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 项，故分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta/T}$</span>，取倒数得下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T$</span> 的下界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的显式衰减：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta/T}\\to 1$</span>，下界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>，与命题 1(i) 的均匀极限一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\delta/T}\\to 0$</span>，下界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与命题 1(ii) 的 one-hot 极限一致。该下界可用于设定分布外检测的温度相关阈值：若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T\\ge\\tau$</span>，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le\\delta/\\log((K-1)/(1/\\tau-1))$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1/K$</span> 时），这给出温度选择的一个显式约束。证明仅用代数放缩，无需求导或极限交换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-温度作为指数族自然参数的缩放\">温度作为指数族自然参数的缩放<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-温度作为指数族自然参数的缩放\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 3 节已建立 softmax 的指数族视角：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\exp(\\theta_i-\\psi(\\theta))$</span>，自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=z$</span>，对数配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(\\theta)=\\log\\sum_j e^{\\theta_j}$</span>。温度缩放对应自然参数替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to\\theta/T$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_T(\\theta)=\\psi(\\theta/T)$</span>。指数族的均值参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\psi_T=\\mathbb{E}_{p^{(T)}}[\\,\\cdot\\,]$</span>，协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2_\\theta\\psi_T=\\frac{1}{T^2}(\\mathrm{diag}(p^{(T)})-p^{(T)}(p^{(T)})^{\\top})$</span>，与命题 6 的 Hessian 一致（交叉熵损失的 Hessian 即对数配分函数的 Hessian，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p^{(T)}_y=\\psi_T(\\theta)-\\theta_y/T$</span> 的 Hessian 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_T$</span> 的 Hessian）。温度因此是自然参数空间中的各向同性缩放，它保持指数族结构不变，只改变充分统计量的尺度；这一视角把命题 1–8 统一为“在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 空间沿射线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto t\\theta$</span> 移动”的几何图像，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 即该射线的参数倒数。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>温度缩放的精确定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(T)}=\\sigma(z/T)$</span>，命题 1 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时一致收敛到均匀分布（速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|z\\|_\\infty/T)$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 时收敛到最大值集合上的均匀 one-hot 极限，非唯一最大值时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|M|$</span> 等分。</li>\n<li>命题 2–4 分别证明熵随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调不减、最大概率单调不增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|p^{(T)})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 取唯一最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 且向两侧单调增；三者的证明仅用有限和求导，无需 Dominated Convergence，且 (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 处处有限、KL 不触发无穷。</li>\n<li>数值实现必须先减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_j(z_j/T)$</span> 再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span>，否则小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时上溢为 <code>nan</code>；代码的三个断言分别锁定形状契约、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 等价（容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>）与两端极限及退化情形（容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，与命题 1 的解析界匹配），并数值核对了三条单调性。</li>\n<li>温度缩放以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 因子整体缩放交叉熵梯度（命题 5），并以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T^2$</span> 缩放 Hessian（命题 6），后者等于单纯形 Fisher 度量的温度缩放，与第 11 节的度量结构一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 且标签命中最大值时梯度消失，与第 10 节饱和反例同源。</li>\n<li>温度与标签平滑在梯度层面可分离（命题 7）：温度贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span>，标签平滑只改目标向量；二者复合时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0^+$</span> 的梯度量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon/T)$</span>，说明标签平滑通过使目标偏离单纯形顶点来阻止完全饱和。</li>\n<li>分布外得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调不增且破坏尺度不变性（命题 8 给出显式下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1+(K-1)e^{-\\delta/T})$</span>），故推理时改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 须重校准阈值；指数族视角下温度即自然参数的各向同性缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to\\theta/T$</span>，把本节全部结论统一为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 空间射线的几何。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-与采样章的接口\">与采样章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-与采样章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的概率对象，只引入“接口映射”所需的记号。设词表大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 2}$</span>，索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,V\\}$</span>。设 logits 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_V)\\in\\mathbb{R}^V$</span>，温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)\\in\\Delta^{V-1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{V-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^V:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形。记 one-hot 标签 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,V\\}$</span>，其 one-hot 向量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y\\in\\mathbb{R}^V$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_y)_i=\\delta_{iy}$</span>。记本章第 2 节已证的雅可比</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J(z):=\\frac{\\partial\\,\\mathrm{softmax}(z)}{\\partial z}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{V\\times V},\\qquad J_{ij}(z)=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)$</span>。记第 4 节的稳定 log-sum-exp 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{LSE}(z):=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_{j=1}^{V}e^{z_j-z_{\\max}},\\qquad z_{\\max}:=\\max_j z_j .$$</div>\n<p>记第 5 节的温度缩放族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}:=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span>，以及第 7 节的组合梯度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log p_y)=p-e_y$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 有限维可微性)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$V&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上实解析，故任意阶偏导存在且连续。此假设在本节情境下自动成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 是有限词表、<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 是实向量。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 温度有界)</strong> 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\min},\\tau_{\\max}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\tau_{\\min}\\le\\tau\\le\\tau_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span>。采样章的温度调度若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 的极限，则本节只讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 的有限取值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 的退化行为在第 10 节反例节处理，本节不展开。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 采样映射可测)</strong> 采样章使用的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S:\\Delta^{V-1}\\times\\Omega\\to\\{1,\\dots,V\\}$</span>（例如逆 CDF 采样、Gumbel-max 采样）对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega\\in\\Omega$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 可测，且对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 可测。此假设保证本节定义的接口复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p^{(\\tau)}(\\cdot),\\cdot)$</span> 是随机变量，从而其期望与梯度交换有依据。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 可积性)</strong> 采样章若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的某个实值泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[f(S(p))]$</span>，则假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{p\\in\\Delta^{V-1}}\\mathbb{E}[|f(S(p))|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为有界指示函数（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbf{1}\\{S=i\\}$</span>）时自动成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把第 2、5、7 节已证的 softmax 解析对象，与采样章的概率对象通过一个显式的“接口映射”连接起来，并证明该接口在温度缩放与梯度回传下的两个恒等式。接口映射的定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（softmax–采样接口映射）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span>。定义接口映射</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{\\tau}:\\mathbb{R}^V\\to\\Delta^{V-1},\\qquad \\Phi_{\\tau}(z):=p^{(\\tau)}=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau).$$</div>\n<p>对任意采样泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,V\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，定义其接口期望</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_{\\tau,f}(z):=\\mathbb{E}\\big[f(S(\\Phi_{\\tau}(z),\\omega))\\big]=\\sum_{i=1}^{V}f(i)\\,\\Phi_{\\tau}(z)_i,$$</div>\n<p>其中第二个等号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为“按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 独立抽样”的类别采样时成立；对 Gumbel-max 等其它采样器，第二个等号由 (A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的函数可测，但具体表达式可能不同。本节只处理类别采样这一情形，并在命题中显式标注。</p>\n<p>接口映射与相邻概念的区别必须说清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 不是“采样器”，它是把 logits 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 映到概率单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{V-1}$</span> 的参数化映射；采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{V-1}\\times\\Omega$</span> 上的随机映射。接口章要处理的是复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\circ\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的解析性质（可微性、梯度、温度极限），而不是采样器本身的随机性。这与第 12 节混合 softmax 的“层次参数化”不同：那里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 被分解为树上的条件 softmax 复合；本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 是单一 softmax，只带温度一个标量参数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式一-温度缩放下的期望梯度\">接口恒等式一：温度缩放下的期望梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式一-温度缩放下的期望梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（接口期望的梯度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 独立抽样的类别采样器，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,V\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 有界。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上连续可微，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,V\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial E_{\\tau,f}(z)}{\\partial z_k}\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\sum_{i=1}^{V}f(i)\\,p^{(\\tau)}_i\\big(\\delta_{ik}-p^{(\\tau)}_k\\big)\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\Big(\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]-E_{\\tau,f}(z)\\Big)p^{(\\tau)}_k,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]=\\sum_i f(i)p^{(\\tau)}_i$</span> 是接口期望本身，第二个等号是雅可比恒等式的直接代数改写。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i=e^{z_i/\\tau}/\\sum_j e^{z_j/\\tau}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上的实解析函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_k\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i$</span> 存在且连续。由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}(z)=\\sum_i f(i)\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i$</span> 是有限个连续可微函数的线性组合，连续可微。逐项求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial E_{\\tau,f}(z)}{\\partial z_k}\n=\\sum_{i=1}^{V}f(i)\\,\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_\\tau(z)_i}{\\partial z_k}.$$</div>\n<p>由链式法则与第 2 节雅可比恒等式（对变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/\\tau$</span> 应用，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial u_k/\\partial z_k=1/\\tau$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_\\tau(z)_i}{\\partial z_k}\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\,p^{(\\tau)}_i\\big(\\delta_{ik}-p^{(\\tau)}_k\\big).$$</div>\n<p>代入即得第一个等号。对第二个等号，把求和拆开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i}f(i)p_i(\\delta_{ik}-p_k)\n=\\sum_i f(i)p_i\\delta_{ik}-p_k\\sum_i f(i)p_i\n=f(k)p_k-p_k\\,\\mathbb{E}[f(S)].$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]-E_{\\tau,f}(z)\\big)p_k$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}(z)=\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]$</span>，故该式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与上式不一致。这里必须纠正：正确的代数改写应为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i f(i)p_i(\\delta_{ik}-p_k)=p_k\\big(f(k)-\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]\\big),$$</div>\n<p>而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]-E\\big)p_k$</span>。因此命题 1 的第二个等号应写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial E_{\\tau,f}(z)}{\\partial z_k}=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\,p^{(\\tau)}_k\\big(f(k)-\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]\\big).$$</div>\n<p>这一步纠正必须在证明中显式写出，不能跳过。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（采样章的温度梯度回传）</strong> 在命题 1 的条件下，若采样章以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}$</span> 为损失对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 做梯度下降，则温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 只通过因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 缩放梯度，不改变梯度的方向结构：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z E_{\\tau,f}=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\,\\mathrm{diag}(p^{(\\tau)})(f-\\bar f\\mathbf{1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar f=\\mathbb{E}[f(S)]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p^{(\\tau)})$</span> 为对角矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=(f(1),\\dots,f(V))^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 为全一向量。此推论直接由命题 1 逐分量写出，无需额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式二-温度极限与-one-hot-退化\">接口恒等式二：温度极限与 one-hot 退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式二-温度极限与-one-hot-退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（温度极限的接口行为）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^V$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大值唯一，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star=\\arg\\max_j z_j$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)\\to e_{i^\\star}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 的欧氏拓扑下），且对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}(z)\\to f(i^\\star)$</span>。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大值不唯一，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\{j:z_j=z_{\\max}\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)\\to \\frac{1}{|M|}\\sum_{j\\in M}e_j$</span>，即在最大值集合上均匀。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\tau_{\\max}]$</span> 内取值，极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 是良定义的。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j/\\tau=z_{\\max}/\\tau+(z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\notin M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j-z_{\\max}&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau\\to-\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j/\\tau}/e^{z_{\\max}/\\tau}=e^{(z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau}\\to0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in M$</span>，该比值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_\\tau(z)_j=\\frac{e^{(z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau}}{\\sum_{k}e^{(z_k-z_{\\max})/\\tau}}\\to\\frac{\\mathbf{1}\\{j\\in M\\}}{|M|}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|M|=1$</span> 时即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{i^\\star}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}$</span> 的极限由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界与有限维线性组合的连续性直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题是采样章“低温采样趋近贪心解码”的解析依据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时接口映射退化为 one-hot，采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的分布退化为点质量。注意命题 2 只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 的极限，不断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0$</span> 有定义；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 的奇异性在第 10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式三-交叉熵梯度与采样期望的复合\">接口恒等式三：交叉熵梯度与采样期望的复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式三-交叉熵梯度与采样期望的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（接口复合的交叉熵梯度）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,V\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}=\\Phi_\\tau(z)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z\\big(-\\log p^{(\\tau)}_y\\big)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\big(p^{(\\tau)}-e_y\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_y$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上实解析（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)_y&gt;0$</span> 恒成立）。由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_y)=-\\frac{1}{\\Phi_\\tau(z)_y}\\nabla_z\\Phi_\\tau(z)_y$</span>。由第 7 节已证的组合梯度恒等式（对变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/\\tau$</span> 应用），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u(-\\log\\mathrm{softmax}(u)_y)=\\mathrm{softmax}(u)-e_y$</span>。再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial u/\\partial z=1/\\tau$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}(p^{(\\tau)}-e_y)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题把第 7 节的组合梯度与第 5 节的温度缩放接起来：采样章若以负对数似然为损失，则梯度回传时温度只整体缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>，方向由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}-e_y$</span> 决定。这与命题 1 的接口期望梯度形式一致：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_y$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar f=p^{(\\tau)}_y$</span>，命题 1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}p^{(\\tau)}_k(\\delta_{ky}-p^{(\\tau)}_y)$</span>，逐分量即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}(p^{(\\tau)}-e_y)$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个分量。两个命题在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_y$</span> 时相容，这是本节必须验证的自洽性检查。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-具体例子-V-3-的接口数值验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=3$</span> 的接口数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-具体例子-V-3-的接口数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(2.0,\\,0.5,\\,-1.0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_1$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=z/\\tau=(2.8571,\\,0.7143,\\,-1.4286)$</span>。用稳定 LSE 计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{\\max}=2.8571$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{u_j-u_{\\max}}=1+e^{-2.1429}+e^{-4.2857}\\approx1+0.1173+0.0137=1.1310$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{LSE}=2.8571+\\log 1.1310\\approx2.8571+0.1231=2.9802$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_1=e^{2.8571-2.9802}\\approx e^{-0.1231}\\approx0.8842$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_2=e^{0.7143-2.9802}\\approx e^{-2.2659}\\approx0.1037$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_3=e^{-1.4286-2.9802}\\approx e^{-4.4088}\\approx0.0121$</span>。三者之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.8842+0.1037+0.0121=1.0000$</span>。</p>\n<p>命题 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log p^{(\\tau)}_1)=\\frac{1}{0.7}(p^{(\\tau)}-e_1)$</span>。逐分量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{0.7}(0.8842-1)=-0.1654$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{0.7}(0.1037)=0.1481$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{0.7}(0.0121)=0.0173$</span>。命题 1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar f=p^{(\\tau)}_1=0.8842$</span>，逐分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{0.7}p^{(\\tau)}_k(\\delta_{k1}-0.8842)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{0.7}\\cdot0.8842\\cdot(1-0.8842)=-0.1463$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{0.7}\\cdot0.1037\\cdot(0-0.8842)=-0.1310$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=3$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{0.7}\\cdot0.0121\\cdot(0-0.8842)=-0.0153$</span>。这两组数不相等，因为命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_1$</span> 对应的是“采样指示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=1$</span> 的期望”，其梯度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}p_k(\\delta_{k1}-p_1)$</span>，而命题 3 的负对数似然梯度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}(p_k-\\delta_{k1})$</span>。两者相差一个符号与一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 因子：命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 分量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.1463$</span>，命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 分量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.1654$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1463/0.1654\\approx0.8842=p_1$</span>。这说明“采样期望的梯度”与“负对数似然的梯度”不是同一个对象，接口章必须把两者分开陈述，不能混为一谈。这一区分正是本节的核心接口纪律。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-代码-接口映射的梯度与温度极限验证\">代码：接口映射的梯度与温度极限验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-代码-接口映射的梯度与温度极限验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z, tau=1.0):\n    u = z / tau\n    u_max = np.max(u)\n    e = np.exp(u - u_max)\n    return e / np.sum(e)\n\ndef lse_stable(z):\n    z_max = np.max(z)\n    return z_max + np.log(np.sum(np.exp(z - z_max)))\n\ndef interface_grad_expectation(z, tau, f):\n    # 命题 1: grad E_{tau,f} = (1/tau) * p * (f - &lt;f&gt;)\n    p = softmax(z, tau)\n    f = np.asarray(f, dtype=float)\n    f_bar = np.sum(f * p)\n    return (1.0 / tau) * p * (f - f_bar)\n\ndef interface_grad_nll(z, tau, y):\n    # 命题 3: grad(-log p_y) = (1/tau)(p - e_y)\n    p = softmax(z, tau)\n    e_y = np.zeros_like(p); e_y[y] = 1.0\n    return (1.0 / tau) * (p - e_y)\n\nz = np.array([2.0, 0.5, -1.0])\ntau = 0.7\ny = 0\nf = np.array([1.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n\np = softmax(z, tau)\nassert abs(np.sum(p) - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert np.all(p &gt;= 0)\n\ng_exp = interface_grad_expectation(z, tau, f)\ng_nll = interface_grad_nll(z, tau, y)\n\n# 数值梯度校验命题 1\neps = 1e-6\ng_num = np.zeros(3)\nfor k in range(3):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[k] += eps\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[k] -= eps\n    Ep = np.sum(f * softmax(zp, tau))\n    Em = np.sum(f * softmax(zm, tau))\n    g_num[k] = (Ep - Em) / (2 * eps)\nassert np.allclose(g_exp, g_num, atol=1e-5)\n\n# 数值梯度校验命题 3\ng_num_nll = np.zeros(3)\nfor k in range(3):\n    zp = z.copy(); zp[k] += eps\n    zm = z.copy(); zm[k] -= eps\n    Lp = -np.log(softmax(zp, tau)[y])\n    Lm = -np.log(softmax(zm, tau)[y])\n    g_num_nll[k] = (Lp - Lm) / (2 * eps)\nassert np.allclose(g_nll, g_num_nll, atol=1e-5)\n\n# 温度极限: tau -&gt; 0+ 时 p -&gt; e_argmax\ntaus = [1.0, 0.3, 0.1, 0.03]\nfor t in taus:\n    pt = softmax(z, t)\n    print(f&quot;tau={t:.2f}, p={pt}, argmax={np.argmax(pt)}&quot;)\nassert np.argmax(softmax(z, 0.03)) == np.argmax(z)\n\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape)\nprint(&quot;g_exp:&quot;, g_exp)\nprint(&quot;g_nll:&quot;, g_nll)\nprint(&quot;expected: g_exp ≈ [-0.1463, -0.1310, -0.0153], g_nll ≈ [-0.1654, 0.1481, 0.0173]&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>p shape: (3,)</code>；<code>g_exp</code> 与 <code>g_nll</code> 分别匹配上面手算的数值；<code>tau</code> 递减时 <code>argmax</code> 稳定在索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节定义了 softmax–采样接口映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span>，并把它与采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 明确区分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 是解析参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是随机映射；接口章只处理复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\circ\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的可微性与梯度结构，不重复采样器本身的构造。</li>\n<li>命题 1 给出接口期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}p^{(\\tau)}_k(f(k)-\\mathbb{E}[f(S)])$</span>，命题 3 给出负对数似然梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}(p^{(\\tau)}-e_y)$</span>；两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_y$</span> 时相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_y$</span>，故采样期望梯度与交叉熵梯度不是同一对象，接口章必须分开陈述，禁止把目标值相等当成梯度相等。</li>\n<li>命题 2 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)$</span> 退化为最大值集合上的均匀分布（唯一最大值时为 one-hot），这是采样章低温贪心解码的解析依据；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 处的奇异性不在本节断言，留待第 10 节反例节处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式四-Gumbel-max-采样下的接口可微性\">接口恒等式四：Gumbel-max 采样下的接口可微性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式四-Gumbel-max-采样下的接口可微性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前三个命题只处理了类别采样（按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 独立抽样）这一情形。采样章还使用 Gumbel-max 采样，其接口结构不同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 不是按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 抽样，而是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,V$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立同分布，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的分布确实等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\log p,g)$</span> 的函数是分段常值的，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 几乎处处不可微。本节必须把这一接口的可微性条件写清，否则采样章的梯度回传会失去依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（Gumbel-max 接口的几乎处处可微性与梯度期望）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2)、(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(g_1,\\dots,g_V)$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z,g)=\\arg\\max_i(\\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i+g_i)$</span>。则对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>（关于 Gumbel 乘积测度），映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto S(z,g)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上几乎处处局部常值，从而几乎处处可微且梯度为零向量；进一步，对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\nabla_z f(S(z,g))\\big]=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中期望关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 取，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的可微点处取（几乎处处）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto \\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i+g_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上的实解析函数（由 (A1)），故对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 连续。集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z: \\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i+g_i=\\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_j+g_j\\}$</span> 是解析函数的零点集，其 Lebesgue 测度为零（除非该解析函数恒为零，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i-\\log\\Phi_\\tau(z)_j=(z_i-z_j)/\\tau$</span> 不恒为零，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 时该差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 变化）。因此对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 唯一确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z,g)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的某邻域内为常数。局部常值函数几乎处处可微且梯度为零。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(S(z,g))$</span> 几乎处处可微且梯度为零，故其期望的梯度（在可微点取）为零向量。这里交换期望与梯度不需要 Dominated Convergence，因为被积函数几乎处处梯度为零，期望梯度直接为零。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的接口含义必须说清：Gumbel-max 采样下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的梯度几乎处处为零，故“对采样结果做梯度回传”在 Gumbel-max 接口下没有解析梯度信号；采样章若要对 Gumbel-max 做梯度估计，必须使用直通估计器（straight-through estimator）或 Gumbel-softmax 松弛，而这两者都不是本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的解析梯度。本节只断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 本身可微（命题 1、3），但复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\circ\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 在 Gumbel-max 下几乎处处梯度为零。这与类别采样接口（命题 1）形成对照：类别采样下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbf{1}\\{S=i\\}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 线性，故复合可微；Gumbel-max 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是分段常值，复合不可微。接口章必须把这两种采样器的可微性分开陈述，不能把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 可微”误当成“<span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\circ\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 可微”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式五-温度与采样方差的接口关系\">接口恒等式五：温度与采样方差的接口关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式五-温度与采样方差的接口关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样章关心采样结果的方差随温度的变化。本节给出一个可检验的恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的解析性质与采样方差接起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（类别采样指示函数的方差）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}=\\Phi_\\tau(z)$</span> 独立抽样的类别采样器，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbf{1}\\{S=i\\}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(f(S)\\big)=p^{(\\tau)}_i\\big(1-p^{(\\tau)}_i\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大值唯一时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=i^\\star$</span> 则方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne i^\\star$</span> 则方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(S)$</span> 是参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_i$</span> 的伯努利随机变量，其方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_i(1-p^{(\\tau)}_i)$</span>，这是伯努利分布的标准事实。温度极限由命题 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)\\to e_{i^\\star}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_i\\to\\mathbf{1}\\{i=i^\\star\\}$</span>，代入方差公式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)\\to0$</span>（无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=i^\\star$</span> 还是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne i^\\star$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的接口含义：低温采样使指示函数的方差趋于零，即采样结果趋于确定；这与命题 2 的分布退化一致。但注意方差趋于零不等于梯度趋于零：命题 1 的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}p_k(f(k)-\\mathbb{E}[f(S)])$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f(k)-\\mathbb{E}[f])$</span> 的乘积趋于零或常数，故梯度的极限行为需要逐项分析，不能由方差趋于零直接推出梯度趋于零。这一区分是接口章必须强调的：采样方差与梯度是两个不同的接口量，禁止把“方差小”当成“梯度小”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式六-接口映射的-Fisher-度量拉回\">接口恒等式六：接口映射的 Fisher 度量拉回<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式六-接口映射的-Fisher-度量拉回\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节已建立单纯形上的 Fisher 度量。本节把该度量通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 拉回到 logits 空间，给出采样章可用的接口度量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（Fisher 度量的拉回）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{V-1}$</span> 上的 Fisher 度量，其在坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_p(u,v)=\\sum_{i=1}^{V}\\frac{u_i v_i}{p_i}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v\\in T_p\\Delta^{V-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i u_i=\\sum_i v_i=0$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的拉回度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau^*g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处对切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 的值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\Phi_\\tau^*g)_z(a,b)=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_{i=1}^{V}p^{(\\tau)}_i\\big(a_i-\\bar a\\big)\\big(b_i-\\bar b\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar a=\\sum_j p^{(\\tau)}_j a_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar b=\\sum_j p^{(\\tau)}_j b_j$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V\\to\\Delta^{V-1}$</span> 的光滑映射。其微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\Phi_\\tau(z):\\mathbb{R}^V\\to T_{p^{(\\tau)}}\\Delta^{V-1}$</span> 由雅可比给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(d\\Phi_\\tau(z)a)_i=\\sum_j J_{ij}(z/\\tau)\\cdot a_j/\\tau=\\frac{1}{\\tau}p^{(\\tau)}_i(a_i-\\bar a)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar a=\\sum_j p^{(\\tau)}_j a_j$</span>。这里用了第 2 节雅可比恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span> 与链式法则的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 因子。拉回度量的定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_\\tau^*g)_z(a,b)=g_{p^{(\\tau)}}(d\\Phi_\\tau(z)a,d\\Phi_\\tau(z)b)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_p$</span> 的坐标表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{p^{(\\tau)}}\\big(d\\Phi_\\tau(z)a,d\\Phi_\\tau(z)b\\big)\n=\\sum_i\\frac{1}{p^{(\\tau)}_i}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\tau}p^{(\\tau)}_i(a_i-\\bar a)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\tau}p^{(\\tau)}_i(b_i-\\bar b)\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_i p^{(\\tau)}_i(a_i-\\bar a)(b_i-\\bar b).$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\Phi_\\tau(z)a$</span> 确实落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{p^{(\\tau)}}\\Delta^{V-1}$</span> 中：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(d\\Phi_\\tau(z)a)_i=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\sum_i p_i(a_i-\\bar a)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}(\\bar a-\\bar a)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_p$</span> 的定义域正确。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的接口含义：Fisher 度量在 logits 空间中的拉回是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}$</span> 缩放的协方差型度量，其二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i(a_i-\\bar a)^2$</span> 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的方差。采样章若用自然梯度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 更新，则自然梯度方向由该拉回度量的逆给出，温度只整体缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}$</span>，不改变度量的方向结构。这与命题 1 的温度只缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 形成对照：期望梯度的温度缩放是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>，Fisher 度量的温度缩放是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau^2$</span>，两者不同，接口章必须分别陈述，不能混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式七-采样章损失函数的接口分解\">接口恒等式七：采样章损失函数的接口分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式七-采样章损失函数的接口分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样章常把损失写成“负对数似然 + 采样正则”的形式。本节给出该分解在接口映射下的解析表达，作为本节与采样章的最终接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（接口损失的分解）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,V\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}=\\Phi_\\tau(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,V\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 有界。定义接口损失</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L(z):=-\\log p^{(\\tau)}_y+\\lambda\\,E_{\\tau,f}(z),\\qquad \\lambda\\in\\mathbb{R}.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上连续可微，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z L(z)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\big(p^{(\\tau)}-e_y\\big)+\\frac{\\lambda}{\\tau}\\,p^{(\\tau)}\\odot(f-\\bar f\\mathbf{1}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\odot$</span> 为逐分量乘积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar f=\\sum_i f(i)p^{(\\tau)}_i$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，两项均连续可微（命题 1、命题 3）。由线性性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z L=\\nabla_z(-\\log p^{(\\tau)}_y)+\\lambda\\nabla_z E_{\\tau,f}$</span>。代入命题 3 与命题 1 的梯度表达式即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题把采样章的两类损失（监督负对数似然与采样期望正则）统一到同一接口下，并显式给出两者的梯度叠加。注意两项的温度缩放因子都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>，但方向结构不同：第一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}-e_y$</span>，第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}\\odot(f-\\bar f\\mathbf{1})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_y$</span> 时，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\lambda}{\\tau}p^{(\\tau)}\\odot(e_y-p^{(\\tau)}_y\\mathbf{1})$</span>，与第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}(p^{(\\tau)}-e_y)$</span> 不成比例（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 取特定值且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_y$</span> 满足特定关系），故两项不能合并为单一梯度。这正是接口章要强调的：采样期望正则与负对数似然是接口上的两个独立方向，禁止把它们的梯度当成同一对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式八-温度调度下的接口连续性\">接口恒等式八：温度调度下的接口连续性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式八-温度调度下的接口连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样章使用温度调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 随解码步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化。本节给出接口映射在温度调度下的连续性，保证采样章的逐步接口是良定义的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（温度调度的接口连续性）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t&gt;0$</span> 为解码步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 的温度序列，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为离散步，则视为分段常值）。则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\Phi_{\\tau_t}(z)$</span> 连续，且对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto E_{\\tau_t,f}(z)$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 连续：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i=e^{z_i/\\tau}/\\sum_j e^{z_j/\\tau}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的连续函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>）。复合连续函数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\Phi_{\\tau_t}(z)$</span> 连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\tau,f}(z)=\\sum_i f(i)\\Phi_\\tau(z)_i$</span> 是有限个连续函数的线性组合，故连续。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的接口含义：温度调度下，接口映射逐步连续变化，采样章的逐步采样分布不会出现跳变（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 本身跳变）。但注意连续性只保证分布连续，不保证梯度连续：命题 1 的梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 因子，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t\\to0^+$</span> 时梯度可能发散，故温度调度下的梯度回传需要额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t\\ge\\tau_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>（即 (A2)），否则梯度无界。这一区分是接口章必须写明的：分布连续不等于梯度连续，采样章的梯度回传必须显式假设温度有下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口恒等式九-接口映射与采样章的测度变换\">接口恒等式九：接口映射与采样章的测度变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口恒等式九-接口映射与采样章的测度变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，本节给出接口映射在测度层面的一个恒等式，作为采样章“从 logits 空间到概率单纯形”的测度变换依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（接口映射的测度变换）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^V$</span> 上的概率测度，绝对连续于 Lebesgue 测度，密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 推前测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\tau*}\\mu$</span> 绝对连续于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{V-1}$</span> 上的 Lebesgue 测度（维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V-1$</span>），且其密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\Phi_\\tau(z)$</span> 处为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_{\\Phi_\\tau}(p)=\\sum_{z\\in\\Phi_\\tau^{-1}(p)}\\frac{\\rho(z)}{|\\det J_\\tau(z)|},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\tau(z)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}J(z/\\tau)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的雅可比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\det J_\\tau(z)|$</span> 为雅可比行列式的绝对值（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V-1$</span> 维切空间上取）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 是光滑映射。由测度推前的标准公式（面积公式），对绝对连续测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，推前测度在正则点处的密度由雅可比行列式给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的雅可比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\tau(z)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}J(z/\\tau)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 为第 2 节的 softmax 雅可比。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V-1$</span>（因为 softmax 的输出满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，故雅可比的像落在切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i u_i=0$</span> 中），故行列式应在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V-1$</span> 维切空间上取。对每个正则点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的某邻域内是到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{V-1}$</span> 的局部微分同胚，面积公式给出密度贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(z)/|\\det J_\\tau(z)|$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau^{-1}(p)$</span> 中的所有正则点求和即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的接口含义：采样章若在 logits 空间定义先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>，则通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 推前到概率单纯形上的密度由雅可比行列式加权。温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\tau=\\frac{1}{\\tau}J$</span> 进入密度，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 越小，雅可比越大，推前密度越集中。这与命题 2 的温度极限一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时推前测度趋于点质量。但注意本命题只断言绝对连续测度的推前，不处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 的退化情形；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 处雅可比奇异，推前测度可能不再绝对连续，这一边界情形留待第 10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-接口纪律的汇总\">接口纪律的汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-接口纪律的汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节通过九个命题建立了 softmax–采样接口的解析框架。为避免采样章误用，把接口纪律汇总为三条可检验的断言，每条都对应本节的一个命题，且每条都显式标注其假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(I1) 期望梯度与交叉熵梯度不是同一对象)</strong> 命题 1 与命题 3 给出两个不同的梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}p^{(\\tau)}_k(f(k)-\\bar f)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}(p^{(\\tau)}_k-\\delta_{ky})$</span>。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=e_y$</span> 时相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_y$</span>，故不能互相替换。此断言依赖 (A1)、(A2)、(A4)。</li>\n<li><strong>(I2) 采样方差与梯度不是同一对象)</strong> 命题 5 给出指示函数方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)$</span>，命题 1 给出梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 因子。低温时方差趋于零但梯度可能发散，故不能由方差小推出梯度小。此断言依赖 (A1)、(A2)。</li>\n<li><strong>(I3) 分布连续与梯度连续不是同一对象)</strong> 命题 8 给出温度调度下分布连续，但命题 1 的梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>，故梯度连续需要额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ge\\tau_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>（即 (A2)）。此断言依赖 (A1)、(A2)。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三条接口纪律是本节对采样章的全部承诺：本节只证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 的解析性质与复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\circ\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 在类别采样下的可微性，不证明 Gumbel-max 复合的可微性（命题 4 证明其几乎处处梯度为零），不证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 处的任何性质（留待第 10 节反例节），不证明采样器本身的构造（那是采样章的任务）。采样章在使用本节结论时，必须逐条核对上述假设，缺哪条就在采样章的反例节指出会怎样失效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar10--h-本章推导链-softmax-是条件分布的参数化\">本章推导链：softmax 是条件分布的参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-本章推导链-softmax-是条件分布的参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，并仅补充本节推导链所需的记号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设词表大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。logits 向量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_K)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li>softmax 映射记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}^K:p_i\\ge 0,\\ \\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1\\}$</span> 为概率单纯形。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z)_i=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{k=1}^K e^{z_k}},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div></li>\n<li>给定上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，自回归模型在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步输出条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\sigma(f_\\theta(c))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta:\\mathcal{C}\\to\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 为可微的 logits 映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 为上下文空间。</li>\n<li>目标 token 记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，其 one-hot 向量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_y)_i=\\delta_{iy}$</span>。</li>\n<li>温度参数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，温度缩放后的分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z/\\tau)$</span>。</li>\n<li>本节所有求导均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的标准欧氏坐标下进行；雅可比矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 的元素定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J_\\sigma(z))_{ij}=\\partial \\sigma(z)_i/\\partial z_j$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设 A1（正则性）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 上连续可微，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(c)$</span> 的每个分量有限。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(f_\\theta(c))$</span> 的每个分量严格为正，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sigma(f_\\theta(c))_y$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 有定义且可微。</p>\n<p>假设 A2（可积性）：本节出现的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{c\\sim\\mu}[\\cdot]$</span> 均相对于上下文分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 定义；当需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导与期望交换时，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta \\log\\sigma(f_\\theta(c))_y\\|$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 可积，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-可积的控制函数。此假设在本节情境下成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 连续可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 紧支撑（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 具有足够阶矩），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的分量有界于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是给出一条完整的推导链，说明 softmax 不是任意的归一化技巧，而是条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span> 在指数族坐标下的一个具体参数化；并沿这条链把雅可比、log-sum-exp 稳定性、温度缩放与交叉熵组合梯度串成同一个数学对象的不同侧面。本节不重复前序各节已给出的单独证明，而是把它们的逻辑依赖关系显式化，并补上链上尚缺的连接命题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-1-推导链的起点-条件分布作为指数族成员\">1. 推导链的起点：条件分布作为指数族成员<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-1-推导链的起点-条件分布作为指数族成员\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（softmax 的指数族表示）</strong><br>\n假设 A1 成立。固定上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=f_\\theta(c)\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>。则条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\sigma(z)$</span> 是定义在有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 上的指数族分布，其自然参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>（在去掉一个冗余自由度后），充分统计量为 one-hot 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span>，对数配分函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z)=\\log\\sum_{k=1}^K e^{z_k}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n有限集上的概率分布由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个非负数之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 确定。取参考测度为计数测度，写\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(y\\mid c)=\\exp\\big(z_y-A(z)\\big),\\qquad A(z)=\\log\\sum_{k=1}^K e^{z_k}.$$</div>\n这正是指数族的标准形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y\\mid\\eta)=\\exp(\\langle \\eta,T(y)\\rangle-A(\\eta))$</span>，其中自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=z$</span>，充分统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(y)=e_y$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle z,e_y\\rangle=z_y$</span>。归一化条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y=1}^K p_\\theta(y\\mid c)=1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z)$</span> 的定义式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题是整条推导链的锚点：softmax 的分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 不是启发式权重，而是指数族在计数测度下的未归一化密度；分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k e^{z_k}$</span> 是对数配分函数的指数。由此，前序第 3 节“指数族的自然参数”与第 1 节“softmax 的定义与归一化”在此汇合：softmax 就是指数族在有限标签空间上的具体实现。</p>\n<p>需要区分的是：softmax 作为映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 与“条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid c)$</span>”不是同一个对象。前者是参数化映射，后者是经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 拉回后的分布族。推导链的第一环就是把二者对齐：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\sigma(f_\\theta(c))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta(c)$</span> 扮演自然参数的角色。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-2-第二环-雅可比是自然参数到概率坐标的微分\">2. 第二环：雅可比是自然参数到概率坐标的微分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-2-第二环-雅可比是自然参数到概率坐标的微分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（softmax 雅可比公式）</strong><br>\n假设 A1 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处的雅可比矩阵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J_\\sigma(z))_{ij}=\\frac{\\partial \\sigma(z)_i}{\\partial z_j}=\\sigma(z)_i\\big(\\delta_{ij}-\\sigma(z)_j\\big),\\qquad i,j=1,\\dots,K.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(z)=\\sum_{k=1}^K e^{z_k}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i=e^{z_i}/S(z)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求偏导，分两种情况。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 时，由商法则：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z_i}\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}\n=\\frac{e^{z_i}S(z)-e^{z_i}e^{z_i}}{S(z)^2}\n=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}\\left(1-\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}\\right)\n=\\sigma(z)_i\\big(1-\\sigma(z)_i\\big).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 时，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z_j}\\frac{e^{z_i}}{S(z)}\n=-\\frac{e^{z_i}e^{z_j}}{S(z)^2}\n=-\\sigma(z)_i\\sigma(z)_j.$$</div>\n合并两种情况即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J_\\sigma(z))_{ij}=\\sigma(z)_i(\\delta_{ij}-\\sigma(z)_j)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个公式的几何含义是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)$</span> 把自然参数空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的切向量线性地送到单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的切空间。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)$</span> 的每一行之和为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=1}^K (J_\\sigma(z))_{ij}\n=\\sigma(z)_i\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^K\\delta_{ij}-\\sum_{j=1}^K\\sigma(z)_j\\right)\n=\\sigma(z)_i(1-1)=0,$$</div>\n这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\sigma(z)_i=1$</span> 恒成立、其微分沿全一向量方向为零相一致。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)$</span> 的秩至多为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，核空间包含全一向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top$</span>。这正是指数族自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的平移冗余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\mapsto z+c\\mathbf{1}$</span> 在微分层面的体现：softmax 对 logits 的平移不变，故雅可比在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向上退化。</p>\n<p>推导链的第二环因此是：命题 1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span> 的指数族身份，命题 2 给出该参数化的微分。二者合起来说明，softmax 的雅可比不是孤立的矩阵计算，而是“自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 概率坐标”这一映射的导数；其行和为零与平移不变性互为表里。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-3-第三环-log-sum-exp-的数值稳定是同一恒等式的重排\">3. 第三环：log-sum-exp 的数值稳定是同一恒等式的重排<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-3-第三环-log-sum-exp-的数值稳定是同一恒等式的重排\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（log-sum-exp 的平移恒等式）</strong><br>\n对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 与任意常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}=c+\\log\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j-c}.$$</div>\n特别地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=z_{\\max}=\\max_j z_j$</span>，得到\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}=z_{\\max}+\\log\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j-z_{\\max}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}=e^{c}\\cdot e^{z_j-c}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j e^{z_j}=e^{c}\\sum_j e^{z_j-c}$</span>。两边取对数即得第一式。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=z_{\\max}$</span> 即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式与命题 2 的雅可比公式共享同一个根源：softmax 对 logits 的平移不变。命题 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)\\mathbf{1}=0$</span> 是这一不变性的微分表述；命题 3 是这一不变性在对数配分函数上的代数表述。数值稳定实现正是利用该恒等式，把指数运算的输入平移到非正数区间，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_j}$</span> 上溢。</p>\n<p>需要强调：命题 3 是恒等式，不是近似。数值稳定的实现不改变数学值，只改变浮点运算的中间量。前序第 4 节已给出该恒等式的数值稳定讨论；本节把它放进推导链，是为了说明它与雅可比的零行和是同一对称性的两个投影。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-4-第四环-温度缩放是自然参数的仿射重参数化\">4. 第四环：温度缩放是自然参数的仿射重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-4-第四环-温度缩放是自然参数的仿射重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（温度缩放的自然参数解释）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>。温度缩放分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z/\\tau)$</span> 仍是同一指数族成员，其自然参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=z/\\tau$</span>，对数配分函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z/\\tau)=\\log\\sum_k e^{z_k/\\tau}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的最大值唯一，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z/\\tau)$</span> 逐分量收敛到最大值位置的 one-hot 分布；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z/\\tau)$</span> 逐分量收敛到均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n第一句由命题 1 直接得到：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z/\\tau$</span> 即得指数族形式。极限情形逐分量验证。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=\\max_k z_k$</span> 且唯一 attainment 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^*$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne k^*$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z/\\tau)_i=\\frac{e^{z_i/\\tau}}{\\sum_k e^{z_k/\\tau}}\n=\\frac{e^{(z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau}}{\\sum_k e^{(z_k-z_{\\max})/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n分子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-z_{\\max}&lt;0$</span>，故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau}\\to0$</span>；分母中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=k^*$</span> 的项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其余项趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故分母趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z/\\tau)_i\\to0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k^*$</span>，同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z/\\tau)_{k^*}\\to1$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_k/\\tau\\to0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_k/\\tau}\\to1$</span>，每个分量趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>温度缩放因此不是新机制，而是自然参数的仿射变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=z/\\tau$</span>。它与命题 2 的雅可比通过链式法则相连：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial \\sigma(z/\\tau)_i}{\\partial z_j}\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau}(J_\\sigma(z/\\tau))_{ij}\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\sigma(z/\\tau)_i\\big(\\delta_{ij}-\\sigma(z/\\tau)_j\\big).$$</div>\n这个因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很小时放大梯度、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很大时缩小梯度，是前序第 5 节“温度缩放与分布锐化”与第 10 节“softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”之间的定量桥梁。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-5-第五环-交叉熵组合梯度是链式法则的终点\">5. 第五环：交叉熵组合梯度是链式法则的终点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-5-第五环-交叉熵组合梯度是链式法则的终点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（交叉熵与 softmax 的组合梯度）</strong><br>\n假设 A1 成立。固定上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=f_\\theta(c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span>。对目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，定义损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(z)=-\\log\\sigma(z)_y$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z \\ell(z)=p-e_y,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial \\ell/\\partial z_j=p_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,K$</span>。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 可微，则对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta \\ell(f_\\theta(c))=J_{f_\\theta}(c)^\\top(p-e_y),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{f_\\theta}(c)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times d}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 处的雅可比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为参数维数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sigma(z)_y=z_y-A(z)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z)=\\log\\sum_k e^{z_k}$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(z)=A(z)-z_y.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_j$</span> 求偏导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial A(z)}{\\partial z_j}\n=\\frac{e^{z_j}}{\\sum_k e^{z_k}}\n=\\sigma(z)_j=p_j,$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial(-z_y)/\\partial z_j=-\\delta_{jy}$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial \\ell/\\partial z_j=p_j-\\delta_{jy}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\ell=p-e_y$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度由链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta \\ell(f_\\theta(c))=J_{f_\\theta}(c)^\\top\\nabla_z\\ell$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题是整条推导链的收口：命题 1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(z)=A(z)-z_y$</span> 的指数族形式，命题 2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的梯度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z A(z)=\\sigma(z)$</span>，这正是命题 2 中雅可比行结构的来源），命题 3 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z)$</span> 在数值上可稳定计算，命题 4 说明温度缩放只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z/\\tau$</span> 后同一公式的缩放版本。于是“softmax 是条件分布的参数化”这句话的完整含义是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\underbrace{p_\\theta(y\\mid c)=\\sigma(f_\\theta(c))}_{\\text{参数化}}\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\underbrace{\\nabla_z(-\\log p_\\theta(y\\mid c))=p-e_y}_{\\text{组合梯度}}\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\underbrace{\\nabla_\\theta(-\\log p_\\theta(y\\mid c))=J_{f_\\theta}^\\top(p-e_y)}_{\\text{反传}}.$$</div>\n<p>每一步都只用到指数族的定义与链式法则，没有引入额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-6-一个具体例子验证公式\">6. 一个具体例子验证公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-6-一个具体例子验证公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(1,0,-1)$</span>。计算 softmax：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S=e^{1}+e^{0}+e^{-1}\\approx 2.71828+1+0.36788=4.08616,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p=\\sigma(z)\\approx(0.66524,\\ 0.24473,\\ 0.09003).$$</div>\n按命题 2 计算雅可比。对角元：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J_\\sigma)_{11}=p_1(1-p_1)\\approx0.66524\\times0.33476\\approx0.22269,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J_\\sigma)_{22}=p_2(1-p_2)\\approx0.24473\\times0.75527\\approx0.18484,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J_\\sigma)_{33}=p_3(1-p_3)\\approx0.09003\\times0.90997\\approx0.08192.$$</div>\n非对角元：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J_\\sigma)_{12}=-p_1p_2\\approx-0.16280,\\quad\n(J_\\sigma)_{13}=-p_1p_3\\approx-0.05989,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J_\\sigma)_{21}=-p_2p_1\\approx-0.16280,\\quad\n(J_\\sigma)_{23}=-p_2p_3\\approx-0.02203,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(J_\\sigma)_{31}=-p_3p_1\\approx-0.05989,\\quad\n(J_\\sigma)_{32}=-p_3p_2\\approx-0.02203.$$</div>\n每行之和为零，与命题 2 后的推论一致。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y=(1,0,0)$</span>，按命题 5：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_z\\ell=p-e_y\\approx(0.66524-1,\\ 0.24473,\\ 0.09003)=(-0.33476,\\ 0.24473,\\ 0.09003).$$</div>\n直接验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(z)=A(z)-z_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial A/\\partial z_1=p_1\\approx0.66524$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial(-z_1)/\\partial z_1=-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\ell/\\partial z_1\\approx-0.33476$</span>，与上式一致。</p>\n<p>下面的代码把上述数值验证固定为可运行断言。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef softmax(z):\n    z = np.asarray(z, dtype=float)\n    zmax = np.max(z)\n    e = np.exp(z - zmax)\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef softmax_jacobian(z):\n    p = softmax(z)\n    K = p.shape[0]\n    J = np.zeros((K, K))\n    for i in range(K):\n        for j in range(K):\n            J[i, j] = p[i] * ((1.0 if i == j else 0.0) - p[j])\n    return J\n\nz = np.array([1.0, 0.0, -1.0])\np = softmax(z)\nJ = softmax_jacobian(z)\n\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape)\nprint(&quot;p:&quot;, p)\nprint(&quot;J shape:&quot;, J.shape)\nprint(&quot;J:&quot;, J)\nprint(&quot;row sums:&quot;, J.sum(axis=1))\n\nassert p.shape == (3,)\nassert J.shape == (3, 3)\nassert np.allclose(p.sum(), 1.0)\nassert np.allclose(J.sum(axis=1), 0.0, atol=1e-12)\n\n# 命题 5：nabla_z(-log p_y) = p - e_y\ny = 0\ne_y = np.zeros(3)\ne_y[y] = 1.0\ngrad = p - e_y\nprint(&quot;grad shape:&quot;, grad.shape)\nprint(&quot;grad:&quot;, grad)\nassert grad.shape == (3,)\nassert np.allclose(grad, np.array([-0.33476, 0.24473, 0.09003]), atol=1e-4)\n\n# 数值雅可比验证\neps = 1e-6\nJ_num = np.zeros((3, 3))\nfor j in range(3):\n    dz = np.zeros(3)\n    dz[j] = eps\n    J_num[:, j] = (softmax(z + dz) - softmax(z - dz)) / (2 * eps)\nprint(&quot;max |J - J_num|:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(J - J_num)))\nassert np.allclose(J, J_num, atol=1e-5)\n\n# 命题 3：log-sum-exp 平移恒等式\nlse = np.log(np.sum(np.exp(z)))\nlse_stable = np.max(z) + np.log(np.sum(np.exp(z - np.max(z))))\nprint(&quot;lse:&quot;, lse, &quot;lse_stable:&quot;, lse_stable)\nassert np.allclose(lse, lse_stable)\n\n# 命题 4：温度极限\nfor tau in [0.1, 1.0, 10.0]:\n    p_tau = softmax(z / tau)\n    print(f&quot;tau={tau}, p={p_tau}&quot;)\n    assert p_tau.shape == (3,)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>p</code> 形状 <code>(3,)</code>，<code>J</code> 形状 <code>(3,3)</code>，行和全为零；<code>grad</code> 形状 <code>(3,)</code> 且与解析值一致；数值雅可比与解析雅可比最大偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span> 量级；<code>lse</code> 与 <code>lse_stable</code> 相等；温度从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 时分布从接近 one-hot 过渡到接近均匀。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-7-推导链的闭合与边界\">7. 推导链的闭合与边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-7-推导链的闭合与边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，本节把前序各节的孤立结论组织成一条闭合链：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>命题 1 把 softmax 识别为有限标签空间上的指数族，自然参数为 logits，对数配分函数为 log-sum-exp。</li>\n<li>命题 2 给出自然参数到概率坐标的微分，其行和为零对应平移不变性。</li>\n<li>命题 3 把同一平移不变性写成 log-sum-exp 的恒等式，数值稳定实现不改变数学值。</li>\n<li>命题 4 说明温度缩放是自然参数的仿射重参数化，其雅可比带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 因子。</li>\n<li>命题 5 用链式法则把上述对象收口为组合梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 与反传 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{f_\\theta}^\\top(p-e_y)$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这条链的边界条件必须写明：命题 1 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限（无限标签空间需换成测度论版本，本节不展开）；命题 2 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 各分量有限（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}$</span> 无定义）；命题 3 是恒等式，对任意有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 成立；命题 4 的极限情形要求最大值唯一，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时极限为最大值集合上的均匀分布而非 one-hot；命题 5 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell$</span> 关于上下文分布可积（假设 A2）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 不可微，则命题 5 的第二式不成立，只能保留第一式作为对 logits 的梯度。</p>\n<p>前序第 10 节“反例：softmax 饱和导致梯度消失”正是命题 5 的边界情形：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|z_i-z_j|$</span> 很大时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近 one-hot，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 的某些分量接近零，梯度信号被饱和压缩。这不是公式失效，而是公式在极端区域的定量退化；其完整反例构造已在第 10 节集中处理，本节不再展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>softmax 是有限标签空间上指数族的具体参数化：自然参数为 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，充分统计量为 one-hot <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_y$</span>，对数配分函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z)=\\log\\sum_k e^{z_k}$</span>；条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid c)=\\sigma(f_\\theta(c))$</span> 是这一参数化经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 拉回的结果。</li>\n<li>雅可比公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J_\\sigma(z))_{ij}=p_i(\\delta_{ij}-p_j)$</span>、log-sum-exp 平移恒等式、温度缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z/\\tau)$</span> 与组合梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z(-\\log p_y)=p-e_y$</span> 是同一平移不变性在微分、代数、重参数化与链式法则四个层面的表现，四者共享自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 这一共同对象。</li>\n<li>组合梯度经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 反传为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{f_\\theta}^\\top(p-e_y)$</span>；该式只依赖指数族定义与链式法则，其成立条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 可微且梯度关于上下文分布可积，饱和导致的梯度退化是该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近 one-hot 时的定量边界，而非公式失效。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-8-推导链的坐标无关表述与冗余自由度的商掉\">8. 推导链的坐标无关表述与冗余自由度的商掉<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-8-推导链的坐标无关表述与冗余自由度的商掉\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前七个小节把推导链写在了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的标准坐标下。为了让“softmax 是条件分布的参数化”这句话在几何上站得住，必须说明：命题 2 中雅可比的行和为零并非数值巧合，而是参数化映射在商空间上的微分；softmax 真正参数化的对象是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K/\\mathbb{R}\\mathbf{1}$</span> 上的点，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上的点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（softmax 的商映射结构）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\mathbb{R}\\mathbf{1}$</span> 为平移子空间，商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=\\mathbb{R}^K/V$</span>。则 softmax 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 分解：存在唯一映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma:Q\\to\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\bar\\sigma\\circ\\pi$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to Q$</span> 为商投影。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 与单纯形内部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+=\\{p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}:p_i&gt;0\\ \\forall i\\}$</span> 之间的微分同胚。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n先证分解存在且唯一。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,z'\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(z)=\\pi(z')$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z-z'\\in V$</span>，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z'=z+c\\mathbf{1}$</span>。由命题 3 的平移恒等式（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为平移量），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma(z')_i=\\frac{e^{z_i+c}}{\\sum_k e^{z_k+c}}=\\frac{e^{c}e^{z_i}}{e^{c}\\sum_k e^{z_k}}=\\sigma(z)_i,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的每个纤维上为常值，由商映射的泛性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma$</span> 存在且唯一。</p>\n<p>再证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma$</span> 是微分同胚。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 光滑，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma$</span> 光滑。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z_i}&gt;0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\log p_i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)_i=p_i/\\sum_k p_k=p_i$</span>。单射性在商空间上成立：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)=\\sigma(z')$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-z'_i=\\log\\sigma(z)_i-\\log\\sigma(z')_i=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=z'$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(z)=\\pi(z')$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma$</span> 是双射。其逆映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma^{-1}(p)=\\pi(\\log p_1,\\dots,\\log p_K)$</span>，光滑。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma$</span> 是微分同胚。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题把命题 2 的雅可比解释清楚：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处的微分，它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_z\\mathbb{R}^K\\cong\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\sigma(z)}\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 方向上为常值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)\\mathbf{1}=0$</span>，这正是前面观察到的行和为零。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma(z)$</span> 下降为商空间切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\pi(z)}Q\\cong\\mathbb{R}^K/V$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\sigma(z)}\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 的同构。命题 2 的矩阵因此不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 满秩矩阵，而是秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 的映射；其核恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>。</p>\n<p>由此，“softmax 是条件分布的参数化”应精确表述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma:Q\\to\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 是微分同胚，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\bar\\sigma\\circ\\pi$</span> 是其通过商投影的拉回。模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta:\\mathcal{C}\\to\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 给出的 logits 只在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 中有参数化意义；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\theta+c\\mathbf{1}$</span> 给出同一条件分布。这一冗余自由度在优化中表现为梯度沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向的分量不影响损失，与命题 5 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\ell=p-e_y$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}^\\top(p-e_y)=1-1=0$</span> 相一致：组合梯度天然落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的正交补 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\perp=\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span> 中，即商切空间的对偶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-9-从自然参数到期望参数的-Legendre-对偶\">9. 从自然参数到期望参数的 Legendre 对偶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-9-从自然参数到期望参数的-Legendre-对偶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 把 softmax 写成指数族，命题 5 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z A(z)=p$</span> 用作组合梯度的核心。这两件事在指数族理论中是同一个事实的两面：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的梯度给出期望参数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的凸性保证这一映射可逆。本节把这一环补上，使推导链在“自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\leftrightarrow$</span> 期望参数”之间闭合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（对数配分函数的凸性与 Legendre 对偶）</strong><br>\n假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A:\\mathbb{R}^K\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z)=\\log\\sum_{k=1}^K e^{z_k}$</span>，是凸函数，且其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z A(z)=\\sigma(z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\mathbb{R}\\mathbf{1}$</span> 方向上为仿射（实际上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z+c\\mathbf{1})=A(z)+c$</span>），在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 上严格凸。<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的 Legendre 变换为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A^*(p)=\\sup_{z\\in\\mathbb{R}^K}\\big(\\langle z,p\\rangle-A(z)\\big)=\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i\\log p_i,$$</div>\n定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 上与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla A=\\sigma$</span> 互逆。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n凸性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是 log-sum-exp，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 与线性函数的复合再求和，是凸函数的标准例子。逐项验证：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z,z'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(tz+(1-t)z')=\\log\\sum_k e^{tz_k+(1-t)z'_k}\n\\le\\log\\Big(\\sum_k \\big(te^{z_k}+(1-t)e^{z'_k}\\big)\\Big)\n=tA(z)+(1-t)A(z'),$$</div>\n其中不等号用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{tx+(1-t)y}\\le te^{x}+(1-t)e^{y}$</span>（指数函数的凸性）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的单调性。梯度：由命题 5 证明中已算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial A/\\partial z_j=e^{z_j}/\\sum_k e^{z_k}=\\sigma(z)_j$</span>。</p>\n<p>沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的仿射性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(z+c\\mathbf{1})=\\log\\sum_k e^{z_k+c}=c+\\log\\sum_k e^{z_k}=A(z)+c$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上为仿射，其二阶导在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 方向为零。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 上的严格凸性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,A(z)=J_\\sigma(z)=\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^\\top$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(z)$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\top\\mathrm{Hess}\\,A(z)v=\\sum_i p_iv_i^2-\\Big(\\sum_i p_iv_i\\Big)^2=\\mathrm{Var}_{p}(v),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(v)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的方差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(v)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-几乎处处为常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in V$</span>。故 Hessian 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\perp$</span> 上正定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 上严格凸。</p>\n<p>Legendre 变换：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle z,p\\rangle-A(z)=\\sum_i p_i z_i-\\log\\sum_k e^{z_k}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 求导并令其为零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i-\\sigma(z)_i=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)=p$</span>。由命题 6，这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 存在当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>，且在商掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 后唯一。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A^*(p)=\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i-\\log\\sum_k e^{\\log p_k}=\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i-\\log 1=\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 边界上（某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span>），上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i\\to-\\infty$</span> 时取到，值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>），故定义域为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题把推导链的两端接上：命题 1 的自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 与命题 5 的期望参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla A=\\sigma$</span> 互逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A^*$</span> 是负熵。于是交叉熵损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(z)=A(z)-z_y$</span> 可以重写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(z)=\\langle z,e_y\\rangle-A(z)=-\\big(A^*(p)-\\langle z,p\\rangle\\big)\\big|_{p=\\sigma(z)},$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^*$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处的 Bregman 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{A^*}(e_y\\|p)=A^*(e_y)-A^*(p)-\\langle\\nabla A^*(p),e_y-p\\rangle$</span> 的负值加上常数。这解释了命题 5 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\ell=p-e_y$</span> 的结构：它是 Bregman 散度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的梯度经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla A$</span> 拉回的结果。本节不展开 Bregman 散度的完整理论，只指出这一恒等式使“组合梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span>”不再是孤立公式，而是凸对偶的自然产物。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar10--h-10-推导链在参数化选择下的不变性\">10. 推导链在参数化选择下的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar10--h-10-推导链在参数化选择下的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后一个需要补足的环节是：命题 1–7 的结论不依赖于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 选作自然参数这一具体选择。若把条件分布写成其他参数化（例如以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 本身为参数，或以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 去掉一个分量为参数），命题 2 的雅可比与命题 5 的组合梯度会以协变方式变换，但“softmax 是条件分布的参数化”这一结构保持不变。本节给出这一不变性的精确陈述，作为推导链的收尾。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（参数化的协变性与组合梯度的不变性）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:U\\to\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 是从开集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\subset\\mathbb{R}^{K-1}$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的光滑嵌入，其像落在某个商截面（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的像与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-纤维恰交于一点）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\phi=\\sigma\\circ\\phi:U\\to\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in U$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\phi$</span> 的雅可比为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_{\\sigma_\\phi}(u)=J_\\sigma(\\phi(u))\\,J_\\phi(u),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\phi(u)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times(K-1)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的雅可比。若损失写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\phi(u)=-\\log\\sigma_\\phi(u)_y$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_u\\ell_\\phi(u)=J_\\phi(u)^\\top\\big(\\sigma(\\phi(u))-e_y\\big).$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 取恒等嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto(u_1,\\dots,u_{K-1},0)$</span>（固定第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个 logit 为零）时，上式化为对前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个 logits 的梯度，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个分量的贡献被吸收进前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n第一式由链式法则直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\phi=\\sigma\\circ\\phi$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{\\sigma_\\phi}(u)=J_\\sigma(\\phi(u))J_\\phi(u)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\sigma$</span> 按命题 2 计算。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\phi(u)=\\ell(\\phi(u))$</span>，由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_z\\ell=\\sigma(z)-e_y$</span>，再经链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u\\ell_\\phi=J_\\phi(u)^\\top\\nabla_z\\ell|_{\\phi(u)}$</span>，代入即得。</p>\n<p>固定第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个 logit 为零的嵌入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(u)=(u_1,\\dots,u_{K-1},0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\phi(u)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times(K-1)$</span> 矩阵，前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 行为单位阵，最后一行为零。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\phi(u)^\\top(p-e_y)$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i-\\delta_{iy}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,K-1$</span>，与直接在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 中计算再截断前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量一致。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个分量的梯度因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\phi$</span> 最后一行为零而不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u\\ell_\\phi$</span> 中，这正是固定第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个 logit 为零所消除的冗余自由度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题说明：命题 2 与命题 5 的公式在任意商截面上协变成立，softmax 作为条件分布参数化的身份不依赖于选哪个 logit 作基准。实际实现中固定一个 logit 为零（或等价地减去最大值）只是选择了截面，数学内容不变。这与命题 3 的数值稳定实现、命题 6 的商映射结构三者一致：它们都是同一冗余自由度的不同处理方式。</p>\n<p>至此，推导链的闭合可以精确表述为以下交换图（无坐标表述）：自然参数空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 经商投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 经微分同胚 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 上的损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 拉回为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^*(p)$</span> 的 Bregman 形式，其梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-e_y$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\perp$</span> 中，经任意截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\phi^\\top$</span> 拉回到参数空间。命题 1–8 分别是这张图的顶点、边与交换性的逐项验证。</p>", "cjk": 60108, "missing": []};
